window.FWN_IMMORTALITY_THROUGH_ARRAY_FORMATIONS_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_IMMORTALITY_THROUGH_ARRAY_FORMATIONS_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1901,"title":"Chapter 1901 - 931: Dream Omen (Part 2)","paragraphs":["\"The leader of the Demon Sect got away. The Taoist Court locked down the Third-Grade State Boundary and is doing everything it can to hunt him down, but...\"","Gu Changhuai frowned.","\"You probably won’t catch him,\" Mo Hua said.","Gu Changhuai nodded, \"A Demon Sect commander at the late Golden Core Stage, wielding Evil Dragon power—even with several Taixu Sect Elders at the same stage, they couldn’t kill him. Catching him is basically impossible.\"","Mo Hua didn’t like how that sounded, so he spoke in defense of Xun Ziyou and the other Elders:","\"That demon head’s just too strong—it’s not that the Taixu Sect Elders are weak!\"","Gu Changhuai agreed.","This Demon Sect leader, with the power of an Evil Dragon and having devoured endless Blood Qi, was terrifyingly strong. He definitely wasn’t someone ordinary cultivators could subdue.","On the flip side, they were lucky several Taixu Sect Elders teamed up to suppress the Demon Sect leader and even forced him to flee.","If not, with that demon running rampant, who knows how many cultivators from the Taoist Court would’ve died. The consequences would’ve been unthinkable.","They hadn’t expected that, either.","Gu Changhuai nodded, \"The Taixu Sect has deep foundations, and the Elders are righteous and powerful. We were only able to suppress the Demon Sect and exterminate the Demon Cultivators thanks to them.\"","Only then did Mo Hua nod in satisfaction.","Uncle Gu’s been hanging out with me for so long, now he’s learned how to say nice things too.","\"What about the other Demon Sect Elders? Did they all die? Any that slipped through the cracks?\" Mo Hua asked.","Gu Changhuai counted off, one by one:","\"Like you mentioned earlier, that greedy, gluttonous Elder Jiu is dead; the short, snake-like Monster cultivator Elder was slain by Elder Xun; the most senior Second Elder is dead too. Most of the other Elders are dead as well. The only ones left are a Bear Demon Elder and the one you mentioned, ’Elder You’...\"","\"I had people check—no sign of these two Golden Core corpses near the Demon Sect stronghold. The Bear Elder at least showed himself, got his arm slashed by Elder Xun Ziyou. As for that Elder You, he vanished from start to finish.\"","Mo Hua slowed down, chewing his pork knuckle.","This Elder You really is something else...","Did he get a heads-up from the Taoist Court in advance?","Or did he suspect something was wrong with my impersonation as ’Mr. Yuan,’ and, using the Thunder Magnetism Formation, found some clues and escaped early?","How did he escape? Where is he now?","Questions swarmed in Mo Hua’s mind. He sat there, lost in thought.","Gu Changhuai glanced at him, took a sip of wine, and said, \"Enough, stop obsessing. This is Taoist Court business.\"","He paused, then added, \"If there’s any word on those two, I’ll let you know.\"","The message was clear: stop wasting your energy on this, focus on cultivation, and leave hunting Demon Sect remnants to the Taoist Court. If there’s any news, you’ll hear it.","\"Got it,\" Mo Hua nodded.","\"There’s one more thing,\" Gu Changhuai said. \"The merit points from destroying the Demon Sect are being tallied by the Taoist Court. Everyone who helped with the encirclement will get a cut, including you. Once they finish, the Taoist Court will issue the rewards through Taixu Sect to your Disciple Token. It’s a big deal, so the merit should be pretty generous.\"","Mo Hua didn’t react much.","Mostly because he was already kind of a ’merit tycoon’—he had so many, he barely knew how much anymore.","Whether there was a bit more or less didn’t really matter to him at this point.","Also, Mo Hua knew all too well how slowly the Taoist Court worked—by the time those merit points arrived, who knows how many years would have passed.","After chatting, and finishing their meal, Mo Hua got ready to return to the Sect for class.","As he was leaving, Gu Changhuai said,","\"Your cousin wanted me to tell you—if you want, come to the Gu Family’s New Year’s banquet.\"","\"The New Year’s banquet?\"","Mo Hua froze, then suddenly remembered—it was only a little over a month until the New Year.","Another year had somehow already slipped by.","Mo Hua felt a vague sense of urgency, like time was passing too quickly and something big was about to happen. It was just a feeling, though; he couldn’t put his finger on why.","\"Uncle Gu, you’re not going to be busy at the banquet this year, right?\" Mo Hua asked.","Gu Changhuai looked at Mo Hua and, after a while, finally let out a slow breath:","\"Thanks to you, the Demon Sect disaster’s over and the Taoist Court can finally relax for a while and enjoy the new year.\"","\"No need to thank me,\" Mo Hua nodded, looking pleased. \"I’ll come to the Gu Family to hang out during the festival.\"","Gu Changhuai was silent for a moment, then sighed, \"All right.\"","...","After saying goodbye to Gu Changhuai, Mo Hua returned to the Sect.","That night, back in his room at the Disciple’s Residence, Mo Hua read by lamplight. When his eyes got tired, he rested his head on the desk, lost in thought.","The Demon Sect chaos was, for now, settled.","Apart from the beginning, when he was making plans and pulling strings—putting in quite a bit of effort—he barely had to lift a finger during the actual encirclement.","Not a single Golden Core demon head came looking for a fight.","Most of the methods he’d prepared ended up going unused.","Mo Hua felt a hint of regret.","But on the other hand, this wasn’t a bad thing. After all, cultivators need to be cautious when it’s time to be cautious.","And with the Demon Sect wiped out, Demon Cultivators killed or all but wiped out, the rest locked away in the Taoist Prison—","From now on, the local innocent cultivators would be spared from murder and the threat of the Demon Sect. That, at least, counted as a deed of merit.","The only remaining issue was his own Magic Treasure—that Four Symbols Green Dragon Evil Formation...","Thinking of this, Mo Hua couldn’t help but sigh.","Getting that Formation Diagram was just too difficult...","Now, with the ferocious, powerful Demon Sect leader escaped—like a flood dragon to the sea—he was completely clueless about his whereabouts.","Plus, after seeing how the Demon Sect conducted its business—and the sheer size of that Blood Pool—Mo Hua couldn’t help but start to wonder if the Four Symbols Azure Dragon was really as upright as its name suggested."]},{"number":1902,"title":"Chapter 1902 - 931: Dream Omens (Part 3)","paragraphs":["If it wasn’t proper, how could I make it my own Magical Treasure?","Is my destined \"own Magical Treasure\" really going to be this Green Dragon Formation?","Mo Hua’s brows knit tightly.","\"Or maybe... I should do a Calculation?\"","The situation was deadlocked—no clues, and besides a fortune-telling, there didn’t seem to be any better way.","Mo Hua took out the Copper Coins left to him by his master, set up a Divine Mist Formation to seal off his aura, then calmed himself, emptying his thoughts, and began the Heavenly secret Calculation.","The Copper Coins tossed into the air, drawing the threads of causality, and then fell, finally landing in his palm.","Mo Hua silently recited in his heart:","\"What is my own Magical Treasure...\"","Then he opened his eyes and glanced at the Copper Coins in his hand.","The Copper Coins lay quietly in his palm, without the slightest premonition or trace of cause and effect upon them.","What does that mean?","Mo Hua frowned in confusion.","\"Can’t calculate it?\"","Mo Hua stared at the Copper Coins for a long time, but saw nothing unusual. Just as he was about to give up and put them down, his Sea of Consciousness suddenly throbbed with pain, overwhelming Divine Sense surged toward the Copper Coins like a tide.","At the same time, fate rose and fell, and cause and effect began to swirl.","But this thread of causality was so vast that, even with Mo Hua’s Divine Sense, he couldn’t bear it at all.","In just a moment, all of Mo Hua’s Divine Sense was sucked dry.","His eyes rolled back, and with a \"thud,\" he collapsed onto the table.","The causality on the Copper Coins stopped when there was no Divine Thought to sustain it. Whether the Calculation succeeded or failed, a thread of premonition still sank deep into Mo Hua’s Divine Thought.","In a haze, Mo Hua felt like he was dreaming again.","In the dreamland was an Azure Dragon.","But this dream was shattered and fragmented; all he could see was the dragon’s silhouette, sense its unlimited might and boundless power, and in his ears, the clear sound of dragoncries, rising and falling ceaselessly.","Mo Hua was struck by a feeling.","\"Is this the dream-prediction from the cause and effect Calculation? Dreaming of an Azure Dragon... does it mean that my own Magical Treasure ought to be the orthodox Four Symbols Green Dragon Evil Formation?\"","Mo Hua let out a breath of relief.","If that’s the case, all I’d need to do is stick to my original plan, keep searching out that Demon Sect Leader, and find a way to get my hands on the Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation Map from him...","As Mo Hua was thinking this, the dreamland shifted abruptly.","It was as if something strange had invaded his dream, shattering it piece by piece and provoking the Azure Dragon’s fury, making it roar loudly in anger.","In just a moment, a blurry, black fog-like thing came sweeping towards the Azure Dragon like a hurricane.","A twisted, strange, unnamable thing wrapped itself around the dragon, ripping it apart—then, alive and writhing...","Swallowed it whole.","In an instant, the dreamland was completely broken. Mo Hua jolted awake, replaying the visions in his mind as waves of shock surged within him.","\"A dragon... was swallowed by something...\"","\"What does that even mean?\"","\"Was that dream a premonition of my fate?\"","\"Then what exactly is my own Magical Treasure...?\"","Mo Hua murmured in a low voice, feeling even more lost than before.","...","After that, life instead became unusually calm.","Mo Hua still remembered the \"dragon devouring\" omen from his dreamland, unable to figure it out despite thinking it over a hundred times, but all he could do was keep it in mind.","He also asked some Elders, bringing it up casually as if it were a random question: in this world, what could possibly \"eat a dragon\"?","But the question was just too bizarre.","The Elders were also bewildered, only chalking it up to Mo Hua’s \"childlike innocence,\" asking off-the-wall things.","Unable to get any answers, Mo Hua could only settle into his cultivation and classes.","And so, another month passed, and another year came to a close.","During the Sect assessment, Mo Hua made unprecedented progress.","From the eternal \"one Grade A, six Grade C’s\" to \"one Grade A, one Grade B, five Grade C’s.\"","His Taoist Skill went from \"Grade C\" to \"Grade B.\"","Probably because Elder Yi sparred with him in \"hide and seek,\" and after witnessing Mo Hua’s attainments in movement technique, made an exception to give him a \"Grade B.\"","Judging movement technique alone, Elder Yi thought giving him a \"Grade A\" would’ve been more than fair.","Even if he suppressed his cultivation to Initial Golden Core, there were few disciples in all of Taixu Gate who could last twenty rounds against him, let alone someone like Mo Hua who could go toe to toe in a real exchange.","Giving a \"Grade B\" was just to keep things low-key.","Besides, no matter how good his movement technique, that’s all it was—movement technique.","His weakness in Spiritual Power meant his Spell techniques would never be highly accomplished—at least, not to the Sect’s assessment standards, and thus hard to get a good evaluation.","Mo Hua didn’t care much for the \"Grade B.\"","He just felt vaguely uneasy inside.","Whenever strange things happen, there’s a catch.","His results, which never changed year after year, had suddenly shifted. For someone like Mo Hua, who had a basic grasp of cause and effect, it felt like a harbinger that some new development was coming.","And then, it was time for the festival again.","This was his seventh festival at Taixu Gate, and Mo Hua had begun to get used to it.","And since Uncle Gu had already invited him in advance, he just went with the flow, stopped by the Gu Family, and planned on mooching a festival feast—eating something decent for a change.","There was still some time before the feast.","Mo Hua took Yu Er around Qingzhou City for a stroll.","Qingzhou City was lively. Yu Er was grinning with joy, though there was a faint trace of worry in his smile.","It was a subtle shift that others probably wouldn’t notice, but it couldn’t escape Mo Hua’s eyes.","Mo Hua bought a few skewers of candied hawthorns, handed them to Yu Er, then asked softly:","\"Yu Er, is something on your mind?\"","Yu Er’s smile immediately stiffened, then his face became weighed down with concern.","He was still young, unable to hide his feelings.","Mo Hua looked at him gently.","Yu Er hesitated for a long time before stammering, \"Brother Mo, I... dreamed again.\"","Mo Hua was slightly surprised.","The dream again...","\"A nightmare?\" Mo Hua asked.","Yu Er nodded, then shook his head. \"Not exactly... it’s different from before...\"","\"What did you dream?\"","\"I...\" Yu Er seemed timid, but looking at Mo Hua’s eyes, he finally spoke slowly, \"I dreamed of myself.\"","Mo Hua raised his brows. \"Yourself?\"","\"Mm...\" Yu Er’s eyes flickered, his words a bit disjointed. \"It was me, but didn’t really feel like me...\"","\"And then?\"","\"Then... there were three of me: one in the mountains, one in the water, and one inside my heart. They all just stared at me in silence. I was really scared. They said, said...\"","Yu Er looked at Mo Hua, teary-eyed. \"They said my mother would die, and Brother Mo, you’d die too...\"","Those words seemed to have weighed on him for a very long time.","Pure and kind-hearted Yu Er had wanted to speak, but always held back out of fear.","Mo Hua looked at Yu Er, seeing the worry, fear, and tears in his eyes. He smiled kindly and spoke softly:","\"Demon Monsters and Evil Spirits can take human form and deceive the mind. Those three ’yous’—they’re all Demon Monsters, just trying to scare you.\"","Yu Er’s cheeks were still streaked with tears. \"Really?\"","\"When have I ever lied to you?\"","Yu Er thought for a moment, then nodded. Brother Mo had always treated him well, never lied to him.","Mo Hua patted Yu Er on the head and said gently:","\"You don’t have to be afraid of anything in your dreams. Whatever shows up, so long as they dare to show themselves, I’ll cut them down—all of them—with a single sword.\"","No matter what, I’ll cut them down, every last one, with a single sword...","Those words gave Yu Er a world of courage.","Yu Er’s eyes gradually brightened; a smile appeared on his young face as he nodded to Mo Hua with all his might: \"Mm!\""]},{"number":1903,"title":"Chapter 1903 - 932: Master Xia","paragraphs":["With his worries set aside, his heart knot released, Yu Er’s smile grew ever more pure—he could finally play happily, for real.","Yu Er held a skewer of candied hawthorn in his mouth, darting through alleyways and avenues of Qingzhou City, now pausing to check out lanterns, now watching street performers, or else staring wide-eyed at a handful of spirit beast cats and dogs—eyes never blinking once.","Mo Hua followed at Yu Er’s side, his face filled with quiet content. Yet Yu Er’s words still lingered in his mind.","\"Three ’Yu Ers’—one in the mountain, one in the water, and one is himself, watching him in silence...\"","Mo Hua couldn’t help but remember that nightmare Yu Er had spoken of, long ago:","\"There were so many mountains in my dream, so many demon monsters, all covered in blood...\"","\"Rabbits and crying, mountains and rivers and one person...\"","\"A lot of people are going to die, the blood will run into the river, bones will be stacked to build tall towers, human flesh will forge cities, everything joined together...\"","\"Because of Yu Er, everyone will die...\"","He kept his composure, mulling it over in silence.","His entry into Qian Learning State Boundary, his chance to join the Taixu Gate, all traced back to \"Yu Er.\"","Mr. Tu wanted to capture Yu Er; demon monsters from the Great Wilderness invaded Yu Er’s nightmares; above the very authority of the Great Wilderness Evil God, Yu Er’s mark stood out, clear as day...","This all pointed to one thing: Yu Er and the Great Wilderness Evil God were undeniably connected somehow.","\"The rabbit is crying...\"","Mo Hua pondered for a long time. He turned to study innocent Yu Er and suddenly started—\"Could this child be talking about...a crafty rabbit has three burrows...\"","A crafty rabbit, three burrows: a mountain, a river, a person?","And then...","\"Many people die, blood flows into the river, bones make towers, flesh builds cities...\"","That line couldn’t help but make Mo Hua recall the Blood Swamp of Yanluo Mountain: there, around the Demon Sect, countless White Bone Evil Formations drained the living of their flesh and blood, transforming it into deadly evilness that seeped into the earth veins.","Everything he’d witnessed seemed to secretly echo Yu Er’s nightmares.","Mo Hua’s pupils shrank ever so slightly.","He felt as if he was on the verge of grasping something...","...","After wandering the city, night fell; lanterns hung high, fireworks splattered the sky.","Mo Hua took Yu Er by the hand and, under the burst of colors, returned to the Gu Family residence.","An hour later, the Gu Family’s annual banquet began as well.","This year’s spectacle was bigger than the last; guests came in greater numbers, the grand hall brimming with more life and noise than ever before.","All the guests’ seats were arranged on descending tiers from the dais, in order of relationship, cultivation, and status.","Mo Hua sat on the high dais, his seat only one lower than the Family Head’s.","Somehow, he’d gone from the \"regular guest\" of the Gu Family’s annual banquet to an outright \"honored guest.\"","That came both thanks to Elder Master Xun’s influence, and to the fact that, in Qian Learning State Boundary, he now held the identity of \"Formation Leader\"—ranking above thousands of Sects.","Wenren Wan and Yu Er sat elsewhere; their places weren’t low, but unlike previous years, they weren’t at his table.","Mo Hua felt slightly puzzled.","Until the banquet began—when strange-faced family Elders or Cultivators of various Sects took turns approaching him with wine cups to offer toasts—did Mo Hua finally realize why.","This meal, it seemed, was for \"socializing\"; he couldn’t just eat and drink as he pleased, like usual.","He couldn’t just eat his fill and ignore everyone else.","Since people kept coming over to toast him, Yu Er and Wenren Wan couldn’t very well sit with him this time.","Mo Hua let out a soft sigh.","Sure enough—just as the saying goes, \"fame invites trouble.\"","Who would’ve thought his own name would one day become a burden?","Of course, such good fortune would be something anyone else would kill for. Mo Hua couldn’t really complain.","Though a little uncomfortable, he refused no one.","The reason these family members and Sects all swarmed the Gu Family’s banquet, odds were, was to network with the \"Formation Leader\" of Qian Learning State Boundary.","But the very fact they were invited meant their ties with the Gu Family were solid.","Mo Hua had received plenty of help from the Gu Family; now that he’d made a name for himself, it was only right for him to support the family, and add to their prestige a bit.","At the end of the day, it was just a glass of wine and some pleasantries—no hardship at all. On the contrary, it let him make connections with even more Cultivators.","A \"cup of wine\" could count as a bond, after all.","Gu Shouyan, seated at the high table, had been a bit worried—afraid Mo Hua would resent the social dealings of such noble families.","He himself didn’t care much for such worldly affairs.","But he was the Family Head; dealings between noble houses were inevitable.","No matter how honest and upright the family, there was no such thing as truly \"pure\" gentlemen’s friendship—networks and interests always factored in, even just a little.","Luckily, Mo Hua, for one so young, had a broad and generous heart, not making much fuss of it all.","Gu Shouyan was quietly grateful inside.","So, as toasts went round and guests came and went, Mo Hua soon lost track of who he’d toasted and drunk with.","Thankfully, the Gu Family knew his \"taste\" and served him fruit wine; his cheeks reddened adorably, though he didn’t seem very drunk.","Still, Gu Shouyan feared he really would get drunk, so he stopped more people from coming over to toast him.","Only then did Mo Hua finally get a moment to deal with the delicacies on the table.","After a while, a commotion broke out. Mo Hua looked up to see a group of people escorting a man in a white Taoist Robe, edged with golden and jade Patterns, approaching.","This man was tall and upright, his features commanding and stern; his aura was like a deep pool or a looming peak—profound beyond measure.","This was none other than the Taist Court Inspector from the Xia family in the Feather Transformation Realm—Master Xia—whom Mo Hua had met several times before.","Gu Family Head, Gu Shouyan, stood to greet him.","\"Master Xia, forgive us for not coming out to meet you sooner.\"","Master Xia wasn’t one to stand on ceremony either; his tone was quite amiable: \"Business kept me busy, so I arrived late. Don’t hold it against me, Family Head.\""]},{"number":1904,"title":"Chapter 1904 - 932: Master Xia (Part 2)","paragraphs":["\"Inspector, please, have a seat.\" Gu Shouyan cupped his fists in greeting.","Master Xia walked to the highest seat on the platform, sitting as an equal with the Gu Family Head, and just so happened to be right next to Mo Hua.","Only now did Mo Hua realize who the empty seat above his left was meant for.","\"So it’s Master Xia...\"","Mo Hua muttered to himself.","But he didn’t really care—this kind of seating arrangement had nothing to do with him. He’d already done his round of \"socializing\"; now all that was left was to eat and fill his stomach.","Besides, he barely knew Master Xia. There was no need to pay him any attention.","Master Xia was, after all, a big shot. No way would he personally come over to toast Mo Hua.","Mo Hua lowered his head and started working on a gigantic crab on the table, its claw meat as much as a fist-sized bun.","But before he even finished one crab, a voice both strange and familiar rang in his ear:","\"Little brother.\"","Mo Hua turned to see Master Xia holding a cup, his gaze stern yet carrying a hint of goodwill, looking at him.","Mo Hua was slightly stunned.","Master Xia was sitting in his seat, holding his cup, not making any other move.","After a moment, Mo Hua understood, lifted his cup, and said to Master Xia, \"Master Xia, let me offer you a toast.\"","After all, Master Xia was in the Feather Transformation Realm, and was the Dao Court Inspector.","Even if he took up his cup first, there was no way Mo Hua would let him lead the toast.","This subtlety, Mo Hua understood.","Mo Hua’s quick-wittedness made Master Xia quite satisfied. He downed the wine in his cup, then said in a slow voice:","\"You know, little brother, there’s a bit of fate between us.\"","\"Yes, that’s true.\"","\"Do you have any plans for what’s next?\"","Mo Hua was a little confused. \"Master means...?\"","Master Xia set down his cup, lips not moving, yet his voice reached Mo Hua’s ears:","\"The Qianxue Sect preaches the Dao for nine years. In two years, you’ll graduate. After that, do you plan to stay at Taixu Gate, join the Inner Gate as an Elder and teach, or head out into the wider world and see what you can make of it?\"","Mo Hua was stunned for a moment.","Was Master Xia really bringing this up at the annual banquet, with all these people present?","He looked around and was surprised to find that everyone nearby seemed oblivious—as though they neither saw nor heard anything—completely unaware.","Only the Gu Family Head in the Feather Transformation Realm seemed to know something, but even he just quietly sipped his wine, showing nothing.","Master Xia’s voice entered Mo Hua’s ears: \"What happens here—heaven knows, earth knows, you know, I know.\"","Mo Hua suddenly understood, and quickly asked, \"Master, are you trying to recruit me into the Xia family?\"","Master Xia was briefly surprised, thinking to himself, \"The kid sure is blunt, says whatever comes to mind.\"","But that was fine; talking to a clever person saves headaches.","\"So, little brother, what do you think?\"","\"Any benefits?\" Mo Hua was pragmatic.","Master Xia gave Mo Hua a silent glance. \"The Xia family is an ancient family, ranked at sixth grade, located in the heart of the Nine State—Taoist State, subordinate to the Central Dao Court. Over generations, we’ve produced multiple Pavilion Elders, our influence stretches across the world, and our heritage runs unimaginably deep...\"","Master Xia was just stating facts.","Anyone with a shred of awareness would know what weight these words carried.","Any single phrase—whether \"ancient family,\" \"sixth grade,\" \"located in Taoist State,\" \"under the Dao Court,\" or \"produced Pavilion Elders\"... All these are things most cultivators and family sects spend a lifetime dreaming of, yet never reach.","Even the greatest fifth-grade noble families within Qian Learning State Boundary couldn’t compare.","Mo Hua, however, shook his head and said, \"That’s the Xia family’s business; it’s got nothing to do with me.\"","\"If you were to align yourself with the Xia family—\"","\"My family name is Mo.\" Mo Hua said blandly.","Master Xia was momentarily taken aback, but then he understood Mo Hua’s meaning.","No matter how powerful the Xia family, it’s still just the \"Xia\" family.","Even if Mo Hua joined the Xia family, he’d still be an outsider. He had no desire to marry in, change his surname, forsake his roots, or become someone subservient to a noble house.","Master Xia’s expression grew more distant.","But in his heart, he looked at Mo Hua with greater respect.","There are many prodigies in this world—talented, proud—but precious few who see their circumstances clearly and understand their social standing.","Born humble but possessing a sense of self, not blindly clinging to power—that’s true dignity and humility.","\"You know the Three Talents Formation, right?\" Master Xia asked.","Mo Hua’s eyes suddenly brightened.","\"Our Xia family holds the legacy of the Three Talents Formation.\" Mo Hua’s reaction did not escape Master Xia, who spoke calmly.","Mo Hua’s eyes betrayed his yearning.","Elder Master Xun once said, the true Three Talents Formation embodies Heaven, Earth, and Human; governing the infinite of the Qian Path, the profound virtue of the Kun Path, and the mysterious changes of the Human Dao. Its framework is vast; the derivations endless.","This is the lore by which the Dao Court rules the world.","The core heritage of the Three Talents is strictly kept by the Dao Court—never passed on lightly. Unless you reach Taoist State, join the Dao Court, and gain access to its higher ranks, you’ll never learn the true essence of the Three Talents Formation...","Mo Hua felt an itch in his heart, and his tone toward Master Xia grew warmer, almost conspiratorial.","He quietly asked, \"If I follow the Xia family, can I learn the Three Talents Formation?\"","Master Xia shook his head. \"No.\"","Mo Hua, deeply disappointed, muttered, \"Then what’s the point...\" He turned back to tear into his big crab.","Master Xia could only say, \"Your cultivation’s not enough yet.\"","Mo Hua took a bite of crab meat. \"What if my cultivation is enough?\"","\"You’d have to reach the upper ranks of the Xia family to have a shot at learning the Three Talents Formation.\" Master Xia’s gaze grew intent.","Through this brief exchange, Master Xia realized that this \"Formation Leader\" before him, though young and seemingly simple, was perceptive through and through.","He speaks according to the person before him.","Master Xia decided to lay out the truth:","\"To enter the upper ranks of the Xia family, the best way is to ’marry in’, change your surname, wed a true direct descendant of the Xia bloodline, and thus become part of the family’s core of power.\""]},{"number":1905,"title":"Chapter 1905 - 932: Master Xia (Part 3)","paragraphs":["\"If not by marrying in, just through an ordinary marriage, with your family background and qualifications, it’s impossible for you to marry the legitimate daughter of the Xia family’s main lineage, and naturally, you cannot enter the upper echelons of the Xia family.\"","\"The importance of the Three Talents Formation, as a Formation Master, you should be well aware of. If you do not enter the core of the Xia family, do not hold a high position in the Xia family, you certainly won’t get to learn it.\"","What Master Xia said was the truth, and he did not hide anything from Mo Hua.","But Mo Hua definitely could not marry in, nor could he marry a woman from the Xia family.","However, in front of Master Xia, he didn’t want to say this directly, so he curiously asked: \"What do you mean by the legitimate daughter of the main lineage, are there different levels among them?\"","Master Xia glanced at Mo Hua, not knowing whether to answer.","Mo Hua had already turned his head to continue eating crab, appearing indifferent.","Master Xia sighed slightly and said: \"A legitimate daughter and a legitimate daughter are not the same, the most important thing is the bloodline.\"","\"Bloodline?\"","Mo Hua frowned, and couldn’t help but think of Junior Sister.","\"Bloodline... What exactly is it? Is it really that important?\" Mo Hua asked Master Xia.","Master Xia was silent for a moment.","In truly top-tier great families, this isn’t much of a secret, but ordinary cultivators know very little about it.","Because those with \"bloodline\" are often concentrated in Sixth grade ancient families with long legacies and deep foundations, and in some powerful Fifth grade peak families.","Other families, and even ordinary loose cultivators, have a very low probability of possessing \"bloodline.\"","But such bloodlines are bound to be extremely thin.","Moreover, very few cultivators know about bloodline knowledge, and without guidance, without awakening, even if one possesses bloodline power, it is likely to remain unrecognized, living life in a muddled obscurity.","Master Xia hesitated for a moment, then explained it simply to Mo Hua:","\"Bloodline, at its root, is the power hidden in the inherited flesh of a cultivator. The source of this power is generally divided into two types: one comes from cultivators with great cultivation, and the other from divine beasts with strong bloodlines.\"","\"A powerful cultivator, practicing specific cultivation techniques or Taoist skills, developing special spiritual power or blood qi, may have it passed down through the bloodline.\"","\"As for divine beasts, they embody the essence of heaven and earth and possess supreme might as innate beasts. Their bloodline can also merge with cultivators and thus be passed down through generations.\"","\"How exactly is it passed down?\" Mo Hua asked Master Xia curiously with bright eyes.","\"These are ancient clan secrets, not convenient to discuss in detail,\" said Master Xia.","Mo Hua felt a bit disappointed and asked: \"In the great families or ancient families, do the true direct lineage members all have bloodlines?\"","\"Not necessarily,\" Master Xia said, \"Even in the great families, those who can awaken the bloodline are few.\"","Mo Hua nodded.","If one possesses a bloodline, even in a truly top-tier family like the Xia family, they are considered exceptional.","This means his Junior Sister is indeed special.","Though he wonders if his Junior Brother has any bloodline.","But his Junior Brother is clumsy and doesn’t seem like someone who can keep secrets, if he really had any bloodline, he’d probably have boasted to Mo Hua already...","Mo Hua frowned and pondered for a moment, suddenly asked solemnly:","\"Master Xia, do I seem like someone who has a hidden bloodline?\"","Master Xia silently scrutinized Mo Hua for a moment.","Not wanting to discourage Mo Hua, yet also not apt to say it outright, he asked: \"Does your bloodline have anything special?\"","Mo Hua nodded and said: \"Yes, innately weak, and particularly weak...\"","Master Xia: \"...\"","How could this person so righteously present his \"disadvantage\" as a \"specialty\"?","He could only be a bit more subtle: \"Among loose cultivators, those who can awaken their bloodline are extremely rare, less than one in a million.\"","The implication being, unless your ancestors’ graves emit green smoke that reaches up to cover the skies, don’t expect it.","Mo Hua thought it over and agreed.","In this world, not every good fortune can fall upon him.","Surely he would know if he had any bloodline power, if there was even a hint of it, he wouldn’t be innately weak to this extent.","However, speaking of bloodlines, Mo Hua thought of a crucial question:","\"Master Xia, do cultivators have ’dragon’ bloodlines?\"","This kind of question might not yield much if asked to others. But coming from a Sixth grade ancient family and residing in Taoist State, Master Xia should know something.","In a journey of three people, there must be one who can teach me something. Even though he wasn’t familiar with Master Xia, asking some questions shouldn’t be a problem.","Moreover, it was Master Xia who approached him for a chat, he might even want to win Mo Hua over, with this opportunity, might as well ask.","Master Xia did not answer but instead asked: \"What do you think?\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, \"The Heavenly Son of the Taoist Court?\"","Master Xia nodded, \"The lineage of the Heavenly Son of the Taoist Court, from Taoist Monarch to Daoist, has the bloodline of the dragon flowing within.\"","Mo Hua asked, \"Then, is it so that those with ’dragon’ bloodlines are related to the Heavenly Son?\"","\"Not entirely,\" said Master Xia, \"Dragons also have different ranks, the lineage of the Heavenly Son is that of the True Dragon. Below True Dragon, there are Karma Dragons and Jiao Long.\"","\"Karma Dragons and Jiao Long?\"","\"Jiao snakes, exotic beasts, undergo tribulations and transform into dragons, becoming Jiao Long; below the True Dragon, throughout the world, there are either innately mutant or inherited dragon blood dragons, known as Karma Dragons.\"","\"Oh...\" Mo Hua nodded and then lowered his voice to ask the question he most wanted to know:","\"Then... is there something that can ’eat’ dragons?\"","Upon hearing this, Master Xia felt his heart skip a beat and his scalp tingle.","Eat dragons?!","This kid really has the guts to ask...","Master Xia maintained a calm demeanor, but his hand holding the wine cup trembled slightly, speaking in a deep voice: \"Dragons are divine beasts, residing at the peak of all creatures, there is nothing in this world capable of using dragons as food.\""]},{"number":1906,"title":"Chapter 1906 - 932: Master Xia (Part 4)","paragraphs":["\"Oh...\" Mo Hua also realized, knowing he had asked something he shouldn’t have, so he gave a silly smile and turned his head to continue gnawing on the crab.","Master Xia glanced at Mo Hua, seeing him casually eating the crab, he figured that Mo Hua was just ignorantly fearless, asking without thinking, and slowly let out a breath.","With a child speaking without restraint, he didn’t take it to heart.","After that, while eating, Mo Hua changed the topic and asked Master Xia about some trivial matters concerning the Xia family and Taoist State.","As they were trivial matters, they weren’t as \"shocking,\" so Master Xia didn’t mind and answered them one by one.","As they chatted, Mo Hua unexpectedly found that Master Xia didn’t seem to be purely the utilitarian, selfish, and \"corrupt\" inspector he had previously imagined.","Mo Hua thought for a moment and couldn’t help but quietly ask: \"Inspector, I have a question that might be slightly offensive...\"","Master Xia glanced at Mo Hua indifferently, thinking what question could be more offensive than \"eating a dragon\"?","\"Ask away.\"","Mo Hua said, \"You knew about Xiao Tianquan’s affair from the start, didn’t you? Why did you shield him so much?\"","This question was indeed a bit sharp.","Master Xia paused slightly, then said indifferently, \"This is a matter of the Xia family, it’s inconvenient to say more.\"","Mo Hua nodded and didn’t ask further.","Master Xia looked at Mo Hua, suddenly feeling a cause and effect stirring within, and slowly spoke again: \"That’s how families are; only when you’re willing to do things will the family take care of you.\"","\"But in large families, the easy and profitable tasks are never your turn.\"","\"You have to do the tasks that others disdain or are unwilling to do, even if they’re dirty or foolish tasks, to rise above the masses...\"","Master Xia’s expression was indifferent, and his words carried deeper meaning.","Mo Hua was stunned, seemingly understanding yet not fully, as he nodded.","Seeing that the conversation was almost over, Master Xia said:","\"Consider what I said, but your cultivation level is still too low. Even if you want to join the Xia family, it’s still early, so no need to rush, take your time to consider.\"","\"Alright.\" Mo Hua nodded.","Master Xia lightly flicked his sleeve, seemingly cancelling a spell, and the spiritual shield vanished, causing the surrounding noise to rise slightly.","Mo Hua knew that this \"secret talk\" amidst the public had come to an end.","And afterward, Master Xia indeed didn’t glance at him or speak another word, as if he didn’t know him at all.","Mo Hua sighed in his heart.","Truly, the inspector from the Taoist Court does things seamlessly.","The secret talk ended, and the annual banquet continued.","While eating a feast of delicacies from the mountains and seas, Mo Hua pondered over the conversation with Master Xia.","Including future paths, bloodlines, dragons, and such...","While he was deep in thought, there was suddenly another commotion in the crowd. Looking up, Mo Hua saw someone else approaching, surrounded by people not far away.","The newcomer was a noble and elegant woman, her expression cold, her beauty unmatched. She wore a Taoist Robe embroidered with hundreds of flowers, vibrant and luxurious, yet dignified and elegant.","This woman’s beauty was breathtaking, her aura imposing, making others involuntarily feel inferior as she walked through the crowd.","The originally noisy banquet quieted down slightly.","Gu Shouyan was taken aback, quickly stood up to greet her, saying: \"I didn’t know Hua Valley Master was coming, I apologize for not welcoming you from afar.\"","Within the Gu family, there were female disciples who had joined the Hundred Flower Valley, and they all stood up at this moment to respectfully greet the stunning woman: \"Greetings, Valley Master.\"","Hua Valley Master nodded slightly.","Gu Shouyan was a bit puzzled, asking: \"Valley Master, your purpose here is...?\"","Hua Valley Master’s gaze, like a fleeting glance, swept across the female disciples of the Gu family, seemingly yet subtly drifting towards the high platform, landing on Mo Hua, her lips curling into a slight, shallow smile:","\"I came to see... the disciple of our Hundred Flower Valley...\""]},{"number":1907,"title":"Chapter 1907 - 933: Hua Valley Master","paragraphs":["With a clatter, Mo Hua’s chopsticks dropped onto the table. He was totally stunned.","Maybe no one else caught it, but Mo Hua definitely understood. He knew perfectly well what he’d done.","Especially since, just now, he’d clearly seen that impossibly beautiful Valley Master of Hundred Flower Valley give him a deep, meaningful look.","Mo Hua’s heart skipped a beat.","\"Did the Sect Leader of Hundred Flower Valley find out I snuck in? No way, my luck can’t be that bad...\"","\"Or was it Senior Sister Qianqian who sold me out? Did she quietly spill all my black history to the Sect Leader?\"","\"No, Qianqian would never do that...\"","Mo Hua’s thoughts were a mess; even the crab in his mouth tasted bland.","On the other side, Gu Shouyan also noticed the Valley Master’s glance, nodded ever so slightly, understanding what was going on.","This Valley Master of Hundred Flower Valley might seem like she was visiting the Gu Family just to see the Hundred Flower Valley disciples, but really, she was here for Mo Hua, the \"Formation Leader.\"","But what he didn’t know was, this \"Formation Leader\" was, in a way, also a \"Disciple of Hundred Flower Valley.\"","Hundred Flower Valley held a special place, and with the Valley Master here herself, Gu Shouyan was extra polite:","\"Valley Master, please take the honored seat.\"","Since she was an \"unexpected guest,\" Gu Shouyan had ordered for a seat to be arranged on the fly.","Given the Valley Master’s high status, she was seated on par with the Family Head, set just to the right of Master Xia—right next to Mo Hua.","Seeing the Valley Master, Master Xia stood up to greet her, cupped his hands and said: \"Master Valley, my respects.\"","His manner was surprisingly respectful.","The Valley Master simply nodded lightly, then seated herself beside Mo Hua.","Mo Hua quietly picked up his chopsticks again, sat up ramrod straight, barely even breathed, picking at the crab meat with the tiniest movements, all delicate and well-behaved—nothing like his previously carefree and lively feasting.","Master Xia gave him a strange look, wondering to himself how this kid had managed to change personalities in the blink of an eye.","Wasn’t he just talking non-stop a second ago?","He turned to look at the Valley Master, dressed in ornate palace attire, her features exquisite—his expression grew odd.","The Valley Master sat with graceful poise, her white jade fingers holding a crystal cup, sipping flower wine, every gesture elegant and dignified. Since sitting down, she hadn’t said a word.","Mo Hua, feeling like he was sitting on pins and needles, couldn’t help but breathe a sigh of relief, thinking:","\"It must be in my head. Surely this beautiful Valley Master doesn’t know I sneaked into Hundred Flower Valley...\"","\"If I just pretend nothing happened and finish this meal quietly, then bolt out of here before she catches me...\"","\"She looks so cold and aloof, she probably won’t even bother with me...\"","But as if his inner monologue had been overheard, a clear and ethereal voice suddenly piped up:","\"You’re Mo Hua, right?\"","Mo Hua’s body instantly froze, turning his head stiffly to find the Valley Master’s devastatingly lovely face, curved in a half-smile, half-smirk.","\"I... am,\" Mo Hua replied in a small voice.","\"Do you know who I am?\" the Valley Master asked him.","Mo Hua sensed something was off, nodded, \"You’re... the Valley Master of Hundred Flower Valley...\"","\"Oh?\" The Valley Master’s eyes flickered, \"You’re pretty familiar with Hundred Flower Valley, huh?\"","Mo Hua’s heart gave a thump.","Damn, looks like this Valley Master really knows everything.","But... when did she find out?","She couldn’t have known from the very beginning, right?","Did she see him wearing a Hundred Flower Valley Taoist Robe?","No way, right?","The Valley Master’s clear eyes watched him intently, and Mo Hua could only steel himself and, feeling a bit guilty, said, \"Well, kind of... a little familiar... but not that much...\"","Truth was, he’d only gone to Hundred Flower Valley once, and the whole way Qianqian had led him around, keeping his head down, all meek and obedient—he hadn’t really seen anything, forbidden or not.","\"Mo Hua...\" the Valley Master murmured his name, then praised softly, \"A Formation Leader at Foundation Establishment—Middle Stage, there’s probably no one else like you even in the Qianxue State Boundary.\"","Mo Hua replied modestly, \"You flatter me, Valley Master.\"","\"I have a request. May I ask, Young Master, would you consider?\"","Knowing he was in the wrong, Mo Hua answered, \"Please, Valley Master, speak your mind.\"","The Valley Master spoke gently, \"All the disciples of my Hundred Flower Valley are young women, used to tending flowers and herbs, so they’re a bit lazy. Their Formation studies aren’t up to par. If Young Master Mo has the chance, perhaps you’d visit Hundred Flower Valley and teach a bit on Formations?\"","Mo Hua wouldn’t dare say a word of refusal, so he nodded immediately, \"Certainly. I’d be honored.\"","But as soon as he said it, he caught himself and asked, confused, \"Isn’t Hundred Flower Valley off-limits to male disciples?\"","The Valley Master’s half-smile grew, \"Oh, I almost forgot—yes, men aren’t allowed inside Hundred Flower Valley. Good thing you remember the rules so well, Young Master.\"","Mo Hua wished he could crawl into a hole in the ground.","Seeing Mo Hua’s cheeks flush red as an apple, the Valley Master found him amusing and decided not to press any further, raising her winecup and, half sincere, half teasing, said:","\"Young Master, you have a bright future. I offer you a toast. If Hundred Flower Valley ever needs anything down the line, I hope you’ll lend a helping hand.\"","At the side, Master Xia shot the Valley Master a surprised look, not expecting her to say something like that.","Mo Hua hurriedly picked up his cup, returning the gesture:","\"I, Mo Hua, am of humble talent. If the Valley Master should ever need it, I promise I’ll give my all.\"","The Valley Master nodded in satisfaction, drained her flower wine in one go, eyes smiling at Mo Hua, \"Please, Young Master, be seated. No need to be so tense.\"","After drinking, Mo Hua gave the Valley Master a bow and finally sat properly.","At the same time, he let out a long sigh of relief.","Thank goodness the Valley Master was magnanimous, only asking him to make a promise—a little \"pledge of loyalty\"—and let the whole affair slide, without actually punishing him for sneaking into Hundred Flower Valley against the rules."]},{"number":1908,"title":"Chapter 1908 - 933: Hua Valley Master (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Otherwise, I’d really be down on my luck.","Even if it doesn’t get that bad, it’d still be a massive embarrassment.","The dignified junior brother of Taixu Gate, Formation Leader of Qianxue State Boundary, sneaking around in a Hundred Flower Valley Taoist Robe, quietly blending into Hundred Flower Valley.","If people ever found out...","Just thinking about it made Mo Hua’s scalp tingle.","The New Year banquet kept rolling on, and Mo Hua didn’t dare do anything else, didn’t dare say a word, didn’t even dare look around, just kept his head down quietly, eating at the table until the very end of the banquet.","During that time, the strikingly beautiful Hua Valley Master only exchanged a couple of polite words with Patriarch Gu, then sat alone, drinking her wine.","She had status, looked gorgeous, carried an elegant air—and her presence was immense.","She didn’t speak, and no one in the room dared disturb her.","Once the banquet ended, Hua Valley Master rose to leave, Gu Shouyan and Master Xia all stood up to see her off.","\"Sorry for the lackluster hospitality. Please forgive us,\" said Gu Shouyan.","Hua Valley Master smiled softly. \"Sorry to impose. Thank you for your trouble, Patriarch Gu.\"","Gu Shouyan cupped his fists. \"Not at all, I’ll walk you out.\"","Hua Valley Master gave a slight nod, and just before leaving, she glanced back at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua had drunk a lot, the alcohol still lingering, his cheeks flushed with a trace of red, but his eyes were even brighter than usual; he stood well-behaved on the high platform, looking shy and quiet.","Hua Valley Master’s thoughts stirred, and couldn’t help but recall, the scene in the upper pavilion—when she saw Mo Hua dressed in Hundred Flower Valley Taoist Robe, walking down that flowery mountain path in a riot of color.","\"This kid, wearing my Hundred Flower Valley Taoist Robe... actually looked pretty damn good...\"","After just that single glance, Hua Valley Master turned, left the Gu family hall, and climbed into the Hundred Flower Valley carriage, surrounded by a bevy of Hundred Flower Valley women.","Inside the lavish, fragrant carriage covered in floral silk and brocade.","Hua Valley Master sat upright for a long while, then silently took out a treasured sword.","The sword was inlaid with gold and jade, ancient and precious, with the words \"Dragon Spring\" inscribed upon the blade.","But the sword was covered in dust, and hadn’t left its sheath in ages, just like its former master—a hidden gem, long lost to time and hardship.","Hua Valley Master gently stroked the Dragon Spring Sword, her expression wistful, half-muttering to herself, half speaking to the sword:","\"That day at the Formation Competition, I saw this kid, relying on his own strength, suppressing the Four Great Sects and hundreds of sects’ prodigies... cold and fierce, with a demeanor that defied the whole world. He reminded me so much of you. For a moment I wondered, maybe there’s some kind of fate between him and you...\"","\"But seeing him today, he’s just too shy and cute. Plus, no bloodline, and his Spiritual Root is weak. You never took in disciples like that.\"","\"The disciples you chose... I can’t imagine them strutting around in my Hundred Flower Valley Taoist Robe, barging into my valley...\"","Her face twisted into something between a smile and a sigh, then finally settled into deep melancholy.","Some memories, when you first recall them, taste sweet. But the longer you chew on them, the more they leave you with a bitter aftertaste. The more you dwell, the more it hurts.","\"In this lifetime... will I ever see you again...\"","Every word stabbed straight to the heart.","But the Dragon Spring Sword lay silent, unable to reply.","...","At the Gu family, in the banquet hall.","Mo Hua watched as Hua Valley Master departed, immediately feeling a huge weight lift from his shoulders.","\"Guess I dodged a bullet...\"","\"From now on, I’ll never show my face again. This life—never, ever going to Hundred Flower Valley. Hell no, not happening...\"","Then a question nagged at him.","That Hua Valley Master, the seriously beautiful one... she seemed to carry a lot of weight?","Not only did the always serious and upright Patriarch Gu defer to her, even Summer Family’s Sixth Grade, Dao Court Inspector Master Xia bent over backward not to offend her.","Why?","Hundred Flower Valley, at the end of the day, is just one of the Twelve Sects, right...","Isn’t she just the Sect Leader of Hundred Flower Valley?","Unless this Hua Valley Master actually has another, deeper background? Or some kind of remarkable origin?","Mo Hua pondered, didn’t come up with much, so decided not to overthink it. Wasn’t his problem anyway.","As long as he avoided that pretty Valley Master from now on, and didn’t let her catch him again, he’d be fine.","Mo Hua gave a quiet sigh.","He’d originally thought, like every year, this banquet was just a chance to freeload a nice meal. Never expected to bump into so many unexpected people.","And huge players, all of them.","Still, he managed to muddle through—and picked up a ton of hush-hush big family secrets. Worth it, honestly.","And with that... the banquet wrapped up.","Guests trickled out, one by one.","Mo Hua, per usual, strolled around the Gu family’s courtyard, working off some food, and accidentally ran into Elder Gu Hong.","Elder Gu Hong was dressed all in red, beaming with joy.","Mo Hua asked curiously, \"Elder Hong, something good happen? How come you’re in such a good mood?\"","Elder Gu Hong saw it was Mo Hua, pulled him over to sit and poured him tea, piled on fruit. \"Here, eat, let me tell you.\"","Mo Hua was already stuffed, but picked up a slice of melon anyway and nibbled at it.","\"It’s about Changhuai,\" Elder Gu Hong said with satisfaction, \"These past days, a bunch of families from the Qianxue State Boundary have come to me about proposing marriage...\"","Mo Hua was a little surprised. \"Uncle Gu’s stock is rising?\"","\"Rising stock, huh? You brat...\" Elder Gu Hong grumbled, but clearly didn’t mind at all—he couldn’t even hide his smile.","\"So what happened?\" Mo Hua pressed, curious.","Elder Gu Hong explained, \"Told you before, Changhuai is a Supervisor, which, on paper, is a pretty sweet gig. But for marriages among the big families? Not so much. It’s risky, it’s tough, you’re away from home all year round.\"","\"Don’t take bribes, and the pay’s crap. Take bribes, and you end up sliding down the Outer Gate Evil Path if you’re not careful.\"","\"Plus, Changhuai’s personality—you know how he is. That’s why proposing matches for him always hit a wall.\""]},{"number":1909,"title":"Chapter 1909 - 933: Hua Valley Master (Part 3)","paragraphs":["\"But over these past few years, Changhuai, whether it’s due to a turn of fortune or meeting a ’noble person,’ has achieved quite a lot of merit working in the Taoist Court.\"","\"Just recently, he even eradicated a Demon Sect with over a thousand members.\"","\"That’s quite an accomplishment. It seems the Taoist Court is even considering promoting him to ’Deputy Court Leader.’ At his age, with hard work, his cultivation could reach Feather Transformation, and with more experience, if fortune favors him, he might even become the Court Leader of the Qianxue State Boundary in the future.\"","\"Even if he doesn’t become the Court Leader of the Qianxue State Boundary, being placed in other slightly inferior Fourth or Fifth Grade State Boundaries as a local Court Leader, with great authority in hand, his prospects are still limitless.\"","Even Mo Hua was astonished, \"Uncle Gu has such a promising future?\"","Elder Gu Hong looked pleased, \"Changhuai himself is not lacking. In the Taoist Court, in terms of qualification, family background, and capability, he is top-notch. Of course, his temper is somewhat lacking, and his popularity isn’t the best. But being a Supervisor is about offending people, so that’s not much of a shortcoming.\"","\"Previously, the biggest issue was his ’performance,’ which was middling, so whether he got promoted or not was indifferent.\"","\"But now, he’s proven his achievements, and he has the experience. That previous Supervisor from the Xiao family...who was that?\"","\"Xiao Zhenhai?\" Mo Hua chimed in.","\"Right,\" Elder Gu Hong said, \"Xiao Zhenhai, originally more experienced than Changhuai, also more adept at networking, but it seems he got himself into trouble? Is he gone now?\"","\"Yes.\" Mo Hua nodded.","Got himself killed.","\"So,\" Elder Gu Hong continued, \"now in the Taoist Court, when you count them all, Changhuai stands out. If not promoting him, then who? He’s a man of the Gu family. If he was lacking in ability, being suppressed would be one thing. But now that he has both ability and experience, who dares openly put my Gu family at a disadvantage?\"","Mo Hua slightly nodded.","Elder Gu Hong remarked, \"Among these great families, indeed there are many who are not so sharp, but each can be sharper than the other when it comes to shrewdness. Seeing Changhuai’s situation and knowing he has boundless prospects, potentially becoming a ’Court Leader,’ their attitudes change entirely.\"","\"These past few days, those talking about this almost broke the threshold down.\"","Elder Gu Hong couldn’t help but be a bit pleased, boasting to Mo Hua.","Mo Hua was also happy for Uncle Gu.","However, he also had his own little plans.","Mo Hua quietly asked, \"But... isn’t Sister Xia good?\"","Elder Gu Hong was momentarily startled, then sighed, \"That girl is certainly good, but still, as I said before... Changhuai might not be up to match...\"","\"The future ’Court Leader’ wouldn’t be a match?\"","\"You mentioned, it’s ’the future,’ who can say for sure about the future?\" Elder Gu Hong shook his head, \"To other families and small families, the position of Court Leader is extremely precious, but to the Daozhou Xia Family, it’s not so crucial. Furthermore, the appointment to Court Leader, before it’s settled, everything is uncertain...\"","Mo Hua mused, \"What if... I speak with Master Xia on his behalf?\"","Elder Gu Hong, surprised, asked, \"You have ties with Master Xia?\"","\"A little,\" Mo Hua answered.","Just a little tie from chatting recently.","Elder Gu Hong patted Mo Hua’s shoulder, pleased, \"I appreciate your intentions, but in matters like these, they can’t be forced. A person’s destined marriage in life, sometimes, is fate, and ultimately, it depends on Changhuai’s own affinity.\"","\"You shouldn’t expend favors on him. Among great families, favors are very precious. Without a family to rely on, save these favors for yourself for the future, and don’t always fret over others.\"","Elder Gu Hong’s words were sincere and considerate of Mo Hua.","Mo Hua felt grateful and nodded, \"Elder Hong, I understand.\"","...","After bidding farewell to Elder Gu Hong, Mo Hua went to see Gu Changhuai.","Gu Changhuai was in the study, perusing the files of the Taoist Court.","Mo Hua couldn’t help but ask, \"Isn’t the Demon Sect matter finished?\"","\"There’s still some wrapping up to do,\" Gu Changhuai looked up, glancing at the fruits in Mo Hua’s hands, \"You came from Aunt Hong’s?\"","\"Yes,\" Mo Hua nodded, \"Elder Hong told me there are many people proposing, and you’re almost ready to marry...no, you’re almost ready to take a Dao companion.\"","Gu Changhuai paused in his actions, slowly uttering an \"Oh.\"","Mo Hua observed his expression and quietly asked, \"Uncle Gu, what do you think?\"","\"What are you thinking about?\"","Mo Hua felt that he was playing dumb, so he probed, \"What do you think of Sister Xia?\"","Gu Changhuai was stunned for a moment and then said lightly, \"...Just like that.\"","Seeing his heart and mouth were in disagreement, Mo Hua sighed, thought for a moment, and said:","\"Uncle Gu, let me tell you a story...\"","\"When I was little, there was an instructor for Formation enlightenment named Mr. Yan. On the surface, he seemed like just a Formation instructor in Little Immortal City, but in truth, he carried the blood feud of a devastated Sect, spending his life searching for the Sect’s traitor, with a single-minded focus on reclaiming the Sect’s heritage.\"","\"Instructor Yan had a chubby junior brother who always persuaded him to find a Dao companion to pass on his legacy, but Instructor Yan always refused.\"","\"In the end, after relentless efforts, Instructor Yan found the traitor and reclaimed the heritage, planning to devote all his remaining efforts to rebuilding the Sect.\"","\"I once thought Instructor Yan would die alone.\"","\"But later, Instructor Yan met a female Formation Master, and upon merely seeing a portrait of her, he rushed to pursue her without a second thought, and they were married in less than two months...\"","\"Instructor Yan also told me to never let go of what you can grasp.\"","\"So,\" Mo Hua concluded, \"in this life, if there’s no destined meeting, just focus on your own affairs.\"","\"But if there truly is a destined meeting, you must seize it, or you’ll regret it for a lifetime.\"","Mo Hua looked serious.","Gu Changhuai stared blankly at Mo Hua and after a moment couldn’t help but ask, \"How old are you? How do you have so much nonsense in your head?\"","Mo Hua replied, \"I can’t help it, naturally smart, that’s just how it is.\"","Gu Changhuai’s face darkened, responding with resignation, \"Alright, alright, off you go, I still have things to do.\"","After saying that, he lowered his head and resumed looking at the document.","\"Alright then, I won’t disturb you.\" Mo Hua said with a little reluctance and left.","After Mo Hua left, Gu Changhuai looked at the document for a while but couldn’t help recalling Mo Hua’s words in his mind.","He lowered his head, looked at his hands, and muttered:","\"Never let go of what you can grasp...\"","...","After leaving Gu Changhuai’s study, Mo Hua wandered around the Gu Family a few more times before planning to return to the Sect.","As in previous years, after having dinner, he typically wouldn’t stay overnight.","Now, he had enough time to return, and after going back to the Sect, he could practice Formations again in his Sea of Consciousness.","As for Uncle Gu’s romance, it was something he had to figure out himself, Mo Hua had done his best.","The Gu Family personally sent a carriage to take Mo Hua back to the Sect.","But at this time, coinciding with the festival, Qingzhou City was bustling with traffic and very crowded; he needed to get outside the city to catch the carriage.","Mo Hua wasn’t in a hurry, taking this opportunity to stroll around and enjoy the night scenery of Qingzhou City.","At this moment, red lanterns like dragons, colorful fireworks filling the sky, amid the pitch-black night, thousands of trees blooming, extraordinarily beautiful.","Mo Hua strolled through the night scene while making his way out of the city.","As he walked, suddenly someone brushed past him.","Because there were already many people on the street, at first, Mo Hua didn’t pay it any mind, but as they passed by, a sudden chill rose from his heart.","A blur appeared before his eyes and a mass of dark purple Heavenly Mechanism Causality slowly emerged, weaving and twisting together, ugly and dirty, yet suffused with a depraved desire, like a filthy heart or a decaying \"poppy.\"","The poppy gradually bloomed...","Just like that night by the Mistwater River, when he first saw the Rouge Boat.","Mo Hua’s pupils trembled, and he immediately turned around.","At that same moment, the young nobleman who had brushed past him seemed to feel something as well and turned his head.","In an instant, their eyes met, and they clearly saw each other’s faces."]},{"number":1910,"title":"Chapter 1910 - 934: Young Lord","paragraphs":["This was a young nobleman, elegantly dressed and handsome as jade.","His fair and striking features carried a natural air of nobility.","His appearance was unfamiliar—Mo Hua was seeing him for the first time—yet there was an odd sense of déjà vu, as if the two of them shared some karmic entanglement from long ago.","Mo Hua gazed at the nobleman, his thoughts unsettled.","At the same time, the young nobleman’s eyes were fixed on Mo Hua. For a brief moment, surprise flickered across his face; then his brows arched, and he spoke indifferently:","\"You are... Mo Hua?\"","Mo Hua’s heart skipped a beat, but his expression remained calm. \"You know me?\"","\"Qianxue State Boundary, Formation Leader...\" The young nobleman’s tone held a hint of approval and a touch of nonchalance. \"My cousin Jun Cai lost to you once. He mentioned you—your Formation skills are impressive.\"","Mo Hua responded blandly, \"You flatter me.\"","He looked the young nobleman over again and asked, \"May I ask, sir, your esteemed surname and given name?\"","The young nobleman’s lips curled into a cold smile, tinged with displeasure.","It seemed he was always the one being greeted, his name spoken with humility—never had anyone failed to know his name, let alone dared to ask him directly.","He looked down on Mo Hua with pride, not wanting to answer, but for some reason, found himself willing to make an exception with Mo Hua’s unusual aura.","The young nobleman said coolly, \"Qian Taoist Sect, Shen Linsu.\"","Qian Taoist Sect, Shen Linsu, Shen...","Mo Hua’s pupils contracted minutely.","This youthful nobleman, handsome as jade, was actually a disciple of the Shen Family from the Qian Taoist Sect?","Mo Hua glanced behind the young nobleman.","There were six cultivators following him.","Three of them at Foundation Establishment Late Stage, with refined bearing—clearly heir-apparent sons from elite families of the Qianxue state boundary.","Two were middle-aged, their cultivation profound—Golden Core Cultivators.","The last was an old man, whose depth was utterly unfathomable.","Mo Hua couldn’t gauge the old man’s origins, but having dealt with many High-Rank cultivators, his instincts told him: this elder must be a Feather Transformation Realm True Man.","Shen Linsu went out with three top-tier clan followers, two Golden Core Guards, and a Feathered Immortal as escort.","Even in the Shen Family, or the Qian Taoist Sect, this level of treatment marked him as an extraordinary favored son of heaven.","Shen \"Linsu\"... just as the name implies.","Mo Hua’s thoughts churned beneath a calm facade.","Shen Linsu glanced at Mo Hua again, and—almost as if compelled—said, \"On the seventh day of the new year, I’m hosting a Daoist tea gathering. Will you attend?\"","At these words, the three disciples behind Shen Linsu all changed expression.","The two Golden Core Guards looked astonished.","Even the Feathered Immortal now fixed a deep gaze upon Mo Hua.","A tea gathering?","This is probably no ordinary feast.","Mo Hua shook his head. \"We’re barely acquaintances.\"","Shen Linsu’s eyelid twitched. \"I rarely invite anyone personally.\"","\"Oh...\" Mo Hua replied indifferently.","Shen Linsu’s face hardened, his eyes cold and sharp. He scoffed, \"I give you a chance, and you can’t take it.\" Flinging his sleeve, he turned and walked away.","The three young clan followers quickly hurried after him. As they passed Mo Hua, they cast him sidelong glances, eyes glinting with jealousy and scorn at his supposed ignorance.","The two Golden Core cultivators and the Feathered Immortal also silently followed behind Shen Linsu.","And just like that, the group vanished into the crowd.","Once they’d gone, Mo Hua finally let out a long breath, cold sweat beading in his palm. Not daring to linger, he hurried to Qingzhou City’s gate, boarded the Gu Family’s carriage, and headed straight for the Sect without pause.","The brightly lit Qingzhou City receded into the distance.","The carriage left the bustle behind and rolled into the deep night.","Inside, Mo Hua couldn’t help sinking into thought:","\"That omen just now... it wasn’t an illusion. Those ’poppy-like’ karmic chains were exactly the same as the ones on Rouge Boat.\"","\"Shen Linsu must be connected to Rouge Boat.\"","\"Could Shen Linsu be the very ’nobleman,’ the one surrounded by praise, onboard Rouge Boat?\"","\"Back in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons—was the nobleman I hunted through those nightmare visions also him?\"","\"Is he the mastermind? Or at least, is he the person of highest power and status behind both the Rouge Boat and Demon Valley affairs?\"","Mo Hua’s expression was grim.","Human encounters truly are unpredictable and strange.","He’d never imagined he would run into the ’nobleman’ of the Shen Family, in such an offhanded moment, utterly unprepared.","The Shen Family...","Is Mr. Tu backed by the Shen Family? By the Qian Taoist Sect?","It would make sense—and it’d be easier to settle all accounts at once.","But he had no evidence yet; he couldn’t prove whether his deduction was true.","Shen Linsu’s status was indeed lofty—but was he truly the Young Masters’ Pavilion’s nobleman? Was he truly the one behind the Rouge Boat, Demon Valley, even Mr. Tu’s chosen ’mastermind’?","He had no proof of any of this.","And also...","\"Does he really know who I am?\"","Mo Hua frowned. \"He knows my name is Mo Hua, disciple of Taixu Gate, Formation Leader of Qianxue State Boundary, but he shouldn’t know my real identity...\"","\"Otherwise, he would have killed me outright just now—never mind inviting me to his Daoist tea gathering, to sit and drink tea together.\"","\"And that tea gathering... probably not a genuine invitation. Who knows what he plans to serve...\"","\"Could I kill him? Probably not...\"","\"Besides, with Golden Core followers and a Feathered Immortal for protection, I can’t afford to provoke him. All I can do is keep my distance and hurry back to the Sect first...\""]},{"number":1911,"title":"Chapter 1911 - 934: The Young Master (2)","paragraphs":["The carriage sped along, and the scenery outside the window was swallowed by darkness.","Mo Hua stared blankly out the window, his thoughts a tangled mess, yet he could vaguely sense that some crucial figures were gradually surfacing...","...","As Mo Hua passed through Qingzhou City’s southern gate and left the city—","The young lord named \"Shen Linsu\" and his entourage headed for the northern gate, boarding a carriage that looked plain on the outside but was extravagantly luxurious within, heading in the opposite direction to Mo Hua.","Inside the carriage, Shen Linsu, his face handsome as jade, lounged atop a soft pelt of an Exotic Beast, tapping lightly on the table with his finger in silence, his expression dark and sullen.","The atmosphere in the carriage was stifling.","Everyone more or less guessed the reason for the young lord’s foul mood.","One of the noble-born Disciples tried to console him, \"Mr. Shu, that man is too blind to see Mount Tai before him—the chance for a meteoric rise is staring him in the face, and yet he fails to grasp it.\"","\"These Formation Masters always have their heads buried in study and understand nothing about the world.\"","\"They cram Formation knowledge until their brains turn to mush, don’t know how to scheme, and end up slaving away for others their entire lives.\"","\"Indeed. Someone so blind to honor isn’t worth your time, young lord.\"","\"I know.\" Shen Linsu spoke coolly, but his face only grew uglier.","From childhood to now, he’d never spoken so courteously to anyone of his own generation.","Yet today, when he encountered this \"Mo Hua,\" on some strange impulse he’d deigned to invite him, even wanting him to join the Young Masters’ Pavilion tea gathering.","He didn’t even understand why he’d done that.","Since \"Young Masters’ Pavilion\" holds the word \"Master,\" it’s not just about talent in Tao Cultivation—family, background, and bloodline are all indispensable.","This Mo Hua—Formation Leader or not—his family, Spiritual Root, Bloodline are all too lowly. To join the Young Masters’ Pavilion, to mingle with them, he’s nowhere near worthy.","Especially family and bloodline—you either have them or you don’t.","It’s like a giant Heavenly Chasm keeping the low-born, powerless, and insignificant forever outside the core circle.","This Mo Hua has no idea what an insanely precious invitation he was handed.","This was the real sky-ladder of the Cultivation World.","The true path of the privileged elite.","The people of the Young Masters’ Pavilion—he could never hope to associate with them. Even to sit and have tea together, he ought to feel unspeakably honored.","Yet Mo Hua refused.","Whether it’s \"eyes and no pearls,\" or \"not knowing what’s good for him,\" it’s like a thorn stuck in the heart, making him unspeakably uneasy.","And besides, Shen Linsu felt there was something oddly familiar about Mo Hua.","Shen Linsu’s brow furrowed.","Seeing that Shen Linsu was still troubled, another noble Disciple smiled and whispered,","\"There’s no need to care, Mr. Shu. The low-born are blind from birth—chances sit right before them and they never seize them. That’s why they’re fated to remain low-born.\"","\"No matter whether he’s truly ’blind with eyes,’ he shouldn’t disrespect you. To disrespect you is to disrespect the Young Masters’ Pavilion. If everyone follows suit, where lies our authority?\"","\"How about...\" The noble’s gaze flickered. \"We get someone to snatch him, gouge out his eyes, break his limbs, and dump him in the Mistwater River to feed the Clam Demons?\"","The others laughed in agreement, \"Indeed—a fine idea.\"","\"If he’s blind, then those eyes are useless anyway.\"","The two Golden Core Guards remained silent, pretending not to have heard a thing.","The only Elder Feathered Immortal present, however, frowned deeply.","He knew these young lords were capable of anything.","Their backgrounds were simply too good. Since childhood, they get whatever they want, with too many people flattering them to no end. Some among those toadying up are even Taoist Court Supervisors and Court Leaders. So to these young masters, the very word \"law\" simply does not exist.","Whatever trouble they cause, the family always cleans up after them.","They even take pride in making messes, knowing nothing of fear.","But this \"Mo Hua\"—he absolutely cannot be touched...","He’s Taixu Gate’s Formation Leader, with Ancestor Xun backing him.","Low-born or not, he’s not some pawn to be trifled with.","To move against him would mean endless trouble.","But such things can’t be spoken openly.","If these young lords get it into their heads to rebel, some hot-blooded impulse could actually get Mo Hua killed.","That would mean a mortal vendetta.","The Elder Feathered Immortal pondered a moment, then spoke:","\"The path of Formations is, in the end, just a ’craft of skill.’ No matter how well you learn it, you’ll only ever serve the nobility. Scholars hone their arts, but their wares are still traded to the great families. No matter how hard the low-born struggle, they can never escape this fate.\"","\"This Mo Hua is the same. Formation skills or not, at best he’s just a high-grade ox and horse. Young lord, you need not take it to heart—don’t cheapen your own standing.\"","Shen Linsu froze, nodding slightly.","The others, though a bit disappointed, did not contradict the Feathered Immortal in his presence.","Seeing this, the Elder Feathered Immortal added:","\"What’s more, soon the next Sword Discussion Conference will be held. That is the truly important matter—before then, it’s best to avoid distractions or unnecessary complications.\"","At this, the noble Disciples all grew much more serious.","One nodded in agreement, \"True, the Sword Discussion Conference is what matters. Nine years in the Sect, and yet you only get this one chance. You could even say for a Sect Disciple, this is their only shot in life.\"","Another noble-born quickly flattered, \"Mr. Shu, with your family and talents, if you add the glory of being Champion of the Conference, you’ll soar directly to Tian Shu, and the path to immortality will be clear before you.\""]},{"number":1912,"title":"Chapter 1912 - 934: Young Master_3","paragraphs":["\"That’s right, ranking is everything. As long as we get first place, our Ancestor will give us whatever we want. We’ll be able to do anything we want in the future, and no one will dare to control us.\"","\"In the Cultivation World, power is paramount.\"","\"A genius, a genius, as long as you’re talented enough, whatever you do is right.\"","\"If I can get first place, even if I break into the Taoist Court and kill a Supervisor, the Ancestor would probably cover for me.\"","\"Bullshit, I don’t believe it.\"","\"I’ll kill someone and show you, just bet on whether the Ancestor will protect me. If I get protected, you’ll let me play with your betrothed Dao partner for a night.\"","\"Screw you.\"","\"You don’t believe me?\"","\"It’s not that I don’t believe the Ancestor will protect you; I don’t believe you can get first place. With your skills, you think you deserve to be first in Debating Sword?\"","\"You spineless wimp dare to say that about me. I may not match Mr. Shu, but I’m better than you. By the way, do you agree or not... that betrothed Dao partner of yours is from the Ming family, right? I’ve wanted her for a long time...\"","\"Get lost, I don’t even dare touch her.\"","\"It’s just a game, what are you afraid of...\"","...","These noble family’s sons are speaking more and more absurdly.","But the two Golden Core cultivators nearby remained silent, even the Elder Feathered Immortal acted like he saw nothing and heard nothing.","For a job like theirs, the most important thing is to neither listen nor speak. That way, they won’t make mistakes.","These noble infants in front of them were truly \"little ancestors,\" and were not to be offended at all.","If they truly offended them and made them hold a grudge, they could go to their parents, elders, or even the Ancestor to lodge a complaint.","Even if they themselves are Golden Core or Feather Transformation cultivators, they can’t afford the consequences.","This is the power of authority.","And this power is based on the enormous strength of these noble families.","A few noble family’s sons quarreled for a while, when suddenly someone asked:","\"Mr. Shu, why are we going to Solitary Mountain City? Isn’t that taking a big detour? I’m worried we won’t make it to the family’s ancestor worship.\"","Shen Linsu didn’t answer.","Someone said, \"The gentleman instructed us. Just do as he says. Why do you talk so much?\"","\"You...\"","Shen Linsu ignored their quarrel.","He looked out at the dark night outside the window, with thoughts unknown, and after a moment, that familiar feeling came again, and Shen Linsu involuntarily thought of Mo Hua.","He remembered Mo Hua’s bright eyes and his pure, indifferent face.","\"Was it really my first time meeting him? Why does he feel so familiar? Even...\"","Feel wary?","Do I feel wary?","Shen Linsu’s gaze turned slightly cold, murmuring in his heart:","\"This Mo Hua... who exactly is he?\"","...","Taixu Gate.","After returning to the Sect, Mo Hua temporarily settled down.","In the following days, he took time to investigate this \"Shen Linsu,\" but he didn’t gather much information. He vaguely learned that even among noble families, they are truly \"high-door children,\" completely different from ordinary Disciples, especially someone like Mo Hua.","Mo Hua sighed.","Cultivation barriers, the monopoly of inheritance, the isolation of bloodline...","The more he looked into these channels and layers of barriers, the deeper and higher they appeared.","Of course, Mo Hua just sighed; there’s nothing he can do about it.","Afterwards, he continued to diligently attend cultivation classes.","The new year of Sect life began, and everything soon settled into routine.","This was Mo Hua’s eighth year at Taixu Gate, and it was also the penultimate year of the Sect’s nine-year cultivation.","Next year, it would be the Debating Dao Conference.","In the Qianxue state boundary, a Disciple can only participate in the Debating Dao Conference once in a lifetime. Therefore, the opportunity to debate the Dao is extremely precious.","The one last Debating Dao Conference that Mo Hua attended was an exception, courtesy of backdoor access.","By rights, next year’s Debating Dao Conference is his rightful turn.","And for the Debating Dao Conference of his generation, in the blink of an eye, it’s just over a year away.","Mo Hua felt that time flew by quickly, even though he’s been through so much, yet entry day seemed just like yesterday. In the blink of an eye, the nine-year term is nearly over and he’s about to graduate.","Mo Hua couldn’t help but feel a bit of urgency, yet why he felt urgent, he couldn’t quite articulate.","...","Taixu Gate, Sect Leader Residence.","Towers stood towering, cloud-wrapped.","Elder Master Xun and the Taixu Sect Master were drinking tea and discussing matters.","\"The next Debating Dao Conference is almost upon us, less than two years away...\" the Taixu Sect Master sighed.","Elder Master Xun silently drank tea, without speaking.","The Taixu Sect Master hesitated for a moment, still feeling a bit anxious in his heart, and asked, \"Master, do you think our Taixu Gate will get a decent ranking this time?\"","Elder Master Xun calmly said, \"Asking me is of no use, I don’t tell fortunes.\"","\"Aren’t you capable of deducing Cause and Effect?\"","\"That’s called deduction, not fortune-telling. Very few in the Cultivation World truly can tell fortunes. Besides, in deducing Cause and Effect, you’re not the only one who can do it, others can too. Trying to take shortcuts in this aspect is futile.\"","The Taixu Sect Master felt a bit regretful and then frowned, \"By rights, after the Three Sects Unification, our Taixu Gate’s strength isn’t what it used to be. With formations and Mo Hua as a safety net, even if we don’t advance further in the next Debating Dao Conference, it shouldn’t be a problem to maintain our ranking, but...\"","The Taixu Sect Master sighed, \"I always feel uneasy, as if something major will happen at this Debating Dao Conference.\"","Hearing this, Elder Master Xun’s gaze narrowed. After a moment, he poured himself a cup of tea, \"Do your best and leave the rest to fate. When a disaster arises, there’s no avoiding it.\"","The Taixu Sect Master was silent.","Elder Master Xun took a sip of tea, then looked up at the Taixu Sect Master, \"Instead of worrying, wouldn’t it be better to focus on nurturing some good seedlings, so they can achieve a good ranking at the Debating Sword?\"","\"One must be strong personally; if our Taixu Gate’s Disciples are strong enough, isn’t it only reasonable that we secure our ranking?\"","The Taixu Sect Master was silent for a moment, then nodded, \"Master is right. I will look for more Disciples and focus on nurturing them.\"","But he felt a bit helpless in his heart.","It’s one thing to say, but here in the Qianxue state boundary, there’s no shortage of geniuses.","The Taixu Gate is already at a disadvantage in terms of disciple recruitment, and no matter how they select, there’s only so much strength to be had.","Moreover, now that the Three Sects have unified, there are more people, and the requirements are higher.","If it were the former Taixu Gate, maintaining eighth place would be considered lucky.","But now, at the very least, Taixu Gate must maintain a spot in the \"top three,\" otherwise, without a sufficient portion of the Qianlong Spirit Mine, they can’t support this big family.","The Sect needs a large number of Spirit Stones.","Currently, the Three Sects Unification, to a certain extent, is subsisting on their individual reserves.","If they don’t secure a good ranking and claim a bigger share in the Qianlong Spirit Mine to get more Spirit Stones, sooner or later they will \"idle away their resources.\"","At that point, once the Spirit Stone supply is insufficient, and they can’t make ends meet, when times get tough, the Taixu Gate will be nothing more than a \"big empty shell,\" and a decline is only a matter of time.","\"Running a Sect really burns through Spirit Stones...\"","The Taixu Sect Master sighed in his heart.","So, the ranking in the Debating Sword is of great importance.","He seriously began to consider candidates for the Debating Sword.","\"Ling Huxiao from the Rushing Void Sect, a Sword Dao Genius not seen in five hundred years, was originally Rushing Void Sect’s little treasure, but is now a benefit to my Taixu Gate... No, we’re all Taixu Gate now; there’s no benefit to anyone...\"","\"The Tai’a Sect, the Ouyang family does have a few good ones, who are skilled in the Sword technique...\"","\"In our Taixu Gate, though there’s no one particularly outstanding, with Mo Hua as the ’Junior Brother’ leading the way, the cohesion within our Sect is strong, and cooperation is more seamless...\"","The Taixu Sect Master murmured, suddenly his heart stirred, and he curiously asked, \"Master, do you think Mo Hua...is he suitable for the Debating Sword?\"","Given it’s about Mo Hua, Elder Master Xun took it seriously.","He frowned and pondered for a moment, slowly shaking his head:","\"Not suitable... this child’s abilities, his strengths and weaknesses are too obvious. It’s too hard for him to go to the Debating Sword, and he’s too easily targeted...\""]},{"number":1913,"title":"Chapter 1913 - 935: Wood White Gold Jade","paragraphs":["\"Mid-Lower Grade Spiritual Root, it is not actually considered bad... but that depends on the era.\"","Elder Master Xun said, \"Now it is already over 20,000 years into the Taoist Calendar, and time has passed by; the Cultivation World has evolved to such an extent that those without a Spiritual Root have long been eliminated, and Mid-Lower Grade Spiritual Roots are almost only found among Loose Cultivators.\"","\"True Great Families, including some Mid-level Families, are engaging in ’Spiritual Root inheritance’ through marriage. Disciples from family sects intermarry, and with each generation, the Spiritual Roots improve.\"","\"It can truly be said... ’No Top-Grade Spiritual Roots in poor families, no Low-Grade Spiritual Roots in noble families.’","This was the development of the Cultivation World, but as Elder Master Xun discussed this, there was no sense of satisfaction.","Taixu Sect Master also understood this, nodding, \"Indeed... Mo Hua with this Low-Grade Spiritual Root, in a group of Loose Cultivators, might still look acceptable; within a regular family, at most considered average;\"","\"But this is in the Qian Learning State Boundary, and he’s part of a top sect, surrounded by fellow disciples from noble lineages. Compared to them, his Mid-Lower Grade Small Five Elements Spiritual Root is somewhat... inferior...\"","Taixu Sect Master shook his head and sighed, \"The Inferior Spiritual Root means low-grade Cultivation Techniques, which means fewer Spiritual Power Cycles, and naturally, low spiritual power.\"","Elder Master Xun pondered, \"But then again... although this child’s spiritual power is weak, he has quite a few cards up his sleeve, I suppose.\"","\"I haven’t seen him in person, so I can’t be certain, but firstly, his formation techniques are definitely extraordinary. Furthermore, his movement technique is proficient, his Concealment Techniques masterful, and he must have a few trump cards as his ’killer moves’...\"","\"Who?\" Taixu Sect Master was astonished, \"Mo Hua?\"","Elder Master Xun glanced at him, \"You’ve gone through Mo Hua’s dossiers. He’s been sneaking around, causing all kinds of stir.\"","Taixu Sect Master silently recalled.","From what he saw in the archives of Taixu Gate, including but not limited to, capturing Sin Cultivators for rewards just after joining, participating in the assassination of the Fire Buddha, infiltrating and destroying the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, assisting in the hunt for Water Yama, burning down the Rouge Boat, and escaping the Dragon King Temple...","Recently added to the list, was stirring up trouble, eradicating the Demon Sect...","It’s frightening upon realizing.","Taixu Sect Master had not realized that in the few years Mo Hua had joined Taixu Gate, he had unknowingly been involved in so many major events.","Yet...","In these events, in the archives, Mo Hua was only a participant; the resolution still relied on the Taoist Court and the Elders of Taixu Gate.","\"Participation...\"","Taixu Sect Master was taken aback, realizing the issue.","How could a typical Foundation Establishment Disciple be involved in so many perilous incidents?","Once or twice might be said to be good luck.","But so many times, it’s not luck, but strength.","If Mo Hua didn’t have some skills, it would have been impossible for him to survive in these perilous situations.","In fact, perhaps in some of these incidents, certain Sin Cultivators and Demon Cultivators might have actually perished at Mo Hua’s hands.","Mo Hua’s ’harmless’ appearance resurfaced in his mind, and Taixu Sect Master trembled slightly within.","\"Fooled by this kid’s pretty face...\"","Taixu Sect Master pondered for a moment, then said to Elder Master Xun, \"In that case... the Sword Discussion Conference, indeed, might not be suitable for Mo Hua to attend.\"","Elder Master Xun nodded, \"Firstly, it’s about the spiritual power.\"","\"The Sword Discussion Conference is not about winning a single match to claim victory. It requires many rounds of taxing and laborious battles. Without sufficient spiritual power, one simply can’t afford it.\"","\"Moreover, once participating in the Sword Discussion Conference, those he might face in a head-on clash could include true elite disciples from the Four Great Sects, bloodline Heavenly Prides.\"","\"None of these individuals lack Superior-Grade Spirit Roots, and occasionally, one or two with a Heavenly Spirit Root can even emerge.\"","\"The innate difference is too large.\"","\"Although in the Sword Discussion Conference, it’s a five-person collaboration focusing on strategy and tactics, those strategies and tactics are still based on cultivation and spiritual power, and there’s no way to truly ’take shortcuts’.\"","\"Not to mention, this child Mo Hua must keep some of his methods hidden, untold to others.\"","\"Once his hand of cards is revealed, he will inevitably be targeted. To expose all his skills for the Sword Discussion Conference is akin to exposing his weaknesses, which will certainly sow future troubles, and he’ll be schemed against.\"","Elder Master Xun’s expression was solemn.","There was one most crucial point he left unsaid.","Mo Hua is \"that person’s\" disciple, and undoubtedly has that person’s teachings.","The Sword Discussion Conference attracts all eyes.","If Mo Hua is watched by so many people and reveals his foundation, he will inevitably get entangled in frightening cause and effect, subject to countless plots and schemes falling upon him.","These intricate plots and schemes are beyond the capacity of such a little cultivator at the Foundation Establishment Realm to bear.","Therefore, for Mo Hua to participate in the Sword Discussion Conference would certainly do more harm than good.","Taixu Sect Master asked, \"Have you talked about these things with the child?\"","Elder Master Xun said, \"This child is wise and doesn’t need me to say much.\"","The issue of cause and effect, he should understand without me mentioning it.","Mo Hua also knows well about his Spiritual Root.","Moreover, Spiritual Roots are predestined from birth, talking about it doesn’t help much.","Taixu Sect Master nodded, no longer touching on the topic.","The two took a sip of tea, and Elder Master Xun recalled something, asking, \"What about the matter I asked you to handle earlier?\"","Taixu Sect Master said, \"Are you referring to the matter of the own Magical Treasure?\"","\"Yes, that inheritance seems to exist only where you are.\"","\"I’ve inquired, but,\" Taixu Sect Master frowned, \"Wood White as skin, Gold and Jade as bones... this life-casting body method wouldn’t work for Mo Hua. He lacks bloodline, his physique is weak, and he has no related inheritance.\""]},{"number":1914,"title":"Chapter 1914 - 935: Wood White Gold Jade (Part 2)","paragraphs":["\"It’s useless,\" Elder Master Xun nodded.","The Taixu Sect Master was taken aback. \"Then why do you still want me to get this thing?\"","\"I don’t see much use for it,\" Elder Master Xun looked a bit puzzled, \"but after some divination, the hexagrams show that Mo Hua might actually need it. How exactly? I can’t say...\"","The Taixu Sect Master had a subtle expression. \"Ancestor, didn’t you say you can’t predict the future?\"","\"This... it’s not fortune-telling.\"","\"Isn’t it?\"","\"It’s complicated. Anyway, that’s how it is... If you haven’t studied the Heavenly secret technique, you won’t understand it even if I explain.\"","\"Alright...\" said the Taixu Sect Master.","You’re the Ancestor—whatever you say, goes.","But there was something else nagging at him. The Taixu Sect Master hesitated, \"Is Mo Hua’s own Magical Treasure really that hard to determine? Even with your insight, you can’t be sure?\"","Elder Master Xun quietly took a sip of tea.","Like he could know for sure...","No one truly knew whose disciple Mo Hua actually was.","That whole cultivation path of his was wild and unpredictable, full of bizarre, scattered things—who knows how much he’s learned, or who he learned it from.","Even as a Heaven Void Ancestor, he really couldn’t get a handle on it.","But that was not something to admit out loud.","Elder Master Xun said, \"I know what I’m doing. You don’t need to worry, just get the ’Wood White Gold Jade’ spell point casting technique for him. This kind of legacy—only you have the connections.\"","With Elder Master Xun’s instructions, the Taixu Sect Master naturally wouldn’t refuse.","Even though this legacy is no small matter and not easy to obtain, now that he’s Taixu Sect Master, he still has to consider the Sect’s interests.","Plus, the spell point is for Mo Hua.","Mo Hua’s a kid he really likes—even putting aside any plans to forge \"good karma,\" he genuinely wants to help out.","\"Rest assured, Master. I’ve already sent a letter to ask, there should be a reply soon.\"","Elder Master Xun nodded happily. \"Thank you for your trouble.\"","The Taixu Sect Master saluted. \"Don’t mention it, Master—this is my duty as Sect Master.\"","After that, the two continued sipping tea, chatting about Sect matters.","The preparations for the Sword Discussion Conference were advancing step by step.","...","A few days later, at Refining Demon Mountain.","Mo Hua was back at Refining Demon Mountain for some Monster Hunting.","Ever since the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons incident, he’d rarely come here—this time, it was specially organized by the Sect Elders.","The point was to have Disciples enter the mountain, hunt Monster Beasts, and hone their Taoist Skills.","On top of that, a new item had been added: sparring matches between Disciples.","The Elders didn’t spell it out, but Mo Hua could guess—this was clearly to prepare for the Sword Discussion Conference.","To see which Disciples really had strength, who had a talent or knack for dueling, who was insightful—who could be useful, who could shine for the Sect at the Conference.","Since it’s a Sword Discussion, you can’t just judge by Cultivation on paper.","Cultivation’s one thing—actual battle’s another.","Some Disciples have only Cultivation—when it’s time for real fighting, they get nervous and barely use half their abilities.","Others look mediocre on paper, but they’re sharp, daring, and when it comes to combat, they perform way above expectations.","You only know once they’ve really fought.","Only by letting the Disciples spar and experience actual combat can promising candidates for the Sword Discussion Conference be chosen.","It wasn’t just Mo Hua who understood—every other Disciple did too.","The Sword Discussion Conference wasn’t just about their personal future—it was about the reputation of the Sect, about Sect interests.","Besides, after nine years of study, each gets only one shot at the Dao Discussion Conference.","Every Disciple treasured this opportunity like nothing else.","Midway up Refining Demon Mountain, on a spacious hillside.","The Elders were setting up Disciples for one-on-one sparring, testing their martial and spell skills.","It’s just practice—the point isn’t really who wins or loses, but to help the Elders get a measure of each Disciple’s strength.","Mo Hua did not participate.","If he did, it’d be pointless.","On paper, his strength was abysmal.","Among the fellow Disciples, besides Cheng Mo, Situ Jian and a handful who really knew Mo Hua and had seen him show off once or twice as Junior Brother, most of them had never even seen Mo Hua fight or duel—","At best, they’ve seen Mo Hua throw a couple Fireball Techniques.","In their minds, their innocent \"Junior Brother\" was a freakishly talented Formation expert whose other abilities—including physical body and Spiritual Power—were laughably weak.","Sparring with him is pointless.","And honestly, no one really dared to spar with Mo Hua.","If Junior Brother got hurt, fine, at worst you eat a couple Fireball Techniques and maybe get a little burn.","But if you accidentally injure him, that’s when things get ugly.","Mo Hua’s always been Junior Brother—kind, gentle, always helpful—and has tons of friends in the Sect. Pretty much every Disciple owes him something.","If you hurt him, piss everyone off—good luck mixing at Taixu Gate after that.","Not to mention, Mo Hua’s pale and delicate, physically fragile—if you hurt him, even just a scrape, that’s already a crime.","The Elders wouldn’t dare let Mo Hua spar either.","This is the Taixu Gate’s Formation Leader, their treasured prodigy. He’s not the Ancestor’s real grandson, but it’s basically the same—and if he got hurt during a Formation match, who could bear that blame?","So, in this huge forest, with blades and spells flying everywhere, the Disciples are going at it, lively as can be.","Mo Hua could only sit atop a big tree, watching the show.","The Elders even set up a protective Formation around his tree, afraid that stray spells might fly up and accidentally harm him during the matches below."]},{"number":1915,"title":"Chapter 1915 - 935: Wood White Gold Jade (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Mo Hua sat alone atop the big tree, sighing helplessly.","Just as he was bored out of his mind, someone walked over from afar. Mo Hua’s eyes lit up, and he called out, \"Xiaoxiao!\"","The newcomer was none other than Linghu Xiao.","To outsiders, he was the aloof Sword Dao Genius, rarely seen with a smile on his face.","In the entire Taixu Gate, only Mo Hua dared to call him \"Xiaoxiao.\"","Linghu Xiao felt hopeless too.","Mo Hua sat in the tree, waving him over. Linghu Xiao used his movement technique, his figure like a sword, and in just a few swift steps climbed up next to Mo Hua.","\"You finished your match?\"","\"Yeah, finished.\"","Linghu Xiao nodded. He was now at the Foundation Establishment Late Stage, already starting to refine the Chongxu Sect sword as his own Magical Treasure. Not only had his cultivation improved, but his Sword Qi was sharper than ever.","And after that calamity in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, his Sword Heart had been tempered, and it showed—his whole presence now radiated astonishing Sword Dao aura top to bottom.","His Chongxu Swordsmanship had truly started to reach a masterful level, showing its edge.","During sparring, ordinary disciples couldn’t even block a single strike from him before being defeated on the spot.","So Linghu Xiao finished up quickly, and since he had nothing else to do, he came to find Mo Hua sitting in the tree, watching the show.","The two of them watched for a while. Suddenly, Linghu Xiao asked Mo Hua, \"You going to the Sword Discussion Conference?\"","Mo Hua hesitated. \"Hard to say...\"","To say he didn’t want to go would be a lie.","Even though he’d won the Formation Competition and became the Leader, Sword Discussion and Formation Competition were totally different beasts.","Whether it was intensity, excitement, difficulty, or attention, they weren’t even on the same level.","At the Sword Discussion, the proudest compete, and anything can happen. Until the very end, no one knows who will claim the prize.","But his situation was unique, and he knew it well.","He could participate, sure, but how much effort it’d take, how far he’d get, it was all up in the air.","Merit Points? He had more than he could ever use.","His reputation? Brought more baggage than help.","Honestly, right now the Sword Discussion hasn’t got much pull for him.","Maybe, at best, since Taixu Gate’s not doing so hot, he’d find a way to help snag a spot for them, but that’d be it.","To really risk everything, possibly expose all his trump cards, just for a top ranking—he couldn’t see the point.","Everything has two sides.","Winning fame at the Sword Discussion, standing atop the mountain, might look glorious, but with so many watching, it could just as easily plant the seeds of trouble.","Mo Hua was just as unsure as before.","Linghu Xiao nodded silently. After a pause, he said, \"If you go, I’ll go with you.\"","Mo Hua was stunned, turning to give Linghu Xiao a look.","Linghu Xiao’s face was calm, but his eyes were resolute.","Mo Hua felt a surge of gratitude.","Sword Discussion isn’t just a one-man show. You need five people working as one. If you want a good result, you’ve got to \"join forces\"—not a single weak link among you.","Mo Hua knew he wasn’t exactly weak, but in a straight-up fight under these rules, he might not be all that strong after all.","But Linghu Xiao really was strong. Ever since he hit Foundation Establishment Late Stage, his swordsmanship had been growing stronger every day.","He was probably trying to help out, even if this would be his one and only chance at the Sword Discussion in his life.","Even if Mo Hua’s Spiritual Power was low and might drag him down.","Mo Hua smiled, giving Linghu Xiao’s shoulder a pat. \"I appreciate it, really. But let’s talk about that later.\"","Linghu Xiao nodded, saying no more.","Quiet settled in. Mo Hua focused, watching the disciples spar below.","As he watched, Mo Hua realized his fellow disciples of Taixu Gate had come a long way since before—in both Cultivation and Taoist Skill.","Especially Cultivation.","Their Spiritual Roots were better than his, and they’d reached Foundation Establishment Late Stage sooner, meaning they’d had half a year more to build their Cultivation than he had.","Mo Hua checked around and saw, among all the disciples, his own Spiritual Power was truly the lowest.","And the gap had widened without him noticing.","At Foundation Establishment Early Stage, it wasn’t obvious.","Now, having passed the Middle Phase and entered the Late Stage, the differences in Spiritual Roots and Cultivation Technique were more pronounced than ever.","Mo Hua compared again.","If, at Foundation Establishment Early Stage, his Spiritual Power Cycle was just twenty percent below his peers—","Now, he was thirty or even forty percent lower.","And that’s just compared to the average level.","Compared to top geniuses like Linghu Xiao, Mo Hua found his Spiritual Power Cycle barely matched half of theirs...","Only half as much...","And this was just Foundation Establishment.","If he reached the Golden Core Realm, the gap might grow even bigger.","Because the baseline difference was huge, and the higher you climb, the greater the multiplication of power, and that gap gets wider and wider.","Mo Hua knew this in theory before, but back then he’d been clueless, never felt it quite so keenly as now.","Mo Hua took a quiet, shaky breath.","The difference in wealth among cultivators was astonishing, but the difference in Spiritual Power was even more outrageous.","\"I’ve gotta figure something out...\"","Mo Hua felt urgency mount inside.","...","Nighttime, in the Disciple’s Residence.","Back from Refining Demon Mountain, Mo Hua slumped over his desk, diligently practicing Formation.","He figured he ought to strengthen himself some more.","But his lack of Spiritual Power was pretty much a dead end—an unsolvable weakness he couldn’t break through right now. Only thing left was to try and bolster his Divine Sense.","If his Divine Sense was stronger, his Formations, spells, Sword techniques, they’d all get better.","And with the Sword Discussion Conference coming up next year, it was only smart to prepare. Even if he only took part, having strength was better than going in empty-handed.","But after a few rounds of Formation practice, Mo Hua checked inside himself and shook his head in defeat.","\"No good... I can barely sense any growth in my Divine Sense.\"","Ever since he reached Foundation Establishment, he could still boost Divine Sense through Formation, but just relying on this method, the growth was next to nothing.","The Formation now mostly honed his grasp of its rules and control over Divine Sense, not so much boosting its strength.","Maybe it had something to do with his Divine Sense becoming more attuned with the Dao.","Could be eating all those Demon Monsters and Evil Spirits had something to do with it too.","And now he’d quit eating them, or there wasn’t anything good to eat anyway, Mo Hua’s Divine Sense had almost stopped improving—especially as he’d hit this critical Twenty Patterns bottleneck.","\"Stuck again...\"","Divine Sense, Formation, Sword technique, own Magical Treasure—all caught up.","Mo Hua sighed.","Tao Cultivation really isn’t easy—obstacles everywhere.","Of course, the long road of Tao Cultivation is always full of bumps and setbacks.","Mo Hua forced himself to calm down and kept practicing Formation, running those familiar drills over and over, countless times.","Bit by bit, grinding his Divine Sense, seeking the truths of Cultivation.","No clue how long he practiced for, or why, but somehow Mo Hua felt a weariness descend on him for the first time ever—an overwhelming exhaustion pulling down his eyelids.","He struggled a little, but it was useless. He just couldn’t muster the energy.","Finally, he couldn’t hold on any longer. His eyes closed, his head drooped, and he collapsed onto the desk, knocking over the Spiritual Ink with his arms.","The Spiritual Ink spread out, staining the Formation Paper black.","Mo Hua fell into a nightmare.","In the nightmare, it was pitch black. A creature shaped like an \"Evil Embryo\" stared at Mo Hua, eyes full of malice."]},{"number":1916,"title":"Chapter 1916 - 936: Orphan","paragraphs":["This Evil Embryo is both familiar and unfamiliar.","Its appearance is that of a pitch-black infant, somewhat resembling the one Mo Hua had slain before, but obviously larger, with more malformed limbs, and an aura more chaotic, mingled with countless resentments, sorrows, and malice.","At the moment, it is staring at Mo Hua with a cold expression, eyes ferocious.","Mo Hua also gazed at it.","In the pitch-black and turbid nightmare, a golden figure and a filthy black Evil Baby silently stared at each other.","It is unclear how much time passed before the Evil Baby’s expression suddenly turned savage, opening a mouth full of jagged teeth, eyes blood red, pointing at Mo Hua with its right hand, murmuring in a strange voice.","Mo Hua frowned, unaware of its intention, but then noticed the black mist surging around, the blood color vibrating.","The ground bulged everywhere, black water condensed, manifesting into one figure after another.","The figures seemed like Demon Monsters, but upon closer inspection, they were not \"Demon Monsters,\" but actual \"humans,\" one after another, tragically deceased.","Their clothes were tattered, limbs severed, faces full of blood and tears, enslaved, dominated, filled with countless grievances, struggling toward Mo Hua.","Hands grabbed Mo Hua, mouths bit into Mo Hua’s body.","Tremendous pain ensued.","This pain was not merely physical, but also interwoven with countless cultivators’ repression and torment in life, and sorrow and despair in death.","Mo Hua’s expression changed, pinching his fingers, yet no fireball appeared at the fingertips.","With a thought, no Formation constructed around. Grasping his palm, no Sword of Divine Thought emerged.","As if in this nightmare, he was merely a frail, humble low-level cultivator.","He had no cultivation, no spells, no formations, no sword techniques, nothing, helpless and desperate in the face of catastrophe.","More and more of the tragically deceased climbed beside Mo Hua, gnawing at Mo Hua’s body.","The pain of life and despair of death seeped into Mo Hua’s entire body like venom.","Pain intensified, with Mo Hua losing all strength, beginning to feel cold and hopeless.","Just when he was being torn apart by these half-human, half-ghost Demon Monsters, sinking into boundless pain, about to be submerged by the Corpse Mountain, a clarity suddenly arose, and his Taoist Heart was suddenly purified anew.","Mo Hua suddenly woke up.","\"Fake... It’s all fake.\"","\"This weak, powerless, humble low-level cultivator is not me.\"","\"I am Mo Hua. I have the Divine Thought of Dao Hua, my own Dao. Hundreds and thousands of formations mastered, incorporated into myself, Divine Thought into sword both slays the self and the Evil Demon.\"","Mo Hua’s gaze grew increasingly firm, radiating a sword-like brilliance.","He clasped his palms.","Between his palms, a wisp of Sword Intent twisted, flickered, and emerged constantly, continuously breaking through a certain limit of thought, shattering a certain nightmare rule...","Finally, a slight sound, cracks spread all over Mo Hua’s body.","Mo Hua grasped with his right hand, and Golden Light burst forth, the sword revealed its edge.","He held the Sword of Divine Thought, the first sword, slashing toward himself.","The golden sword light flashed, directly shattering his \"Divine Thought Incarnation.\"","But what was severed was not himself, but that weak, powerless, desperate, humble cultivator who could only die tragically in the face of catastrophe.","What was severed was the nightmare rules that assigned him a \"self\" through deception and enchantment.","The false self extinguished, the true self returned, and Mo Hua’s consciousness cleared instantly.","The nightmare’s rules were broken.","All the Divine Thought Power of Mo Hua returned fully to his body.","The Sword of Divine Thought in his hand gleamed with flowing light, the Sword Qi surged, Mo Hua swung his arm, the Sword Qi drew a brilliant golden light, like a river bursting its banks, sweeping through.","All the half-human, half-ghost Demon Monsters were severed at the waist, annihilated by the golden sword light, reduced to ashes.","The blackness in the nightmare was swept clean.","Mo Hua turned his head, staring firmly ahead.","That malformed and strong \"Evil Baby\" ahead still gazed ferociously at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua did not go to slash this \"Evil Baby.\"","For he knew, what lay before him was merely an \"illusion,\" something that fundamentally did not exist, a kind of Power of Cause and Effect.","It was like a \"anchor point\" of cause and effect, from which nightmares and Demon Monsters arose, but it was never really there.","The nightmare’s rules were broken, Mo Hua’s consciousness gradually cleared, the nightmare dissipated, and the form of the Evil Baby was also gradually disappearing.","Yet the Evil Embryo still watched Mo Hua...","When Mo Hua entered the dream, it watched Mo Hua; as Mo Hua was engulfed by Demon Monsters, it watched Mo Hua; as Mo Hua broke the nightmare, slashing the Demon Monsters with one sword, it still watched Mo Hua; now, as the nightmare is about to dissipate, it continues to watch Mo Hua.","Its pupils were hollow and pitch black, threaded with blood, looking sinister and terrifying.","Until the nightmare completely dissipated, and Mo Hua awoke from the nightmare, those blood-red eyes remained imprinted in his mind.","Mo Hua opened his eyes.","He found the Spiritual Ink spilt on the desk, ink seeping into the Formation Paper, the marks still wet.","The nightmare came quickly, and left just as swiftly.","From entering the dream to awakening from it, not much time had passed.","Mo Hua tidied up the desk, wiped the ink stains, organized the scrolls, then sat at the desk, frowning in deep thought.","\"Why did I have this nightmare?\"","Was it because the previous Evil Embryo wasn’t completely slain? Or did the cause and effect linger after slaying the Evil Embryo?","Or perhaps it’s because I met that ’young master’, personally seeing the poppy-like fallen Heavenly Mechanism Chain, causing the cause and effect to start operating subtly?","\"Why was this nightmare different from those before? In the dream, it was as if I was no longer myself, could this also be the capability of the Evil God?\""]},{"number":1917,"title":"Chapter 1917 - 936: Orphan_2","paragraphs":["And...","Mo Hua frowned.","\"What kind of thing is this evil embryo I’ve dreamed about?\"","Is it dead or not?","If it’s dead, why does it appear in my dreams?","If it’s not dead, does that mean the Great Wilderness Evil God has more than one evil embryo?","How many evil embryos does Mr. Tu keep?","The words Yu Er said, the dream she had, resurfaced in his mind. Mo Hua’s gaze slightly condensed as he gradually formed a suspicion.","The things he needed to do next gradually took shape.","Mo Hua composed himself, began to discard distractions, and continued to practice Formation without interruption.","Formation must be practiced. As long as you practice, there will surely be progress.","No matter how many unexpected events or changes occur in life, as long as there is time, Formation must be practiced.","And time is limited, it flows relentlessly forward, and once moments are wasted, it is impossible to recover them.","Mo Hua continued practicing Formation, but shortly after he began, his expression became serious.","Those hollow and pitch-black, blood-threaded, eerie and terrifying eyes appeared in front of him again, silently watching him.","These eyes seem to exist forever.","They will always be in some unknown place, watching Mo Hua eternally.","Mo Hua silently watched the terrifying eyes in his heart and after a moment, murmured softly:","\"Dare to look at me...\"","\"If you keep looking, I’ll ’eat’ you...\"","...","A few days later, in Tai Xu City.","Mo Hua arranged to meet Master Gu at a tavern.","Since it wasn’t a rest day, Mo Hua still had to attend classes, and time was limited, so the two only had a simple meal and chatted.","Master Gu is a Third Grade Artifact Refiner from the Gu Family, overseeing the refinery shop they opened in Solitary Mountain City.","The refinery shop was originally on the verge of closing down, struggling to survive. It was Mo Hua who painted formations, customized spiritual artifacts, and brought in business, allowing it to revive and prosper.","Master Gu was extremely grateful to Mo Hua, constantly pouring him wine and serving him food, as if Mo Hua was the Golden Core and he was just a Foundation Building Cultivator...","\"Master Gu, no need to be so courteous,\" Mo Hua said.","\"Of course, of course,\" Master Gu said as he served Mo Hua a chunk of pork, laughing, \"The young master has done a great favor for our refinery shop; do let me know if there’s anything you need in the future.\"","Master Gu looked earnest.","Mo Hua’s gaze flickered slightly as he asked, \"Master Gu, how have things been in Solitary Mountain City?\"","\"Recently?\"","\"Yes.\"","Master Gu thought for a while, \"The recent situation in Solitary Mountain City hasn’t changed much compared to before, but our refinery shop’s business has improved, earning more spirit stones, and consequently, the economy around it has also become better.\"","\"Quite a few Artifact Refiners came to our refinery shop to make a living. Those who mine or do hard labor also have meals to eat thanks to our refinery shop.\"","\"Compared to some prosperous Great Immortal Cities, or even some wealthy medium and small Immortal Cities, it’s obviously not nearly as good. But it’s much better than the previous Solitary Mountain City, with more cultivators coming and going, and the city gradually coming back to life...\"","Mo Hua nodded.","In other words... things are improving, and life is getting better little by little.","\"Then...\" Mo Hua lowered his voice again and asked, \"Has anything happened recently in Solitary Mountain City?\"","Master Gu also lowered his voice involuntarily and asked, \"What kind of incident are you referring to, young master?\"","\"I mean, anything strange, weird, or...\" Mo Hua’s gaze darkened slightly, \"a major murder case involving many deaths?\"","Master Gu’s expression stiffened, \"A murder case?\"","\"Yes,\" Mo Hua nodded, \"Like the Tu family massacre, where many people died.\"","Master Gu frowned, thought seriously for a moment, and shook his head, \"No.\"","\"No?\"","\"Yes, it’s relatively peaceful recently,\" Master Gu said, \"Moreover, in a place like Solitary Mountain City, most are loose families and households. Since the decline, there are few small families left, and such scenarios like ’the Tu family massacre, where many people died’ are unlikely.\"","After all, a loose cultivator family only has a few members, hardly enough to constitute an ’annihilation.’","Mo Hua nodded, but felt even more puzzled.","No incidents, no major cases...","The Gu family’s refinery shop business is getting better, bringing sustenance to surrounding cultivators, increasing the city’s traffic, and gradually bringing vitality.","All of this clearly points to a positive direction.","But why...","On the day they besieged the Demon Sect, the Court Official named ’Fan Jin’ he encountered wanted so badly to be transferred away from Solitary Mountain City?","If it was simply wanting a transfer, that wouldn’t be an issue.","It’s understandable to seek better opportunities.","But in his eyes, there was a deep-seated fear...","What on earth is in Solitary Mountain City that makes even a Golden Core Steward of the Taoist Court feel ’fear’?","The more Mo Hua thought about it, the stranger it seemed, so he asked, \"Master Gu, do you know Fan Jin?\"","\"Fan Jin?\" Master Gu was slightly stunned, \"Young master, are you referring to Master Fan from Solitary Mountain City?\"","\"Yes.\" Mo Hua nodded.","\"You actually know him,\" Master Gu was quite surprised.","Mo Hua simply said, \"By chance, we met once.\"","Master Gu nodded, didn’t ask further, and after pondering for a bit, said:","\"I’ve had drinks with this Master Fan a few times, so we have some rapport. He’s a decent person, though a bit self-serving, likes to put on airs, and somewhat bullies the weak and fears the strong, but nothing too out of line. In ordinary matters, he follows the rules. Solitary Mountain City is too impoverished, with nothing much to gain, so he’s relatively ’clean’ as a steward...\"","\"Oh...\" Mo Hua seemed to be in thought.","Master Gu observed and whispered, \"Young master, did this Master Fan commit a crime, or did he offend you?\"","Mo Hua smiled, \"It’s nothing, he said he’s a steward in Solitary Mountain City and wanted to treat me to a meal, so I just asked casually.\""]},{"number":1918,"title":"Chapter 1918 - 936: Orphans (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Master Gu let out a sigh of relief, thinking it was fine as long as nothing happened.","This Fan Datou truly has some insight, recognizing the ’big thigh’ like Young Master Mo, who keeps such a low profile...","The two chatted some more, then after drinking and dining to their heart’s content, Mo Hua returned to the Taixu Gate. Before leaving, he said: \"Master Gu, in three days it’s the ten-day break, then I’ll visit Solitary Mountain City.\"","Master Gu was stunned upon hearing this, then he rejoiced, quickly saying:","\"Rest assured, Young Master, I will make arrangements and personally come to greet you.\"","Mo Hua smiled and said: \"Thank you, Master Gu.\"","...","Three days later, Mo Hua took a carriage from the Gu family, personally escorted by Master Gu, and together they headed for Solitary Mountain City.","Halfway through the journey, Mo Hua was deep in thought, suddenly feeling something, he looked up.","He saw a mountain peak in the distance, hidden deep within the mountains and forests, with a small part of a dilapidated temple revealed—the very place of his old friend, Lord Yellow Mountain’s temple.","\"Mountain Lord...\"","Mo Hua, driven by a sudden impulse, thought of visiting Lord Yellow Mountain.","After all, it seemed he hadn’t seen this old friend for a long time, and he wondered how he was doing, if he still drank rainwater and ate stale buns.","Yet, thinking again, Master Gu was on the road, and the journey to Solitary Mountain City was rather far; visiting the Mountain Lord along the way would take up too much time.","\"Next time... next time I’ll definitely visit Lord Yellow Mountain.\"","Mo Hua thought silently to himself.","A mountain wind blew through Kushan, the forests rustled, and the deep-seated Mountain God Temple seemed to tremble slightly.","...","Later, Master Gu drove the carriage while Mo Hua rested his eyes inside.","The carriage sped swiftly, and after more than half a day, they finally arrived at Solitary Mountain City.","Mo Hua lifted the curtain, poked his head out, and looked around, taking in the scene of Solitary Mountain City.","The mountain city was still rather desolate, the stones were bare, vegetation withered, the sky dim and grey, and all around were mostly abandoned mines, with few people in sight.","Being accustomed to the prosperity of the Qian Learning State Boundary and its surrounding Immortal Cities, seeing Solitary Mountain City gave one a strong sense of disconnection.","It might even create the illusion that these people might not be living in the same world.","But what Master Gu said was not wrong.","Compared to before, Solitary Mountain City had improved quite a bit; at least the cultivators coming and going were no longer as dejected and worried, but rather seemed a bit more spirited.","The carriage slowly made its way along the rugged stone streets, moving forward, entering a large Refinery Shop located in the southeastern corner of Solitary Mountain City.","Above the entrance of the Refinery Shop, a plaque hung, with the words \"Gu Family Refinery Shop\" elegantly inscribed, with a smaller plaque below reading \"Solitary Mountain Branch.\"","Inside the Refinery Shop, it was a scene buzzing with activity.","Compared to before, the changes within the Refinery Shop were nothing short of transformative.","The Refining Furnace was larger, the Melting Fire Formation more complete, with more Artifact Refining Masters and disciples.","The people collaborated, placing one Spiritual Artifact embryo after another into the Refining Furnace for roasting, quenching, and then taking them out for forging.","Amidst the raging fire, sparks flew. Rows of freshly crafted, variously shaped Spiritual Artifacts were neatly arranged in the courtyard.","Both in scale, stoves, manpower, and production, they far exceeded the past.","Mo Hua hadn’t been to Solitary Mountain City for a long time, since setting up the rules and the Formation and Spiritual Artifact standards, he had become a \"hands-off manager.\"","Looking at the scene before him now, Mo Hua couldn’t help but feel somewhat astonished, praising Master Gu:","\"Master Gu, your Refinery Shop is getting better and better...\"","Receiving the compliment, Master Gu was full of pride, bowing to Mo Hua, saying: \"It’s all thanks to Young Master. Without you, where would the Refinery Shop be today.\"","Mo Hua waved his hand modestly, saying: \"Oh no, I just lent a small hand.\"","Master Gu then ordered people below to gather a large group of Artifact Refining Disciples, instructing: \"Come, greet Young Master Mo.\"","\"Greetings, Young Master Mo!\"","A group of muscular, sweat-dripping Artifact Refining Disciples saluted in unison, saying:","\"We’ve met Young Master Mo!\"","\"Young Master Mo, your kindness is unforgettable!\"","The scene was too grand, making Mo Hua a bit uneasy, quickly saying: \"No need for formalities, carry on with your work.\"","Master Gu then dismissed them and said to Mo Hua, \"Young Master, I’ve arranged a banquet for tonight, specially to entertain you. There’s still some time now, shall I show you around?\"","Master Gu guessed that Mo Hua had a purpose in coming to Solitary Mountain City.","This purpose, he couldn’t figure out, so he could only do his best to show Mo Hua around.","Mo Hua nodded, \"Thank you, Master Gu.\"","\"Please, Young Master.\" Master Gu then personally led the way in front, taking Mo Hua for a tour around the Refinery Shop.","To outsiders, these were all secrets.","But Mo Hua was different; if he wished to see, Master Gu would naturally not refuse.","After seeing the Refinery Shop, Master Gu then led Mo Hua outside.","Outside the Refinery Shop, there were also quite a few cultivators gathered in the nearby open space, sitting cross-legged, with bamboo backpacks in front of them, filled with various black, grey, or white ores.","\"These are also Loose Cultivators, their cultivation is not high, they can’t refine artifacts, nor do they have any other skills, just strength, only able to carry bamboo baskets, head into the solitary mountains to try their luck, picking leftover ores.\"","\"If they’re lucky, these ores are useful in artifact refining and can be exchanged for a few Broken Spirit Stones to buy some coarse grain and barely fill their stomachs.\"","\"If unlucky, they just go hungry.\"","\"Formerly in Solitary Mountain, there were only a few viable Refinery Shops, and the ores they picked were of poor quality, with no one willing to buy them.\"","Master Gu’s words carried a hint of melancholy, he sighed and said:","\"But now it’s better, our Refinery Shop is growing, requiring a significant amount of ores. Even if the ores they pick are of poor quality, they’ll still fetch a few Broken Spirit Stones, at least they won’t starve.\"","Mo Hua felt comforted yet complex emotions arose. Turning to look, he found that among the crowd were quite a few children around the age of ten.","They were skinny and dark-skinned, with dirty faces, their arms thin as sticks, carrying bamboo backpacks filled with black-grey ores.","The heavy ores weighed them down, making it hard for them to stand up straight.","And there weren’t just one or two such children, but many.","Mo Hua felt a sting of compassion and a vague sense of unease, asking: \"Do these children collect ores alone? Where are their parents?\"","Master Gu showed a bitter expression, shaking his head, \"This is Solitary Mountain City, most of these children are orphans...\""]},{"number":1919,"title":"Chapter 1919 - 937: Wind Pattern","paragraphs":["\"Orphan?\" Mo Hua was somewhat incredulous, \"The ’Solitary’ of Solitary Mountain City, is it the ’solitary’ of orphans?\"","\"Not entirely,\" Master Gu explained, \"Solitary Mountain City is adjacent to Solitary Mountain, and this Solitary Mountain was originally called ’Guhuang Mountain.’\"","\"The mountain was rich in bright yellow copper ore, which was golden, pure, and dazzlingly brilliant, more luminous than gold when plated on spiritual artifacts, treasures, and palaces, hence highly esteemed by renowned families.\"","\"Later, this bright yellow copper ore was overexploited, extracted until it was entirely gone, leaving behind only this scarred and desolate, dark black mining mountain. Due to the decline of the mines, the number of cultivators dwindled, and orphans increased significantly, hence the mountain came to be called ’Solitary Mountain,’ and the city, ’Solitary Mountain City’...\"","Mo Hua glanced around, spotting dozens of frail, dark-skinned orphans carrying stones on their backs. After a silent moment, he sighed.","Some are born into wealth and live a life of luxury.","And some seem destined to toil and suffer from birth.","This suffering only grows, persisting until death...","Mo Hua furrowed his brow, feeling conflicted.","Suddenly, a child carrying a bamboo basket slipped and fell to the ground, spilling coarse, worthless black stones all over.","This child didn’t mind the wound on his scraped knee but immediately got up, scrambling to gather the stones back into the basket, as if afraid someone might steal them.","Most of these stones are worthless.","But the child still treasured them like gems.","This is his only means of livelihood; he can only have a meal by picking up these worthless stone scraps.","Outside, other children might indeed snatch them away.","Fortunately, being near the refinery shop, everyone adhered to order, and no one took his stones.","The child picked up the stones, placed them back in the basket, and shouldered it once more.","The heavy basket immediately bent his small frame, and the straps left two bruises on his shoulders.","This child was queuing with the basket on his back.","He could have put the basket down for a short rest, but it seemed he was used to it.","Perhaps because the thought of putting it down unsettled him, worried he wouldn’t get a meal.","So he continued to bend his back, numbly carrying the heavy burden.","He wasn’t alone; all the children nearby were doing the same.","Mo Hua couldn’t help but walk over.","The child noticed someone approaching, looked up, and saw a young gentleman with skin as fair as jade, his demeanor gentle as water, elegant as if from the heavens. Stunned for a moment, he then averted his eyes, a bit ashamed.","Mo Hua looked with compassion and reached to take the basket off his back.","The child trembled with fear but, after a brief hesitation, did not resist, allowing Mo Hua to take the basket.","Mo Hua was weak by nature, but this was relative to Foundation Establishment cultivators. He wasn’t below the standard of ordinary Qi Refinement.","The basket was heavy, filled with pitch-black stones.","Mo Hua weighed it and, after a quick thought, took out a Formation Pen.","He intended to draw a formation on the basket, but as soon as he started, he paused and fell into contemplation.","He couldn’t draw something difficult.","The basket’s material was poor and easily damaged, unable to bear complex formation structures.","He couldn’t draw a high-rank formation.","The spirit stone consumption was too high, and these kids couldn’t afford them.","Even an ordinary formation containing nine patterns would be too \"luxurious\" for these children.","After careful thought, Mo Hua slowly began to draw.","He drew only one formation pattern.","The simplest first-grade formation pattern.","An Eight Trigrams Wind Formation Pattern.","Once the pattern was complete, a faint light shone and merged with the basket.","Mo Hua gently said, \"Try carrying it again.\"","The child, puzzled and bewildered, shouldered the basket again. He froze, looking at Mo Hua in disbelief.","As he lifted the basket, the pattern lit up, and a gentle wind from below lightly lifted the basket.","The entire load seemed lighter, no longer such a heavy burden.","His shoulders wouldn’t be sore from the straps.","His back straightened a bit.","This was just the simplest first-grade formation pattern, hardly qualifying as a formation, and the power it contained was minimal. But for these children, it was enough to give them a breather from the weight of fate.","Looking at the pattern, Mo Hua suddenly understood what Elder Zheng meant.","The heavens encompass all life, without distinction of rank.","The path of formations encompasses all techniques, without distinction of level.","High-rank formations are obscure and profound, able to exhaust formation principles and explore the Heavenly Dao.","But only low-rank formations, spread throughout the world, can truly benefit the common people.","Sometimes, formations aren’t even needed; just a simple pattern or two suffices.","In a flash of inspiration, Mo Hua’s heart trembled.","The simpler, the easier to learn, disseminate, and apply, the more likely it could change the plight of the most disadvantaged people on the largest scale.","Could this be the ultimate form of the \"Dao\"?","Using the \"simplest\" form to encompass the vast, infinite Great Dao, spreading its will across the world, uniting all beings, achieving universal harmony?","This is truly the Dao’s simplicity, returning to the essence?","Mo Hua was shaken to his core.","Suddenly, he recalled the \"Returning to the Source\" algorithm, the Five Elements Sect’s sect-protecting legacy.","Simplifying the complex, unifying all formations.","Reducing the voluminous formations to a single \"Source Pattern\" imbued with the Five Elements Law—could it also embody this principle?","From simplicity to complexity, mastering all formations under heaven."]},{"number":1920,"title":"Chapter 1920 - 937: Wind Pattern (2)","paragraphs":["Returning from complexity to simplicity, all the myriad Formations are reduced to their origins.","Only in this way can one fully grasp the mysteries of Formation and truly ask the Dao to become Immortal?","Mo Hua stood still, lost in thought. A subtle aura emanated around him, with traces of the Great Dao’s will flowing in his eyes.","Master Gu, beside him, was shocked in his heart.","He couldn’t understand what Mo Hua had comprehended, but he knew that Formation is a manifestation of the Dao, and a Formation Master is closest to the Dao.","A Formation Master can fathom things that ordinary cultivators cannot.","However, despite this, it was the first time he saw such a profound aura flow during a Formation Master’s moment of sudden enlightenment.","\"Are all Formation Masters like this, or is Young Master Mo particularly special...\"","Master Gu thought to himself, and wisely chose not to disturb him.","After a moment, Mo Hua came to, the aura around him dissipated, and the glimmer in his eyes subsided.","\"Let these children bring their bamboo baskets, I’ll draw a Formation Pattern for them,\" Mo Hua said gently.","\"Alright.\" Master Gu nodded.","Then he instructed the children carrying bamboo baskets to line up and come over one by one.","Mo Hua used the Formation Pen to draw a First Grade Wind Pattern on each of their bamboo baskets.","To Mo Hua, this Wind Pattern was exceedingly simple; with a slight touch of the pen tip, he could complete one in just a few breaths.","Within thirty minutes, all the children’s dirty bamboo baskets bore this bright white Formation Pattern.","A gentle breeze accompanied them.","When they carried the bamboo baskets laden with heavy ore, it wasn’t so strenuous anymore.","After finishing the Formation Patterns, Mo Hua said nothing, only looked at the group of children and smiled gently before turning to leave.","All the children watched Mo Hua.","Their faces were dark, thin, with some hints of timidity and rigidity, but a gleam of hope gradually lit up in their eyes.","...","In the Refinery Shop, the parlor.","Master Gu personally poured a cup of tea for Mo Hua.","Yet Mo Hua was still pondering about the orphans; after a moment, he said, \"Is there no way for these orphans...?\"","Master Gu understood what Mo Hua meant and sighed, \"This matter is actually quite troublesome.\"","\"Giving them more Spirit Stones?\"","\"It’s not feasible.\" Master Gu shook his head. \"The human heart is treacherous. If these children are given more Spirit Stones and have some left over, even just a few Broken Spirit Stones, they’ll be robbed clean immediately.\"","\"They’ll rob each other. Some adult cultivators will also rob them.\"","\"There are even some depraved cultivators who will threaten them for Spirit Stones.\"","\"Ironically, when these orphans have no value, no one cares about them, and they live miserably. But once there is anything valuable about them, and people start targeting them, they live even worse.\"","\"I also want to give them more food...\" Master Gu shook his head. \"But there are too many orphans in Solitary Mountain City. Once this opens up, everyone will rush in, and we simply can’t feed them all.\"","\"Moreover, my Refinery Shop has only just started to turn around. The masters, disciples, and apprentices under me haven’t even been fed long enough to eat a full meal, so we simply don’t have the capacity to take care of these children.\"","Master Gu’s expression was bitter.","Mo Hua sighed.","The human heart is unpredictable.","Sometimes, even the simplest good deed becomes extraordinarily complicated when people are involved.","In this world, doing good deeds is truly much harder than doing bad ones...","Mo Hua thought for a moment and then asked Master Gu, \"Do you have any Formation Masters in the Refinery Shop?\"","\"That depends on what kind of Formation Master you’re referring to... There are those who can randomly sketch a few Formations, but none that would catch Young Master Mo’s Dharma Eye...\" Master Gu said.","\"That’s fine; someone who can draw simple Formations will do.\"","Mo Hua took out a piece of paper from his sleeve, which depicted a Formation Pattern, the very Wind Formation Pattern he had just drawn on the bamboo baskets.","\"This Pattern is a First Grade Eight Trigrams Wind Formation Pattern. In Bagua Formation Method, Wind Formation is quite rare, usually passed down only in Great Sects. But a simple First Grade Wind Formation Pattern isn’t that difficult; just find someone with a basic understanding of Formations and have them practice a lot.\"","\"Master Gu, have someone learn this Pattern.\"","\"Hereafter, when those orphans come with their bamboo baskets to exchange for Broken Spirit Stones, draw this Wind Formation Pattern on their baskets.\"","\"A First Grade Pattern has minimal effect, and thus low spiritual consumption. Just mix a small amount of Spirit Stone powder into the Spiritual Ink, and it will run for a long time. These orphans can afford it, too.\"","Master Gu took the thin piece of Formation Paper from Mo Hua, his hands trembling slightly.","He couldn’t help but look up at Mo Hua, whose appearance was as gorgeous as a celestial being, with clear, refined eyes tinged with compassion, and sighed in his heart that there truly are naturally benevolent people in this world.","Moreover... He looked down at the Formation Paper in his hand.","It looked like just a simple Formation Pattern, but Master Gu knew that this was the hardest part.","Using the simplest, most cost-effective way to solve the most challenging problem.","Without extensive Formation experience and a profound understanding of Formations, it would be impossible to achieve.","Master Gu solemnly put away the Pattern, clasped his fists to Mo Hua, and said:","\"On behalf of the thousands of orphans in Solitary Mountain City, I thank Young Master Mo!\"","...","That evening, Master Gu specially set up a banquet to entertain Mo Hua and also invited the masters, disciples, and apprentices of the Refinery Shop to have a grand meal.","Outside the Refinery Shop, Master Gu also set up a food stand where each child could receive two buns and a bowl of porridge.","Naturally, doing this every day would be impossible.","But since Mo Hua was here, it was an exception, and hosting one meal was fine.","Thus, the inside of the Refinery Shop was brightly lit, and the atmosphere was exceptionally lively."]},{"number":1921,"title":"Chapter 1921 - 937: Wind Pattern_3","paragraphs":["Outside the refinery shop, the faces of the children had more smiles.","Mo Hua sat at the head of the courtyard, eating spiritual meat.","This spiritual meat was a specialty of Solitary Mountain City, and though it tasted good and wasn’t particularly expensive, just thinking about the children outside being delighted over a bun...","Suddenly, the spiritual meat in Mo Hua’s mouth didn’t taste so good anymore.","But he wasn’t a picky person, and besides, the spiritual meat itself was innocent and should not be wasted.","Mo Hua still finished all the meat in front of him.","After finishing the meat, he had a bit of wine, watched the masters in the refinery shop playing rock-paper-scissors and wrestling, had his fun, and feeling tired, went back to his room to rest.","Master Gu had prepared a fine guest room for him.","Mo Hua lay on the bed, closed his eyes slightly to rest and clear his mind of the effects of the alcohol, preparing to get up to draw formations, but unexpectedly fell into a stupor and slept until just before 1 p.m.","He had that nightmare again.","In the dream, a pair of pitch-black, hollow eyes, filled with blood threads and terrifyingly evil, stared at him.","Countless mutilated bodies of the violently dead seemed to crawl up from the abyss, struggling to reach Mo Hua, gnawing at his divine thought \"body\".","Mo Hua once again experienced the feeling of being weak, powerless, and in despair.","This time the feeling was even more real, clearer, more helpless.","This also meant that the power of the nightmare’s rules was stronger.","But Mo Hua’s expression was icy, without a trace of hesitation or fear.","As he was drowned by countless vengeful souls, gnawed and bitten, Mo Hua stood firm, relying on strong divine thought and will, considering everything before him as but \"illusion\".","In his palm, a strand of divine thought sword light was intermittently condensing.","Who knows how much time passed before a bright light burst in Mo Hua’s eyes, the sword of divine thought formed in his hand, breaking free from the illusion of the \"small self\" in the nightmare; with a single sword wave, golden light surged, burying the countless ghastly vengeful souls before him.","The sinister and bloody gaze of the evil embryo disappeared.","Mo Hua awoke from the nightmare.","This time, he was more certain.","The true nightmare of the evil god carried a certain \"rule\" power, capable of distorting his divine sense’s perception, thus suppressing, or even to some extent, erasing his divine thought power, trapping him in a nightmare from which it was difficult to escape.","The power of the first nightmare wasn’t very strong.","This time, it was obviously much stronger than the last.","Why?","Is it because... I am closer to the source of this nightmare...","Mo Hua turned his head to look out of the window.","Outside was the endless solitude of mountains, covered by the night, dark, dead silent, desolate, eerie, like a terrifying giant silently devouring Solitary Mountain City.","Mo Hua’s gaze became slightly focused.","...","Early the next morning, after breakfast, Mo Hua said, \"Master Gu, can you take me to walk around Solitary Mountain?\"","\"Solitary Mountain?\" Master Gu was taken aback.","\"Yes.\" Mo Hua nodded.","Master Gu hesitated, \"Solitary Mountain is rugged and messy, largely abandoned due to over-exploitation, there’s not much to see.\"","Mo Hua replied, \"It’s okay, I want to take a look.\"","Master Gu pondered for a moment and nodded, \"Alright.\"","He arranged the matters of the refinery shop and then, alone with Mo Hua, followed a few abandoned rugged mountain paths into Solitary Mountain.","It was just morning, but there were already quite a few cultivators on the mountain, some of them children.","They carried bamboo baskets, heads down, picking through scattered and messy mine debris for anything possibly useful.","The cultivators lived off the mountain.","Solitary Mountain was originally their ancestral wealth, meant to provide for the descendants of Solitary Mountain’s families to live on.","But now the mountain’s resources had long been exhausted.","The descendants of Solitary Mountain could only pick up remnants on the \"bones\" of Solitary Mountain to exchange for some broken spirit stones, just barely getting by.","Mo Hua took it all in with his eyes, then continued forward.","As Master Gu had said, Solitary Mountain was extremely desolate.","Everywhere there were abandoned mine shafts, chaotic and disorderly. Dark mine entrances dotted the mountain, leading who knows where.","Some mountain paths were damp and gloomy, the mine debris underfoot exuding a strange smell with a trace of mine poison.","Mo Hua wandered for a long time but still found nothing.","In this place, he found no clues he was searching for, nor detected any signs of anything sinister.","Mo Hua couldn’t help but look back at the vast Solitary Mountain:","\"This shouldn’t be wrong...\"","What Yu Er said, a careful rabbit has three burrows, a mountain, a water, a person.","This water should refer to Mistwater River.","Then this mountain, according to his guess, most likely referred to \"Solitary Mountain\".","But around here, there were no signs of evil spirits.","No henchmen of the evil god, no traces of demon cultivators, no presence of demon monsters.","No altar.","No killing.","Nor any formation...","It looked just like a desolate mining mountain, exhausted of its value, and subsequently abandoned.","Mo Hua’s brow gradually furrowed, continuing to walk forward.","But after a few steps, he was stopped by Master Gu, \"Young master, you cannot go any further, beyond this point is the Shen Family’s mountain.\"","Mo Hua’s pupils contracted, \"Shen Family?\"","Master Gu nodded.","\"Which Shen Family?\"","\"Qian Learning State Boundary, top-tier fifth-grade family, within one of the Four Great Sects, Qian Taoist Sect, with hereditary positions... that Shen Family.\"","Master Gu spoke with a tone tinged with fear, pointing ahead, \"The next hundred miles are all Shen Family’s mountains. Back then, the Shen Family bought this huge expanse of mountains to mine Bright Yellow Copper Ore, and after mining was finished, they abandoned this mountain but prohibited other cultivators from entering.\"","Mo Hua’s eyelid twitched, turning around to take in the vast stretch of mountains.","This mountain head was no different from any other place.","If Master Gu hadn’t mentioned it, he wouldn’t have thought it would belong to the Shen Family...","\"Young master, perhaps... we should look somewhere else?\" Master Gu suggested tactfully.","The power of the Shen Family was truly enormous, and he dared not provoke it.","Mo Hua thought for a moment and nodded.","The two of them changed direction, continuing to walk to the right, but walked a large circle with no discoveries.","Seeing it was getting late, Master Gu said, \"Young master, perhaps we should return?\"","Mo Hua didn’t decline.","The two of them retraced their steps along the messy mountain path.","This path was even more remote.","After walking for a while, Mo Hua, with sharp eyes, suddenly noticed a fresh pile of stone debris not far off the roadside, along with some peculiar ax and chisel marks.","Mo Hua asked Master Gu, \"Is this mountain head still being mined?\"","Master Gu, puzzled, responded, \"Impossible...\"","He walked to the pile of stone debris, pinched it with his hand, then scrutinized those peculiar ax and chisel marks, his brow gradually knotting:","\"This doesn’t look like mining; it looks more like... tomb raiding...\"","Mo Hua was taken aback, \"Tomb raiding?\""]},{"number":1922,"title":"Chapter 1922 - 938: Funerals and Burials","paragraphs":["\"Master Gu, how did you figure it out?\"","Master Gu picked up some stone debris, examined it carefully for a moment, and nodded, \"These stone fragments are half old and half new, carrying a stale scent, and these chiseling marks... Around Solitary Mountain, Mining Cultivators use pickaxes and other Spiritual Artifacts for mining, and the refinery shops are all too familiar with them. A normal mining pickaxe could never leave such marks on stone.\"","\"These marks are left by Spiritual Artifacts used for tomb raiding.\"","Master Gu reminisced for a moment, then continued, \"Years ago, when I was learning to refine artifacts, I met several fellow travelers and got along well with them. While drinking and chatting, I heard some secrets and found out... they made tomb raiding Spiritual Artifacts for the tomb robbers.\"","Mo Hua’s expression was somewhat peculiar, \"Wouldn’t the Taoist Court cause trouble for them?\"","Master Gu smiled wryly, \"There’s nothing that can be done; it’s a grey market. Some Artifact Refiners struggle financially and, without some side income, they can’t earn Spirit Stones. Their cultivation can’t progress, and their artifact refining skills can’t advance either.\"","\"Generally speaking, the Taoist Court is too lazy to investigate unless it escalates into a major incident. Otherwise, they won’t trace it back to the Artifact Refiners.\"","\"Moreover, sometimes there’s no other choice. Tomb robbers are ruthless desperados. If they target you and ask you to refine artifacts, following their orders may keep you safe. They don’t say anything, you don’t say anything, and no one traces it back to you.\"","\"If you refuse, they’ll find ways to threaten you, hold your weaknesses against you, or even use your family, relatives, and Taoist friends as leverage.\"","\"It’s better to avoid trouble, and there’s Spirit Stones to be earned. The average Artifact Refiner can’t refuse...\"","Mo Hua nodded, understanding the situation.","Although one should distinguish between right and wrong, after all, people have to live.","Since they must live, there are many situations where one is not in control, and it’s hard to blame them harshly.","He himself had been \"coerced\" by Lu Chengyun to refine a Corpse King for him.","Master Gu glanced at Mo Hua, seeing that he was empathetic, he sighed in relief, then continued:","\"Those fellow travelers of mine had no choice either. Later, during a drinking session, they inadvertently let it slip. Only when I questioned them did I grasp some of the intricacies involved.\"","Pointing at the marks on the ground, he said, \"These axe and chisel marks are fashioned cleverly, like a crane’s beak or a crescent moon. Others might not recognize them, but those with intent can see at a glance that they are left by tomb-raiding Spiritual Artifacts.\"","Mo Hua nodded, pondering silently.","\"Tomb raiding...\"","As far as he knew, the Cultivation World had funeral customs, and they were diverse.","There were water burials, cremations, wood burials, and earth burials.","Aside from the Wildland, where customs were unique and state boundaries remote, most Cultivators would still choose earth burial after death, to rest in peace.","And there were many methods for burial too.","Mo Hua remembered that long ago, back in South Yue City, his Master talked about Cultivator funerals and the theory of formation for both yang residences and yin residences.","At Taixu Gate, he had a Junior Brother named Xie Ling, who came from Gen State.","Gen State was mountainous, with peculiar peaks, high ridges like dragons, gathering the essence of heaven and earth, sun and moon, hiding many ancient tombs.","The Xie Family, which Xie Ling hailed from, seemed to be one of the great families of Gen State. Their family passed down the Kanyu Skill, discerning the mountain and river energy, determining life and death burials, and transmitting the Yin Yang Feng Shui Secret Formation.","They emphasized discerning Qi, burrowing into mountains, determining graves, and warding off malevolent spirits. They identified the Earth Qi Mechanism, used mountains and rivers as concealment, checked Feng Shui, pinpointed graves, prevented Corpse Transformation, and expelled ghosts...","But the intricacies within it ran deep.","And Mo Hua, from childhood till now, has seen a \"colorful\" twenty years of experience, but has come across very few tombs, understanding little about Cultivator funerals.","Tongxian City was very poor, almost devoid of grand tombs.","\"Do Cultivators have to be buried after death?\" Mo Hua asked Master Gu.","Master Gu, being a Golden Core from the Gu Family, wandered far and wide during his youth to learn artifact refining, enduring many hardships and witnessing much of the world, likely knew more than Mo Hua.","Master Gu replied, \"Generally, yes. Born between heaven and earth, standing tall during life, resting in peace after death.\"","\"But if impoverished and solitary, it doesn’t matter: while alive, there’s no place to stand; after death, there’s no place to be buried.\"","\"Without descendants, it also doesn’t matter: no offspring, no one to erect a tombstone; no incense, no fire, no one to visit the grave. Death is death, before and after.\"","\"Those who die unexpectedly, their bodies exposed in the wild, buried in the belly of a demon, naturally don’t adhere to any custom either.\"","\"Of course, most of these are Loose Cultivators. Family Cultivators are different.\"","\"Once there’s family, even if just a small family, there will be ancestral halls and ancestral graves, and more attention will naturally be paid to funerals.\"","\"The larger the family, the more important the funeral, with stricter rules. Many family cultivators take pride in resting in the family ancestral grave after death.\"","\"And when it comes to family level, some High-Rank Cultivators, after death, are strictly ordered by the Taoist Court to be buried.\"","\"Forced burial?\" Mo Hua was a bit confused, \"The Taoist Court even manages burials after death?\"","\"Normally, they wouldn’t, only for family-born High-Rank Cultivators.\"","\"What qualifies as High-Rank? A Golden Core?\"","Master Gu shook his head, \"It depends on the state boundary specifically. Generally, in a small state boundary, if Golden Core is the pinnacle, then Golden Core funerals are managed. But in some Great Province Boundaries and Great Families, only when Cultivators of the Feather Transformation Realm fall will the Taoist Court care about their funerals.\"","Mo Hua was quite puzzled, \"Why does the Taoist Court involve itself in this?\"","Master Gu contemplated for a moment, then slowly said, \"It’s said... it’s to revive the Spiritual Energy of this world.\"","\"Revive Spiritual Energy?\" Mo Hua’s heart skipped a beat.","\"Yes.\" Master Gu pointed upwards, \"It’s said that in ancient times, the Spiritual Energy of this world was very abundant. Ancient Cultivators didn’t need Spirit Stones to cultivate; they just needed to find a mountain, meditate, and through a few circulations, the Spiritual Energy would flow into their meridians and settle into their Qi Sea.\""]},{"number":1923,"title":"Chapter 1923 - 938: Funerals (Part 2)","paragraphs":["\"Now, as time has passed and the world has changed, the spiritual energy between heaven and earth has become extremely thin, and cultivators must rely on spirit stones mined from spiritual mines to cultivate.\"","\"But spirit stones are different from spiritual energy.\"","\"Spiritual energy is a gift from heaven and earth to all things, while spirit stones become personal possessions of cultivators.\"","\"Spiritual energy roams in the sky, fills the earth, and treats all living beings without distinction.\"","\"But spirit stones, once considered ’wealth’, only gather from below upwards, ultimately concentrated in the hands of a few.\"","\"And the mining of spirit stones itself is like consuming the resources of a mountain without replenishing, making it unsustainable in the long run.\"","\"Therefore, more than ten thousand years ago, an ancestor of the Taoist Court established a rule: after death, cultivators of great power, especially Feathered Immortal Cultivators, must undergo corpse disintegration.\"","Mo Hua’s pupils trembled, \"Corpse disintegration?\"","Images of bodies torn apart and dying horribly flashed in Mo Hua’s mind.","Master Gu saw this, knew Mo Hua misunderstood, and quickly explained: \"It is not the literal meaning of corpse disintegration. The so-called ’corpse disintegration’ is not about the physical body, but about spiritual power.\"","\"Spiritual power disintegration?\"","\"Indeed,\" Master Gu said, \"Through a certain formation, the immense spiritual power these great cultivators gathered in life is decomposed and transformed back into pure spiritual energy to be released into heaven and earth.\"","Master Gu spoke with a solemn voice.","\"In life, one gathers spiritual energy unto oneself; in death, through corpse disintegration, one returns the spiritual power to heaven and earth...\" Mo Hua murmured, feeling a sense of shock.","It seemed that this ancestor of the Taoist Court who stipulated that cultivators above Feather Transformation should undergo \"corpse disintegration\" after death had not only immense cultivation and influence but also extraordinary vision and magnanimity.","However...","Mo Hua frowned, \"Wouldn’t the family clans disagree?\"","\"Naturally,\" Master Gu nodded, \"Cultivators rely on their cultivation. This cultivation, painstakingly acquired in life, how could one be willing to disperse it to heaven and earth even in death?\"","\"It is said that back then, when the Taoist Court implemented ’corpse disintegration’, it incited widespread anger, and family clans were thrown into chaos.\"","\"But the Taoist Court persisted resolutely, even deploying the Dragon Soaring Forbidden Army, to subdue the noble families across the Nine State, enforcing the ’Corpse Disintegration Skill’ with an irreversible determination.\"","\"During that time, the fires of war were widespread, and disputes were ceaseless. Some Fifth-Rank Great Families, refusing to comply with corpse disintegration, had their ancestors executed by the Taoist Court and were thus removed from nobility and obliterated.\"","\"This upheaval lasted nearly a millennium before gradually subsiding.\"","\"The family clans acquiesced to this rule, and corpse disintegration became customary.\"","Mo Hua found it rather astonishing.","This Chapter of cultivation world history, succinct though it may sound, encompassed the rules of the Heavenly Dao, the power struggles of great forces, the laws of the Taoist Court, and the chaos of family clans. It unknowingly involved countless open battles and power shifts, with casualties among cultivators, truly a grand and turbulent era...","\"But... does corpse disintegration really work?\" Mo Hua asked, \"Aren’t the spiritual energies of heaven and earth still thin?\"","Master Gu smiled bitterly, \"This involves the power struggles above Feather Transformation, something a mere Golden Core like myself doesn’t understand. But it should make some difference... Now it’s only thin, but without great cultivators undergoing corpse disintegration to return spiritual power to heaven and earth after death, even this ’thin’ spiritual energy might be lost.\"","Master Gu sighed and said melancholically: \"If that day comes when there is no spiritual energy in heaven and earth, having only spirit stones would be useless.\"","\"Without spiritual energy, some naturally occurring spiritual objects in heaven and earth would become extinct.\"","\"The so-called blessed paradises, spirit mountains of immortal families, would lose their spirituality and become mere dirt and stone.\"","\"Spiritual mines will shrink, and spirit stones will become increasingly scarce.\"","\"For ordinary cultivators, it will become increasingly difficult to cultivate and survive.\"","\"At that time, who knows what will happen...\"","Master Gu appeared worried.","Mo Hua also frowned, lost in thought.","After a while, he glanced at Master Gu, admiringly saying: \"Master Gu, you know so much.\"","Master Gu froze, then self-deprecatingly said, \"You’re overpraising me, young master. These aren’t my words.\"","\"Not yours?\"","\"Back then, when I was studying abroad, I met an old storyteller who told me these things during a casual chat.\"","\"An old storyteller? Was his cultivation high?\" Mo Hua asked curiously.","Master Gu shook his head, \"At that time, I was only at Foundation Establishment and couldn’t tell... But even if that old master didn’t have high cultivation, his insight alone was enough to command respect.\"","\"Indeed.\" Mo Hua nodded.","Family clan tombs, feathered corpse disintegration, spiritual energy revival...","These are not secrets an ordinary cultivator can delve into.","\"The old storyteller...\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment and then recalled something, asking:","\"Master Gu, if high-rank cultivators don’t ’disintegrate’ and don’t dissipate spirit but are directly buried in tombs, what would happen?\"","Master Gu frowned tightly, \"This... to be honest, young master, I’ve only heard a little about this, it may not be true.\"","\"I understand, please go on.\" Mo Hua said.","Master Gu said in a low voice, \"It’s said that if high-rank cultivators do not undergo corpse disintegration and retain their spiritual power when buried, a mutation could occur.\"","\"Mutation?\" Mo Hua raised an eyebrow.","\"Yes,\" Master Gu said, \"either a corpse transformation or ghost transformation...\"","\"If plagued by malevolent energy, they become copper corpses or flying corpses. If a mouthful of resentment remains, it might transform into a ’Fierce Ghost’ in red.\"","\"Moreover, a tomb is an abode of yin, stained with death qi, and the corpse transformations and ghost transformations inside differ greatly from the ordinary corpse cultivators and ghost cultivators of the Demon Path, much more vicious and terrifying...\"","Mo Hua felt a chill in his heart.","\"Of course, these are things I’ve just heard of, young master needn’t take them too seriously.\" Master Gu emphasized once again.","\"Indeed.\" Mo Hua noted everything in his heart and nodded.","Master Gu’s words contained many secrets that he hadn’t known before, so he needed to remember them well and digest them carefully."]},{"number":1924,"title":"Chapter 1924 - 938: Funerals (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Tao cultivation experience can sometimes be more important than cultivation itself.","Mo Hua pondered for a long time, and when he snapped back to reality, he realized it was already late.","He turned his head again, looked at the stone debris and chisel marks in front of him, and asked, \"Is there a tomb here in Solitary Mountain?\"","\"That’s the strange part,\" Master Gu frowned and said, \"This is a mining mountain, with so many mines, I don’t know how many times it’s been excavated. Who would bury a tomb here? These tomb robbers, I can’t tell if they’re stupid or have some ideas...\"","\"Do they have other motives? Is tomb robbing just a cover?\" Mo Hua speculated.","\"It’s possible...\" Master Gu nodded in agreement.","Mo Hua stroked his chin, \"Let’s see if there are any other clues, let’s find out what this group of tomb robbers is really up to.\"","Master Gu hesitated a bit.","This was a matter for Solitary Mountain City; he didn’t really want to trouble Mo Hua.","The young master was a man of \"great deeds\" and didn’t need to waste time here.","Moreover, most tomb robbers were ruthless, vicious people, and he didn’t really dare to let Mo Hua take risks.","But in the blink of an eye, Mo Hua was already searching for clues around.","Master Gu sighed in his heart.","With the young master’s current status, he does whatever he wants, and he can’t really stop him.","Master Gu could only follow closely within ten feet of Mo Hua, protecting him while searching for tomb-robbing traces near the mines.","He was actually curious too, about the intentions of this gang of tomb robbers.","He even felt somewhat wary.","Strange things must have something supernatural, and on this always peaceful mining mountain, suddenly foreign robbers came to loot tombs; there must be something odd...","After that, the two of them searched around nearby, but there were few traces outside the mines. The mines were deep, intricate, and there were no other clues.","Master Gu glanced at the sky and said, \"Young Master, let’s go back first.\"","Mo Hua could only nod.","The matter of the tomb robbers is just strange, not worth wasting too much time on.","The urgent matter is still Solitary Mountain, especially the affairs of the Shen Family.","But that being said, leaving it entirely unattended isn’t good either.","Mo Hua thought for a moment and then said, \"Let’s take a trip to the Solitary Mountain Taoist Court and talk to them about it.\"","By the way, he also happened to meet with Master Fan of Solitary Mountain City.","\"Alright.\" Master Gu nodded.","So the two left the Solitary Mountain, entered the city, and walked straight to the Taoist Court located in the north of the city along the Blue Stone Street.","The Solitary Mountain Taoist Court, the place is quite large, but very dilapidated and old.","At a glance, it was once splendid, but now it’s rundown.","There aren’t many staff in the Taoist Court either.","Solitary Mountain City is down and out, cultivators struggle to make a living, and consequently, the Taoist Court is poor, a barebones establishment, unable to sustain many idle people.","Upon entering the Taoist Court, there was an enforcement leader guarding the gate.","This enforcement leader was listless and impatient, until he saw Master Gu, who was at the Golden Core Realm, and immediately stood up smiling:","\"Master Gu, what brings you here today?\"","In recent years, the Gu Family’s refinery shop business has suddenly improved, earning more Spirit Stones, and there’s been a substantial increase in their spiritual tax submissions to the Taoist Court.","If not for this, the days for these minor enforcement leaders would be even more difficult to endure.","\"Bread and butter,\" so they must be treated well, hence the enforcement leader was especially courteous to Master Gu.","Master Gu said, \"Is Master Fan in?\"","\"He is, he is.\" The enforcement leader nodded.","\"Could you please inform him that I’d like to have some tea and discuss something with him?\"","\"Please wait a moment, I’ll go inform him.\"","The enforcement leader said and then dashed towards the inner hall.","In the inner hall’s archivist room.","Fan Jin was slumped in his chair, his face filled with frustration, in a terrible mood.","When the enforcement leader came in hurriedly, it roused Fan Jin’s irritation even more.","As soon as the enforcement leader entered the door and before he could speak, Fan Jin couldn’t help but berate him:","\"Didn’t I tell you? Don’t bother me today! Damn it, this place is a godforsaken hole with no peace...\"","The enforcement leader was used to the scolding, stammering a bit: \"No, it’s just...\"","\"What is it?\"","\"It’s Master Gu.\"","\"Master Gu?\" Fan Jin frowned, \"What’s he doing here?\"","\"Master Gu said he invites you for tea...to discuss some matters.\" The enforcement leader said in a low voice.","Fan Jin rubbed his forehead, impatiently said: \"Tell him maybe another day...I’m not in a good mood today.\"","\"Alright,\" said the enforcement leader, \"I’ll go tell him you’re not in a good mood and to come back another day.\"","Fan Jin’s forehead twitched, his temper flared, he gritted his teeth: \"Are you... thick-headed? Can you reply to someone like that? I’ve told you so many times, why can’t you remember! You should say I’m ’busy with affairs’, and ’invite him to come another day’.\"","Fan Jin felt desperate.","They say a spiritual land raises special people, non-spiritual land, non-special people.","This godforsaken place of Solitary Mountain City, with its harsh conditions, recruits some enforcement leaders whose brains aren’t sharp and whose speech isn’t smooth.","\"Oh, okay...\" The enforcement leader memorized \"busy with affairs\", \"come another day\", and walked out the door.","\"Wait,\" Fan Jin frowned, asked, \"Did Master Gu come alone?\"","\"No,\" the enforcement leader said, \"he also brought a follower.\"","\"Follower?\" Fan Jin frowned, waved his hand, a bit dispirited, \"Then never mind.\"","The enforcement leader walked out a few steps.","Just as he was about to leave, Fan Jin felt uneasy, called him to stop: \"Hold on!\"","Fan Jin asked: \"This ’follower’... what do they look like?\"","The enforcement leader pondered for a moment, described: \"...fair-skinned, not very tall, quite handsome.\"","Before he finished speaking, the originally slumped Fan Jin immediately sprang up from his chair like a carp flipping out of water.","\"You’re really... gonna be the end of me someday.\" Fan Jin was extremely annoyed.","Just a little, just a little more...","\"Quick, go invite them in!\" Fan Jin ordered.","The enforcement leader was taken aback, said \"Yes\", and was about to turn around when Fan Jin stopped him again.","\"Forget it...\" Fan Jin pondered, \"No need to invite; I’ll go myself!\"","\"You’re going yourself?\" The enforcement leader was stunned.","\"Yes.\"","Fan Jin somehow took out a mirror.","He tidied his clothes in the mirror, adjusted his hair crown, and then promptly put on an extremely bright smile, walked out of the inner hall with a brisk step, leaving the enforcement leader with a look as if he’d seen a ghost.","When he left the inner hall and came to the front yard, seeing Mo Hua from a distance, Fan Jin’s eyes lit up, and his smile became even more radiant.","\"Master Gu! Young Master Mo! Pardon my neglect, please forgive me, please forgive me!\"","Fan Jin was exceedingly enthusiastic.","Times have changed for the better, fortune has turned, the \"great noble\" has finally arrived!"]},{"number":1925,"title":"Chapter 1925 - 939: Taking Sides","paragraphs":["Master Gu looked at the burly man in front of him, whose face was blooming like a chrysanthemum, his smile even brighter than sunlight, and was momentarily stunned.","This is that Fan Jin, Supervisor Fan?","He almost didn’t recognize him...","Mo Hua also smiled and said, \"Supervisor Fan, it’s been a long time.\"","\"It’s been a long time, it’s really been a long time.\" Supervisor Fan replied cheerfully. Then he bent his tall frame and made an inviting gesture, \"Young Master, Master Gu, please come inside.\"","\"Thank you, Supervisor Fan,\" Mo Hua said with a smile.","\"No need, no need.\"","Supervisor Fan led the two of them into the inner hall. Once they were seated, he called out, \"Someone come in.\"","The Enforcement Leader from earlier walked over.","Fan Jin said, \"Serve tea.\" Then, worried his subordinate might do something clueless, he lowered his voice and added, \"Serve the good tea.\"","The Enforcement Leader hesitated for a moment, then asked quietly, \"Supervisor, is it... the top shelf tea? Last time Master Gu came...\"","Fan Jin shot him a glare that told him to shut up, and whispered, \"Even better than that.\"","The Enforcement Leader muttered, \"I don’t think... there’s anything better left...\"","Fan Jin’s old face flushed red, anger bubbling up inside him again.","This blockhead’s brain must be made of elm wood.","With a subordinate like this, there’s no way to improve at all.","\"Above that, there’s a little box, in the box there’s a jade casket...\"","The Enforcement Leader nodded, then suddenly froze. \"Isn’t that the Court Leader’s private stash...?\"","If it weren’t for these important guests, Fan Jin would’ve kicked him by now.","\"Just go get it, less chatter, more moving, alright?\"","The Enforcement Leader saw that Fan Jin really seemed upset this time, so he didn’t dare dawdle, quickly said, \"Yes, sir,\" and ran off to secretly fetch the tea.","Fan Jin let out a sigh. When he turned his head, he saw Mo Hua’s pair of clear, wide eyes staring right at him, and couldn’t help but flush in embarrassment, forcing a smile as he said:","\"This remote backwater, all the people I can hire are a bit dense. Please don’t laugh, Young Master.\"","\"You’re too modest, Supervisor Fan,\" Mo Hua said curiously. \"But, you’re actually serving me the Court Leader’s tea—if your Court Leader finds out, won’t he blame you?\"","\"Oh come on,\" Fan Jin laughed, \"if the Court Leader found out his tea was used to serve Young Master Mo, he’d be thrilled, not upset.\"","Fan Jin was well aware of just how important this young Master was.","A prodigy of the Eight Great Gates, the Taixu Gate’s little monster.","The moment Fan Jin heard the name Mo Hua, he’d already guessed.","He’d eventually gone through countless channels to confirm it—and he was right!","At the Proving Dao Conference, he, with a Foundation Establishment Middle Stage cultivation, swept the Four Sects, outshined the Eight Gates, suppressed thousands of Qianxue Sects, and became the unrivaled \"Formation Leader.\"","Originally, Fan Jin didn’t know the first thing about Formations, nor did he care about the Formation Competition.","But there was no helping it—a Formation Leader at Foundation Building Middle Stage was just too much of a \"freak,\" freakish enough that even him, an out-of-the-way, unconcerned Supervisor in Solitary Mountain City, had heard of Mo Hua’s name.","A figure like that, drinking the Court Leader’s tea.","If the Court Leader went around bragging, he’d have stories to tell for three years straight.","He wouldn’t be upset—he might even thank him.","After a while, the tea arrived. The tea was a bright jade color, with a rich fragrance—to be sure, it was excellent tea.","Mo Hua took a sip and nodded.","Fan Jin studied his expression, saw Mo Hua nod in approval, and finally breathed a sigh of relief. His smile grew even broader:","\"Young Master and Master Gu, may I ask what brings you here today?\"","Mo Hua glanced at Master Gu, then answered, \"Master Gu and I took a trip to Solitary Mountain, and on our way back, we found some traces—looked like they were left by a tomb robber. Thinking something about this is fishy, we came to the Taoist Court to inform you, Supervisor Fan.\"","\"Tomb robbing?\" Fan Jin was a little stunned.","\"Supervisor Fan, you hadn’t seen anything like that earlier?\"","\"No,\" Fan Jin shook his head, confused, muttering in his mind, \"What kind of idiot would rob tombs in a godforsaken place like Solitary Mountain... must have rocks in their head...\"","Of course, with Mo Hua bringing it up, he didn’t dare brush it off, and immediately assured him, \"Don’t worry, Young Master, I will rigorously investigate this myself to keep an eye out for any lowlifes up to no good.\"","Mo Hua nodded, lowered his head to take a sip, savoring the sweet aftertaste as the tea slid down his throat, feeling his mood brighten a little.","But when he looked up, he noticed Fan Jin was gulping down his tea like a cow chomping peonies—on the surface calm, but his Divine Soul was uneasy, as if there was some agitation within him.","Mo Hua’s thoughts flickered, so he asked, \"Supervisor Fan, is the matter of your promotion not going well?\"","Supervisor Fan started, surprised: \"How did you notice that?\"","Mo Hua took another sip of tea, but said nothing.","Supervisor Fan didn’t press further, just sighed, \"To tell you the truth, Young Master, things really... haven’t gone smoothly lately.\"","Mo Hua asked, \"Last time in the campaign against the Demon Sect, didn’t Supervisor Fan earn quite a bit of merit?\"","A large portion of the Demon Sect’s intelligence had been \"leaked\" to the Taoist Court by Mo Hua after digging it up with Thunder Magnetism.","Mo Hua also knew all about the Taoist Court’s plans.","In the campaign to annihilate the Demon Sect, while Supervisor Fan didn’t make any great achievements, he worked hard and never shied away from tough jobs. Even if they were minor accomplishments, adding them up was still a good amount.","Mo Hua had roughly calculated it—with Supervisor Fan working so hard, his merits, while maybe not enough to get him straight up to Fifth Grade Qianxue Taoist Court, should be enough for a promotion to Fourth-grade, or at least a parallel transfer to a slightly richer Third-Grade State Boundary post—there shouldn’t be any problem.","Fan Jin had been frustrated, stuck here in Solitary Mountain City with no one to talk to. So, since the topic came up, he poured out his troubles to Mo Hua like beans spilling from a bag:","\"Not gonna lie, Young Master, my merit really should be enough. I even went and consulted Supervisor Gu—Supervisor Gu said that by the Taoist Court’s regulations, under normal circumstances, there shouldn’t be any problem at all. Even if I don’t get promoted, I should at least get a lateral transfer.\"","\"I was really happy, so I just stayed home waiting for good news. But who’d expect—the process dragged on and on, and in the end, I got stuck by some higher-up—they said I lack experience, need further assessment, goddammit...\""]},{"number":1926,"title":"Chapter 1926 - 939: Taking Sides (2)","paragraphs":["Fan Jin accidentally let some profanity slip.","Mo Hua asked, \"Do you know who’s blocking you?\"","Fan Jin gave a bitter smile, \"When it comes to internal promotions within the Taoist Court, I, a small-time Supervisor with no power or influence, have no right to know. I’m nothing more than a pawn to be manipulated from above.\"","Mo Hua gave Fan Jin a subtle glance.","As he knew, positions in the Taoist Court mostly depended on interests and connections, but it wouldn’t be without reason to block the promotion of a small Supervisor.","Perhaps someone wanted to keep Master Fan in Solitary Mountain City?","Sometimes motion doesn’t beat stillness.","Someone doesn’t want changes in the personnel of the Taoist Court in Solitary Mountain City...","\"Master Fan,\" Mo Hua asked, \"are you familiar with the Shen family?\"","Fan Jin was slightly taken aback, \"The Shen family?\"","\"Yes.\"","Fan Jin pondered for a moment, \"I’ve dealt with them a bit, but the threshold of the Shen family is too high. I can’t form close ties, so no, not really familiar.\"","Mo Hua nodded and asked again, \"To the north of Solitary Mountain, there’s a large area of mountains belonging to the Shen family. Are they still mining there?\"","Fan Jin shook his head, \"I’m not sure about other things, but there’s absolutely no way they can keep mining there. Back then, the major families swarmed in like locusts, extracting everything possible from Solitary Mountain. Not even a sip of soup is left; how could there still be anything to mine?\"","\"Since there’s nothing left to mine, why does the Shen family still hold onto that mountain, not letting others approach?\" Mo Hua was a bit puzzled.","\"It is indeed strange,\" Fan Jin frowned, \"but after all, the Shen family bought that mountain, so they can do whatever they want, and others can’t interfere...\"","Fan Jin spoke, glancing suspiciously at Mo Hua and lowered his voice to ask, \"Young master, why are you asking about the Shen family?\"","\"Oh, nothing,\" Mo Hua blinked, casually saying, \"I passed by and saw it, got curious, so thought I’d ask.\"","\"Oh...\"","Fan Jin seemed dubious.","Mo Hua took another sip of tea, then got up to bid farewell, \"It’s getting late, I should be going back.\"","Fan Jin panicked and hurriedly said, \"Young master has come from afar, you must let me do my duty as a host and properly entertain the young master.\"","\"Master Fan, you’re too kind,\" Mo Hua politely declined.","Fan Jin earnestly pleaded, \"Please grace us with your presence, young master.\"","He didn’t want to let a \"noble person\" who came by drop by the wayside, for his efforts would be in vain otherwise.","At least have a meal to build some relationships. Otherwise, if you miss this chance, who knows when the next will come by?","Mo Hua hesitated slightly.","He wasn’t being insincere, but his break time was limited, and he really had other things to investigate.","Seeing this, Fan Jin immediately said, \"Young master, I’ll invite you to Hongyan Building, the largest Food Building in Solitary Mountain City.\"","The largest Food Building?","Something piqued Mo Hua’s interest, \"Could this Food Building be Shen family’s property?\"","\"Indeed,\" Fan Jin said.","Mo Hua’s eyes flickered as he nodded, \"Then it would be a treat, Master Fan.\"","\"Not at all,\" Master Fan rejoiced, cupping his hands, \"Young master, please.\"","\"Please.\"","Master Gu, who was watching on the side, thought to himself, \"This Fan Datou is really willing to spend big... But then again, to have that kind of eye and knack for maneuvering, if it weren’t for such poor background and lack of power and connections, he’d have surely made it by now.\"","Then Fan Jin led the way, and the group left the Taoist Court and headed to the busiest area of Solitary Mountain City, to the largest Food Building:","Hongyan Building.","Upon arriving at Hongyan Building, Mo Hua looked up, a bit surprised.","This building was magnificent.","A wealthy and splendid building in an otherwise marginal and impoverished third-grade Immortal City, rivaling some high-end Food Buildings within a fifth-grade state boundary like Taixu City.","Indeed, even the poorest places have their wealthy individuals.","Conversely, it’s because some places have such wealthy people that the poor get poorer.","\"The Shen family...\"","Mo Hua’s gaze sharpened slightly.","Fan Jin booked a private room at Hongyan Building and ordered a lavish table of dishes specifically to entertain Mo Hua.","During the meal, Fan Jin continually poured wine and served food to Mo Hua.","Even though he was a Golden Core cultivator with a strong build, he did it with such ease as if he were wielding his hammer against Demon Cultivators.","Mo Hua even praised him as being quite talented.","After a few rounds of drinks, the three chatted casually, becoming more familiar with each other.","Mo Hua asked, \"Does the Shen family own many businesses in Solitary Mountain City?\"","\"Of course,\" Fan Jin, his face rosy from the drinks, pointed to the ceiling, \"this Hongyan Building, belongs to the Shen family. Moreover, on the way here, you saw those Pill Pavilions, Artifact Refining Pavilions, stores... they’re all owned by the Shen family.\"","There were some things not suitable for minors that Fan Jin didn’t mention.","Those places with their dusky beauty are mostly mundane and vulgar, used for business meetings and entertaining.","The young master, a person as pristine as a breeze or bright moon, should not be tainted by such squalor.","Fan Jin continued, \"These were all industries the Shen family set up when Solitary Mountain was prosperous to mine the Bright Yellow Copper Ore.\"","\"The Shen family bought the mountains, mined the ore, made a wave of Spirit Stones, established leisure and entertainment industries, and made another wave.\"","Mo Hua frowned, recalling something: \"As the saying goes, ’relying on the mountain to eat the mountain.’ According to the general regulations of the Taoist Court, since Solitary Mountain City is next to Solitary Mountain, its mineral resources should be jointly owned by all cultivators of the city. Why was it sold to the Shen family?\"","\"The situation is a bit complicated...\" Fan Jin found it hard to explain.","Mo Hua poured him a cup of wine.","Fan Jin was instantly flattered, then sighed, \"Oh well, everyone with clear eyes knows about these things, so I won’t hide it from the young master...\"","\"The regulations of the Taoist Court are just regulations. This Solitary Mountain’s mine is nominally owned by all cultivators of Solitary Mountain City. But, in reality, who takes it, who gets more, who gets less, there are so many intricacies involved.\""]},{"number":1927,"title":"Chapter 1927 - 939: Choosing Sides (Part 3)","paragraphs":["\"Local small families have ancestral property and can occupy a small hill.\"","\"Loose cultivators, who come from the same ancestor and have the same surname, can also mine on a fixed hill.\"","\"There are also some scattered mines available for loose cultivators without home or job to make a living mining.\"","\"Of course, the Taoist Court can also occupy a piece...\"","\"Although the situation is chaotic, it is relatively reasonable. Everyone can have a bite to eat, and the mining resources of the entire Solitary Mountain City are sufficient to support the city’s population.\"","Fan Jin shook his head and sighed, \"But later the various family clans, especially the Shen Family, came and changed everything...\"","\"Loose cultivators are mostly ignorant and short-sighted. When the Shen Family arrived, they offered high prices to buy the mines, and many greedy ones sold immediately.\"","\"Those who didn’t sell were persecuted by the Shen Family.\"","\"Some wanted to rally against the Shen Family. But human hearts vary: some are greedy for wealth, some for beauty, and some wishing to ingratiate themselves, were secretly used by the Shen Family, thus being divided and unable to unite.\"","\"In the end, large tracts of hills were sold to the Shen Family.\"","Mo Hua frowned slightly, \"With the mines sold, how will the cultivators of Solitary Mountain City make a living?\"","Fan Jin said, \"The Shen Family initially promised that after buying the mines, they would still recruit loose cultivators to mine for them and promised not low prices.\"","Fan Jin couldn’t help but laugh derisively, unclear if it was at the Shen Family or the loose cultivators.","\"Once the mines were sold, when trying to get the Shen Family to keep their promise, they ignored you.\"","\"Such a large family clan as the Shen Family, with developed industries, builds large Spiritual Machines, cooperating with Formations for mining as steadily as flowing water. Why would they still need those bottom-level loose cultivators with pickaxes and hammers?\"","\"Loose cultivators realized they were deceived and tried to make a fuss, but it was useless. The mines belonged to others, clearly written in the Spirit Pact.\"","\"Even if there were subsequent conflicts due to mining disputes between family clans and loose cultivators, how can an arm twist a thigh?\"","\"After several bloodsheds and some deaths, the loose cultivators became like scattered sand and nothing came of it...\"","\"Later on...\" Fan Jin gazed out at the desolate Solitary Mountain, \"After extracting all the ore, family clans wrapped up the riches and withdrew, leaving Solitary Mountain ravaged. The cultivators of Solitary Mountain City, without a means of livelihood, either perished or fled, drastically reducing the population. Solitary Mountain City then became desolate, showing its current state...\"","After speaking, Fan Jin looked regretful. Master Gu also felt the sentiment.","The atmosphere became somewhat dreary for a moment.","Mo Hua pondered for a while, his eyes glimmered, and said to Fan Jin, \"Speaking of which, the Taoist Court can’t be absolved from this, can it?\"","The family clans coerced and enticed loose cultivators to sign Spirit Pacts, annexing the mines, and then suppressed the riots of loose cultivators.","No need to think, the Taoist Court must have been helping the tyrant.","Otherwise, in matters of regulations, the Shen Family couldn’t have managed.","Mo Hua silently looked at Fan Jin.","Fan Jin, flustered by Mo Hua’s gaze, hurriedly waved his hands, \"I have nothing to do with it.\"","Mo Hua made no comment.","Fan Jin, helpless, said, \"These were matters of the former Taoist Court. Back then, I hadn’t even joined the Taoist Court and wasn’t clear about the exact ins and outs.\"","\"What about those from the former Taoist Court?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"They were promoted.\"","\"Promoted?\" Mo Hua’s expression was somewhat complicated.","Fan Jin sighed, \"They helped the Shen Family annex the mines and extracted so many ores, earning a vast amount of Spirit Stones, making Solitary Mountain City appear ’prosperous’ for a time. On the surface, this was naturally a great achievement. Having achievements, coupled with the Shen Family’s operation, the related Court Leader and Supervisor naturally got promoted early and went flying high.\"","\"By the time I became Supervisor, it was already a mess. I didn’t even have a chance to ’help the tyrant.’\"","He was quite frank, speaking his mind.","\"Also, those promoted weren’t just from the Taoist Court.\" Fan Jin’s gaze darkened slightly, \"The mines of Solitary Mountain were the mark of the Shen Family’s rise. It was through the wealth from Solitary Mountain that the Shen Family operated everywhere, gradually reaching the status they have today.\"","\"Some branches of the Shen Family, through the operations concerning the mines, also obtained huge profits and leaped into the family’s core.\"","Fan Jin talked about these matters, shaking his head all the while, unclear whether it was from envy or jealousy.","Master Gu remained silent but was obviously a bit angry.","It’s just that the Shen Family’s influence was too large. Even if these cultivators were dissatisfied, they couldn’t express it.","Mo Hua also looked thoughtful.","The banquet thus ended in a somewhat stifling atmosphere.","Fan Jin let out a sigh of relief, as at least his purpose was initially achieved.","He treated this Young Master Mo to a meal and shared so many secrets.","This friendship might count as somewhat deep; if I get a chance in the future, I’ll help this young master with a little favor. As we interact more, the friendship will deepen.","At least, I can finally latch onto a considerable backer.","After eating, the three left the private room, walking along the luxurious corridor towards the exit, when they ran into a group of people. Leading them was a young master from a noble family, followed by three or four people.","They passed by each other. Mo Hua was lost in thought and only glanced slightly, not paying much attention.","But after taking just a few steps, he suddenly heard someone shouting at him:","\"Stop!\"","This sudden command to stop caught everyone off guard.","Mo Hua turned his head and saw that it was that young master who had told him to \"stop\".","This noble young master was dressed in fine clothes, with an arrogant expression.","But Mo Hua had no impression of him and wasn’t familiar with him, not understanding why this person called him to stop for no reason.","\"I recognize you, you’re Mo Hua.\" The noble young master spoke.","\"Oh...\"","Mo Hua responded casually.","Now he was somewhat of a \"celebrity\", so being recognized on the street seemed quite normal.","Mo Hua was gradually getting used to it.","\"You don’t recognize me?\" This noble young master said with a cold face.","Mo Hua wanted to say no, but thought it was impolite, so he replied somewhat tactfully, \"You are...\"","Mo Hua’s apparent \"disregard\" made a trace of fierceness appear in the noble young master’s eyes, \"New Year’s Eve, Qingzhou City, we met once, I was behind Mr. Linsu...\"","Mo Hua remembered and suddenly realized:","\"You’re that follower.\"","Follower...","Standing in the middle of everyone, with everyone fawning over him, the noble young master’s face turned ashen.","He was indeed Shen Linsu’s \"follower\", but not just anyone had the right to call him that.","Perhaps not elsewhere, but here in the remote Solitary Mountain City, as a young master of the Shen Family, he could do whatever he wanted.","No one had dared to call him a \"follower\" before.","\"Blind fool...\" The noble young master’s face darkened, ordering the person behind him, \"Go, tear his mouth apart, gouge out his eyes...\"","Immediately, one Golden Core cultivator behind him stepped forward, exuding a murderous aura.","Master Gu’s expression turned severe and without a second thought, he stood in front of Mo Hua, releasing the aura of a Golden Core.","\"Golden Core?\" The noble young master sneered, \"In Solitary Mountain City, want to compare manpower with me?\"","Before he finished speaking, another Golden Core stepped out from behind him, with hands sharp as claws, his face twisted in a sinister grin.","Another Golden Core appeared opposite.","At this time, another Golden Core behind Mo Hua seemed at a loss.","\"No, what’s the situation here...\"","Fan Jin was sweating profusely.","All he wanted was to latch onto a powerful ally, and before anything had even happened, just after a cup of tea and a meal, he was suddenly facing a life-and-death \"choosing sides\" test?","One side was Mo Hua, the other the Shen Family.","Intervene, and you’ll offend the Shen Family.","Do nothing, and you’ll offend Mo Hua.","Isn’t this courting death?","Fan Jin was completely at a loss.","This damned cultivation world, is too hard to navigate...","He just wanted to latch onto a powerful ally, why is it so difficult?!"]},{"number":1928,"title":"Chapter 1928 - 940: Take a Look","paragraphs":["The Shen Family goes without saying—it’s the top clan in the Qian Learning State Boundary, one of the Four Great Sects by hereditary right, a true behemoth. For someone like him, just an unremarkable early Golden Core cultivator, he’s not much better than an ant in front of the Shen Family.","As for Mo Hua, the Taixu Gate’s Formation Leader—even the late-stage Golden Core True Transmission Elders serve him tea. His status is unfathomable.","In front of him right now, it’s really \"immortals\" fighting—no side he could afford to offend.","And he couldn’t even sit this one out if he wanted to.","He’d invited Young Master Mo to dinner, and now they’d gotten blocked off—things were about to turn violent. If he tried to just stand by and watch, that’d be like kicking someone when they’re down.","Don’t even think about clinging to someone powerful in the future. Mo Hua not trying to kill him would already be considered lucky.","This Young Master Mo looks gentle and cute, approachable and friendly, but Fan Jin isn’t an idiot—he would never really believe Mo Hua was as simple as he seemed.","You can’t judge a person by their appearance.","Someone who, as a Foundation Building Middle Phase cultivator, overshadowed the Four Great Sects, seized the title of Formation Leader, and sipped tea as an equal with Elders in the Taixu Gate? How could that be any ordinary figure?","\"Fuck, what the hell am I supposed to do?\"","In that instant, Fan Jin’s heart was pounding up into his throat.","And he didn’t have much time to decide. Both sides looked like they’d start throwing hands any moment now.","If he stepped up now, he could still pick a side. Wait even a little longer, once fighting broke out for real, he wouldn’t even get a choice anymore.","Fan Jin gritted his teeth, thoughts spinning rapidly.","If he stayed out of it, he’d offend Young Master Mo and the Shen Family wouldn’t remember his so-called consideration anyway.","And if he did step in, sure, he’d piss off the Shen Family, but at least he’d be in Young Master Mo’s good books.","Between a rock and a hard place, you pick the lesser evil. Since he had to offend someone either way, he might as well choose the one that could benefit him.","\"Fuck it—whatever...\"","Fortune favors the bold.","If you want benefits, you’ve gotta take risks. If you’re too scared to take risks, don’t even fucking think about getting ahead.","Plus, he was the one who invited Young Master Mo here; for someone to show up and provoke him, it made sense, both emotionally and logically, that he couldn’t just stand back and do nothing.","Fan Jin’s legs were a little weak, but he still managed to step forward and put himself in front of Mo Hua.","He wavered a bit as he took that step, but in his heart, he suddenly felt steadier.","If you’re dead either way, once you’ve chosen your path, there’s no point hesitating anymore.","Fan Jin put on a cold face.","Across from him, a Golden Core from the Shen Family barked coldly, \"Master Fan, what’s this? You gonna go against our Shen Family just to show off?\"","Fan Jin replied earnestly, \"Whatever grievances you all have aren’t my concern, but this gentleman is an honored guest of our Taoist Court. At the very least, here in Solitary Mountain City, our Taoist Court is obliged to protect him.\"","He’d brought up the \"Taoist Court.\"","This way, it didn’t seem like he was deliberately going against the Shen Family, but rather that he was just upholding the duty of the Taoist Court—he had no choice but to step in.","If things were investigated later, at least on the surface, no one could blame him.","Being in the right gives weight to your words; working at the Taoist Court, sometimes how you word things is even more important than what you do.","The other Shen Family Golden Core sneered, \"You think bringing up your Taoist Court is gonna scare us? You’d better—\"","\"Cut the crap,\" the Shen Family young master frowned. \"Do it.\"","The two Shen Family Golden Cores froze briefly, then cupped their hands: \"Yes, sir.\"","Among the Shen Family’s group, honestly, only two were Golden Core cultivators, the rest were Foundation Building stage. But in a Third-grade Immortal City like Solitary Mountain City, those two Golden Cores were plenty to do as they wished.","On Mo Hua’s side, besides two Golden Cores, there was only Fan Jin himself.","All in all, the Shen Family had the numbers advantage.","What’s more, their goal was to take down Mo Hua—just to let the Shen young master vent his anger.","But Master Gu and Fan Jin couldn’t lay a finger on the Shen young master; they could only passively protect Mo Hua, a Foundation Establishment Realm cultivator—putting them at a natural disadvantage.","The numbers game was off, one side attacking, the other defending.","It was pretty much a losing battle.","Both Master Gu and Fan Jin understood this clearly—which was why their faces looked so grim.","At that moment, the two Shen Family Golden Cores—one drew out a Fire Knife, the other’s hands turned into dark green Iron Claws—were about to charge straight at Mo Hua.","Master Gu’s expression was as cold as still water.","Once the fight broke out, the situation would be beyond his control.","And with the surge of Golden Core Spiritual Power, Mo Hua could easily get caught up and hurt.","If Mo Hua so much as got a scratch, he’d have no way to explain himself to the Gu Family or to the Taixu Gate—not to mention, Mo Hua was a huge benefactor to their Refinery Shop.","Master Gu was getting anxious, so he blurted out, \"Wait!\"","The two Shen Family Golden Cores paused slightly, looking over at Master Gu.","Master Gu said in a deep voice, \"Don’t say I didn’t warn you—this gentleman is direct lineage of the Taixu Gate, personally instructed by the Ancestor, and has even caught the Ancestor’s Dharma Eye. If you dare lay a hand on him, you’d better think very carefully.\"","Mo Hua’s reputation went way further than that.","But Master Gu was scared that, with so many ears around, saying too much might draw unwanted attention—so he chose to keep it low-key.","After all, there’s only one Formation Leader—that’d draw too much heat.","Being core Taixu Gate lineage is impressive, but not as eye-catching, and there could be several of those.","Among everyone present, the only one who really knew Mo Hua’s true identity was the Shen Family young master—Shen Linsu’s follower.","But the two Golden Cores from the Shen Family didn’t know.","The words \"direct lineage of the Taixu Gate\" made both of them tense up instantly.","They were just branch family members of the Shen Family, ordinary Golden Cores—they had to risk their lives for core disciples if they wanted any real future in the clan.","They might be hardened killers, but that didn’t mean they were clueless—they weren’t about to mess with just anyone.","Ordinary Loose Cultivators? Killing them was like slaughtering chickens and dogs.","Normal family disciples? If they died, they died.","Branch family members from prominent families or peripheral sect disciples? You could kill them too, but you had to be secretive, couldn’t let anyone find out.","But the true core members of powerful families or Sects—unless you were guaranteed outrageous fortune or once-in-a-lifetime opportunity, you’d never risk killing someone like that."]},{"number":1929,"title":"Chapter 1929 - 940: Just One Look (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Taixu Gate ranks third among the Eight Great Gates of the Qian Learning State Boundary.","The direct lineage of Taixu Gate carries enough weight on its own.","Moreover, in such a public setting, Master Gu and Master Fan’s statuses are not low either. Committing murder and killing a sect’s direct lineage in front of everyone—they truly don’t have the guts to do it.","The two Golden Cores from the Shen Family frowned, hesitant to move forward.","Young Master Shen was displeased and said, \"What are you afraid of? Kill him, and I’ll take full responsibility.\"","The two Golden Cores from the Shen Family gritted their teeth, cursing silently in their hearts, ’What responsibility can you possibly bear.’","Once it’s revealed that a sect’s direct lineage has been killed, Taixu Gate will come demanding accountability.","As for Young Master, of course there are ancestors and True Men to protect him, and after a minor punishment, he’ll go free.","Meanwhile, the fate of these henchmen will be to be abandoned as scapegoats, facing the wrath of Taixu Gate.","The two Golden Cores from the Shen Family are well aware of this.","Seeing the two Golden Cores hesitating and disobeying orders, Young Master Shen felt his face was utterly disgraced, anger welling up inside him, and his words became immediately harsh.","\"You’re side branches, eating from the main family. A little problem arises, and you hesitate. Do you believe I won’t tell my father and crush your rice bowls?\" Young Master Shen said icily.","Upon hearing his words, the two Golden Cores felt a chill run down their spines, followed by a surge of anger.","But they had no choice; seeing Young Master Shen’s face growing grimmer, they realized he was truly angry. Without further hesitation, they had no choice but to brace themselves and attack.","The aura of Golden Core cultivation surged, filled with killing intent.","One man’s dagger emitted a cold gleam, aiming straight for Mo Hua’s throat.","The other transformed his hands into sharp claws, targeting Mo Hua’s heart artery.","Master Gu and Fan Jin wore solemn expressions, not daring to slacken for even a moment, one wielding a longsword like the wind, the other swinging a massive hammer, battling the two Golden Cores from the Shen Family, trying all means to protect Mo Hua.","The narrow tavern erupted with flying wood and stone, the formation trembled, and walls shattered.","The two Golden Cores from the Shen Family held the clear advantage.","Master Gu and Fan Jin were struggling, appearing somewhat battered.","Young Master Shen watched with a sneer, observing coldly, but after a while, his expression froze, and he couldn’t help but curse internally.","The battle before him looked intense, but it was all the Golden Cores fighting, having nothing to do with Mo Hua.","The two Golden Core cultivators from the Shen Family only engaged with the Artifact Refiner with the surname Gu and only exchanged moves with the Supervisor with the surname Fan, avoiding Mo Hua completely! Even amidst their attacks, they deliberately avoided Mo Hua, fearing to harm him.","Outwardly, it appeared fierce, but they were merely going through the motions.","\"These two useless fools!\"","\"How dare they call themselves Golden Cores, cowardly as mice!\"","A fierce expression surfaced on Young Master Shen’s face.","\"Trained dogs, appearing fierce but truly scheming and afraid when faced with real challenge.\"","Fine, if even the dogs won’t bite, then this ’master’ himself must act.","Young Master Shen extended his right hand, a flash of spirit light revealing an ornate and precious longsword in life and spirit cultivation, tempered to seven or eight tenths of full control.","\"A mere Foundation Establishment Late Stage Formation Master with poor spiritual roots and weak Blood Qi, not worth mentioning...\"","Grasping the longsword, Young Master Shen, full of killing intent, walked towards Mo Hua.","His entire body exuded a thick aura, the Sword Qi menacing, indicating he cultivated a top-grade cultivation method, and the grade of his Swordsmanship was of superior rank.","\"Not good!\" Master Gu perceived his killing intent, his face changing instantly, shifting his attack to target Young Master Shen.","Fan Jin also couldn’t concern himself with much else, risking offending the Shen Family as he moved to block Young Master Shen.","But their maneuvers were intercepted mid-way by the two Golden Core cultivators from the Shen Family.","The two dared not touch Mo Hua, already defying the Young Master. Now they couldn’t possibly allow Master Fan and Master Gu to ruin Young Master’s opportunity.","In that instant, Young Master Shen, sword in hand, had already arrived in front of Mo Hua, driving his sword moves to the extreme.","The sword glinted coldly, Sword Qi and killing intent rampant.","All this hostility locked onto the frail aura and slender figure of Mo Hua across from him.","The outcome was evident.","\"Young Master, run!\" Master Gu, entangled by the Golden Core cultivators from the Shen Family, was in a panic, unable to rush to aid.","\"Too late,\" Young Master Shen raised the longsword high, a grotesque and rampant expression appearing on what was originally a somewhat handsome face.","\"I’ll cripple you now, you fool who can’t see your place...\"","Mo Hua, who had stood there from the start without moving, finally lifted his gaze, giving Young Master Shen just a faint glance.","With just that single glance.","In an instant, the air resounded with a shrill, pig-like scream, echoing throughout the entire Food Building.","Young Master Shen’s longsword slipped from his grasp, clutching his eyes, as if witnessing something terribly frightful, his entire body shivering, akin to a pig branded by a hot iron, rolling uncontrollably on the ground.","The change came too abruptly and suddenly.","Everyone engaged in combat halted, their eyes following the sound in astonishment, witnessing an inconceivable scene.","The once arrogant, sword-wielding Young Master Shen had, in the blink of an eye, transformed into a panic-stricken, humiliated, fleeing figure, struggling and shrieking.","\"Young Master!\"","The two Golden Cores from the Shen Family were taken aback, immediately dropping their opponents to rush to Young Master Shen’s side.","\"Young Master, what happened to you?\"","\"What happened?\"","Still clutching his eyes, trembling uncontrollably, Young Master Shen said, \"My, my eyes, I saw...\"","\"So much blood, ghosts, and prison...\"","\"I...\"","\"Don’t, don’t kill me, don’t kill me...\"","...","He seemed mad, trapped in some terrifying Heart Image of the Divine Soul.","The two Golden Cores from the Shen Family felt a chill in their hearts, simultaneously turning to Mo Hua, angrily demanding, \"What... what did you do to our Young Master?\""]},{"number":1930,"title":"Chapter 1930 - 940: Just One Glance_3","paragraphs":["Mo Hua snorted disdainfully and said, \"I didn’t even move a hand, what could I have done to him?\"","The Golden Core cultivator of the Shen Family was taken aback.","They had witnessed the scene clearly—it was their young master who struck first, while this young master of Taixu Gate indeed didn’t move a muscle, just barely lifted an eyelid at most.","How... is that possible?","Mo Hua pondered slightly, then speculated:","\"Did your young master practice some evil skills and encounter a mishap during cultivation, leading to rebound and causing a deviation?\"","\"You... slanderer!\"","The Golden Core cultivator from the Shen Family was furious, but this anger seemed somewhat bluffing and tentative.","They also knew in their hearts that these affluent young masters live luxurious lives and might seek thrill by practicing some forbidden cultivation techniques secretly.","Upon hearing Mo Hua’s words and looking at the Shen Family’s young master rolling on the ground, babbling nonsensically and seemingly mad, these two Golden Core cultivators of the Shen Family actually found Mo Hua’s words to be quite plausible, and couldn’t help but suspect in their hearts:","\"Could it be that Young Master Qing really learned some evil skills, causing his meridians to become disordered, and thus he deviated?\"","While everyone was still in shock and doubt, a commotion gradually arose.","It seemed that the disturbance here was too great, attracting the nearby cultivators, and many people gathered around.","Master Gu then approached Mo Hua and whispered, \"Young Master Mo, it’s crowded and noisy here, it’s best to return early.\"","Upon seeing Mo Hua about to leave, the two Golden Core cultivators from the Shen Family immediately said, \"Halt! You cannot leave.\"","\"Our young master has become like this, you need to give an explanation.\"","\"That’s right!\"","Mo Hua glanced at them indifferently and said coldly:","\"You tried to kill me and still want me to give you an explanation? Do you really think that Taixu Gate can’t kill you?\"","The two Golden Core cultivators from the Shen Family felt a shiver down their spine immediately, and their backs went cold.","Mo Hua was only at the Foundation Establishment stage, but at this moment, this aura of indifferently holding others’ life and death in his hands made the two Golden Core cultivators feel a faint sense of fear.","If it wasn’t a mere bluff, then it meant that this seemingly frail young master indeed had the background and means to hold their lives under his control.","The two Golden Core cultivators from the Shen Family were immediately at a loss.","Just at this moment, there was a stir among the crowd, and then it quieted down.","The crowd parted to both sides, and a middle-aged cultivator with a paper fan in hand, scholarly in appearance and extraordinary in demeanor, stepped forward.","The two Golden Core cultivators from the Shen Family saw him and immediately brightened up, bowing their hands, \"Elder Xiu, you’re just in time.\"","The middle-aged cultivator frowned, \"What’s going on?\"","\"A little conflict...\" one Golden Core cultivator from the Shen Family stepped forward and whispered a few words into his ear.","The middle-aged cultivator nodded arrogantly, his gaze sweeping over Mo Hua.","At first, he glanced casually, not paying much attention, but after a moment, he slightly paused, unable to help but stare at Mo Hua a few more times.","As he looked, his pupils gradually dilated, his face full of disbelief, and finally, his expression even became somewhat... frightened.","\"You...\"","The middle-aged cultivator’s lips trembled, yet he still tried to suppress the alarm in his heart, speaking in a seemingly calm tone:","\"Alright... I understand... We’ll discuss this later... Young Master Qing’s safety is most important; first find a way to send him back to the Shen Family...\"","The middle-aged cultivator instructed, but his gaze was evasive, never daring to look directly at Mo Hua.","Everyone exchanged glances.","And the commotion ended hastily like this.","The people from the Shen Family, protecting their young master, left the Food Building.","The middle-aged cultivator known as \"Elder Xiu\", turned his back to Mo Hua, seemingly calm, but hurriedly walked away.","Master Gu and Fan Jin exchanged a look, both finding the situation inexplicably odd.","\"Young Master Mo...\"","\"Let’s head back first.\" Mo Hua gazed at the corridor’s end where the middle-aged cultivator disappeared without daring to look at him, his eyes narrowing as he slowly said.","\"Alright.\"","Master Gu and Fan Jin nodded.","It’s not suitable to stay here for long.","After all, this is the Shen Family’s Food Building, and they didn’t want Mo Hua to linger here any longer to avoid unexpected incidents.","The three of them thus left the Food Building, heading in the opposite direction of the Shen Family.","As the distance between the two parties grew, no further incident occurred.","Fan Jin escorted Mo Hua back to the Gu Family’s Refinery Shop, where he felt at ease and bowed to say goodbye:","\"There are matters at Taoist Court; I shall not disturb you any longer. The Shen Family is powerful, so please, Young Master Mo, be extra cautious.\"","Mo Hua nodded lightly, \"Thank you, Master Fan; I will remember your kindness.\"","Fan Jin was overjoyed but remained humble on the surface, saying:","\"It was nothing, Young Master. You speak too highly. Whenever you need any assistance in the future, feel free to call on me. I, Fan, will surely do my utmost to help.\"","Mo Hua smiled, bowed, and said, \"Alright.\"","A great weight was lifted from Fan Jin’s heart, and he smiled as he bid farewell, leaving in light steps.","After Fan Jin left, Master Gu was still somewhat worried.","\"Young master, perhaps you should depart for Taixu Gate early? I’m afraid...\"","Master Gu didn’t say it outright, but Mo Hua understood.","He thought for a moment and nodded, \"That’s fine, but before that, there’s one more thing...\"","Mo Hua paused briefly, his gaze meaningful, \"I need to see someone.\"","...","In front of a magnificent residence in the northwest of Solitary Mountain City.","A middle-aged cultivator, holding a folding fan and looking cultured, instructed a disciple of the Shen Family:","\"The Pill Master of the clan checked, and it seems Young Master Qing was merely frightened, which caused panic. It shouldn’t be anything serious. You should report to Elder Shouxing early; after all, he has only one son... There are some matters in my sect that need to be dealt with, so I won’t stay any longer.\"","\"Yes.\"","After giving his instructions, the middle-aged cultivator got into a carriage, leaving the Shen Family Mansion and heading south along the street, eventually leaving the city gate and heading towards the outskirts of Solitary Mountain.","Inside the carriage, the middle-aged cultivator closed his eyes to rest, but his brows were furrowed, clearly troubled.","The desolate mountain scenery around him slipped away.","The carriage drove further and further from Solitary Mountain City.","After traveling for an hour, passing by a desolate forest, the middle-aged cultivator suddenly opened his eyes.","He hesitated for a moment, then sighed deeply and shook his head helplessly.","\"Stop the carriage.\"","The carriage stopped, the middle-aged cultivator paused for a moment, got off, and instructed the driver: \"Wait for me here.\"","\"Yes,\" the disciple bowed in response.","The middle-aged cultivator then plunged alone into the side’s desolate forest.","The barren forest was deserted; thick layers of dead yellow leaves covered the ground, rustling underfoot.","The middle-aged cultivator walked into the forest, stepping on the fallen leaves, continuing forward for about a hundred steps, then looked up to see a young cultivator with refined eyebrows and deep eyes sitting on the bough before him.","The middle-aged cultivator looked at the young man ahead and bowed with a sigh, \"It’s been a long time since we parted outside Li Mountain City.\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"Indeed, it’s been a long time.\"","His gaze was deep as he scrutinized the cultivator in front of him.","And this person was the same middle-aged cultivator who traveled with Young Master Yun and the skeletal elder.","Back in South Yue City and the ruined temple outside Li State City, he had had some interactions with him.","However, Mo Hua never expected him to be an elder of the Shen Family."]},{"number":1931,"title":"Chapter 1931 - 941: Old Acquaintance","paragraphs":["Mo Hua sized up the cultivator in front of him once more, a middle-aged man who looked cultured and refined, and asked in surprise, \"You’re actually from the Shen Family?\"","The middle-aged cultivator cupped his hands and said, \"I am Shen Xiuyan.\"","\"Shen Xiuyan...\"","Mo Hua silently remembered the name and asked again, \"Are you an Elder of the Shen Family? Are you in charge of matters in Solitary Mountain City?\"","The middle-aged cultivator known as \"Shen Xiuyan\" shook his head, \"I’m not in charge of Solitary Mountain City. I’m an Elder of the Little Spirit Sect.\"","\"Little Spirit Sect?\" Mo Hua had never heard of this sect before.","Shen Xiuyan said, \"It’s a small sect, one of the Qian Learning Hundred Gates, not very renowned, so it’s normal that Young Master Mo hasn’t heard of it.\"","\"Oh.\" Mo Hua nodded, slightly surprised, \"Isn’t your Shen Family a hereditary family of the Qian Taoist Sect? You didn’t become an Elder in the Qian Taoist Sect?\"","Shen Xiuyan smiled wryly, \"The Qian Taoist Sect is one of the Four Great Sects, the top sect in the Qianxue state boundary, with very high entry requirements. It’s not easy to get in.\"","\"Moreover, the Shen Family is large, with many cultivators within, all engaging in fierce competition. Everyone wants to join the Qian Taoist Sect, let alone take an Elder’s position; even a teaching position requires a lot of effort and struggle.\"","\"I lack the background and the capability. I originally wanted to go out and seek opportunities to defy fate... but I didn’t find any.\"","\"Eventually, I had to accept my fate and choose an ordinary sect within the Qian Learning Hundred Gates to be an instructor and pass my days.\"","\"Of course, now that I have reached the Golden Core stage, with the Shen Family name, the Little Spirit Sect couldn’t afford to neglect me, so it naturally elevated me to ’Elder’.\"","\"You’re not an ordinary Elder, are you?\" Mo Hua pondered, \"I noticed that other members of the Shen Family hold you in high regard.\"","\"Neither the best nor the worst,\" Shen Xiuyan said, \"There are plenty in the Shen Family who do very well, and too many who don’t. As an Elder in the Qian Learning Hundred Gates, I’m not as good as the true direct descendants but better than the average family disciples who have to rely on others.\"","\"I see...\" Mo Hua nodded, gaining a slight understanding of the Shen Family’s internal situation.","Great families oppress the Loose Cultivators.","But even within great families, there is internal strife.","Not everyone in great families fares well.","\"Young Master Mo,\" Shen Xiuyan looked at Mo Hua deeply again, and said with some unease, \"What... do you seek from me?\"","The character \"Mo Hua\" had completely slipped his mind until now, with no impression at all.","Everything about Mo Hua was shrouded in a veil of mystery, buried in the corners of his memory.","Instinctively, Shen Xiuyan didn’t want to remember, nor dare to recall.","Until today, seeing Mo Hua in person, the wheels of fate turned, revealing long-buried memories. Shen Xiuyan finally recalled the name \"Mo Hua\" and details associated with him.","At the same time, he remembered another \"Mo Hua.\"","The one rumored in the Qianxue state boundary, the monster \"Mo Hua\" in various sects.","The Formation Leader of the Qianxue state boundary.","The formation demon of the Taixu Gate.","Gradually, Shen Xiuyan connected the two.","The clever and quirky little kid he encountered during the Nanyue City corpse disaster and the Li State City demon disaster had now become a leader in formations, surpassing countless geniuses in Qianxue.","As time passed, the world changed.","Shen Xiuyan was shocked to his core, overwhelmed with disbelief.","Mo Hua’s identity was mysterious, his origins equally unfathomable.","Thus, Shen Xiuyan felt uneasy about Mo Hua seeking him out, unsure of Mo Hua’s true intentions.","Mo Hua nonchalantly said, \"I just want to ask a little about some matters concerning the Shen Family, nothing major.\"","Of course, Shen Xiuyan could not believe this.","With Mo Hua’s identity, anything involving him could not be trivial.","After a moment of silence, Shen Xiuyan gently reminded, \"Young Master... I am of the Shen Family.\"","As a member of the Shen Family, naturally, he would uphold the family’s interests.","He could not betray his family’s secrets for an outsider.","\"I know,\" Mo Hua said softly, \"but are the Shen Family’s interests all your interests? Are all the family members your relatives?\"","\"Some benefits in the hands of other Shen Family members, how do they concern you?\"","\"Some are destined to be Elders in the Qian Taoist Sect, while you can only be a Little Spirit Sect instructor...\"","These words, like demonic whispers, stirred Shen Xiuyan’s soul.","Even family members are not in the same family.","The larger the family, the more this is true.","Entangled interests, unequal distribution, mutual deception, scheming... these are common.","Mo Hua wasn’t wrong.","But Shen Xiuyan still hesitated.","He didn’t want to be further involved with Mo Hua; such boundless entanglements of great cause were too risky, best to avoid.","Mo Hua looked deeply into his eyes, saying slowly, \"Do you remember what happened that night in the ruined temple?\"","Shen Xiuyan’s pupils contracted, feeling as though a cold wind blew through, chilling him to his bones.","The scene in the ruined temple gradually resurfaced in his mind.","About ten years ago, he, Old Wen, and Young Master Yun tracked down someone to the outskirts of the demon-infested Li State City. As darkness fell, they sheltered for the night in a ruined temple outside the city.","As night deepened, the three grew drowsy.","For some reason, Old Wen started feeling hunger pangs, chewing on his fingers like \"Fasting Pills\"; Young Master Yun drew his sword and stabbed his own heart;","And he, too, drew his blade, slashing his throat over and over, blood pouring...","As though ensnared in a horrific nightmare.","Over the years, he sometimes dreamed of this nightmare, repeatedly slicing his throat in the dream, blood everywhere."]},{"number":1932,"title":"Chapter 1932 - 941: Old Acquaintance (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Even the head was cut off and fell to the ground, the headless body continued to slice the neck bit by bit...","Blood was dripping, the flesh was a blurred mess.","This dream, too real, too terrifying, and seemingly endless.","Half awake, Shen Xiuyan found himself in a daze, and even had doubts.","He doubted whether he was already dead, doubted whether he had truly walked out of that broken temple back then...","Because all memories of Mo Hua were gone, shrouded in a haze, he simply couldn’t recall how he broke the situation and exited the temple.","Now, upon meeting Mo Hua, his memories began to trace back, threads of causality filled in, and only then did the events of the past begin to clarify.","Frowning, Shen Xiuyan withstood the palpitations of his heart and recalled, only then did he realize.","Back then, indeed, it was this young lord who saved his life.","Otherwise, he would have died unknown and unclear in that broken temple outside the Li State City.","He wouldn’t even know how he died...","Seeing the clarity in his mind, Mo Hua said:","\"It’s not that I’m asking for repayment, but in this world, everything has causality. I saved your life, you do something for me, that’s causality. Having causality and not repaying it can easily lead to great misfortune.\"","Mo Hua’s expression was solemn.","Shen Xiuyan’s heart was jolted.","The matters of Heavenly Mechanism Causality were things Old Wen often muttered about, and he wasn’t particularly convinced.","But ever since ten years ago, when he went to seize an opportunity in the chaos for \"defying fate and changing destiny\", he had no choice but to believe in certain things.","He still remembered the corpse disaster in South Yue City back then; it was none of his business, and he didn’t really want to get involved.","But after Old Wen divined about it, he mysteriously said that a great horror lay ahead, with life and death uncertain, and that if one could save the entire South Yue City, and even the cultivators of an entire state boundary, by forming good karma, there might be a sliver of hope when facing a life-and-death crisis in the future.","The three of them stayed in South Yue City and helped suppress the corpse disaster.","It was precisely because of this corpse disaster that they met a little child named \"Mo Hua\".","This was the cause.","And this effect just so happened to manifest in the deadly ordeal of the broken temple.","Without calming the unrest of corpses and not knowing Mo Hua, in the broken temple, Mo Hua wouldn’t have saved them, and the three of them would have perished with no place to bury them.","\"Causality of good and evil, what goes around comes around, Mr. Zhuang gave us a choice back then, which also meant a sliver of hope for survival...\"","These were Old Wen’s words.","At the time, Shen Xiuyan listened without much feeling, but the more he thought about it later, the more he felt the profound mystery of the matter.","\"Causality, huh...\"","Shen Xiuyan silently glanced at Mo Hua again.","Memories slowly loosened, and some scenes gradually cleared up.","In the broken temple back then, under the firelight, Mo Hua’s eyes were sparkling, his small face flushed red, the scene of him roasting by the fire, grilling fish and sweet potatoes reappeared in his mind.","It was clearly a very cute scene.","Yet, for some reason, a hint of fear inexplicably sprouted in Shen Xiuyan’s heart.","Because he knew, back then in the corner of the broken temple, beside Mo Hua, there was a shadow, within the shadow, a vaguely seen Taoist.","Who this person was, he didn’t know at the time, but hearing the rumors from Li State City afterward, he gradually understood.","That year, to compete for that chance, the entire Li Mountain State Boundary, became a meat grinder of righteous and demonic slaughter.","Golden Core cultivators fell like the tide.","Even Feathered Immortals fell one after another.","And the instigator was precisely that Taoist.","Those who had seen that Taoist, whether righteous or demonic, almost all died tragically, even Feathered Immortals were no exception.","And the young lord before him, who back then was almost just a Qi-refining little kid, could actually sit with that Taoist, grilled fire, grilled fish, grilled sweet potatoes right in front of him, and even rescue people under his watch...","Recalling it now, Shen Xiuyan felt terrified.","The more he understood about this matter, the more terrifying it felt.","Whether it’s a psychological effect or not, Shen Xiuyan looked at the present Mo Hua and faintly sensed a trace of \"Gui Taoist\" disposition in him.","Just like a young \"Gui Taoist\"...","Such a person, coming to seek to resolve causality with him...","Shen Xiuyan felt a chill from his heart, not daring to utter half a word of \"no\".","\"Young Master Mo, please speak... as long as it’s within my knowledge and doesn’t involve the core secrets of the Shen Family, I’ll certainly speak without reserve,\" Shen Xiuyan sincerely said.","Mo Hua nodded slightly, quite satisfied, and asked him, \"The Shen Family has a mountain peak in Solitary Mountain, you know that, right?\"","Shen Xiuyan nodded, \"I know.\"","\"What is that mountain peak used for?\" Mo Hua asked.","Shen Xiuyan pondered for a moment, \"This was a mining mountain bought by the Shen Family in Solitary Mountain back then, to mine bright yellow copper ore. Now that extraction is complete, it’s vacant with no other use.\"","\"No other use... why is it sealed off, preventing others from approaching?\"","\"I’m not quite sure about that,\" Shen Xiuyan contemplated briefly, \"Generally, after extraction, mining mountains that have been vacant for years are very dangerous. There’s miasma, evil energy, toxic gases brewing, possibly even fierce monster beasts residing, and over time, mountain stones can easily collapse...\"","\"Preventing approach might be to avoid accidents.\"","\"After all, if a cultivator dies in the mining mountain of Shen Family, spreading the word would indeed be troublesome for the Shen Family.\"","Mo Hua nodded slightly, finding it somewhat reasonable.","He then asked, \"Do you Shen Family have any temples built in Solitary Mountain City?\"","\"Temples?\"","\"Yes,\" Mo Hua nodded, \"Temples, or altars, secret chambers, palaces, and other places used for offerings.\""]},{"number":1933,"title":"Chapter 1933 - 941: Old Acquaintance (Part 3)","paragraphs":["This question is a bit tricky and peculiar.","Shen Xiuyan thought for a moment and still shook his head, \"In the past, the impoverished Mining Cultivators, when entering the mines for safety, would worship things not knowing whether they were Mountain Gods or spirits.\"","\"But this is because they were poor, with low cultivation; when encountering danger, they couldn’t protect themselves and had to place their fate on the elusive mythical beings.\"","\"The Shen Family’s mines are deep and solid, mostly mined with Spiritual Machines, and few people go down the mines, so it’s unnecessary and almost never builds such things...\"","Mo Hua nodded, her gaze tightening, and then asked, \"Then your Shen Family...would you massacre an entire family?\"","Shen Xiuyan’s face stiffened.","Is it really appropriate to ask such a sharp question directly to him, a Shen Family Elder...","\"No.\" Shen Xiuyan flatly denied.","\"Really no?\"","\"Young Master Mo,\" Shen Xiuyan sighed, \"My Shen Family, after all, is a Fifth-grade family by heredity among the Four Great Sects, a proper Sect. Without reason, without cause, it’s impossible to openly violate the Taoist Law and do such ’massacre’ things.\"","\"If the Taoist Court were to know this, reported to the Taoist Court, my Shen Family wouldn’t be able to escape unscathed.\"","Mo Hua, suspicious, said, \"But, your Shen Family’s Young Master seems very arrogant, ready to kill at the slightest disagreement.\"","That’s because he’s foolish, his eyes growing above his backside.","Shen Xiuyan cursed secretly.","He’s truly spoiled, lawless, daring to do anything.","\"Great families often have wastrels, there’s no way around it.\" Shen Xiuyan said, \"It’s not just the Shen Family; other Great Families are like this too, having some dark dealings more or less in secret.\"","\"Great families are too large, with too many people, and even if the family rules are strict, they’re still beyond control.\"","\"However, those with the backing, the legitimate ones who can act recklessly, are in the minority. Most family descendants still have to follow the rules and are far from being so free.\"","\"Even if these legitimate disciples really make a mistake and kill someone, it doesn’t mean there’s no impact at all.\"","\"In most cases, the family will find some branch members to ’take the blame’ for the legitimate ones, go to the Court Official to confess their crimes, and thus quell the situation.\"","\"In this world, there’s nothing that comes entirely without cost, it’s just that...\"","\"It’s just that,\" Mo Hua said, \"those with privileges will shift the cost onto others.\"","Shen Xiuyan sighed and nodded.","\"The Young Master in Gushan Hongyan Building, is he called ’Young Master Qing’?\" Mo Hua asked again.","\"Yes,\" Shen Xiuyan said, giving the name of that Shen Family Young Master to Mo Hua, \"His name is Shen Qingsheng.\"","\"Shen Qingsheng...\" Mo Hua repeated, \"Is he also a legitimate descendant of the Shen Family?\"","\"Strictly speaking, not quite.\" Shen Xiuyan said.","\"What do you mean?\"","Shen Xiuyan said, \"This Shen Qingsheng, he’s a legitimate descendant raised halfway, with not a very pure bloodline, and without the protection of the ancestors.\"","\"Then how is he so prestigious?\" Mo Hua was somewhat puzzled.","Shen Xiuyan explained, \"His father is a real Powerful Elder, whose jurisdiction includes Solitary Mountain. In Solitary Mountain, he practically rules the place.\"","\"Shen Qingsheng has thus gained from it, so long as he’s in Solitary Mountain City, almost no one dares to control him, and over time, he’s become this lawless personality.\"","\"What’s his father called?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"Shen Shouxing.\" Shen Xiuyan said.","\"Shen Shouxing, Shen Qingsheng...\" Mo Hua nodded, \"I remember.\"","He had asked about almost everything he wanted to know.","This trip had indeed revealed some clues, but not too many...","Mo Hua thought for a moment and then said, \"Elder Xiu, could you help me find some Shen Family archives related to Solitary Mountain City? Especially those involving the mines from back then.\"","Shen Xiuyan frowned tightly.","Mo Hua said, \"Never mind if they’re too confidential, ordinary level archives would suffice.\"","The truth often hides within ordinary details.","Moreover, Shen Xiuyan probably couldn’t get his hands on highly confidential archives.","Shen Xiuyan was a bit troubled but after thinking it over, he didn’t refuse.","He truly didn’t dare to owe Mo Hua any karma.","\"Alright, I’ll go back and check.\" Shen Xiuyan said.","\"Thank you, Elder Xiu.\" Mo Hua said politely.","Shen Xiuyan looked at Mo Hua, hesitated, and finally spoke slowly: \"Young Master Mo, you should try... not to get involved in the Shen Family’s matters.\"","The Shen Family is vast, with deeply rooted power.","Mo Hua, after all, only has Foundation Establishment cultivation, opposing the Shen Family is really not wise.","And besides, it is difficult for him to handle.","But Shen Xiuyan could only subtly mention it, he dares not instruct this young master on how to act.","\"Also, in Solitary Mountain City, be cautious of Shen Qingsheng.\" Shen Xiuyan added.","\"Will they father and son target me?\" Mo Hua raised an eyebrow.","\"It’s not them as father and son,\" Shen Xiuyan shook his head, \"It’s Shen Qingsheng.\"","Seeing Mo Hua somewhat confused, Shen Xiuyan explained:","\"Shen Shouxing is a Powerful Elder. His background is not great, but he’s climbed step by step over the years. Such a person, when faced with benefits, is like a hungry wolf. But relatively, given there is no interest involved, he has a clear mind about what risks not to take, and whom not to offend.\"","\"If Shen Shouxing hears about your status in Taixu Gate, he should know boundaries and won’t act against you. But his son, it’s uncertain...\"","\"Shen Qingsheng is Shen Shouxing’s only son, spoiled since childhood, arrogant and vengeful.\"","Noble juniors, always unruly. If they truly were restrained, they wouldn’t be considered unruly.","Mo Hua nodded, \"Thank you, Elder Xiu, I understand.\"","Shen Xiuyan didn’t know if Mo Hua really understood, but he didn’t say more.","\"Well, Young Master Mo, I...\" Shen Xiuyan said in a low voice.","Mo Hua cupped his hands, \"Elder Xiu, take care as you leave. I won’t hold you back.\"","With Mo Hua’s permission, Shen Xiuyan finally sighed in relief.","Although he is Golden Core, and a Sect Elder of Qian Learning Hundred Gates, in front of Mo Hua, he dared not show any arrogance.","Even thinking about the karma related to Mo Hua, the people he is connected with, those scenes in the ruined temple, made Shen Xiuyan’s heart grow cold.","\"Young Master, take care, I shall leave first.\"","Shen Xiuyan clasped his fists in greeting to Mo Hua, then turned, walking slowly out of the barren forest, boarding the carriage, and gradually moving away along the mottled mountain road.","As night deepened, Mo Hua watched Shen Xiuyan’s retreating figure, his expression thoughtful.","After a moment, he also did not hesitate further, and walked to the other side of the mountain forest.","On the other side of the mountain road, a carriage was parked, Master Gu held the horse, standing in front of the carriage, looking alert.","Upon seeing Mo Hua, Master Gu eased up.","\"Young Master, is the matter settled?\" Master Gu asked.","\"Yes.\" Mo Hua nodded, \"It’s done.\"","\"Good.\" Master Gu said.","He didn’t ask what Mo Hua had seen, or what he had done, but acted as if he knew nothing at all, \"I will take you back to the sect.\"","To Taixu Gate, the journey is quite long, and the sky is dark, Master Gu was uneasy and dared not be careless.","\"Thank you, Master Gu.\" Mo Hua said.","Then he got into the carriage, under Master Gu’s personal escort, taking advantage of the night, returned to Taixu Gate.","...","Two days later, Solitary Mountain City, Shen Family.","In a luxurious study.","Shen Qingsheng, who hadn’t fully recovered, his face still pale, with eyes red, shouted hysterically:","\"How could it just end like this?!\"","\"Dad, I’m your son!\"","\"That petty little one from Taixu Gate, he humiliated me, he schemed against me, he almost... killed me!!\"","Opposite Shen Qingsheng stood a middle-aged man with a hooked nose, whose face was somewhat ordinary. This man is Shen Qingsheng’s father, Shen Shouxing, the Powerful Elder of the Shen Family.","Shen Shouxing looked lightly at his son, his voice deep, and asked:","\"How did he humiliate you, how did he scheme against you, and how did he almost kill you?\"","Shen Qingsheng was ashamed and angry, gritting his teeth, \"He, he... looked at me...\"","\"Your meaning is...\" Shen Shouxing’s face indifferent, \"He just looked at you, and almost killed you?\"","Shen Qingsheng’s face turned blood red, painfully hot like branded iron."]},{"number":1934,"title":"Chapter 1934 - 942: Geomancy","paragraphs":["Just one look at you, and I almost killed you?","Shen Qingsheng held his breath, his chest feeling blocked, unable to utter a word.","Shen Shouxing looked at him with disappointment, then solemnly said, \"Be honest, have you secretly learned something behind my back?\"","The claim that just by looking at someone, one could kill, was naturally something Shen Shouxing could not believe.","Mo Hua is in the Foundation Establishment Late Stage, and so is his son.","Their cultivation is comparable, and even in terms of Spiritual Root, Spiritual Power, Cultivation Technique, and Taoist Skill, his son surpasses him.","How could it be possible to be driven insane, babbling madly, and losing composure just from a glance?","A Foundation Building Cultivator would not have such means.","Most likely, it’s a problem with his own son.","Shen Shouxing looked deeply at his son.","He’s usually too busy.","Holding an important position, there’s always a plethora of affairs, every move watched by others. He can’t even focus on advancing further; even maintaining his own interests requires meticulous planning, leaving no time for anything else.","He can’t keep an eye on his son all the time, unaware of what he does in daily life.","Yet he knows all too well the indulgent habits of aristocratic progeny.","Thinking of that \"possessed\" behavior, Shen Shouxing truly suspects his son might have sought excitement by secretly learning some disreputable Taoist Skill, causing his meridians to suddenly go awry, leading to madness.","Such a thing is a major taboo!","If it remains unexposed, it’s fine, but once revealed and detected, his son would be ruined.","Expulsion from the Sect would not be the worst outcome; under severe circumstances, he might be erased from the family records or even thrown into the Taoist Prison.","This would essentially be a \"death sentence\" for his only son.","The foundation he has worked so hard to build for so many years, with no one to inherit or pass it on to, would eventually be in vain.","Shen Shouxing’s gaze grew increasingly stern.","Shen Qingsheng’s face was pale, eyes panicked, \"Father, I didn’t... Father, I’m your son, how could you distrust me but believe the nonsense of that little scoundrel?\"","Shen Shouxing said angrily, \"Shut up, stop speaking disrespectfully! Little scoundrel this, little scoundrel that, do you know who he is?\"","\"Isn’t he just an ordinary disciple of the Taixu Gate?\"","Shen Shouxing sneered, \"A Formation Leader, favored by the ancestor, just an ordinary disciple?\"","Shen Qingsheng, unconvinced, mockingly said, \"Formation Leader, that must be due to his luck and the ancestor paving the way for him. Otherwise, with him being only in the Foundation Building Middle Stage, how could he have defeated my Qian Taoist Sect seniors?\"","Shen Shouxing reprimanded, \"Then why aren’t you lucky? Why haven’t you become a Formation Leader?\"","\"I...\" Shen Qingsheng paused, then stiffened his neck, \"If the ancestor showed me favor and paved the way for me, becoming Formation Leader wouldn’t be difficult either.\"","Shen Shouxing took a deep breath.","This son is truly spoiled.","Raised in comfort and arrogance, everything came too easily, so he does not cherish anything.","Having never truly struggled, he looks down on others’ efforts and fails to see their capabilities.","Shen Shouxing sighed, no longer wanting to say more, he sternly warned, \"I don’t care about other matters, but you must not provoke Mo Hua again.\"","\"Father! He...\"","\"Shut up!\"","\"Father!\" Shen Qingsheng said stubbornly, \"We are the Shen Family, hereditary in the Qian Taoist Sect, what is there to fear about the mere Taixu Gate?\"","Shen Shouxing reprimanded sternly, \"We are the Shen Family, but the Shen Family is not ours. Hereditary in the Qian Taoist Sect, but you are just a disciple of the Qian Taoist Sect.\"","\"Where do you get the audacity to look down on the Taixu Gate, one of the Eight Great Gates? Dare to disrespect their ancestor?\"","\"Truly... ignorant of heaven and earth!\"","Shen Qingsheng, full of disdain, clearly did not listen, secretly resenting:","\"That kid from Taixu Gate crossed Young Master Lin. He doesn’t show Young Master Lin respect, so I must teach him a lesson.\"","Shen Shouxing said, \"I placed you by Young Master Lin’s side to use his status to make connections and gradually climb up.\"","\"Young Master Lin is the real young master, don’t think you are the same kind of person.\"","Shen Qingsheng remained defiant, saying nothing.","Shen Shouxing was tired of speaking more, \"I’ve said my piece, you must not offend Mo Hua from the Taixu Gate any further, or I will confine you and suspend your Spirit Stone stipend for three months.\"","Shen Qingsheng panicked, \"Father, I’m your own son! If you won’t help me, why do you side with that little...\"","Shen Shouxing’s expression changed, exuding an intimidating aura without anger.","Shen Qingsheng knew his father was truly angry and dared not say more, though still stubborn.","Shen Shouxing sighed, waved his hand, \"You may leave.\"","\"Yes...\" Shen Qingsheng hastily saluted and retreated.","As Shen Shouxing watched Shen Qingsheng’s figure fade away, he frowned deeply. Once Shen Qingsheng left, he summoned a trusted aide, instructing:","\"Keep an eye on him, don’t let him cause trouble.\"","\"Yes, Elder.\"","The trusted aide departed to carry out the orders.","Standing in the luxurious yet empty study, Shen Shouxing felt overwhelmed by everything but internally empty.","\"Struggling to reach this point, not knowing how much was sacrificed, how much humiliation endured, how much was given up...\"","\"In the end... what was it all for...\"","Shen Shouxing murmured with a lonely gaze.","...","Taixu Gate.","Mo Hua continued cultivating, attending classes, and drawing formations as usual.","In his free time, he wrote to Gu Changhuai to inquire about Fan Jin.","\"Master Fan?\"","\"Yes,\" Mo Hua replied, \"In the Demon Sect crackdown, even if he had no direct achievements, he endured hardship and should have considerable merit. Why does the Taoist Court refuse his transfer request?\""]},{"number":1935,"title":"Chapter 1935 - 942: Geomancy (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Gu Changhuai did not answer, but curiously asked: \"How do you know Master Fan?\"","The various elders of the sect may be understandable, he is a sect disciple, favored by the ancestor, knowing a few more is normal.","Why now, even a Supervisor from a remote place, he can recognize?","This social ability, is it a bit too much?","Mo Hua replied, \"We met by chance, had tea together, and a meal, and got to know each other.\"","Gu Changhuai fell silent.","Mo Hua asked again, \"Why didn’t the Taoist Court agree to the reassignment?\"","Gu Changhuai thought for a bit, then said, \"I asked around, it seems someone above gave a word.\"","\"A word?\" Mo Hua pondered, \"Gave a word not to let Master Fan leave Solitary Mountain City?\"","\"Possible, but there’s another possibility...\" Gu Changhuai said solemnly, \"None of the Enforcement Leaders, Supervisors or Court Leaders in Solitary Mountain City can be reassigned.\"","Mo Hua felt a chill in his heart, increasingly certain there’s a problem with Solitary Mountain City, and possibly a big one.","\"Who gave the word? Shen family?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"Not necessarily.\" Gu Changhuai replied.","Mo Hua was a bit puzzled, so Gu Changhuai explained, \"The Taoist Court, it concerns the authority of the Taoist Court, the people inside have complex backgrounds, sometimes it’s hard to tell a person’s purpose and stance from the surface.\"","\"Someone might not have the surname Shen but could be working for the Shen family.\"","\"Someone might have the surname Shen but the interests they pursue might be of another family.\"","\"Power changes, interests change, people’s stances also keep changing. It’s hard to distinguish truth from falsehood.\"","\"Oh...\" Mo Hua murmured internally.","Uncle Gu looks simple-minded, but surprisingly knows quite a lot.","Gu Changhuai asked puzzled, \"Why are you asking these, did Fan Jin ask you to inquire?\"","\"No, I’m just curious, so I came to ask you.\" Mo Hua replied.","Gu Changhuai made no response.","\"By the way, Uncle Gu,\" Mo Hua thought for a bit, then asked, \"What do you think of Master Fan as a person?\"","\"In which aspect are you asking?\"","\"Character, ability, and his future in the Taoist Court.\"","Gu Changhuai pondered for a moment before saying, \"Fan Jin is astute, hardworking, and daring. He has ability.\"","\"If he were from a noble family, with his willingness to strive and work hard, he’d naturally do well.\"","\"But the problem is, he comes from a poor background, has no connections in the Taoist Court, his talent is average, the cultivation technique he practices and the magic treasure he raises are a bit mediocre. Without great fortune, it’s hard to see any prospects...\"","Gu Changhuai spoke objectively.","He is a Supervisor of noble lineage, leads by example for years, interacts with many people, knows what kind of person has what kind of fate, whether they have a way out.","Mo Hua nodded.","\"Do you have any other plans?\" Gu Changhuai asked Mo Hua.","Knowing Mo Hua well, he wouldn’t take interest in something for no reason, he must have his reasons.","\"Not much really, just...\" Mo Hua paused and came up with a phrase, \"building good karma.\"","In the Food Building, Fan Jin could withstand the Shen family’s pressure to help him, Mo Hua naturally owes him a favor.","If others treat him well, he’ll treat others well.","If others treat him badly, he’ll treat others badly.","Responding with virtue for virtue, responding straightforwardly for grievance.","That’s the principle of conduct.","Thus, within his capability, helping Master Fan is reasonable.","At the same time, Elder Shen Xiuyan’s matter made Mo Hua understand one thing clearer:","Which is to do more good deeds, accumulate more hidden merits, build more good karma, and plant more causes.","Back then Elder Xiu, if he didn’t help in Nanyue City, didn’t know this \"good man,\" he might really have been doomed when encountering Uncle.","So, plant more good causes, harvest more good results.","Those who gain Dao win more helpers, those who lose Dao have fewer helpers, so if trouble comes later, there will be someone willing to help him, not ending up alone, at a dead end.","His master back then suffered this hardship.","As the master’s youngest disciple, the hardships the master suffered, he certainly won’t suffer again.","Mo Hua deeply cautioned himself.","Gu Changhuai nodded.","\"Building good karma\" as a reason also makes sense, but he doesn’t understand there’s deep meaning hidden within Mo Hua’s thinking.","\"Speaking of which,\" Mo Hua suddenly remembered something else, \"Uncle Gu, is there any clue about the Demon Sect Leader?\"","He is still thinking about the Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation Map.","Speaking of this matter, Gu Changhuai’s expression also became serious, \"Still no clue, the Demon Sect Leader seems to have vanished, nowhere to be found...\"","Mo Hua also murmured internally.","A big demon like that, where could he be hiding...","\"The Taoist Court will investigate this, you focus on cultivation.\" Gu Changhuai said as usual.","\"Alright.\" Mo Hua nodded.","Mo Hua also knows, a late Golden Core Stage demon is indeed not someone he can provoke, but the opportunity of the Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation is with this demon.","He has no choice but to inquire and see if there will be any chance to make use of the situation, get lucky.","Of course, this hope is actually quite slim.","Moreover, as time passes, it will become even more unlikely.","Mo Hua sighed.","\"Let’s sort out the Solitary Mountain City matter first...\"","...","The next day, Mo Hua called for Xie Ling.","Xie Ling comes from the Xie family in Gen State, inheriting the kanyu skill and Yin Yang Feng Shui Secret Formation.","Upon hearing Mo Hua was looking for him, Xie Ling happily ran over, enthusiastically said, \"Junior Brother, what do you need from me?\"","As the Junior Brother, he has received much care from Mo Hua in daily life, be it rewards, monster hunting, or formation cultivation, all guided by Mo Hua.","Hence, he is eager to repay the kindness, to help a bit."]},{"number":1936,"title":"Chapter 1936 - 942: Geomancy (3)","paragraphs":["Mo Hua said: \"I want to ask about tomb raiding.\"","Xie Ling was immediately shocked, \"Junior Brother, you want to raid tombs?\"","\"No,\" Mo Hua indicated to keep his voice down, \"The Taoist Court over there encountered a group of tomb robbers, but there are few clues. I also know little about tomb raiding, so I’m here to ask you.\"","\"I see,\" Xie Ling nodded, then said seriously, \"Junior Brother, let me clarify in advance that the Xie family does not raid tombs.\"","\"Did your parents tell you to say that?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"Yes!\" Xie Ling nodded, then immediately realized and emphasized, \"Our Xie family really does not raid tombs.\"","Practicing Kanyu Skill, identifying the veins of mountains and rivers, determining the life and death in burials, and transmitting the Yin Yang Feng Shui Secret Formation.","On the other hand, it also makes one most suited for tomb raiding.","The Xie family may have done it, but they definitely deny it outwardly, otherwise they’d be in big trouble.","Mo Hua understood and patted Xie Ling’s shoulder, \"I know, I just want to ask about tomb raiding.\"","Since Xie Ling came from a long line of family knowledge, he pondered for a moment before speaking:","\"Tomb raiding... no, it’s the Kanyu Skill, it’s broad and profound, involving many fields.\"","\"First, you must know how to discern the energy mechanisms of heaven and earth, the convergence of Yin and Yang, how to observe the terrain of mountains and rivers, where dragons hide and tigers crouch, to find a place with the best Feng Shui for cultivators to be buried.\"","\"Burial inevitably requires the construction of a tomb.\"","\"There are many considerations in a tomb.\"","\"The overall layout, the orientation of the coffin, trap mechanisms, tomb-guarding statues, corpse disintegration layout... and so on.\"","Xie Ling said a lot, then embarrassedly said: \"However, I only know the basics of these things, not proficient.\"","\"When I was at home, I wasn’t of age, and my parents didn’t let me learn, I just picked up a little from being around it...\"","\"That’s already impressive,\" Mo Hua praised.","Without Xie Ling telling him these burial knowledge, Mo Hua would be completely in the dark.","Each craft has its specialty.","Especially knowledge from such Tao cultivation families, passed down through generations, always kept secret from outsiders.","Encouraged by the praise, Xie Ling racked his brain and spilled a lot more.","\"The layout of a tomb requires secrecy and sturdiness, which inevitably involves formations.\"","\"With these formations, the tombs can last for hundreds, even thousands of years without decay.\"","\"Additionally, using the formation layout, one can hide the energy mechanism, transform Yin to Yang, obscure cause and effect, and integrate the tomb with the earth, dormant in the earth veins for thousands of years, without being discovered.\"","\"After all, if a cultivator’s tomb is easily discovered, it would certainly invite covetous eyes. Unless it’s a family forbidden area, a guarded ancestral tomb, it’s only a matter of time before it’s raided.\"","\"Among the formations in a tomb, the most important is the Yin Yang Feng Shui Secret Formation, which is the Xie family’s secret formation, I haven’t learned it yet, and don’t know what the Formation Diagram is.\"","\"Besides that, there are also the Yin Formation and Earth Formation, which are very important...\"","Mo Hua’s heart was stirred.","The Yin Formation, could it be the Yin Yang type Eryi Formation?","And the Earth Formation... related to the Taoist Meaning of the earth?","Mo Hua silently contemplated, feeling a bit sentimental.","The world is vast, and formations are infinite, scattered in the corners of this world are surely many new and mysterious formations he hasn’t learned, or even come into contact with.","It’s just a pity that Xie Ling’s aspirations do not lie in formations, so he knows little about them, basically just their names.","Mo Hua asked but couldn’t obtain much.","But Xie Ling’s words still provided Mo Hua with a lot of ideas.","\"Feng Shui, mountain terrain, tombs...\"","\"Strengthening with formations, hiding energy mechanism...\"","\"Solitary Mountain City, tomb robbers...\"","\"Evil Embryo...\"","Mo Hua furrowed his brow, vaguely feeling that these matters might be somehow connected.","There can’t be so many coincidences in this world.","Within coincidences, cause and effect are hidden.","It’s just that the cause and effect are not clear yet, as clues are too few, Mo Hua couldn’t see through them for now.","...","Afterwards, Mo Hua still could only continue training and attending classes.","Two days later, he went again to Refining Demon Mountain.","The selection for the Sword Discussion Conference was proceeding steadily, advancing step by step.","Previously it was one-on-one sparring, now on Refining Demon Mountain, disciples of the Taixu Gate have already started forming teams for five-on-five sparring.","With five-on-five, the scene was grander, Spiritual Artifacts and spells were flying around chaotically, battles more intense, variability greater, sometimes decided in a moment’s thought.","But Mo Hua was still just watching the scene.","While everyone else was busy, he alone was sitting aside, appearing somewhat lonely.","Watching, Mo Hua silently made some comparisons in his mind.","The fellow disciples’ strength is steadily improving, and with such efforts in honing, they are expected to grow even stronger by the Sword Discussion Conference.","Both in cultivation and Taoist Skill, they would be stronger than now.","But not for himself.","At this pace, doing nothing, by the Conference, his \"hard strength\" would have basically no enhancement.","At most, cultivating a few more Circulations of Spiritual Power, which is essentially pointless.","While others are getting stronger, he stands still.","Which is equivalent to him getting weaker.","Mo Hua’s expression became solemn.","As heaven moves forcefully, a gentleman must continuously strive for self-improvement.","Since he came to Qian State to study, he must forge ahead and strive for self-improvement relentlessly.","This situation, of not only having no progress but even regressing, must not be allowed to happen.","Mo Hua fell into deep reflection.","A few days later, during the rest period, having prepared everything, he carried a storage bag, and left the Sect once again, embarking on the road to Solitary Mountain City.","...","Elder’s Residence.","Xun Ziyou paid respects to Elder Master Xun, sighing: \"This child, he’s running around again.\"","Elder Master Xun frowned, pinching his fingers, looking at the compass in front of him with profound eyes, after a moment, he spoke lightly:","\"Forget it, shallow waters can’t raise true dragons.\"","\"Let him go play on his own...\""]},{"number":1937,"title":"Chapter 1937 - 943: Ominous Signs","paragraphs":["\"Ancestor, are you truly at ease...\" Xun Ziyou frowned.","He is merely at the Foundation Establishment Late Stage, not at the Late Golden Core Stage. It’s manageable within the Second Grade state boundary, but once he reaches the Third Grade state boundary, the dangers are truly numerous.","Especially in some situations, the threat is genuine and omnipresent, even he, a Late Golden Core elder, might not be able to handle it.","Elder Master Xun was silent for a moment, then sighed slowly, not answering the question but responding with another:","\"Do you think Mo Hua will stay in my Taixu Sect?\"","Xun Ziyou was taken aback, \"You mean... whether he will enter the Inner Gate?\"","Elder Master Xun nodded.","Xun Ziyou pondered for a moment and said, \"He likely will... After all, he is the Formation Leader. Although his Spiritual Root is somewhat lacking, his innate talent in formations is extraordinary. Plus, he’s contributed greatly to our Taixu Sect. Logically, the sect will accept him into the Inner Gate...\"","\"And the elders throughout the sect all like this child. Mo Hua gets along well with fellow disciples and the elders too. If he’s not entering the Taixu Inner Gate, could he possibly join another sect?\"","Elder Master Xun shook his head, \"This child is destined not to stay in Taixu Sect...\"","Xun Ziyou was puzzled, yet dared not ask too much, merely saying:","\"If he doesn’t enter the Inner Gate, then he has to travel outside, and find a way to form a Core himself...\" Xun Ziyou frowned deeply with profound concern, \"Facing the elements like that would be too harsh, and who knows how many dangers he might encounter...\"","It’s not just as simple as \"dangers.\"","Elder Master Xun did not clarify.","Mo Hua’s true background is barely known within Taixu Sect.","And with such significant karma upon him, the crises he’ll face in the future will be even more terrifying.","Terrifying to an extent unimaginable for ordinary people.","The enemies standing against him are unpredictably strong too.","\"One can safeguard for a time, but not for a lifetime...\"","Elder Master Xun sighed deeply, \"Some dangers, he can only confront and overcome himself.\"","\"Blessings come from adversity; crisis and opportunity are intertwined in this world. Only by overcoming dangers, experiencing trials, finding opportunities in dire straits, and advancing step by step can one truly be reborn from the ashes, becoming stronger.\"","\"Sect, elders, treasures, these are all external; they are others’ given ’strength’.","\"Only by truly relying on one’s own knowledge, experience, wit, and strength, surviving adversities, and turning misfortunes into fortunes can one achieve real ’strength’.","\"A sword tempered in fire has its true sharpness.\"","Xun Ziyou’s expression was solemn, then he nodded in deep agreement.","Cultivators raised in comfort often cannot withstand hardship or failure, easily shattering their Taoist Heart when encountering true adversities.","Ordinary people only know to admire cultivators for their Spiritual Root, Blood Qi, lineage, and appearance—shallow things.","Not realizing that the most valuable treasure in a cultivator is actually a Taoist Heart tempered by trials and unyielding to adversity.","This kind of Taoist Heart is hard to forge without trials.","\"The Ancestor’s foresight is profound,\" Xun Ziyou said, \"I won’t interfere with what Mo Hua wants to do.\"","Xun Ziyou stood, intending to leave, but was then stopped by Elder Master Xun.","\"Stop.\"","Elder Master Xun said, \"Don’t really not interfere.\"","Xun Ziyou was stunned, \"Ah?\"","\"Can’t really not intervene at all.\"","Elder Master Xun said, pondering for a while in his heart, after all, he could not bear it.","The saying goes, a sharp blade comes from sharpening, and plum blossoms’ fragrance stems from bitter cold.","Indeed it’s true, but Taixu Sect has only this precious disciple, Mo Hua. If he were to get injured or die carelessly...","Just the thought makes Elder Master Xun’s heart ache.","Moreover, Mo Hua is not like other prodigies; he does not have a special Eternal Life Rune upon him.","Without this protection, not a single oversight is permissible.","Even a slight mistake could lead to total ruin.","Trying to undo it would be too late for regret.","Elder Master Xun previously indeed thought about planting a special Eternal Life Rune for Mo Hua to protect him at critical moments.","But Taixu Sect does not have any \"aged to death\" Heaven Void.","Even if there were, without kinship or connections, how could they expend their essence to plant an Eternal Life Rune for an unrelated child like Mo Hua?","Elder Master Xun considered doing it himself.","But Taixu Sect has few Heaven Voids proficient in formations and rudimentary Heavenly secrets—only him.","Currently, the Qianxue State Boundary is shrouded in darkness, storms are looming, the situation is perilous.","Many major affairs require his personal planning.","His old bones still need to burn on, continuing to uphold the sect’s legacy.","It’s impossible to truly damage his essence and sever his path for Mo Hua by planting such a special Eternal Life Rune.","He could only think of other ways.","\"If Mo Hua goes out to travel, leaving Taixu Sect and the Qian State, far-fetched and distant, I couldn’t manage it even if I wanted to.\"","\"But at least near the Qianxue State Boundary, there should be something as a safeguard to protect him thoroughly.\"","Elder Master Xun took out a pristine Jade Pendant and handed it to Xun Ziyou.","\"Tai Xu Yin Yang Lock is the supreme treasure of my Taixu Sect. Now it hangs around Mo Hua’s neck, guarding his karma.\"","\"This Jade Pendant is paired with Tai Xu Yin Yang Lock, capable of sensing a part of his karma’s aura.\"","\"If this Jade Pendant is white, it means all is well, and Mo Hua will encounter no accidents.\"","\"If pale red, there’s a minor crisis; if deep red, there’s a major crisis;\"","\"If black,\" Elder Master Xun’s gaze turned grim, \"...Then it’s the sign of death!\"","Xun Ziyou’s expression became solemn.","Elder Master Xun gave him the Jade Pendant, instructing, \"Keep this Jade Pendant with you, follow him, not too closely. Let him solve whatever issues arise himself, but should he face life-threatening major crises, at any cost, you must protect him.\""]},{"number":1938,"title":"Chapter 1938 - 943: Bizarre Traces","paragraphs":["Xun Ziyou solemnly took the jade pendant, feeling a heavy weight in his heart.","Though it’s a third-grade state boundary, barring any unexpected crises, as a late Golden Core stage Sword Cultivation Elder of the Taixu Gate, he should be able to handle it.","But there’s always the possibility of things going awry.","If things did indeed go wrong, and Mo Hua got hurt, even if he sacrificed his life afterward, it wouldn’t undo the situation.","\"Ancestor, what if the situation is beyond control... and I can’t protect it?\" Xun Ziyou asked with a frown.","Elder Master Xun’s expression was solemn. He pondered for a moment and then slowly said, \"If the situation is beyond control, you should... crush the Void Sword Order.\"","Xun Ziyou’s heart skipped a beat.","This was the second time the ancestor had mentioned the Void Sword Order.","The need to use the Void Sword Order demonstrated Mo Hua’s status in the eyes of the ancestor.","Or rather, it showed Mo Hua’s importance to Taixu Gate.","Yet, Xun Ziyou remained somewhat puzzled, \"Even with the realm restrictions of a third-grade state boundary, using the Void Sword Order might not tear open the void, right...\"","\"You don’t need to worry about that. I have my arrangements,\" said Elder Master Xun indifferently.","Xun Ziyou was unaware of the ancestor’s arrangements and did not dare to ask further.","Elder Master Xun slightly clasped his fingers, his eyebrows furrowing, then he said, \"It’s getting late, you should set off soon, follow in secret, you’re familiar with the task...\"","Afterward, Elder Master Xun added, \"Don’t repeat what happened before, being a late Golden Core stage elder, yet getting caught watching over a Foundation Establishment disciple...\"","Xun Ziyou felt somewhat embarrassed, \"Yes, this time I will be careful...\"","Elder Master Xun waved his hand, \"Off you go.\"","Xun Ziyou took the order and left.","In the Elder’s Residence, only Elder Master Xun remained.","He looked at the Heavenly Mechanism Compass in front of him, chaotic and unclear, with the threads of cause and effect tangled, frowning deeply, and after a long while, he slowly sighed and said:","\"I can only protect you up to this point...","\"Whether this journey brings great fortune or misfortune, it will all depend on you...\"","...","On the mountain path of the Qian Learning State Boundary, Mo Hua rode a carriage toward the remote Solitary Mountain City.","About half a day later, Mo Hua arrived at Solitary Mountain City.","The run-down city was built against the mountain, with dark hills and desolate woods, seemingly normal from a distance, yet Mo Hua always felt something odd was hidden within the mountain.","Entering Solitary Mountain City, Mo Hua first sought out Shen Xiuyan.","In a concealed teahouse private room, Shen Xiuyan handed a storage bag to Mo Hua.","\"Everything the young master wanted is in the bag. But time is tight, and my authority is limited, I’ve only managed to find some marginal items, some of which are fragmented and may not be of use.\" Shen Xiuyan said in a low voice to Mo Hua.","Mo Hua took the storage bag, glanced at it, then cupped his hands, \"Thank you.\"","\"Glad I could be of help,\" Shen Xiuyan replied, his face showing some apology, \"I can’t stay long.\"","He was an elder of the Shen Family, and Mo Hua was a prodigy of Taixu Gate.","Although the Shen Family and Taixu Gate weren’t exactly enemies, being seen together would still invite suspicion.","Especially since, in a way, Shen Xiuyan was indeed \"betraying\" the Shen Family.","If discovered, it would be impossible to explain.","Mo Hua understood this point too, he cupped his hands, \"Elder Xiu, please feel free to go, I won’t see you off.\"","Shen Xiuyan let out a sigh of relief, stood up, bowed, and then took his leave.","In the teahouse, Mo Hua was left alone.","Mo Hua thought for a moment and decided not to leave; instead, he opened the storage bag directly, drinking tea while reading the dossiers Shen Xiuyan had given him.","The teahouse was quiet, undisturbed.","Mo Hua, with his strong Divine Sense, was very focused and within an hour, he had roughly perused all the dossiers, and then fell into contemplation.","The dossiers recorded the details of the Shen Family’s mining operations in Solitary Mountain, spanning hundreds of years, covering aspects such as cultivator mobilization, project arrangements, spiritual machine structures, spirit pact standards, mineral flow, Spirit Stone pricing, copper ore reserve estimation, loose cultivator surname registers, etc.","It even included several incidents of conflict between the Shen Family and the loose cultivators.","These documents were broad in scope but relatively fragmented, spanning hundreds of years across various periods, capturing segments of events at the mines.","Through them, Mo Hua got a preliminary impression of the mine’s matters.","But the deeper truth remained unreachable, making it impossible to glimpse the full picture.","The only aspect that caught Mo Hua’s attention was the \"orphans\" of Solitary Mountain City.","Mo Hua flipped through the dossiers, discovering that there was a period when the number of orphans in Solitary Mountain City surged, yet the documents did not record what had happened during that time.","It was unclear whether it’s the circumstance of the loose cultivators, being neglected with no records.","Or whether there were records sealed by the Shen Family.","Or perhaps... directly destroyed?","Mo Hua frowned slightly, his heart filled with growing doubts.","\"What exactly did the Shen Family do in Solitary Mountain?\"","\"Could the Shen Family’s matters be related to the Evil Embryo?\"","\"A cunning rabbit has three burrows, one mountain, one water, one person... is there really an Evil Embryo hidden in Solitary Mountain?\"","\"If there is, then where would this Evil Embryo be hiding?\"","For the remainder of the time, Mo Hua meticulously examined these dossiers, hoping to find some clues within.","But after going through them repeatedly, he discovered nothing.","Mo Hua decided to personally visit the mountain peak owned by the Shen Family for a look.","He didn’t call upon Master Gu, opting instead to go alone.","He was capable of using the Concealment Technique, making it more convenient to investigate alone, and he didn’t want to involve Master Gu.","With Taixu Gate as his backing, he had no attachments in Solitary Mountain City, allowing him to come and go freely.","But Master Gu was different, his status within the Gu Family wasn’t high, and he had to manage the livelihood of the apprentices and disciples in the refinery shop. Like monks fleeing their temple, truly opposing the Shen Family would definitely invite revenge, leading to great trouble."]},{"number":1939,"title":"Chapter 1939 - 943: Ominous Portents","paragraphs":["Mo Hua had also made some calculations.","Although Solitary Mountain City was a Third Grade place, it was one of those very poor Third Grade territories.","The Golden Core cultivators that came and went were generally at the initial stage.","Now that his movement technique had integrated Concealment Technique, Water Passing Step, and Water Shadow Illusion, even if he couldn’t defeat an Initial Golden Core cultivator, he could still escape without any problem.","Once Mo Hua thought everything through, he tidied up slightly, then concealed himself and ventured into Solitary Mountain alone.","...","As Mo Hua entered Solitary Mountain, in Solitary Mountain City, Shen Xiuyan had already boarded a carriage, preparing to return to the Little Spirit Sect.","He had handed over the Shen Family’s archives, even some less important ones, to Mo Hua, which could be considered \"leaking information.\"","Though it wasn’t a major mistake, it was better to avoid trouble.","Once the matter was concluded, it was better to leave early to avoid any involvement.","Besides, to be honest, Shen Xiuyan couldn’t help but feel uneasy when he saw Mo Hua, thinking about his origins, and he really didn’t want to have dealings with Mo Hua.","Shen Xiuyan drove the carriage, ready to head back to the sect.","But as soon as the carriage moved a few steps, it encountered a person head-on.","This person had an ordinary appearance, but an extraordinary aura, dressed like an elder of the Shen Family; it was the powerful elder of the Shen Family, Shen Shouxing.","\"Xiuyan?\" said Shen Shouxing.","Shen Xiuyan had no choice but to greet him, \"Brother Shouxing.\"","\"Heading back to the sect so early?\" asked Shen Shouxing.","\"There are some matters at the sect.\"","Shen Shouxing nodded, then said, \"I have something I wish to ask you, please come with me.\"","Shen Xiuyan felt a bit unsettled, but Shen Shouxing’s cultivation was high, and his authority greater than his, so he didn’t dare to refuse.","Though they had some private connections, in a family, connections were not as strong as interests.","\"Alright,\" said Shen Xiuyan.","The two went to the living room where tea was served.","Shen Shouxing then dismissed everyone else, seeing no one around, he was silent for a moment, then said to Shen Xiuyan, \"A few years ago, you asked for a divination for me...\"","\"A divination?\"","Shen Xiuyan was stunned, and then slowly relaxed.","He thought it was about Mo Hua’s matter, but it turned out to be a false alarm...","\"That divination said,\" Shen Shouxing frowned, \"in my entire life, I’ll only have one son?\"","Shen Xiuyan didn’t know why Shen Shouxing brought this up but after pondering for a moment, he suddenly realized.","He was considering \"reopening\" his practice because it had been exhausted.","Shen Xiuyan nodded, \"That’s right.\"","\"The divination result cannot be changed?\"","Shen Xiuyan paused momentarily, and said, \"That divination, I asked someone from Mystery Valley to perform. The Elder from Mystery Valley said the cause and effect are predetermined, and this is your fate, whatever actions you took, whatever results they have, it cannot be changed.\"","This divination had some oddities.","Originally, he wanted Old Wen to perform this divination.","Old Wen was from Mystery Valley and had a treasure called the Three Talents Divination Copper Coin; it wasn’t exactly like he could foresee things like a god, but he could predict auspicious and inauspicious outcomes.","Back then, he followed Old Wen and Young Master Yun, the three of them traveled to Tongxian City, South Yue City, and Li State City.","Throughout the journey, they very much benefitted from his divination arts.","But after experiencing that incident, upon their return, Old Wen was frightened, saying he was afraid of becoming entangled with strange cause and effect, so he sealed away all his divination skills.","For fifty years, he vowed not to question the heavenly secrets or look at cause and effect, concentrating instead on preserving his life.","He had no choice but to ask Old Wen for an introduction, requesting another Elder from Mystery Valley to perform the divination for Shen Shouxing.","At that time, after finishing Shen Shouxing’s divination, the Mystery Valley Elder’s face turned ashen as he uttered many unpleasant words.","Shen Xiuyan couldn’t tell Shen Shouxing exactly what was said, so he could only selectively relay phrases about \"predetermined cause and effect\" to him.","He also informed him: in this lifetime, he will only have one son.","But this divination was only casually performed.","At that time, both Shen Xiuyan and Shen Shouxing didn’t really pay any attention to it.","The cause and effect were elusive and vague; after all, a divination was just a divination, it couldn’t explain anything.","But now, Shen Shouxing truly only had one son. None of his publicly recognized Dao Partners or secretly kept concubines had shown any signs of pregnancy.","This was slightly peculiar.","Now, his only son Shen Qingsheng was acting wanton, causing trouble.","Raising children is like planting trees: if a tree grows crooked, you can prune it and straighten it out with an axe.","But if a son is raised crooked, then he’s truly crooked, and there’s really no way to fix it.","As Shen Xiuyan pondered the situation, he began to empathize with Shen Shouxing, the powerful elder, \"Do you want... to have another divination performed?\"","Shen Shouxing nodded, \"I would appreciate it, Brother Xiuyan.\"","\"Then if...\" Shen Xiuyan cautiously suggested, \"the divination remains unchanged?\"","Shen Shouxing furrowed his brows, \"Then I would ask Brother Xiuyan to help inquire if there’s a way to ’reverse fate and change the life chart’...\"","\"Reverse fate, change the life chart...\" Shen Xiuyan muttered once, suddenly a bit lost in thought, then nodded, \"Alright, I’ll ask for you...\"","\"Thank you!\" Shen Shouxing cupped his hands.","After their conversation finished, they had nothing else to say.","Shen Shouxing finished his tea, then intended to get up and leave, but after taking a few steps, he found that Shen Xiuyan was still sitting in the chair, motionless.","Shen Shouxing found it strange, furrowed his brows, and said, \"Brother Xiuyan?\"","Shen Xiuyan sat there dazed, his expression somewhat confused, as if he hadn’t heard anything, completely oblivious to his surroundings.","\"You...\"","Shen Shouxing furrowed his brows even more tightly.","At that moment, a low voice echoed, \"No need for another divination.\"","\"What?\" Shen Shouxing paused.","Shen Xiuyan slowly raised his head, his eyes dim, tinged with gray, \"I have divined for you... in this life, you will only have this one son.\"","When Shen Shouxing met Shen Xiuyan’s gaze, he, too, momentarily lost focus, his eyes became obscure, and he murmured softly:","\"In this life, I will only have this one son.\"","Shen Xiuyan spoke in a low and unusual tone: \"If this son dies, you will have no descendants.\"","\"If this son dies, I will have no descendants,\" Shen Shouxing repeated exactly the same.","Those words, like seeds, took root and sprouted in his heart...","\"In this life, I will only have this one son.\"","\"If this son dies, I will have no descendants...\"","\"No descendants...\"","Shen Shouxing’s eyes dimmed for a moment, then gradually brightened again, regaining their luster. He turned to look at Shen Xiuyan.","Shen Xiuyan was also somewhat shocked, then stood up and said, cupping his hands, \"It’s getting late, I must return to the sect.\"","\"Then I won’t keep you any longer, Brother Xiuyan,\" Shen Shouxing replied.","\"Farewell.\"","\"Take care.\"","Their conversation over, they parted ways as if nothing had happened.","Shen Xiuyan boarded the carriage, the sound of hooves clattering and wheels rolling, as he left Solitary Mountain City, heading to the Little Spirit Sect.","The mountain scenery on both sides swept past one after another.","Seated within the carriage, Shen Xiuyan was lost in thought for a moment, then suddenly furrowed his brows.","\"Did I just... say something to Shen Shouxing?\"","\"Seems like... I didn’t say much? Just had a simple cup of tea?\"","\"That’s right, I didn’t have much to say to him.\"","\"I can’t quite remember...\"","Shen Xiuyan shook his head, \"Perhaps I’m too tired, or maybe I’ve been dreaming too much, feeling mentally weary...\"","He still occasionally dreamt during this period.","Dreaming of that dark, rundown temple outside of Li State City.","But this time it wasn’t a nightmare, he no longer used a knife on his own throat.","It was just an ordinary dream, and everything in the dream wasn’t so terrifying, dark, or bloody.","The figure of Little Mo Hua roasting sweet potatoes in the dream was becoming more vivid and clear.","Shen Xiuyan gently exhaled.","He sat calmly on the carriage, heading towards the Little Spirit Sect.","But at this moment, he still hadn’t realized, in his dreams, Mo Hua’s figure was becoming clearer, while the silhouette of the Taoist in the shadows was also becoming more distinct..."]},{"number":1940,"title":"Chapter 1940 - 944: Old Man in Cloth","paragraphs":["On top of Solitary Mountain City, abandoned wells are scattered everywhere, a picture of desolation.","The frail orphans in the city, carrying bamboo baskets, hunched over, use their dirty little hands to scrape rough ores from the pitch-black ground, piece by piece.","Only in this way can they survive.","Beside them, Mo Hua silently passed by with a somewhat depressed expression.","Fortunately, Master Gu remembered his instructions and drew a First Grade Wind Pattern on these orphans’ bamboo baskets, reducing their burden somewhat, so the orphans wouldn’t be crushed by the heavy ores, covered in bruises.","For now, this is all he could do.","Mo Hua sighed and walked straight towards the Shen Family’s mountain peak, passing through the mining children.","He’s pretty much visited every other place on Solitary Mountain City, except for the Shen Family’s mountain peak.","That mountain peak definitely holds something unusual.","Mo Hua wants to go stealthily and take a look.","After walking for a while, his vision suddenly broadened, and the sprawling Shen Family mines appeared before him.","These mines are vast and grand, occupying almost half of Solitary Mountain City’s mountain body, and the planning is relatively orderly, the mine openings are wide and expansive.","These are the traces left by large Spiritual Machines digging.","A whole circle of formations for alert was set around the Shen Family mines, and some Shen Family cultivators stationed within occasionally patrolled the vicinity.","The formations are Second Grade, and the Shen Family cultivators are merely Foundation Establishment.","This is an abandoned mine, unable to produce ores, no longer profitable, so naturally, they wouldn’t dispatch a Golden Core Elder to guard it.","In fact, having Foundation Building Cultivators guard it is already a luxury.","But the Foundation Establishment cultivators couldn’t possibly stop Mo Hua, let alone those Second Grade formations.","Mo Hua drew his finger, a flash of ink color, and the formation at the mine boundary broke open, forming a gap on its own.","Mo Hua passed through the gap and approached the Shen Family mines.","Once he stepped onto the mining lands, his vision abruptly darkened, as if countless despairing wails sounded, yet in a blink, they disappeared without a trace. Mo Hua looked around, nothing seemed unusual.","The sunlight overhead was still bright.","Yet Mo Hua always felt that the sunlight touching him was somewhat chilly.","Mo Hua’s expression darkened slightly, stepping on mountain stones, avoiding patrolling Shen Family cultivators, along with nearby occasional traps and formations, he wandered around the Shen Family mines.","He stepped over most of the mountain peaks.","The mountain mines are dug deep and mostly sealed off, making it impossible to delve deeper, he could only take a cursory look.","But after looking for so long, he still found nothing.","With his Divine Sense and causal perception, he couldn’t discern a single clue.","\"How could there be no clues at all...\"","Mo Hua furrowed his brow tightly.","Seeing the sky wasn’t early anymore, the sun gradually setting, he departed from the Shen Family’s mines for now.","Upon reaching the mine’s edge, Mo Hua pointed a finger, ink patterns reweaving, repairing the formation he had broken, concealing his traces.","Then he went to a nearby mountain peak, climbed up high for a distant view, taking the Shen Family mines all in sight.","As he watched, Mo Hua suddenly remembered what Xie Ling had said to him:","\"Practice Kanyu Skill, perceive the cosmic energy, discern earth veins...\"","\"Cosmic energy, earth veins... what are they exactly?\"","Mo Hua slowly closed his eyes, releasing his Divine Sense, calming his mind, shedding the ego, harboring the belief in \"Unity of Heaven and Man,\" perceiving the universe, seeking the so-called cosmic energy and earth veins.","The world’s entities disappear.","The heavens overlook all beings, the earth vast and boundless.","A sense of wonder emerged naturally.","Indeed, there is a wisp of white energy between heaven and earth.","Mo Hua vaguely felt as though he grasped something, yet unsure if he truly understood it correctly.","Though uncertain, Mo Hua followed the energy forward.","The energy lingered along with the mountain’s rise and fall, elusive.","Mo Hua also followed the energy, traversing through the mountains.","He walked a whole circuit like this, the energy vanished, Mo Hua focused and found the surrounding landscape unfamiliar, yet still desolate, appearing utterly ordinary.","This wisp of energy led him to a dead end.","Mo Hua shook his head.","\"Indeed, nothing comes cheap, nothing learned without effort...\"","Mo Hua turned to leave, but as he turned, glimpsing from the corner of his eye, he noticed someone sitting below the distant slope.","This person was an old man, clad in cloth, seemingly not a Mining Cultivator.","Mo Hua contemplated momentarily, withdrew his Stealth Technique, and walked towards the Old Man in Cloth.","Upon nearing, seeing clearly, Mo Hua found the old man’s build gnarled and thin, face slightly dark, with gleaming eyes, and his cultivation was roughly Foundation Establishment Peak.","The old man was sitting cross-legged on the mountain stone, gazing at the distant mountains, seemingly lost in thought.","Noticing someone approaching, he furrowed his brows, turned to look, then saw the talented Mo Hua, and after a slight surprise, his eyes brightened, and he spoke:","\"In this wild place, so deserted, to meet you, little friend, truly is fate.\"","His voice was hoarse but exuded friendliness.","Mo Hua seemed to relax a bit and asked, \"Senior, what are you doing here?\"","\"I’m watching the mountains,\" the old man replied.","\"Watching mountains?\" Mo Hua looked around, somewhat puzzled, \"This place is desolate, barren, what’s there to see?\"","The old man shook his head, \"In the world, everything has outward appearances and internal pathways. Lofty mountains, treacherous terrains, desolate mountains, barren waters, these are appearances, the mountain form. But beneath the mountain form, lies the mountain force; beneath the mountain force, are the earth veins.\"","Earth veins...","Mo Hua shivered and praised, \"Old Senior, you are so knowledgeable.\""]},{"number":1941,"title":"Chapter 1941 - 944: Old Man in Cloth (Part 2)","paragraphs":["\"You’re too kind,\" the old man replied calmly. After pondering for a moment, he asked, \"I wonder, young friend, where are you from? Why have you ventured alone into these desolate mountains?\"","Mo Hua clasped his hands in greeting and replied, \"I am a disciple from a small sect nearby. I was following my mentor to seek knowledge, and as we passed by Solitary Mountain, I took the opportunity to explore. I accidentally lost my way and ended up here, encountering you, senior.\"","The old man’s wrinkled face showed a faint smile, \"Well, it seems we’re truly destined to meet, young friend.\"","\"Indeed, we are,\" Mo Hua nodded, then sat down cross-legged, mimicking the old man’s gaze into the distance. Yet, the distance held nothing but desolate mountains, devoid of anything else.","Mo Hua withdrew his gaze, turned his head, and leaned forward to look at what was in front of the old man.","In front of the old man was a mound of dirt and sand. Upon it were drawn several lines of patterns.","Mo Hua exclaimed in surprise, \"Elder, are you a Formation Master?\"","The old man raised an eyebrow, \"Young man, you understand formations?\"","Mo Hua bashfully replied, \"I know a little.\"","The old man showed interest, \"Where did you learn your skills, young man?\"","\"I dare not say ’learned’ from anyone,\" Mo Hua replied modestly, \"I merely picked up some rudimentary knowledge from the sect’s instructor.\"","The old man nodded approvingly, \"Nowadays, people are boastful, lusting for fame, exaggerating their skills. It’s admirable that a disciple from a sect remains humble like you.\"","Mo Hua felt a bit embarrassed, \"You’re too kind, senior.\"","Then he glanced again at the patterns on the mound before the old man, asking humbly,","\"Elder, these formation patterns, I’ve never seen them before, nor learned them in the sect. They seem profound. I wonder if there’s any particular significance to them?\"","The old man looked deeply at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua also gazed at the old man, his eyes clear.","Perhaps influenced by this \"clearness,\" the old man’s heart grew fond of this talent. Stroking his beard, he said,","\"Meeting is fate. Today I shall teach you some secret teachings in formations, which even the Four Great Sects or Eight Great Gates might not have recorded.\"","Mo Hua mouth opened in disbelief, his innocent face full of astonishment.","The old man pointed to the patterns on the ground and asked Mo Hua, \"Can you discern what these formation patterns are?\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, \"They resemble the Five Elements Earth Series patterns...but not quite.\"","The old man nodded, \"Correct, it’s an Earth Formation.\"","Earth Formation...","Mo Hua’s expression changed, this time genuinely shocked.","\"Senior, what exactly is the purpose of this Earth Formation?\" Mo Hua asked respectfully for instruction.","\"The Earth Formation has many categories and uses,\" the old man explained, \"But the most common use is related to the earth.\"","The old man pointed to the abandoned mine ahead, \"For instance, in the mountain ahead, many Earth Formations are buried.\"","Mo Hua’s heart stirred, then feigned ignorance, asking, \"Do you mean Earth Formations are used to mine the mountain?\"","\"No,\" the old man shook his head.","\"Then...to detect earth veins, is the Earth Formation used?\"","\"Also no.\"","\"Then...\" Mo Hua furrowed his brows.","The old man appeared solemn, \"For tombs.\"","Mo Hua murmured, \"Tombs...\"","\"Indeed,\" the old man looked out at the distant mountains, speaking with a sense of awe, \"The earth embraces all things, not only the living but also the deceased.\"","\"People live on the surface while alive, and rest beneath it after death.\"","\"Yet the living do not allow the deceased peace.\"","\"For the deceased to find peace, tombs must be built, formations drawn. Borrowing the power of formations, tombs are concealed within earth veins, merging with the earth, harmonizing with the Taoist essence, receiving the protection of the heavens and earth, thus distancing from the entanglements of the living.\"","\"These formations are Earth Formations.\"","\"Earth Formation...\" Mo Hua stood there, dazed for a moment before realizing, surprised, \"You mean, within those mountains are buried Earth Formations, doesn’t that imply...there are tombs buried in the mines ahead?\"","The old man nodded, \"Indeed.\"","\"But...\" Mo Hua furrowed his brow, \"Isn’t there a mine ahead, full of mining tunnels? How could tombs have been built there?\"","\"Moreover, those mountains are ordinary, if tombs were built, why is there no indication at all?\"","The old man smiled knowingly, \"An outsider watches the spectacle, while an insider sees the intricacies. Beneath the superficial commotion lies profound mysteries, unknown to others, hence invisible to them.\"","\"Insider...\" Mo Hua muttered to himself, softly asking, \"Senior, what is it that you truly do?\"","The old man chuckled lightly, not answering.","Mo Hua, feeling somewhat anxious, thought to quietly rise and leave, but as he turned, he noticed three people approaching from afar.","These three were all short-statured, clad in cloth garments, which were stained with an earthy smell.","They deliberately restrained their auras, but Mo Hua could sense that these three were all Golden Core cultivators, and their spiritual power felt peculiar.","Mo Hua then stood up, clasping his hands in gesture, saying,","\"Hearing such words from an elder has been enlightening. As it’s getting late, the instructor might be searching for me, so I shall take my leave.\"","However, the old man shook his head, \"You cannot leave.\"","Mo Hua’s expression slightly altered, \"Senior, what do you mean by this?\"","\"Why do you think, without rhyme or reason, I told you so much?\"","\"Wasn’t it because we are destined?\"","The old man in cloth laughed, \"Young brother, you’re still naive, here’s a lesson for you: in the cultivation world, never speak to strangers.\"","\"The cultivation world is perilous, you never know who you are talking to.\"","\"Nor do you know what their intentions are.\"","\"Just like now, you have no idea who I truly am...\"","The old man’s aura shifted, shedding all semblance of friendliness, his face revealing a vulture-like sinister grin.","Mo Hua thought of escaping, but in an instant, the three Golden Core cultivators surrounded him completely, blocking any path for him to flee."]},{"number":1942,"title":"Chapter 1942 - 944: Old Man in Cloth (Part 3)","paragraphs":["\"Really walked right into the trap.\"","\"We’ve been looking outside for half a day and didn’t find any good goods. Yet, unexpectedly, a fool came right to our door...\"","\"Mr. Pi’s luck is really good...\"","\"Smooth-skinned, young, and the cultivation isn’t low. Quite a decent appearance...\"","Mo Hua looked panicked, \"I... I am a disciple of a sect, the sect elder is in the city, aren’t you afraid of offending the elder by making a move on me?\"","The few people remained unmoved.","One of them sneered, \"Near Solitary Mountain City, what good sect could there be? And besides, looking at the aura of your spiritual power, at most you’d have a middle grade spiritual root. With such meager talent, what good sect could accept you?\"","Mo Hua felt a bit displeased in his heart.","However, three Golden Cores, and a Foundation Establishment Peak; if they really fought, surely he wouldn’t be their match.","\"I’ll sneak away first, then call for help, find a way to capture these thieves, toss them into the Taoist Prison, and slowly torture them to find out their intentions...\"","Mo Hua gradually made up his mind, but on the surface, he still appeared flustered and bewildered:","\"I... I am just a disciple at the Foundation Establishment, capturing me won’t do you any good.\"","Mo Hua extended his Divine Sense, searching for flaws within the group, intending to use Water Shadow to make his escape.","\"How would it not be useful? You are quite useful, without you, we...\"","\"Shut up, stop blabbering. Let’s capture him first.\"","As they were about to make a move, an old man intercepted, \"Hold on, this little friend has smooth skin and tender flesh. If we start a fight, and he gets injured, or accidentally killed, it would be useless...\"","\"I’ll be careful.\"","\"Being careful is not enough... you guys are clumsy and heavy-handed.\"","\"Such a hassle.\"","\"Nonsense, taking care of that thing requires great precision. We need the essence, Qi, mind, skin, flesh, and bones, all intact. If there is the slightest injury, it might not open the gate...\"","\"In these desolate fields, it is hard enough to find just one. If we accidentally kill him, where would we find a second one?\"","\"True...\"","Mo Hua paused for a moment, his brow furrowed slightly.","The Old Man in Cloth looked towards Mo Hua, his tone softened a bit:","\"Young friend, given your young age, we won’t trouble you. How about this, if you honestly help us with one thing, after it’s done, we’ll let you go and even give you a generous gift, ensuring you’ll never worry about food or Spirit Stones again, and allowing you to succeed in Tao Cultivation.\"","Mo Hua shook his head, \"I don’t believe you.\"","\"Boy, don’t you understand the situation...\" One person sneered, reaching out to Mo Hua.","The old man stopped him with a harsh look, then slowly said to Mo Hua:","\"Young brother, let me be frank with you, in this situation, you have no other choice...\"","\"Either we kill you now, throw your bones into the mine, and let the mountain demons devour them clean, so your parents and sect elder will never find you.\"","\"Or, you come with us, help us with a small task, and once it’s done, I guarantee you will live, and you’ll get some benefits.\"","Upon hearing his bones would be thrown into the mine, Mo Hua’s face turned pale. After a fit of fear, he seemed to resign himself to fate and asked:","\"You... won’t deceive me?\"","\"I won’t deceive you.\"","\"And after it’s done, there are really benefits for me?\"","The old man turned his head and said to one of the big men, \"Bring something out.\"","The big man paused, \"What?\"","\"Anything from what we dug up below, just bring one out,\" said the old man.","The big man hesitated slightly but reluctantly reached into his sleeve, pulling out a small jade pendant, and tossed it to Mo Hua.","Mo Hua caught it and found that the jade pendant was jade-black, cool to the touch, soaked with a damp and cold aura of death.","\"This is just a small token, listen to us and do your tasks earnestly, and there will be more benefits for you later,\" said the old man.","Mo Hua believed now, he kept the jade pendant and nodded, \"Alright.\"","The old man looked satisfied, nodded, then told the big man beside him, \"Take out a set of shackles and put it on him.\"","Mo Hua was startled, \"Why shackle me?\"","\"Don’t be afraid, it’s just in case,\" said the old man, \"if you truly listen, we’ll unlock it for you afterward.\"","\"Oh...\"","Then the big man brought out a heavy shackle, trying to put it on Mo Hua.","Mo Hua’s eyelid twitched.","Third-Grade shackle?!","\"No way, once shackled, there’s definitely no escape. Life and death would be in others’ hands...\" Mo Hua’s heart stirred, \"I must find a chance to escape first, then react accordingly.\"","However, before he could attempt to escape, the Old Man in Cloth frowned, \"Why are you using a Third-Grade shackle? Trying to tire him to death?\"","\"Didn’t I say, the skin, flesh, and bones cannot have any damage, and he’s only at Foundation Establishment; switch to a Second-Grade shackle.\"","\"Alright,\" the big man said, then changed it to a Second-Grade one.","Mo Hua was silent for a moment, then extended his hand, obediently allowing them to shackle him.","\"Let’s go,\" said the old man.","So the old man led the way, and five people moved towards an abandoned mine entrance not far away.","Around the mine, there were semi-new, semi-old stone debris and long pick scars.","Mo Hua’s mind stirred.","These traces were almost identical to what he had seen before on Solitary Mountain, it seemed these people were indeed the group of tomb robbers.","\"They really found a tomb in the mine?\"","\"They’re taking me to enter the grave?\"","\"But why must they take me? Require the essence, Qi, mind, skin, flesh, and bones intact, could it be...\"","Mo Hua’s gaze sharpened.","Nearing the mine entrance, as they brought out their Spiritual Artifacts to prepare for excavation, one of the Golden Cores said:","\"Wait, someone is here!\"","The group tensed up, turning to look in the direction of the voice, and indeed saw that a group of people was approaching from not far away.","Leading them was a young nobleman, dressed in luxurious clothes, his face haughty and with anger.","Mo Hua recognized the person; it was Shen Qingsheng.","Behind him, there were five to six cultivators from the Shen Family escorting him.","And Shen Qingsheng, from afar, spotted Mo Hua, pointed at him with a sharp voice:","\"Mo! Finally caught you, today you’re dead for sure!\""]},{"number":1943,"title":"Chapter 1943 - 945: Snatching People","paragraphs":["Shen Qingsheng looked at Mo Hua, his expression venomous.","Mo Hua was startled, and several Golden Core tomb raiders around him couldn’t help but glance at each other. The elder addressed as \"Mr. Pi\" glanced at Mo Hua and asked:","\"Do you know each other?\"","Before Mo Hua could say anything, Shen Qingsheng sneered:","\"I expected you would return to Solitary Mountain sooner or later, so I sent someone to watch early on. But you’re so elusive, disappearing as soon as you enter the mountain. I’ve been searching for so long, and finally, I’ve caught you...\"","Shen Qingsheng pointed at Mo Hua, \"This time, no one will save you; you’re doomed!\"","His tone was arrogant and dismissive, focusing only on talking to Mo Hua, not even acknowledging Mr. Pi and the others.","Or rather, in his eyes, an old man at Foundation Establishment Peak and three average Golden Core cultivators were of no consequence.","Mr. Pi and the others looked indifferent.","Mo Hua was somewhat helpless, stretching out his hand to show the shackles on his wrists, and said to Shen Qingsheng:","\"I’ve been captured, and I’m not in charge here. If you want to kill me, you’ll have to see if these seniors agree...\"","\"Hmph.\"","Shen Qingsheng snorted coldly, pointing at Mo Hua and said to Mr. Pi and the others: \"Give me this kid; name your price in Spirit Stones.\"","Mr. Pi’s eyelid twitched, and the other three Golden Core cultivators also had displeased expressions.","\"This young gentleman, we’re not here to catch this little brother, nor are we in charge of him. We just want to ask him for a small favor, and once it’s done, we’ll let him go. By then, whatever grudges you have can be settled on your own...\" Mr. Pi said as politely as possible.","\"What’s with all the talk,\" Shen Qingsheng frowned, \"I want the person, so just hand him over quickly, enough with the chatter.\"","\"What if I don’t let go?\"","\"Don’t let go?\" Shen Qingsheng sneered, waving his hand. The group behind him stepped forward.","Mr. Pi’s expression darkened.","Beside him, a short and stout Golden Core cultivator in grey whispered to him: \"Mr. Pi, what do we do now?\"","Mr. Pi’s gaze was somber, studying Shen Qingsheng and his people, saying: \"Better to avoid trouble. We’re of dubious origin, let’s try not to cause a scene.\"","\"What about the offering...\"","\"We’ll find another way.\"","\"Alright.\"","The two muttered, and after discussing, Mr. Pi said: \"This little brother can be handed to the young gentleman.\"","Shen Qingsheng raised an eyebrow, \"Smart of you.\"","Mr. Pi pushed Mo Hua forward.","Mo Hua had a helpless expression.","He had actually planned to sneak into the tomb and act later, but Shen Qingsheng’s sudden intervention ruined his plans.","Seeing Mo Hua about to fall into his hands, Shen Qingsheng looked increasingly excited, \"You damned brat, today there’s no Golden Core to protect you. Let’s see what you can do now? Falling into my hands, I will surely...\"","Mo Hua raised his eyes, and gave him a calm look.","The look was just like that day, a nightmare revisited, fear rising instantly, causing Shen Qingsheng to cover his eyes and scream. But moments later, he realized that nothing had happened.","Mo Hua really just looked at him, ordinarily.","Shen Qingsheng’s anger surged, his face flushed red, and he screamed:","\"You brat! You dare humiliate me! Try to trick me again!\"","Mo Hua was somewhat speechless.","Just looking at him, not even using Pupil Skill, and he acts like this...","Shen Qingsheng seemed to perceive Mo Hua’s disdain, becoming even more furious, \"Facing death, yet still so reckless.\"","\"Last time you were lucky, it was also my Shen Family who failed to raise people well. Those two Golden Core Guards were so audacious they dared not make a move on you. I’ve replaced them now, with my personal attendants.\"","\"This time it’s my personally trained fighters. Whoever I tell them to kill, they will kill. You’re not getting away with your luck this time.\"","Mo Hua looked at Shen Qingsheng’s followers.","Most of them looked unfamiliar, seemingly indeed a new batch.","Foundation Establishment disciples looked sinister, with two Shen Family Golden Core cultivators appearing even more menacing, standing in front of Shen Qingsheng like two loyal hawks.","Mo Hua’s little finger touched the shackles on his wrist, starting to plan in his mind how to escape.","Shen Qingsheng waved his hand, and the two Golden Core cultivators behind him walked towards Mo Hua.","As they approached closer, just then, Mr. Pi spoke:","\"Hold on!\"","The Shen Family Golden Core cultivators halted, Shen Qingsheng’s face displeased.","Mr. Pi’s gaze was slightly somber and said: \"Young gentleman, you just promised, I’ll give you the person, and you give us Spirit Stones. Now the person is yours, where are the Spirit Stones?\"","Unexpectedly, Shen Qingsheng turned his face and said: \"Spirit Stones? What Spirit Stones? When did I say that?\"","Mr. Pi’s gaze sharpened.","Shen Qingsheng mocked: \"Spirit Stones, I can give, but you can’t ask for. Giving to you is generosity, asking from me is what? Debt collection? Or are you trying to humiliate me?\"","Mr. Pi and his companions’ expressions darkened, with one clenching his fist, muscles coiling on his arm, covered with a layer of stone.","Shen Qingsheng remained fearless, sneering: \"What, want to make a move? This whole mountain is Shen Family’s territory; once things get physical, don’t expect to leave Solitary Mountain.\"","Mr. Pi was stunned, wary, \"You’re from the Shen Family?\"","\"Exactly.\" Shen Qingsheng nodded.","Mr. Pi pondered for a moment, then clasped his hands: \"It’s us who were blind, please go ahead, young gentleman.\"","Seeing them give in, Shen Qingsheng immediately snorted disdainfully, his expression more arrogant, muttering, \"A bunch of country rats, making me waste so many words...\""]},{"number":1944,"title":"Chapter 1944 - 945: Snatching People (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Although his voice was light, Mr. Pi’s group could still hear him. One of the pointy-nosed, lean-cheeked Golden Core cultivators’ expressions changed immediately, unable to suppress his anger.","Shen Qingsheng saw his defiance and sneered coldly:","\"What? Want to make a move? Come on, kill me if you can. Don’t say I didn’t warn you, I’m a direct descendant of the Shen Family, my father is a powerful elder in the Shen Family, and he manages Solitary Mountain. If you dare make a move, don’t think about leaving here alive. Once I tell my father, regardless of your backgrounds or family histories, you won’t escape unscathed...\"","Facing such provocation, Mr. Pi’s group instead calmed down. They exchanged glances, indifferent expressions, and said nothing more.","Mo Hua’s eyelids twitched slightly.","Shen Qingsheng pointed at Mo Hua again and said to a Golden Core beside him: \"Bring him to me.\"","The Shen Family’s Golden Core walked towards Mo Hua, stopping beside him, he drew his knife and placed it on Mo Hua’s neck.","Mr. Pi’s group did not intervene.","The Shen Family Golden Core cultivator then escorted Mo Hua towards Shen Qingsheng.","Shen Qingsheng watched the \"hateful\" Mo Hua being shackled, a knife at his throat, walking towards him step by step, his expression becoming increasingly ferocious.","Yet they did not notice, behind them, a figure among Mr. Pi’s group suddenly vanished, merging into the ground.","With the knife at his neck, Mo Hua walked a few steps forward, and suddenly, with a thought, his foot slipped, and he fell to the ground.","He fell naturally.","The Shen Family Golden Core escorting Mo Hua inwardly cursed \"useless, tripping over a stone,\" and extended his hand to grab Mo Hua’s shoulder.","But just as he was distracted, reaching for Mo Hua, the ground under his feet suddenly trembled, a pair of stony hands emerged from underground, clamping tightly onto the Shen Family Golden Core’s legs as if iron pincers, dragging him below.","The Shen Family Golden Core’s expression changed drastically, but he couldn’t break free in time, and by the time he reacted, he was already half buried.","Beside Mr. Pi, another short and lean Golden Core initiated an Earth Escape skill, gliding to the top of the Shen Family Golden Core, hands like claws, grabbing the Shen Family Golden Core’s head, long fingers penetrating deeply into the vital points on either side of his forehead.","The last Golden Core, a slightly older one in gray, drew a long knife swiftly and fiercely, directly severing the Shen Family Golden Core’s neck.","Blood splattered into the air, spraying out, dyeing the ground red.","Mo Hua, having pretended to fall down early, stood aside unscathed, not a single drop of blood touched him.","Mr. Pi’s three Golden Cores, coordinated seamlessly, acted decisively, discreetly, and ruthlessly.","By the time the Shen Family Golden Core’s screams rang out, he was already decapitated, dead.","Shen Qingsheng and his group looked shocked and terrified, then furious:","\"You scoundrels, how dare you...\"","But Mr. Pi’s group gave them no chance, since they had killed, they naturally intended to finish the battle quickly.","The three ruthless Golden Cores looked as calm as still waters, saying nothing, advancing towards Shen Qingsheng and his group to kill.","Shen Qingsheng had brought only two Golden Cores with him, the rest were all Foundation Establishment cultivators.","Generally speaking, near Solitary Mountain City, two Golden Core Guards were already sufficient, let alone on their Shen Family’s territory, these people were usually good enough to let him walk arrogantly without fear, and it had always been so.","But now the situation had changed.","Those who dare rob graves are all desperate criminals.","One Foundation Establishment Peak, three Golden Cores, one seemingly at the Golden Core Middle Stage, and all are cunning old hands roaming the Jianghu.","In terms of experience and power, they were overwhelming.","The other Shen Family Golden Core lasted less than a dozen rounds before being slain.","The remaining Foundation Establishment cultivators were slaughtered.","Blood and limbs were scattered everywhere, leaving only Shen Qingsheng, his face pale, horrified, murmuring: \"I’m the Shen Family’s scion, my, my father is... how dare you...\"","A stout man slapped him heavily.","The slap was like iron and stone.","Shen Qingsheng was sent flying, crashing to the ground, feeling dizzy, seeing stars, as he spat out a mouthful of blood, then lost consciousness completely.","\"Damn it, give you face, and you don’t want it, pushing us to the point of having to slay you.\"","The stout man stepped forward, about to crush Shen Qingsheng to death.","But Mr. Pi said, \"Keep him, as a backup.\"","The stout man understood his meaning, nodded: \"Alright.\" He spat at Shen Qingsheng, then took out a rope, tying him tightly, his skin pinched until red, looking painful.","Unlike Mo Hua, who is sensible and knows the times, Shen Qingsheng naturally didn’t have Mo Hua’s treatment.","Only then did Mr. Pi look at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua wore an expression of \"fear,\" saying, \"You... you killed people?\"","The stout man sneered, \"Kid, you haven’t seen much, this is just the beginning...\"","Mr. Pi coldly said, \"Enough, don’t babble. Killing means trouble, so go down quickly, it’s safer with the dead.\"","\"Alright.\"","The others stepped forward, collecting storage bags, discarding every traceable item inside separately, then raised earth and stones to cover the remnants and blood of the Shen Family cultivators, crudely concealing the evidence.","Clearly, they were not novices at this.","After completing the task, the stout man stepped forward and picked up the unconscious Shen Qingsheng.","Mr. Pi glanced at Mo Hua, who obediently walked up to him, only then did Mr. Pi nod:","\"Let’s head down to the tomb.\"","The group entered the mine, and in a nearby corner, broke open a wall, revealing a narrow stone path behind it.","The short and lean Golden Core was the first to squeeze through.","After a moment, the stout man carrying Shen Qingsheng also squeezed through."]},{"number":1945,"title":"Chapter 1945 - 945: Snatching People (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Mr. Pi pointed to Mo Hua, \"Go down.\"","Mo Hua obediently squeezed into the narrow stone passage.","Next was the Golden Core cultivator in gray clothes holding a long knife.","Finally, it was Mr. Pi.","He stayed at the end, set up the Formation, sealed the stone wall, and then joined the others in entering the stone passage.","Their figures vanished into the mine.","Only the corpses of the Shen Family cultivators, tragically covered in dirt and stone, remained upon Solitary Mountain...","...","Mo Hua felt darkness engulfing him; the stone passage was narrow, damp, sticky, filled with the scent of earth. He followed the path for an unknown duration until a faint light appeared ahead, revealing an opening.","Jumping through, he landed in a wider corridor.","An intense, putrid smell, a mix of years of decay and unknown odors, assailed him.","Mo Hua hurriedly covered his nose and mouth, held his breath, and used Spiritual Power to shield his senses, feeling slightly better.","By then, everyone had entered the corridor.","Mo Hua surveyed his surroundings, realizing the corridor was tall enough for two men, its walls solid, branching out endlessly, with its depths shrouded in darkness, hiding unknowns, as an icy aura seeped from within.","All around lay dead silence, as if death itself slumbered.","Mo Hua felt a chill in his heart.","Just then, amidst the silence, a sharp howl abruptly pierced the air.","Mo Hua was startled, turning to find it was Shen Qingsheng.","Not only Mo Hua, but even Mr. Pi and the others broke out in cold sweat.","They didn’t know when Shen Qingsheng had awakened.","\"Not good!\"","The man’s face turned pale as he quickly covered Shen Qingsheng’s mouth to silence him, while the others dared not breathe loudly.","A moment later, the corridor remained undisturbed.","The man wiped the sweat from his forehead with a trembling voice, \"Hope it hasn’t startled anything...\"","Mr. Pi, with a serious expression, took out a Compass, studied it for a moment, and exhaled slightly, \"Fortunately...\"","The man turned his head, wishing he could throttle Shen Qingsheng, \"Damn it, you brat, trying to kill us?\"","Shen Qingsheng’s eyes were wide open, filled with both fear and fury, \"I, I’m from the Shen Family... How dare you...\"","The man sneered, whispering, \"Without the Shen Family, you’re nothing but a waste, oblivious to the dangers of the Cultivation World, killing you is just...\"","Mr. Pi frowned, \"Why say so much? Knock him out.\"","Among the group, the elder known as \"Mr. Pi,\" though only at Foundation Establishment Peak, carried significant authority.","The man slapped Shen Qingsheng on the back of the head, knocking him unconscious.","\"It’s getting late, let’s find the location quickly.\" Mr. Pi said in a low voice.","The others nodded.","Then Mr. Pi took the lead, holding the Compass in his left hand, forming hand seals with his right, observing the Compass and discerning the corridor’s direction, guiding the group forward.","Silently, the group followed, not saying a word, seemingly afraid to disturb Mr. Pi, and equally wary of startling certain \"things\" within the tomb.","Mo Hua quietly tagged along.","But most of his focus wasn’t on the perilous corridor but on Mr. Pi, who held the Compass and discerned their path.","One can easily tell when a master takes action.","Mo Hua was certain Mr. Pi possessed real skills.","Earlier on the mountain, while chatting with Mr. Pi, Mo Hua confirmed this, the \"Earth Formation\" inheritance isn’t something a regular Formation Master learns.","This Mr. Pi definitely has a secret lineage.","Moreover, for tomb raiders like them, it’s akin to snatching meat from a dead man’s mouth.","Formation skills and experience must be extraordinary, and their insight unique, without real abilities, they couldn’t survive this trade.","\"I wonder if I can acquire Mr. Pi’s lineage...\"","\"Even if not, learning a bit would still be worthwhile.\"","Mo Hua silently thought.","So, he subtly followed behind Mr. Pi, showing no emotion on his face, yet occasionally craning his neck to peek at Mr. Pi’s Compass, watching his hand seals, and mentally simulating his deduction process.","Etched beneath the corridor’s stone walls were Formations.","These Formations, with their concealed aura, merged with the earth, apparently a type of \"Earth Formation\" used in tombs.","Deducing these Formations and using the Compass to determine their location consumed considerable mental energy.","Mr. Pi concentrated entirely on the Compass until his Divine Sense depleted, taking a brief rest. During a glance, he noticed Mo Hua’s eyes secretly watching him.","These eyes were extraordinarily deep, as if something profound and mysterious flowed within.","Mr. Pi’s heart trembled at once, but upon focusing again, he saw Mo Hua’s gaze was clear as water, so clear it reflected his image.","Mr. Pi silently watched Mo Hua.","Mo Hua watched Mr. Pi.","Mr. Pi’s gaze flickered slightly, silently turned his head, said nothing, and continued leading the way.","Mo Hua breathed a sigh of relief.","The group walked further, reaching a gate.","The gate was covered with dense Formations.","\"We’ve arrived.\"","The man in the crowd breathed a sigh of relief.","Mr. Pi gave everyone a look, signaling them to remain silent, then took an array of items from his storage bag—a Formation Diagram, a Bronze Formation Pen, several batches of Spiritual Ink, and blank Formation Paper—beginning to record on paper while using Formation Patterns to deduce, attempting to break the Formations on the gate.","The group remained vigilant, guarding around the gate in case of unexpected occurrences.","Shen Qingsheng was unconscious, Mo Hua stood by."]},{"number":1946,"title":"Chapter 1946 - 945: Snatching People (Part 4)","paragraphs":["The Formation on the gate looked somewhat familiar to Mo Hua, but he had never seen it before, nor had he truly learned it, so he didn’t know the intricacies of these Formations.","He really wanted to see how Mr. Pi would decrypt the Formation, but he was afraid of being suspected by Mr. Pi, so he stood properly without any movement.","Mr. Pi was decrypting the Formation.","Mo Hua just stood there like that.","After an indeterminate amount of time, Mr. Pi seemed to have finally finished his deductions, and he started using a Bronze pen dipped in Ink to delineate the Formation Patterns on the gate.","Mo Hua resisted looking.","But after holding back for a long, long time, Mr. Pi still seemed unfinished, and Mo Hua couldn’t resist anymore, so he glanced lightly out of the corner of his eye.","With just that glance, Mo Hua realized that Mr. Pi had actually finished drawing.","Just that after he finished drawing, the Formation on the gate wasn’t decrypted, and Mr. Pi, puzzled, gravely began to check.","But as he checked over and over, he seemed unable to find the problem.","Mo Hua’s \"Junior Brother\" habit surfaced, and naturally, he started to check the \"homework\" for Mr. Pi too.","After the first check, Mo Hua also didn’t find any problem because after all, he didn’t really know this type of \"Earth Formation\".","But the Dao of Formations is interdisciplinary.","Mo Hua has extremely profound knowledge in Formation expertise, plus, he has a special insight into the Earth Dao Meaning.","Therefore, as he continued to check, he began to explore some insights.","When he checked for the third time, he finally sensed the hint of stagnation in the flow of Spiritual Power in the whole Formation and finally found out where exactly the error was in this Formation.","Mo Hua really wanted to tell Mr. Pi.","But he hesitated, fearing to hurt Mr. Pi’s pride.","After all, having a mistake discovered by someone else in a Formation you drew yourself is quite damaging to one’s pride.","Especially this Mr. Pi, who at first glance, is an experienced elder Formation Master.","This \"junior\" correcting him might be something he couldn’t accept.","So Mo Hua held back once again and kept silent.","He hoped Mr. Pi could find the problem himself.","But Mr. Pi was not living up to expectations.","He furrowed his brows, checking over and over, spending a full hour without realizing where exactly he went wrong in his drawing.","Mo Hua watched, and finally, couldn’t bear it any longer.","He extended his pale finger, pointing to a Pattern in the corner, speaking to Mr. Pi in a very gentle tone:","\"Senior, I don’t really understand... but doesn’t this Pattern look a bit strange?\"","Mr. Pi was taken aback, looked in the direction Mo Hua was pointing, stared at that Pattern, deducing it a few times, and his heart skipped a beat.","He turned his head, glanced at Mo Hua, nodded, and said, \"It’s wrong here.\"","\"Was it really wrong...,\" Mo Hua feigned an innocent look.","\"Little brother, you have a good eye,\" Mr. Pi praised.","Mo Hua scratched his head, a bit embarrassed: \"Just lucky, let senior laugh.\"","Mr. Pi took out the Bronze pen, corrected that Pattern, re-injected Spiritual Power, and sure enough, after a moment, the Formation lit up, the Patterns circulated, causing the Patterns on the gate to break inch by inch.","The Formation on the door was broken, and the gate slowly lifted.","Everyone looked slightly pleased.","\"Let’s go,\" the gray-robed Golden Core said.","Everyone entered the gate in turn.","Mo Hua also followed the group and walked inside.","Mr. Pi was still at the rear; he collected his Bronze pen, Beast Blood Ink, the waste drafts he deduced earlier, and the reference Formation Diagram, then wiped off the Patterns on the gate to prevent them from being stolen.","After doing all this, Mr. Pi then caught up with the group.","Only, when looking at Mo Hua, his face was extremely unpleasant."]},{"number":1947,"title":"Chapter 1947 - 946: Earth Sect","paragraphs":["Mr. Pi’s gaze gradually turned sinister, but it was only for an instant.","Soon, his expression calmed down as if nothing had happened. He took out the Compass again, walked ahead of the group, as usual, observing the Formation, discerning positions, using the Compass for direction, and continued along the passageway.","As they proceeded, the corridor was dark and oppressive, with a strange smell filling the air.","In the darkness, it seemed as if unknown dangers were lurking, the chilling atmosphere was terrifying.","Everyone maintained a vigilant demeanor, not daring to relax even a bit.","Mr. Pi and his team were experienced, seasoned hands, but because of this, they remained highly alert, not daring to be careless at all.","Mo Hua observed the scene, his mind stirred slightly:","It seems that beneath this Solitary Mountain, there truly is an extraordinary tomb buried?","Otherwise, Mr. Pi and his group could not be so meticulous and cautious, as if expecting a formidable challenge...","Mo Hua glanced around again, and couldn’t help but recall Master Gu’s words, silently contemplating:","\"If there truly is a grand tomb, wouldn’t there... truly be ’Evil Objects’ that may have undergone Corpse Transformation or Ghost Transformation?\"","This tomb might indeed be more dangerous than I imagined...","Mo Hua felt a slight chill in his heart, unconsciously moved closer to the tomb robbers, thinking ’Better them than me’, that if there was any danger, let these Golden Core cultivators face it first.","Fortunately, the subsequent journey was temporarily peaceful.","After walking for an hour, the passageway gradually widened, the stone walls became more solid and stood taller and wider, and soon, in front of them appeared a massive tomb gate.","Upon sighting this tomb gate, Mo Hua was momentarily stunned, and then instantly felt a chill in his heart, goosebumps rising.","Not only because the tomb gate was sinister, solemn, and terrifying.","But because it was evidently a...","Water Prison Forbidden Gate!","The whole tomb gate, its structure looked almost identical to the prison gate depicted in the Water Prison Forbidden Map, located on the Water Prison Forbidden Box, the treasure of the Water Prison Sect, used to suppress and punish sinners.","The roof curled like the fangs of a forbidden beast, the walls densely covered with Formation Patterns, resembling the chains of a prison, interconnected.","At the two large doors, the door rings were like a man-eating beast, intimidating those with evil intentions.","On each side of the grand door, a figure was carved, the figure had a human body and a beast head, one a bull head, the other a horse face, each holding a shackle, securely fastening the tomb door, as if suppressing the things inside the tomb, preventing them from escaping to the ground.","The whole tomb gate exuded a sinister majesty.","Mo Hua knew some inside information, therefore the more he looked, the more alarmed he felt, he never expected to see traces of the Water Prison Sect’s legacy in this underground tomb of Solitary Mountain.","Mr. Pi and his group were unaware of the secrets of the Water Prison Sect, but upon seeing the severe tomb gate, they also felt a slight unease.","\"Mr. Hui, it’s kind of strange.\"","\"How could the tomb gate be structured like this...\"","\"Doesn’t it resemble... the gate of the Taoist Prison?\"","\"I was just saying why it looks so familiar... Damn, I spent fifty years in the Taoist Prison, this thing is the last I want to see...\"","\"Don’t you find it peculiar? The tomb gate is the Taoist Prison’s gate, so shouldn’t the tomb be the prison itself?\"","\"Who gets buried wanting to be imprisoned?\"","\"This doesn’t quite match...\"","\"Wasn’t it said that the one buried here is... that person?\"","...","A few whispered to each other nervously.","Mo Hua listened attentively.","After a while, Mr. Pi frowned and said:","\"Now that we’re here, there’s no turning back. We’re here for this job, and with our necks on the line, we don’t have the luxury to pick and choose. Besides, we’ve already taken the rewards, can’t just walk away now?\"","\"That’s right,\" said the Golden Core Cultivator addressed as \"Mr. Hui,\" \"We’re after the stuff inside the tomb, why bother about what’s buried in there.\"","\"I’ve been underground for many years; seen all sorts of strange things. Those who are bold are fed, the timid starve...\"","After speaking, their courage grew a bit.","\"Mr. Pi, open the tomb gate.\" Mr. Hui suggested.","\"Alright.\" Mr. Pi nodded, then as usual, took out the Compass, Bronze Formation Pen, and Formation Paper, and began his calculations.","After calculating for a while, Mr. Pi frowned, turned and said: \"Time to ’invite the guests’ down.\"","Mr. Hui was taken aback, \"Isn’t it a bit early? According to the agreement, only after breaking the gate would we go fetch them to enter the tomb.\"","Mr. Pi pondered for a moment, shook his head: \"This tomb gate is rather tricky, will require additional effort. Plus, we just killed those Shen Family people above, guessing they’ll come for revenge, time is precious, can’t delay, lest things go awry. You go fetch them, I’ll break the Formation.\"","Mr. Hui contemplated for a moment, nodded: \"Alright. ’Rat’ stays with you.\"","Mr. Hui pointed to the short and thin Golden Core with long fingers, who outside had crushed several Shen Family cultivators’ skulls with his bare hands.","The tomb robbers use nicknames underground for discretion, avoiding their real names.","This ’Rat’ is the nickname of a Golden Core tomb robber.","\"Not necessary, ’Rat’ and ’Stone,’ both of you take them, these guests have quite the background, be cautious.\" Mr. Pi said, \"I alone am enough to break the Formation.\"","Mr. Hui didn’t say anything further.","Mr. Pi was a seasoned tomb robber, a secret Earth Formation Master, his cultivation might not be high, but his experience in tombs surpasses theirs.","Mr. Hui knew, even if they perished, Mr. Pi might not die.","\"Alright.\" Mr. Hui nodded.","Mr. Pi took out a piece of paper, drew some lines, marked directions, then handed the drawing to Mr. Hui.","Mr. Hui then took the other two Golden Core cultivators and turned to leave."]},{"number":1948,"title":"Chapter 1948 - 946: Earth Sect (2)","paragraphs":["In the scene, only Mr. Pi, Mo Hua, and the unconscious Shen Qingsheng were left.","Mr. Pi focused intently, working on breaking the Formation on the tomb door.","This time, Mo Hua didn’t sneak a peek, fearing that Mr. Pi might suspect him again. Instead, he just directed his gaze at the tomb door, observing some subtle marks on it, while endless doubts swirled in his mind.","\"Who exactly built this tomb, and who is really buried inside?\"","\"Why does it have the characteristic layout of the Water Prison Sect...?\"","\"Moreover, this tomb door seems like a ’prison gate,’ resonating with the Blood Pupil Skill of the Water Prison Sect... What is the connection here?\"","...","Mo Hua’s brow furrowed tighter and tighter.","After pondering for a moment, he suddenly felt the atmosphere around him turn chilly. The air was terrifyingly quiet, and even the slight friction sound of the Bronze Formation Pen on the paper had disappeared.","Stunned, Mo Hua glanced around, then furrowed his brow.","\"Strange, where did Mr. Pi go...?\"","As Mo Hua was muttering, he accidentally turned around and saw Mr. Pi standing behind him, his face overcast, holding a dagger, stealthily stabbing toward his back.","Mo Hua was so frightened his face turned white. His legs weakened, and he stumbled to the ground.","Luckily, his fall narrowly avoided Mr. Pi’s lethal, seemingly poison-coated, sharp dagger.","Mr. Pi had a peculiar expression, \"This brat, quite lucky...\"","Mo Hua, scared and bewildered, cried out, \"Senior, what are you doing?\"","Mr. Pi gave a fake smile, \"What do you think?\"","\"I...\" Mo Hua said in panic, \"You... you want to kill me?\"","\"Correct, but it’s of no use.\" Mr. Pi said indifferently, taking a step forward, thrusting his right hand toward Mo Hua’s heart.","Mo Hua’s hands and feet were shackled by Second Grade manacles, incapable of resisting. He could only roll on the spot, awkwardly avoiding Mr. Pi’s lethal move, hurriedly speaking:","\"Senior, weren’t you asking for my help? If you kill me, how will I help you?\"","\"That young master of the Shen family can offer tributes for you. Whether you exist or not, it makes no difference.\"","\"One is not enough, better to keep a spare...\" Mo Hua argued.","But Mr. Pi ignored him, intent on killing Mo Hua as the dagger in his hand glinted coldly, targeting Mo Hua’s vital points each time, though Mo Hua narrowly avoided them each time.","Mr. Pi’s temper flared up, realizing the situation, he sneered, \"You’re a slippery one, indeed practiced a good movement technique...\"","Mo Hua focused solely on escaping for his life, paying him no heed.","Mr. Pi slightly smiled, \"However, it ends here.\"","Mo Hua was startled, just about to speak when he felt the ground tremble, the earth’s energy circulating, stones rose up and instantly trapped him within a cage.","It was a Formation.","Although Mo Hua’s hands and feet were bound by shackles, Mr. Pi had, to ensure nothing went wrong, pre-laid a Formation in advance.","Moreover, this Formation, stemming from Earth Formation heritage, was very obscure, impossible for ordinary cultivators or even ordinary Formation Masters to detect.","Trapped by the Formation, Mo Hua looked pale.","Mr. Pi sneered, \"Try running now?\"","Mo Hua looked like a trapped fawn in a snare, his gaze uneasy and frightened, he asked Mr. Pi:","\"Senior, we have no past enmity, why must you kill me?\"","Seeing Mo Hua trapped by his Formation, with no chance of survival, Mr. Pi gave a faint smile, slowly stepping forward, saying:","\"Throughout my life, I’ve traveled far and wide, met numerous cultivators, and realized you are extraordinary with just a glance.\"","\"At first, I merely considered you talented, with a brilliant understanding of Formations. But just now, you pointed out the flaws in my Formation, enough to prove your master is remarkable, your foundation in Formations profoundly deep.\"","Mo Hua replied evasively, \"I was just lucky...\"","Mr. Pi shook his head, \"This is Formation, it’s either you know it or you don’t, luck has nothing to do with it. In the Dao of Formations, even if someone is lucky, it’s based on their strength. Without strength, luck alone is useless.\"","\"I’m not mistaken, you are a Formation genius.\" Mr. Pi stated confidently.","\"Even if I am a Formation genius,\" Mo Hua anxiously said, \"you don’t have to kill me... As a senior in Formations, shouldn’t you treasure talent?\"","Mr. Pi laughed, \"Kid, are you out of your mind? With no connections, no matter how high your talent is, what does it have to do with me?\"","\"You’re not naïve enough to believe that because you’re talented, everyone you meet will cherish talent and teach you Formations, are you?\"","\"This is the Cultivation World, where people are greedy and self-serving. No one will be good to you for no reason.\"","\"Simply too immature...\"","Mo Hua seemed exposed, his face turned even paler, his eyes showing some \"despair\".","Seeing this pitiful sight, Mr. Pi couldn’t help but feel a slight twinge of pity.","Such a handsome young lad, an excellent Formation seedling, was about to die by his hand today.","\"Kid, before you die, I’ll teach you something, so you die knowing why.\"","Mr. Pi held a poison-coated dagger, approaching Mo Hua step by step, with a sinister smile on his face:","\"As a Formation Master traveling in the Cultivation World, remember this: no matter what you do, in a group, it’s best to have only one Formation Master.\"","\"And that Formation Master, preferably, is yourself.\"","\"If you are the only Formation Master, others won’t dare to easily silence you.\"","\"And since you are the only Formation Master, only you understand Formations. Whatever you do, say, whether right or wrong, you are the only one who knows.\""]},{"number":1949,"title":"Chapter 1949 - 946: Earth Sect (Part 3)","paragraphs":["\"You want to kill, cheat people, double-cross, everything is according to your wishes.\"","\"These are the experiences I’ve summarized after hundreds of years, struggling in the Cultivation World, working with various cultivators, licking blood on the blade’s edge, and snatching food from the tiger’s mouth.\"","\"Your Formation is too excellent, I can’t keep you, so you must die.\"","\"Remember, if there’s a next life, make sure to remember this point...\"","Mr. Pi injected Spiritual Power into the dagger, the blade shimmering with a sinister green and deadly glow.","In Mo Hua’s terrified and desperate gaze, Mr. Pi, with a grim smile, effortlessly stabbed the dagger into the chest of this Formation genius.","He was very adept at these movements.","Erasing a Formation genius also gave this shady old Formation Master a dark thrill.","But in just a moment, the grim smile on Mr. Pi’s face suddenly froze.","His dagger pierced Mo Hua’s chest, but no blood flowed out, only a mass of mist.","Mo Hua’s face was no longer filled with fear, no longer despairing. Instead, he eerily smiled at Mr. Pi.","This smile instantly gave Mr. Pi goosebumps.","\"Oh no!\"","Mr. Pi’s eyes widened, and he immediately turned around, but just as his head was halfway turned, a flicker of fire appeared at the corner of his eye.","This flicker of fire was different from ordinary flames.","Deep, eerie, and filled with violent Spiritual Power. Just the faint pressure it emitted made Mr. Pi’s hair stand on end.","What... is this...","Mr. Pi wanted to struggle, but in that split second, he had no chance to react, the burning sensation on his back had already come.","The flames were devouring his flesh.","At the same time, a gentle voice came: \"Thanks for the guidance, senior. Among a group, there can only be one Formation Master. I’ve learned.\"","Mr. Pi’s heart skipped a beat.","At that moment, he was left with only one thought:","\"Damn, overturned. Played the goose, and got pecked in the eye...\"","In the next instant, the flames exploded, raging and rampant, like a condensed fiery dragon, bursting from Mr. Pi’s back, burning his organs, evaporating his blood, piercing right through his chest, carving a trail of blood and fire in the air, whistling out.","Mini Meteorite Skill!","When the fire extinguished, Mr. Pi slowly knelt on the ground, his internal organs were all burned to ash, already devoid of any vitality.","Mr. Pi was dead.","Now, among this group, only one Formation Master remained.","And this Formation Master, naturally, was Mo Hua.","After killing Mr. Pi, Mo Hua turned his head to look to the side.","Beside him, Shen Qingsheng had awakened at some unknown time. Not knowing what he had seen, he was sitting on the ground, his face filled with terror and disbelief.","Mo Hua, with an indifferent expression, gestured for him to keep silent, warning:","\"You saw nothing. Dare say a word, and you’ll die.\"","Shen Qingsheng only felt a chill surge up his heart, couldn’t help but shiver, incredulously thinking:","\"What on earth is this Mo Hua...\"","Mo Hua didn’t bother him, but began thinking about how to clean up afterward.","After a moment of thought, Mo Hua took Mr. Pi’s storage bag and some possibly useful items from him and packed them onto himself.","Then Mo Hua searched nearby and finally found a mechanism at a passage. This mechanism was designed to kill, consisting of a giant stone roller that would crush anyone entering the tomb.","When entering, Mr. Pi had noticed this mechanism, and specifically avoided it.","But now he’s dead, he couldn’t avoid it.","Mo Hua dragged Mr. Pi’s corpse, placing it onto the mechanism’s slot.","In an instant, the mechanism activated, the slot jolted fiercely, flinging Mr. Pi’s body into the air.","A sound of whistling came from afar, three fiery crossbow bolts pierced through the air, with great force, deeply nailing into Mr. Pi’s body, then along with the crossbow bolts, flew to the end of the passage.","At the end was a stone roller, which clamped shut, directly crushing Mr. Pi’s corpse into a meat patty, blood burst out, staining the stone roller.","Mo Hua hurriedly covered his eyes, grumbling inwardly:","\"I don’t know who designed this tomb, so cruel...\"","So cruel that he wasn’t willing to look.","However, Mr. Pi was a tomb robber, disturbing the dead’s peace in life, robbed so many tombs, finally dying from the tomb’s mechanism, was considered a fitting end.","Mo Hua nodded, then retraced his path to the tomb door.","Shen Qingsheng looked at Mo Hua’s figure, as if gazing at a demon.","Mo Hua glanced at him, Shen Qingsheng instantly turned ashen, cradled his head, curled up on the ground, dared not look at Mo Hua again.","Only then was Mo Hua satisfied, then he put back on the Second Grade shackles he had unlocked, carefully restoring the Formation Patterns on the shackles.","Afterward, he sat cross-legged, beginning to check Mr. Pi’s storage bag.","Mr. Pi’s storage bag, he had longed to obtain. Unexpectedly, it came to him so quickly.","This happened because Mr. Pi was too narrow-minded, too impatient.","Mo Hua shook his head, continuing to rummage through the storage bag.","Besides Spirit Stones, Barrier Breaking Pills, Evil Extinguishing Pills, Filth Repelling Pills, and other commonly used tomb entry pills, most were items of Formation Master heritage.","Such as Compass, Jade Slip, Formation Books, Formation Diagram, and so on...","Mo Hua skimmed through them, then suddenly his heart was struck.","This Mr. Pi seemed to be a disciple of the Earth Sect...","His heritage came from Kun State’s Great Sect—Earth Sect.","\"Earth Sect...\"","Mo Hua thought deeply.","This name wasn’t unfamiliar; he even possessed a secret Ultimate Formation from Earth Sect—","A First Grade Eleven Pattern Thick Earth Ultimate Formation.","When learning Thick Earth Ultimate Formation, his mentor seemed to have mentioned some origins of Earth Sect.","Earth Sect is one of the largest sects in Kun State.","How large exactly, his mentor didn’t say. But even with his mentor’s insight, saying this sect is \"very large,\" it’s estimated to be above Fifth grade sect.","And Kun State, like Qian State, is also a large state.","Kun State is more fertile, wealthy families to the extreme.","One of the largest sects in Kun State, its financial power and heritage might be stronger than the Four Great Sects of the Qianxue State Boundary.","Of course, there’s one thing about Earth Sect that left a deep impression on Mo Hua.","It’s that diagram, said to be Earth Sect’s treasure, passed down for tens of thousands of years, containing strong Taoist Meaning, invaluable, thus coveted by the Taoist Court, had to split in two ancient Contemplation Map—","\"Emperor Heaven and Earth Diagram\"!"]},{"number":1950,"title":"Chapter 1950 - 947: \"Guests","paragraphs":["The origins of the Emperor Heaven and Earth Diagram are truly grand.","During his travels, Mo Hua remembers his master once spoke much about the origins of the Emperor Heaven and Earth Diagram. At that time, he was inexperienced and not deeply affected. Now, upon careful reflection, the more he thinks about it, the more alarmed he becomes.","What is called the Contemplation Map reflects the Divine Thought of others or some other type of existence.","In other words, what can be contemplated in the map is the \"Dao\" of others, or perhaps the \"Dao\" of some Non-Human existences...","Mo Hua, using Divine Sense to Prove the Dao, understands that the deeper one delves into Divine Sense, the more one realizes the profound mysteries it contains.","To date, none of the Contemplation Maps he has seen are simple.","Not to mention one of the largest sects in Kun State, the Earth Sect’s sect-protecting treasure, passed down for millennia—what it truly contains, no one knows.","Even the Earth Sect itself probably doesn’t fully understand.","It could be an ancient Taoist Meaning, or possibly some more horrifying unknown existence.","Mo Hua still remembers his master previously saying that this Emperor Heaven and Earth Diagram, although the Earth Sect’s treasure, violates the Taoist Court’s taboo due to the words \"Emperor Heaven.\"","No matter how large the Earth Sect is, it is only a sect in Kun State and can revere the \"Earth,\" but cannot be termed \"Emperor Heaven.\"","Therefore, this Emperor Heaven and Earth Diagram was forcibly split by the old monsters of the Taoist Court into the \"Emperor Heaven Diagram\" and the \"Earth Diagram.\"","The \"Emperor Heaven Diagram\" is enshrined in the Taoist Court, while the \"Earth Diagram\" is hidden in the Earth Sect.","The Emperor Heaven and Earth Diagram has been passed down for over ten thousand years, and the Taoist Meaning within is undoubtedly terrifying.","But within the Taoist Court, those old monsters, alive for tens of thousands of years with cultivation that reaches the heavens, are the truly terrifying ones...","Could the old monsters in the Taoist Court, with sky-high cultivation, be... beyond the Heaven Void?","Mo Hua felt a chill in his heart.","The waters of the Cultivation World are indeed too deep, and the heavens of the Cultivation World are equally too high. He doesn’t know if in this lifetime, he could ever cultivate to such a realm...","Moreover...","\"I don’t know if I’ll ever have the chance to see the Emperor Heaven and Earth Diagram. If I can’t see the Taoist Court’s Emperor Heaven Diagram, perhaps I could at least see the Earth Sect’s Earth Diagram if there’s a chance...\"","As for the complete Emperor Heaven and Earth Diagram...","His master’s half-joking, meaningful words echoed in Mo Hua’s ears:","\"One day, if you can make the Earth Sect bow their heads in submission, and contend equally with the Taoist Court, merging the Emperor Heaven Diagram and the Earth Diagram might not be impossible.\"","Mo Hua shook his head.","These words, he used to listen to casually.","Now that he’s entered the Qianxue State Boundary and seen so many powerful cultivators, broadening his perspective, he feels this idea is really too arrogant, too disrespectful.","His master may joke, but he could never take it seriously.","Mo Hua set aside these thoughts and suddenly recalled Mr. Pi.","\"So, this Mr. Pi should be a defector disciple of the Earth Sect?\"","After all, a genuine Earth Sect disciple, no matter what, wouldn’t engage in tomb raiding.","Then why did he defect from the sect?","Was he expelled for wrongdoing, or... like Boss Jiang, did he steal some sort of inheritance?","Mo Hua’s eyes lit up, and he immediately searched through his storage bag again, then sighed helplessly:","\"I was thinking too much...\"","He still held a faint hope that Mr. Pi defected because he stole the \"Earth Diagram\" or at least some clues related to it.","Now it seems, indeed, it was wishful thinking.","The existence of the Earth Diagram is such that ordinary disciples probably don’t even have the eligibility to see it.","But without the Earth Diagram, Mo Hua discovered another peculiar item:","A talisman tooth.","This talisman tooth resembles a claw clad in dark gold and light silver, or a polished tooth.","The front end of the claw or tooth is sharp and translucent, emitting a faint fluorescence. The back end is inlaid with gold and silver and has two carved words:","Mo Jin.","\"Mo Jin Talisman?\"","Mo Hua’s heart skipped slightly, and then he carefully inspected this talisman tooth from all angles.","It’s a pity he doesn’t quite understand this field, unable to discern much about it, but he vaguely knows that this talisman tooth must be very valuable; otherwise, it wouldn’t be at the very bottom of Mr. Pi’s storage bag.","Without hesitation, Mo Hua directly placed this ancient Mo Jin Talisman into his Storage Ring.","Whatever its purpose, the item is his now anyway.","The remaining formation diagrams, formation books, a bronze pen, and so on, Mo Hua thought for a moment and ultimately didn’t touch them, placing everything back in Mr. Pi’s storage bag.","Time was short; he simply didn’t have the chance to examine everything carefully.","Sure enough, after a while, extremely light footsteps came from afar, barely audible, yet the auras were complex, as if a group of people had arrived.","Mo Hua was a bit surprised.","Did Mr. Pi’s so-called \"guests\" comprise more than one person?","Does it require so many people to raid a tomb?","While puzzling over this, as the distant figures approached, a quick glance from Mo Hua revealed there were up to seven people.","Besides the three tomb raiders, including \"Mr. Hui,\" there were four \"guests.\"","These four guests were all draped in black robes.","Among them, two hulking men, tall and strong, had to lower their heads while walking through the corridor.","There was an elderly man.","And a young man.","All four were tightly clad in black robes, keeping their auras concealed; the only exception was the young cultivator.","Though he was wrapped in a black robe, his face was revealed—fair-skinned, handsome features, and a slightly arrogant demeanor, appearing to be a pampered young master from some family.","Yet Mo Hua had never seen him and had no particular impression of him.","As for these black-robed cultivators, despite the black robes blocking Divine Sense, Mo Hua instinctively judged them all to be Golden Core cultivators.","Four Golden Cores in total...","Mo Hua felt a slight heaviness in his heart, accompanied by some confusion.","These four \"guests\" appeared peculiar in every way. He couldn’t quite grasp the relationship between them."]},{"number":1951,"title":"Chapter 1951 - 947: \"Guests\" (Part 2)","paragraphs":["The four black-robed cultivators arriving, are they a young lord with three guards?","Or are they elders from the family, bringing disciples for training?","Mo Hua was pondering this as the group had already approached.","Mr. Hui led the way in the front and politely said: \"Rest assured, dear guests, everything is prepared properly, just waiting for Mr. Pi to break open the tomb entrance...\"","Before he could finish speaking, Mr. Hui froze.","The tomb entrance was tightly shut, the front was empty except for Mo Hua in shackles and Shen Qingsheng bound in chains; Mr. Pi was nowhere to be seen.","\"Where is Mr. Pi?\" Mr. Hui glanced around, asking Mo Hua.","Mo Hua whispered: \"Seems... dead.\"","Mr. Hui opened his mouth, his mind momentarily blank.","No... dead? How did he die?","Why did he die?","In good spirits, only a moment’s turn, having just brought the guests over, Mr. Pi died without a sound?","For a moment, he didn’t know how to face this abstract fact.","Mr. Hui frowned and asked Mo Hua: \"How did Mr. Pi die? Where did he die?\"","Mo Hua pointed towards the adjacent corridor.","The crowd looked in that direction, only then spotting a stone roller in the darkness at the corridor’s end.","Mr. Pi had already been ground into pulp, his blood nearly congealed...","\"Mr. Pi was deciphering the formation when a strange noise came from the corridor’s end, and then he seemed possessed, willingly walked into the corridor, activated the mechanism, and ended up like this...\"","Mo Hua said with a sentimental face about the lie he just fabricated.","The crowd found it hard to believe.","Mr. Pi’s three companions were especially skeptical.","\"Mr. Pi, such a character, could not have died so simply...\"","\"Go examine the corpse, see exactly how Mr. Pi died, there must be clues on him.\"","\"That’s a tomb mechanism, do you want to die like Mr. Pi?\"","\"I am a Golden Core.\"","\"What of a Golden Core? Things in the tomb are not that simple...\"","During their dispute, the tomb robber named \"Rat\" suddenly said: \"No,\" pointing at Mo Hua, \"this kid, definitely didn’t tell the truth. Supposedly, Mr. Pi was killed by him.\"","Mo Hua silently raised his shackled arm, indicating how could he kill anyone with shackles?","Rat squinted his eyes.","Mr. Hui also said in a deep tone:","\"With Mr. Pi’s skills, you and I both know clearly, how could he be killed by a mere boy?\"","Mo Hua nodded repeatedly.","\"However...\"","Mr. Hui turned to look at Mo Hua, suspecting he didn’t speak truthfully either. He pondered for a moment, then looked towards Shen Qingsheng, gripping his neck and asked him in a deep voice:","\"You tell me, how did Mr. Pi die?\"","\"I...\" Shen Qingsheng stammered.","Mo Hua subtly glanced at Shen Qingsheng.","Shen Qingsheng immediately trembled, frightened said: \"I... I don’t know, I fainted, I saw nothing...\"","By now, Shen Qingsheng understood.","This tomb, filled with evil men.","Mo Hua looks innocent, but is cruel and treacherous, no less than these Golden Core bandits, if he could kill Mr. Pi, he could kill him too.","At this juncture, only by insisting on knowing nothing could he find a way to live.","And he still had use, Mr. Hui temporarily couldn’t really kill him.","\"Damn...\"","Seeing Shen Qingsheng cowering, Mr. Hui cursed, feeling frustrated.","He never expected such a bad start; a key person died before even entering the tomb, and it was Mr. Pi who died.","Rat approached Mr. Hui, looking at Mo Hua said:","\"Second Master, I still think, this kid is not honest, should we apply some torture to make him tell the truth?\"","Mr. Hui’s expression shifted.","Mo Hua mentally noted down this meddlesome \"Rat\".","Just you, the short pesky one.","Seeing Mr. Hui with some intention, seemingly wanting to torture, Mo Hua said: \"You can’t torture me!\"","\"Why not?\" Mr. Hui raised his eyebrows, asking.","Mo Hua retorted: \"Do you have a Formation Master?\"","Mr. Hui frowned, \"What do you mean?\"","Mo Hua said: \"Mr. Pi was the only Formation Master, he’s dead, you have no one else who knows formations, without formations, how will you open the tomb entrance, after entering the tomb, encountering other formation killing traps, what will you do?\"","Mr. Hui was stumped, looking at Mo Hua, then said: \"Mr. Pi’s formation isn’t any ordinary formation, don’t tell me, at such a young age, you know it too?\"","\"I know a bit.\" Mo Hua said.","\"Nonsense,\" Rat sneered, \"that’s Mr. Hu’s exclusive formation, how could you know it?\"","\"You said it’s ’exclusive’ formation, not ’unique’. Formations are vast and profound, originated from complex sources, his formation isn’t the only one.\" Mo Hua argued confidently.","Mr. Hui and others fell silent.","The formation area has always been Mr. Pi’s responsibility, they indeed didn’t understand much.","Mr. Pi treated his legacy as treasures, never sharing any formation matters with them.","Currently, Mo Hua was the only one left knowing formations.","But Mo Hua is an outsider, and seemed too inexperienced...","Mr. Hui hesitated.","At this moment, among the black-robed cultivators, the handsome young gentleman spoke: \"Can you still open this tomb entrance?\"","His cold words revealed some dissatisfaction.","Mr. Hui trembled internally, knowing due to their group’s negligence, these \"prestigious guests\" were unhappy.","This was a big business deal.","And these prestigious guests, with substantial wealth and influence, absolutely must not be offended."]},{"number":1952,"title":"Chapter 1952 - 947: \"Guest\" (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Never mind...","Mr. Hui looked at Mo Hua and asked: \"This burial gate, can you open it?\"","Mo Hua confidently said: \"Naturally.\"","\"Good...\" Mr. Hui had just nodded when a Golden Core cultivator with a sharp face and the nickname \"Mouse\" approached him and whispered something in his ear.","Mr. Hui’s expression tensed, and he nodded.","Mouse walked up to Mo Hua and snatched Mr. Pi’s storage bag from him.","In front of Mo Hua, Mouse’s eyes gleamed with greed as he turned the storage bag inside out, but he seemed not to find what he was looking for. His face turned vicious, looking at Mo Hua:","\"Kid, where’s that thing?\"","Mo Hua looked puzzled, \"What thing?\"","\"That... Mo...\"","Mouse held back, swallowing his words.","\"What?\" Mo Hua asked.","Mouse’s gaze became more venomous, \"It must be you, who took that thing. Hand over your storage bag and let me check it.\"","Mo Hua was defiant, \"Why should you search my storage bag?\"","Mouse sneered, and then disregarding Mo Hua’s opposition, directly snatched his storage bag.","Most contents in Mo Hua’s storage bag were Formation Diagrams and Formation Books.","Mouse couldn’t understand them at all.","Besides, there were some Pills, Spirit Stones, and some small gifts from others.","Mouse rummaged through and couldn’t find what he desired, hence he looked towards Mr. Hui.","Mr. Hui frowned, glanced at the four black-robed cultivators nearby, showing caution, then said:","\"Forget it, business is important, we’ll talk about that thing later.\"","Mouse had no choice but to relent.","Mo Hua then said: \"Return my storage bag.\"","Mouse sneered and returned the storage bag to Mo Hua, but before doing so, he withheld the Spirit Stones and some valuable spiritual objects from it.","On the surface, Mo Hua looked \"angry yet silent,\" already viewing Mouse as a dead person in his heart.","Mr. Hui took out a pot of wine, walked to Mr. Pi’s corpse, and poured the wine on the ground, chanting:","\"Life and death are destined, Mr. Pi, rest in peace.\"","Mr. Hui’s voice was low.","But in this trade, emotions were indifferent, and no genuine friendship existed.","Alive, everyone drank and ate meat, dead, less one person to work, less one person to share Spirit Stones.","At most, there might be a bit of mourning, but nothing too sentimental.","After Mr. Pi’s mourning, the matter was put aside, and Mr. Hui turned to Mo Hua: \"Open the burial gate. If you can open it, we’ll ensure you survive. But if you can’t, you’ll have to accompany Mr. Pi.\"","A helpful Formation Master is a good Formation Master.","If you can’t help, you’re just a dead person.","Thus, under the gaze of everyone, Mo Hua approached the burial gate, attempting to decipher the formation on it.","But the formation on the burial gate was unfamiliar Earth Formation, and Mo Hua, after looking for a moment, still couldn’t move. After a while, he reached out to Mr. Hui:","\"Give me Mr. Pi’s storage bag.\"","Mr. Hui’s gaze narrowed, \"Why do you need the storage bag?\"","\"I want to check the Formation Diagram.\"","\"Check the Formation Diagram?\"","\"Yes,\" Mo Hua nodded, \"Some formations I’m unfamiliar with, need to learn.\"","Mr. Hui felt a pulse on his forehead, stunned: \"What... you’re learning it now?\"","After all this, was this kid bluffing?","He didn’t know the formation on the burial gate at all!","Mo Hua justified himself, \"Otherwise? Who is born knowing everything? If you don’t know, you must learn!\"","Mr. Hui was speechless, he pointed at Mouse and said, \"Give him the storage bag, let him learn.\"","Mouse’s eyes flickered, a little reluctant, but due to the circumstances, he still passed the storage bag to Mo Hua.","Mo Hua took Mr. Pi’s storage bag, retrieved some Formation Books and Diagrams from it, and started flipping through them in front of everyone.","Mr. Hui and the others just watched Mo Hua without saying anything.","But Mo Hua knew, if he could break the Earth Formation and open the burial gate, it’d be fine. Otherwise, they’d be the first to kill him.","Mo Hua calmed down, patiently perusing Mr. Pi’s Formation Books.","Once involved with formations, Mo Hua quickly entered the zone, studying intently.","After an hour, Mo Hua had roughly understood Mr. Pi’s Earth Formation legacy.","The so-called Earth Formation is related to the earth, and there is a commonality with the Earth Formation in the Five Elements Formation.","Earth is associated with the land, but the Earth Formation is simpler.","After all, the earth carries everything, not just a layer of \"soil\" on top.","The Earth Sect’s Earth Formation is a notch higher than the Earth Formation, its formation principles profound, almost infinitely close to the Eight Trigrams’ \"Kun\" Formation.","But this kind of Earth Formation should be somewhat inferior to the actual \"Kun\" Formation of the Eight Trigrams, otherwise, it would not be called \"Earth Formation\" but directly \"Kun Formation\".","In the Eight Trigrams, Qian Formation and Kun Formation preside over the heavens and earth’s patterns, possibly having a lineage with Taoist Court’s Three Talents Formation, very seldom has their legacy spread outside.","Earth Formation learning is vastly more profound than the Five Elements Earth Formation.","Such formations are related to the Taoist Meaning of the earth, entry-level isn’t hard, but truly comprehending them is extremely difficult.","Mo Hua was the opposite.","He learned the First Grade Eleven Pattern Thick Earth Formation, communicated with the earth’s Taoist Meaning, proficiently mastered Drawing Ground into Formation, often painting formations on the ground.","Thus, he had an affinity with the land far beyond ordinary cultivators.","The most challenging aspect of Earth Formation, for Mo Hua, was instead not difficult.","What was hard for him was the lack of legacy, lack of Formation Diagrams, unable to get started.","As long as he learned some basics, crossed the threshold of Earth Formation, once in, it would be smooth sailing, learning faster and faster.","This is the advantage of a solid formation foundation.","Also, after understanding the Ultimate Formation, communicating with Taoist Meaning, the benefit of complexity first, ease later.","After an hour, Mo Hua’s eyes sparkled, and then mimicking Mr. Pi’s actions, simultaneously looked at the Earth Formation Compass and took out a Bronze Formation Pen, dipped in Spiritual Ink, and began sketching on the burial gate.","Mr. Hui and the others didn’t really notice anything.","Instead, a black-robed young man watching Mo Hua showed an unexpected expression, his pupils quivered.","Mo Hua, using the Bronze Formation Pen, completed the formation on the burial gate, checked it over, felt it was fine, then opened the Formation Book, according to its instructions, inked with the pen, sketched some Formation Patterns to activate the formation.","A dim light flashed, and the breaking formation patterns lit one by one.","The sealed patterns broke inch by inch.","The burial gate also slightly vibrated.","Moments later, accompanied by an aged, rusty, coppery sound, the bronze burial gate slowly opened a crack, and a chill seeped through the door gap.","\"It really opened...\"","Not only Mr. Hui and the three, but even the four black-robed cultivators also glanced at Mo Hua amazed.","Mo Hua systematically collected the Formation Book, Formation Diagram, Bronze Pen, Compass into his storage bag.","Then matter-of-factly claimed Mr. Pi’s storage bag as his own.","Mr. Hui and the others paused but didn’t say anything further, including Mouse, who dared not object to Mo Hua.","Among cultivators, strength speaks volumes.","Know formations, break formations, and open gates—those are measures of strength.","At this point, an elder from the black-robed cultivators said hoarsely like wind through sand:","\"No time to waste, open the gate.\"","The esteemed guest spoke, Mr. Hui didn’t dare to delay. He walked to the burial gate, grabbed the Oxhead and Horseface door knocker, and forcefully pulled it to the sides.","The burial gate slowly opened.","Beyond the gate, empty, pitch-black, exuding a chilling unease, coupled with an almost suffocating oppressive feeling.","Meanwhile, low growling sounds emerged.","An overwhelming scent of evil spirits wafted in."]},{"number":1953,"title":"Chapter 1953 - 948: Shen Shouxing","paragraphs":["Evil Spirit...","Mo Hua’s gaze slightly stiffened.","This evil aura was extremely intense, extremely cold, filled with despair, and was very similar to the aura he had sensed in the Evil Embryo dream signs.","But unlike before, when he sensed this aura, Mo Hua did not feel the \"hunger\" of his Divine Soul; instead, he felt a sense of \"nausea.\"","He could now initially determine that beneath Solitary Mountain, there must be an Evil Embryo being nurtured.","However, the method of nurturing this Evil Embryo might be different from any before...","Mo Hua’s expression gradually became serious.","It’s not just him; Mr. Hui, Mouse, and Stone, the three tomb raiders, also shivered and exchanged glances.","\"Sir, this tomb, the aura seems a bit off...\"","Stone, who was short and sturdy with solid muscles and spoke little along the way, said in a low voice to Mr. Hui.","Mr. Hui frowned.","In all his years of tomb raiding, he had never encountered such a peculiar tomb.","But remembering what the \"client\" said about this tomb’s origins and the tomb owner’s identity, he slowly felt relieved at heart.","The bigger the tomb, the less it could be judged by common sense.","\"Let’s go in then,\" said Mr. Hui.","\"Alright.\"","Stone nodded; he was merely expressing some doubts, saying it in passing.","Thieves never leave empty-handed; the tomb door was open, and he couldn’t just turn back now.","\"Little Brother,\" Mr. Hui turned his head and looked at Mo Hua, \"please go ahead.\"","Mo Hua’s face turned pale, and he became a bit nervous, \"It’s so eerie inside, I’m... a bit scared, can I not go in?\"","Mr. Hui looked at Mo Hua coldly.","Mo Hua sighed resignedly, \"Alright...\"","He then took a step and entered the tomb door, with Mr. Hui closely following beside him.","Stone and Mouse followed.","Finally, the four black-robed cultivators, they exchanged a glance, with deep eyes holding various thoughts in the dark, then filed into the pitch-black tomb entrance.","...","Inside the tomb entrance, it was a complete shadow.","This was a more intense darkness.","Mo Hua squinted for a moment, then adapted to the darkness in front of him.","But in the darkness, there wasn’t anything particularly special, still the same as outside, a long passageway that stretched endlessly and deep and closed-off darkness.","And these passageways were similarly all-encompassing.","Mr. Hui looked at Mo Hua and said in a low voice, \"Little Brother, lead the way.\"","Mo Hua imitated \"Mr. Pi,\" holding a Compass in one hand, pretending to gesture with the other hand, while his eyes shone slightly, releasing his Divine Sense to sense the flow of Earth Formation forces around to guide everyone.","This was originally \"Mr. Pi’s\" job.","But Mr. Pi was right; among the group, there couldn’t be two Formation Masters.","Now that Mr. Pi was dead, Mo Hua, who was proficient in formation techniques, naturally had to take over and guide everyone.","Thus, Mo Hua led the way at the front, identifying the direction according to the formations, guiding everyone forward.","But after walking for quite a while, the surroundings were still passageways, with no end in sight.","Mo Hua frowned, unable to help but sigh at how large this tomb really was.","Could it be that Solitary Mountain really buried some remarkable cultivator?","But on second thought, it seemed unlikely.","Solitary Mountain was just a Third-Grade State Boundary, still a \"backwater\" mountain city, how could such an extraordinary cultivator be buried in a place like this...","But after pondering for a moment, Mo Hua still felt something was amiss.","Again, the issue was that this tomb was too large for an ordinary cultivator to be buried here.","Moreover, if the tomb of Solitary Mountain was insignificant, these tomb raiders and those four black-robed cultivators wouldn’t come to this tomb?","Together, these people amounted to seven Golden Cores!","Golden Cores aren’t easy to cultivate; in small state boundaries’ small families and sects, a Golden Core Cultivator could be considered a patriarch.","Seven Golden Cores, anywhere, would be a formidable force.","Mo Hua’s heart became filled with more doubts.","Furthermore, he was also unclear about the purpose of this group of people.","Mr. Pi and his companions were easier to understand, they were tomb raiders, even if they had many schemes, ultimately, it was for tomb raiding.","But those four black-robed cultivators weren’t likely that simple.","That young black-robed youth didn’t just look young; he was genuinely young.","At such a young age, to be a Golden Core Cultivator, requires not just talent, but also resources and inheritance; he definitely has a significant background.","The other three, shrouded in black robes, suppressing their aura.","When they first met, Mo Hua hadn’t noticed. But along the way, the faint pressure they unconsciously exuded carried a murderous aura throughout.","Mo Hua could determine that these three black-robed cultivators were not ordinary Golden Cores; their cultivation must be more than Initial Golden Core.","\"Who exactly are these people?\"","Mo Hua frowned.","While holding the Compass, observing the formations, discerning the direction, he contemplated inwardly, trying to figure out the identity of these people.","But after thinking for a while, he was still clueless.","These four black-robed figures were tightly wrapped, revealing nothing, with too few clues.","The one young man who showed his face, Mo Hua didn’t recognize.","\"Should I... calculate?\"","\"To see what their true identities are?\"","After pondering for a moment, Mo Hua couldn’t suppress his curiosity, touched his thumb, took out a Copper Coin from the Storage Ring, slightly rubbed it, and conducted a calculation.","But he didn’t dare to calculate much, only slightly touching the Copper Coin, skimming the surface for a sliver, and immediately stopped.","This was within the tomb passage, surrounded by Golden Core level desperadoes.","He was being watched and didn’t dare to make any grand gestures; otherwise, it would be easily detected by others."]},{"number":1954,"title":"Chapter 1954 - 948: Shen Shouxing (2)","paragraphs":["Moreover, he didn’t dare to calculate too deeply.","The longer he engaged with the ways of the heavenly secret, the clearer Mo Hua became. The Way of Cause and Effect was mysterious and unpredictable.","The more you calculate, the more you know, the more traces you leave behind, increasing the probability of being calculated by others, and naturally, more secrets will be spied upon.","Many things are mutual.","You are peering into cause and effect, and cause and effect are watching you as well...","So now, when faced with truly significant matters, Mo Hua actually dared not recklessly calculate, fearing that powerful forces were at play behind these matters, and in making such a move, he would be caught by the tail.","Mo Hua even had a constant feeling that, unknowingly, he had already been caught by the tail, but because he was too insignificant, he hadn’t been worth the attention of those powerful beings and thus hadn’t been pursued.","Therefore, regarding these four black-robed cultivators, Mo Hua only wiped around the edges, calculating a little bit of cause and effect.","Yet just that little bit was enough to startle Mo Hua.","As he fumbled with the patterns on the Copper Coin, a wave of intense familiarity surged in Mo Hua’s heart. The connections of cause and effect were murky, as if these four black-robed cultivators had some ties with him.","In a certain sense, they could be considered ’acquaintances.’","Mo Hua became even more puzzled.","\"How is this possible... What cause and effect could I have with them?\"","Leaving aside the other three, at least regarding that black-robed gentleman, Mo Hua could confirm he absolutely did not know him.","Even his aura was very unfamiliar.","So unfamiliar that Mo Hua could nearly be certain he wasn’t a cultivator from the Qian Learning State Boundary, but someone from afar.","Mo Hua frowned even more deeply.","\"If there’s a chance later, I really want to see who you all are...\" Mo Hua thought to himself silently.","For now, though, it’s best to remain inactive.","This Solitary Mountain tomb is too eerie, and who knows what dangers lurk within. Alone, he certainly couldn’t reach the deepest part.","Mr. Hui and his three companions are experienced tomb robbers.","The four black-robed cultivators have strong cultivation and impenetrable strength.","All I need to do is stick with them.","No matter what dangers lie within this tomb, they are the seven Golden Cores at the forefront, and if anyone is to die, it’ll be them first.","All I need to do is keep my distance and avoid getting splattered by their blood.","Being the only Formation Master among them, unless it comes down to the very last moment, they likely won’t ’kill the donkey when the grinding is done.’","Having thought this through, Mo Hua nodded slightly, then stopped overthinking and focused on leading the way.","After traveling for a bit further, avoiding some tomb traps, they came upon another gate.","The gate was densely covered with Formation Patterns, more complex than those outside.","Previously, Mo Hua hadn’t noticed, but ever since seeing the tomb gate outside, engraved with the Seven Souls Blood Prison and guarded by Oxhead and Horseface, he felt this current gate seemed more like a prison gate.","The entire corridor felt like a passage within a Taoist Prison.","They were not only in a tomb but also within a ’Taoist Prison.’","Mo Hua shook his head and began breaking the Formation.","When it came to breaking formations, he was much more adept and quicker than Mr. Pi, not even needing Formation Paper for a ’draft,’ as he could compute it in his mind.","But to keep a low profile, he still took out the bronze pen and Formation Paper, imitating Mr. Pi, calculating the Formation Patterns’ interactions diligently on the paper.","Occasionally making mistakes, scribbling, and erasing.","After a while, he scratched his head, stopped his pen, put on a troubled look as if racking his brains without finding a solution.","Seeing Mo Hua’s unreliable appearance, Mr. Hui’s trio was a bit anxious, afraid he wouldn’t solve it, delaying their tomb-robbing venture.","Thus, despite Mo Hua’s scribbling and dragging at the gate, no one dared to interrupt his thought process.","Mr. Hui’s trio held their breath, while the four black-robed cultivators remained silent.","After an unknown duration, Mo Hua suddenly brightened up, appearing excited: \"I figured it out!\"","Mr. Hui’s group exhaled in relief.","Mo Hua, holding the bronze Formation Pen, carefully inscribed the Formation Patterns he had laboriously calculated onto the gate.","One by one, the Formation Patterns lit up, and the Sealing Patterns broke apart.","Subsequently, with a rusty creak, the gate finally began to open slowly.","Mr. Hui was slightly surprised, turning to glance deeply at Mo Hua, thinking:","\"This guy looks unreliable, but unexpectedly, his understanding of formations is so high, able to grasp Mr. Pi’s formation just like that...\"","\"With Mr. Pi already dead, maybe... we should keep this kid?\"","\"Make him change his appearance, pick a new nickname, and become a tomb robber, deciphering formations for us underground.\"","\"However, he might not be willing...\"","Mr. Hui looked at Mo Hua and instantly had an idea:","\"It seems he’s still a novice. Once we’re out, let’s find a few prostitutes to introduce him to indulgence.\"","\"Young people, full of Blood Qi, once they taste indulgence, there’s no turning back. By then, delighted by the thrill, he’ll willingly serve me.\"","\"If he doesn’t appreciate the opportunity, we’ll lock him up, beat him like a dog a few times, starve him for a few days...\"","\"By combining favor and intimidation, he won’t dare refuse.\"","\"These days, Formation Masters are all talents, especially since this kid is different from Mr. Pi; he’s a genius Formation Master with life in my hands...\"","Mr. Hui’s heart grew warm, a cold glint flashing in his eyes.","Mo Hua felt a chill run down his spine but pretended to know nothing, wiped the sweat from his forehead, and sighed deeply:","\"The gate is open, we can proceed forward now.\"","\"Good, thank you, young brother.\"","Mr. Hui’s tone had become significantly gentler."]},{"number":1955,"title":"Chapter 1955 - 948: Shen Shouxing_3","paragraphs":["Afterward, it was still Mo Hua holding the Compass, leading the way in front, with everyone surrounding Mo Hua, stepping further into the depths of the tomb.","...","Solitary Mountain, on the barren ridge.","Fan Jin and Master Gu wore grim expressions.","The Taoist Court, the Shen Family, and people from the Refinery Shop were clearing away the surrounding gravel.","Beneath the gravel lay a layer of dark red blood, which had already seeped into the soil.","The ground was littered with dismembered limbs.","These cultivators died tragically.","After roughly clearing the scene, the Enforcement Leader walked over and cupped his hands, saying:","\"Reporting to the Supervisor, all the deceased are Shen Family cultivators, including two Golden Cores and several Foundation Building Cultivators. But there was no ’Mo’ Young Master as described by the Supervisor, nor the Shen Family’s Young Master Qing...\"","Fan Jin and Master Gu both secretly breathed a sigh of relief, but the clouds of worry on their faces did not dissipate.","Because Mo Hua and Young Master Qing were still missing.","And the \"murderers\" had also vanished without a trace.","Even more terrifying, these murderers were able to slay two Shen Family Golden Cores, indicating that this group had power above the Golden Core level.","This was simply not a problem the Solitary Mountain Taoist Court could handle.","In the face of such formidable assassins, Young Master Mo and Shen Qingsheng were unlikely to escape, and it was highly probable they had been kidnapped.","If they couldn’t be rescued, it would certainly be a life-and-death situation.","In Master Gu’s heart, the life or death of Shen Qingsheng was inconsequential; the main concern was Mo Hua, who was a benefactor of the Refinery Shop and couldn’t meet with any misfortune.","In Fan Jin’s view, Mo Hua was a high disciple of Taixu Gate, and Shen Qingsheng was a direct descendant of the Shen Family; if anything happened to either of them, it would be a huge problem for him as the Supervisor.","From then on, not to mention any further advancement, even continuing as Supervisor was uncertain.","\"Do you know the whereabouts of the murderers?\" Fan Jin asked.","\"A mine was discovered nearby, with traces of a Formation at the edge of the mine.\" The Enforcement Leader reported.","\"Quickly!\" Fan Jin commanded, \"Take me there.\"","The Enforcement Leader led Fan Jin to the mine, and sure enough, there were some scattered footprints in a corner, along with marks of a Formation sealing.","\"Can you break it?\" Fan Jin asked.","\"No,\" the Enforcement Leader replied, \"The Shen Family Formation Master has inspected it. This passage is narrow, and the stone walls are fragile. If the Formation is broken, the stone walls will collapse, completely blocking the stone path entrance. People outside won’t get in, and those inside won’t get out.\"","\"Damn...\" Fan Jin frowned, unable to help cursing, then asked, \"What about this mine? Where does it lead?\"","\"The mine is also blocked.\"","\"Then go find the mine map to see if there is a mine that leads underground.\"","\"This...\" The Enforcement Leader showed a bitter expression, \"The mine maps nearby are kept by the Shen Family and are not allowed to be seen by outsiders.\"","Fan Jin paused, his brow furrowing even tighter.","Master Gu glanced at the mine, then at the nearby mountain terrain, his pupils slightly trembling, he pondered:","\"Let’s make a trip to the Shen Family to see if we can request the mine maps.\"","Fan Jin thought for a moment, then sighed, \"Alright, we have no choice but to make a trip.\"","Just as they were about to set off, a commotion arose in the distance, and a large group of people approached. Leading them was a man with ordinary looks but an imposing presence and an unusual demeanor. It was the Shen Family’s Late Golden Core Stage Powerful Elder, Shen Shouxing.","\"Shen Shouxing...\"","Fan Jin and the others exchanged a glance, their expressions growing even more grave.","Although Shen Shouxing had not reached Feather Transformation, due to his numerous contributions to the Shen Family, he held significant power.","Solitary Mountain had always been under Shen Shouxing’s responsibility.","And now, his son had gone missing here, possibly even murdered.","Shen Shouxing, of course, had to come personally.","But his personal arrival also meant that this matter had escalated, and without an explanation, it was hard to say how it would end.","But since trouble had come, there was no avoiding it.","Fan Jin braced himself and cupped his hands, \"Elder Shen.\"","\"Supervisor Fan,\" Shen Shouxing’s voice was cold, but he clearly suppressed his anger, \"What exactly happened?\"","Fan Jin could only say, \"A group of tomb robbers suddenly appeared here at Solitary Mountain. While digging the mountain, they presumably encountered Young Master Qing, and a conflict erupted. This group of tomb robbers is no small matter; they killed all of Young Master Qing’s guards. It’s very likely that Young Master Qing was also captured by them and is now...missing...\"","After Fan Jin finished speaking, he noticed Shen Shouxing’s face had turned ominously dark, \"Are you saying... tomb robbers?\"","\"Yes...\"","Initially, Fan Jin didn’t think much of it, but upon reflection, he felt a chill down his spine.","He realized he might have fallen into a deep pit; the matter he wanted to avoid had unwittingly found its way to him.","But Fan Jin controlled himself, showing no signs of abnormality.","Shen Shouxing’s thoughts were not on Fan Jin but after thinking for a moment, he unequivocally declared:","\"Have everyone withdraw; this matter will be investigated by my Shen Family.\"","Fan Jin breathed a sigh of relief.","But Master Gu next to him said, \"Elder Shen, my Gu Family also has someone to save.\"","\"Gu Family?\" Shen Shouxing frowned, \"Who do you want to save?\"","\"Mo Hua,\" Master Gu replied.","Shen Shouxing’s pupil contracted, as a Powerful Elder of the Shen Family, he was surely aware of the identity and weight of \"Mo Hua\".","\"I understand...\" Master Gu said, \"Young Master Mo’s status is noble, my Shen Family will also ensure his rescue, Master Gu need not worry.\"","\"How does Elder Shen plan to rescue them?\" Master Gu asked.","Shen Shouxing replied, \"Since they are tomb robbers, they will definitely dig into the mountain. Once they dig, they will naturally reach the mines. My Shen Family has the mine maps, and by following them, we will surely encounter these thieves.\"","Master Gu said, \"Since it’s like this, the more people we have, the more strength we can muster. I will accompany Elder Shen into the mine.\"","Shen Shouxing’s expression showed displeasure."]},{"number":1956,"title":"Chapter 1956 - 948: Shen Shouxing (4)","paragraphs":["He was already being very courteous by speaking these few words to this Gu Family affiliate, Master Gu, who was in the Initial Golden Core stage.","A large part of it was because of Mo Hua’s special status, which prompted him to give them some explanation.","But wanting to enter the Shen Family’s mine was simply wishful thinking.","\"No way,\" Shen Shouxing said firmly, \"This is the Shen Family’s mine, outsiders are not allowed to enter.\"","Master Gu’s heart chilled slightly.","He suddenly realized that Mo Hua’s previous suspicion might very well be correct. There might indeed be some shady dealings in the Shen Family’s mine.","\"Young Master Mo has been a great benefactor to our Gu Family, now he is missing, I must find out the truth.\"","Even as someone in the Initial Golden Core stage, facing a high-ranking elder of the Shen Family, Master Gu remained determined and staunch.","Shen Shouxing let out a cold laugh and mocked: \"This is a matter of our Shen Family, your Gu Family has no hand in this.\"","Master Gu furrowed his brows tightly.","At this moment, another voice sounded: \"What if you add in Taixu Gate?\"","Shen Shouxing’s expression changed slightly, he turned his head to see a cultivator approaching, who exuded a sharp sword light and had an imposing aura.","\"Taixu Gate’s Sword Dao Elder, Xun Ziyou.\"","Xun Ziyou appeared calm, his gaze sharp.","Shen Shouxing’s expression turned grave.","The Gu Family was still manageable, a quasi-fifth-grade family, and Master Gu was merely a branch member with little authority.","But the elder of Taixu Gate before him was entirely different.","Moreover, Mo Hua was the Formation Leader of Taixu Gate, whose significance to Taixu Gate needed no explanation.","He disappeared, surely Taixu Gate would demand an explanation.","Shen Shouxing frowned and asked: \"What does Elder Xun intend to do?\"","Xun Ziyou slowly explained: \"I will join you in entering the mine to rescue my disciple from Taixu Gate.\"","According to the ancestor’s instructions, he was supposed to protect Mo Hua in secret.","With the Jade Pendant paired with the Tai Xu Yin Yang Lock, Mo Hua’s presence had been safe all along, so Xun Ziyou hadn’t paid attention.","But now Mo Hua had gone down into the mine, and where he had gone was completely unknown, causing Xun Ziyou to feel anxious.","Though there was temporarily no sign of danger from the Jade Pendant.","If by chance Mo Hua truly encountered a crisis, at that time, being too far away would make it impossible to lend assistance, and if Mo Hua suffered due to this, it would become a big problem.","Therefore, he had to at least be closer to Mo Hua to feel more at ease.","Shen Shouxing’s expression was cold.","Xun Ziyou’s request was actually reasonable.","But the Shen Family’s mine absolutely cannot allow any outsider to enter...","Shen Shouxing shook his head and coldly refused: \"Forgive me, Elder Xun, but I cannot grant your request.\"","Xun Ziyou was somewhat surprised, and then he became as composed as water.","The atmosphere was slightly teetering on the edge.","Master Gu realized that persisting like this wasn’t the answer, so he cupped his hands and said: \"Elder Shen, your Young Master has also been kidnapped, if we delay further, I fear...\"","Shen Shouxing’s brow twitched.","Indeed, Qingsheng was also inside.","But even so, the things in the mine absolutely cannot be discovered by outsiders, even if Qingsheng dies inside, the Shen Family’s secrets must not be exposed...","Shen Shouxing’s gaze was resolute.","But in an instant, Shen Shouxing’s eyes turned dark, as if something precious was gouged out from his heart, leaving him lost.","A strange voice echoed in his ear:","\"You have only one son in this life.\"","\"If this son dies, it will result in a broken family line...\"","Shen Shouxing’s body trembled, his face pallid, feeling as if his heart was being cut, muttering softly: \"Yes, I have only this one son...\"","The unnoticed grayness in his eyes gradually went away, then he lifted his head and nodded: \"Alright, we will go down together.\""]},{"number":1957,"title":"Chapter 1957 - 949: Corpse Fiend","paragraphs":["Xun Ziyou was taken aback.","He felt that Shen Shouxing was unpredictable and a bit strange.","But since Shen Shouxing had agreed, he had no reason to refuse. He was originally going to enter the mine for Mo Hua.","Xun Ziyou gathered his Sword Qi, cupped his hands and said, \"Alright, thank you, Elder Shen.\"","Shen Shouxing nodded with a dull gaze.","Then he ordered someone to bring the mine map and led the way to Shen Family’s mine, accompanied by many Shen Family cultivators.","Xun Ziyou’s gaze slightly focused as he followed behind him.","Master Gu, without hesitation, also followed.","However, Fan Jin, his footsteps heavy as if filled with lead, hesitated.","From the bottom of his heart, he didn’t want to get involved in this mess.","But with the people from the Shen Family, Taixu Gate, and Gu Family all going, if he, as Solitary Mountain City’s Records Officer, didn’t go along and fulfill his duty, he would really face severe consequences later.","Not to mention being an officer, he feared he wouldn’t have a place anywhere in the Qianxue region.","Seeing everyone getting farther away, Fan Jin grew anxious, and finally gritted his teeth and, with heavy steps, joined them.","As Shen Shouxing and his group entered the mine, more and more cultivators from Solitary Mountain kept arriving, and the situation grew increasingly complicated...","Meanwhile, in the tomb, Mo Hua was still holding the compass, discerning the direction, leading Mr. Pi and the four unknown black-robed cultivators.","As they walked, Mo Hua suddenly stopped.","\"What’s wrong?\" Mr. Hui asked.","\"I keep feeling that something is following us...\" Mo Hua nervously said.","Mr. Pi and his group looked around.","All around was pitch-black, with nothing visible.","\"You must be mistaken,\" Haozi said.","Mo Hua frowned but said nothing, continuing to move forward.","But in the shadows behind them, there indeed seemed to be something making rustling sounds, though none of those walking forward noticed...","...","After walking for a while, another gate appeared in front of the passage.","Everyone had to stop before the gate.","\"Another gate?\" Mr. Hui frowned and said, \"Why so many gates in this tomb passage...\"","No one could answer him.","Mr. Hui shook his head and looked at Mo Hua, \"Young brother, it’s up to you.\"","\"Yeah.\" Mo Hua nodded, then proceeded as before, taking out the compass and formation pen, starting to deduce the formation patterns, seeking their solution.","Mr. Hui and his group patiently waited alongside.","Mo Hua looked over the formation patterns on the gate several times, calculating them mentally, and knew how to breach the formation on the gate.","But to appear as a \"normal Formation Master,\" he stayed indifferent and pretended to work sluggishly.","On the blank formation paper, stroke by stroke, Mo Hua seemed serious, but internally he was perfunctory while deducing.","As he drew, Mo Hua suddenly paused, frowning.","\"Seems like... there really is something...\"","From the passage they came through, in the darkness, the rustling sounds seemed genuine, though calling it \"sound\" wasn’t quite right, it was more like a Divine Thought’s \"synesthesia.\"","As if something eerie was crawling toward him from the dark.","But... what could it be?","Mo Hua frowned.","If there really was something in the darkness, could Mr. Hui with the tomb robbers and the four mysterious black-robed cultivators not sense it?","After all, they were Golden Core Cultivators.","Though Mo Hua walked the path of Divine Sense Proving the Dao with strong Divine Thought, he was only at Foundation Establishment with a Divine Sense of Peak of Nineteen-Pattern, and wouldn’t truly believe his Divine Thought was stronger than Golden Core.","Especially not stronger than seven Golden Cores.","If there was really something amiss, these seven surely wouldn’t be completely oblivious...","Mo Hua calmed down and continued feigning the solution.","As he drew, the eerie feeling grew closer, stronger, and clearer.","Mo Hua paused for a moment, suddenly realizing something.","But he remained silent, stayed calm for a while, then suddenly blinked, involuntarily looking up.","His unusual behavior also caught the others’ attention.","Everyone looked up, but above was a dark passage, devoid of light, and no sign of any presence.","\"Kid, what are you doing, making a fuss...\"","The tomb robber called Haozi, with a sharp-face resembling a monkey, frowned and was about to speak, when his expression suddenly changed, he exclaimed:","\"...Mr. Hui!\"","Mr. Hui was puzzled, but his face soon turned pale.","He felt as if something was tightly sticking to his back.","Sticky, disgusting, like a clump of decayed flesh wrapped around bone.","Mr. Hui dared not move his head, and glanced back with the corner of his eye, seeing a rotten, dirty, muddy hand clasping his shoulder.","At the same time, a foul breeze wafted from behind his head.","As if something had opened its jaws to bite his head.","In a rush, Mr. Hui lowered his head abruptly, dodging the bite behind.","And with this action, Mo Hua and the others saw what was clinging to Mr. Hui’s back.","It was a rotting corpse.","Distorted, emaciated, ugly, oozing black and rancid blood, its facial features crushed and deformed, unrecognizable as a face, except for the mouth, with three splits, resembling worm teeth in the earth, white and ghastly.","Everyone’s expression changed upon witnessing this scene.","And the bloody flesh monster, after missing its bite, immediately tore its face apart, opening its three-fanged mouth, like a maggot, once again aiming for Mr. Hui’s head.","It clung to his back, moving deftly and covertly, rendering Mr. Hui helpless for the moment."]},{"number":1958,"title":"Chapter 1958 - 949: Corpse Fiend (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Just as the three-lobed mouth of the flesh monster was about to suck on Mr. Hui’s back head, the black-robed young man nearby flicked his long sleeve, and a sharp longsword flew out, carrying a blood-colored sword light, and pierced directly through the monster’s face.","The swift sword body carried great power.","The powerful sword qi penetrated the monster’s head, and also sent this monster flying backward, nailing it onto the stone wall of the passage.","Yet even with its head penetrated, the monster still jumped around, struggling on its own, and within a short moment, it endeavored to rise, emitting an eerie cry, heedless of the splattering black blood, indifferent to its mangled flesh, it directly pulled its bloody and deformed head out of the longsword.","Like meatballs being pulled off a skewer.","Seeing it was about to pounce again, the short and stout tomb robber nicknamed \"Stone\" immediately rushed forward, channeling spiritual power, covering his right arm with a layer of earth and stone armor, and punched the flesh monster into scattered limbs.","The monster’s scattered limbs still wiggled on the ground.","But they did not regroup, nor continued their attack.","Everyone breathed a sigh of relief.","But before they could fully relax, Mo Hua shouted: \"Above!\"","Mr. Hui looked up, and a blob of flesh fell onto his face.","This was another corpse-like monster, slightly smaller in size but equally rancid and rotten, with a three-lobed mouth.","There were originally two of these monsters.","One lurking behind and one clinging to the passage ceiling.","When the first was slain, everyone relaxed briefly, and this other one suddenly appeared, pouncing onto Mr. Hui’s head.","This abrupt change caught them off guard, leaving Mr. Hui without time to react as the monster leaped onto his face.","The monster’s insect-like teeth parted, three rows of sharp fangs directly biting into Mr. Hui’s forehead.","Yet the anticipated scene of flesh exploding didn’t occur. The monster’s three-lobed mouth bit down with effort but only managed to open a little.","Though its teeth were sharp enough, it seemed to be only second grade and could not gnaw through Mr. Hui’s Golden Core Realm flesh.","The ghastly sharp teeth left a few teeth marks on Mr. Hui’s forehead, drawing a trail of blood.","Even so, the monster continued its greedy sucking, without letting go.","Mr. Hui calmed after the fright, then anger arose from his heart.","He reached out both hands, directly grabbed the monster, tore it apart, and then, enduring disgust, removed its three-lobed mouth from his face.","Stone took out a bottle of unknown spiritual liquid and handed it to Mr. Hui.","Mr. Hui poured the spiritual liquid over his head, washing away the decayed flesh and filthy blood.","Afterward, he dared not be careless, promptly took out a bottle of azure powdered medicine, sprinkled it on the wound, and ingested several pills, then sat down for introspection, ensuring there was no problem with his flesh and spiritual power, nor any signs of corpse poison, only then did he let out a long breath.","The black-robed young man nearby saw this, his gaze fixed, and he asked: \"Are you okay?\"","Mr. Hui nodded, somewhat relieved: \"Thankfully this thing was only second grade, if it were third grade, I fear I might have met my end here.\"","Moreover, being gnawed by this monster, the death would have been terribly tragic, truly dying without a resting place.","\"What exactly is this monster?\" The black-robed young man frowned and asked.","Mr. Hui’s face was grim, \"It’s probably a kind of ’corpse demon’ from the tomb...\"","\"Corpse demon...\"","The black-robed young man pondered for a moment, frowning: \"This type of corpse demon seems entirely different from the copper corpses and iron corpses refined through the Demon Path’s corpse refinement method...\"","Mr. Hui, having spent years in tombs familiar with their peculiarities, knew quite a bit, as his line of work was inherently gray, he’d interacted with many demon cultivators, so he nodded and said:","\"Copper corpses and iron corpses are ’zombies’ crafted postnatally by demon cultivators. But these corpse demons are different, they mostly occur naturally in dark underground environments, formed by corpse transformation amidst mixtures of evil qi, yin qi, and death qi, they are sinister and bizarre.\"","\"Zombies are carried along by corpse cultivators, but generally, these corpse demons are only found in cemeteries, you’d hardly encounter them outside tombs.\"","The black-robed young man nodded slightly, then curiously questioned: \"Between heaven and earth, all beings have breaths, demons have demonic qi, monsters have monster qi, since this is a ’corpse’, naturally it ought to have ’corpse qi.’\" He added, \"Moreover, these corpse demons are imprisoned underground, with intense corpse qi, their flesh rotting to such extremes, emitting extremely pungent odor, why didn’t we detect anything?\"","\"This...\"","Mr. Hui frowned, unable to explain.","Corpse demons vary greatly.","Some corpse demons do stink fiercely, with overwhelming corpse qi, detectable from far away.","Yet why the ones in this tomb have their aura so concealed remains unknown.","At that moment, an elder in a black robe within the group suddenly spoke.","It was his first time speaking since entering the tomb. His voice was strangely old and carried a heavy death aura:","\"Life and death, both are creations of heaven and earth. These ’corpse demons’, amalgamated with innate grievance, earth yin qi, and evil qi of the dead, transform under fortuitous circumstances.\"","\"This is thus a creation of heaven and earth.\"","\"Earthly creations, whether living or dead, possess unique qualities, thereby, compared to copper corpses and iron corpses, tend to have elusive abilities which no crafted items by cultivators can match.\"","The black-robed young man pondered for a moment, nodded, and bowed respectfully:","\"This junior has been enlightened.\"","Even Mo Hua was astonished by these words.","This elder in black robe, whose face remained concealed, indeed harbored exceptional understanding of the Dao of Heaven and Earth.","His identity remains unknown...","Mo Hua pondered inwardly.","Nonetheless, despite this, to the group these corpse demons remain major troubles."]},{"number":1959,"title":"Chapter 1959 - 949: Corpse Fiend (Part 3)","paragraphs":["The stone beside him whispered to Mr. Hui: \"Second Master, this is still on the outskirts of the tomb, and there are already such corpse spirits lurking around. There may be more inside, perhaps even Third Grade ones...\"","Stone’s expression showed a hint of dread.","Mr. Hui frowned deeply, then his eyes lit up and he said in a deep voice:","\"No tomb without spirits. The more sinister it is, the more it indicates the tomb’s prestige, and the more treasures it holds inside.\"","Stone nodded and said no more.","This is how the tomb-raiding business works: the greater the reward, the higher the risk.","Similarly, the greater the risk, the richer the rewards might be.","They all understand the principle of seeking fortune amidst danger.","Afterwards, everyone prepared to set off.","Mo Hua continued to unravel the formation, intending to open the gate.","Mr. Hui still sat at the side, adjusting his breath.","He’s a veteran in this line; he knows that the things inside the tomb all exude eeriness and won’t become complacent just because the recent corpse spirit was only Second Grade.","Some of his Golden Core peers fell victim to some unknown Second Grade corpse poison, only to perish within the tomb.","Mr. Hui has heard quite a bit about such incidents.","Therefore, in the tomb, if injured, even if it’s a minor injury, one must be extremely cautious.","Mr. Hui meditated, regulating his injury.","Meanwhile, Mo Hua focused on breaking the formation.","Now that the corpse spirit has appeared, he didn’t want to delay longer, so after fumbling around for a bit, pretending, he broke the gate’s formation, opening it.","Beyond the gate, there was still a dark passage.","\"This wretched tomb, it’s truly vast...\" Mousie frowned and said, \"Endless.\"","\"Hurry up, stop complaining.\" Mr. Hui said.","He conducted an internal inspection for the last time, checked his injury, confirmed there were no issues, and also confirmed no \"corpse poison\" was contracted, then got up and said, \"Let’s go.\"","The group proceeded deeper into the passage.","Mo Hua still held the compass, leading the way.","The group followed behind him.","Yet, because of the \"corpse spirit\" incident, not only Mr. Hui’s group but even the four in black robes became vigilant.","These corpse spirits are sinister, rotted and foul-smelling, yet silent and undetectable by Divine Sense, making them unpredictable and highly dangerous.","Thus, everyone was on high alert, with focus heightened to the maximum.","Especially Mr. Hui, as those two corpse spirits earlier had both targeted him, one clawing over his shoulder, and the other leaping onto his face, with its disgusting fangs biting down on his forehead.","Once bitten by a snake, one becomes ten times more cautious.","Consequently, Mr. Hui was particularly cautious.","Especially considering that those two corpse spirits might have been trailing them from behind for a long while, unnoticed by everyone...","Mr. Hui realized this and something struck his heart.","\"No... not everyone was unaware...\"","Mr. Hui turned his head to glance at Mo Hua, feeling alarmed: \"This kid seemed to have noticed...\"","\"On the way earlier, he mentioned feeling something, clearly sensing something.\"","\"Perhaps the perception wasn’t clear, but such vigilance towards danger is rare, especially in the tomb-raiding trade...\"","Mr. Hui regarded Mo Hua with newfound respect.","\"This is an outstanding prospect, can’t let him slip away, must keep him tightly under control, have him work for me.\"","Mr. Hui’s eyes gleamed with excitement, then he masked his expression, pretending nothing happened and remained on guard.","While Mr. Hui silently watched Mo Hua, Mo Hua was also quietly observing him.","There was something Mo Hua hadn’t mentioned.","In Mr. Hui’s mind, those two corpse spirits were targeting him.","But that was not the case.","Those corpse spirits were actually after Mo Hua.","Just like the nightmare he’d had in Solitary Mountain City, where many malformed vengeful spirits crawled out from the abyss, tearing and biting at him.","Those two corpse spirits were the same.","However, the corpse spirits were somewhat \"dull\", for while they knew where Mo Hua was, they somehow couldn’t distinguish exactly which one amidst the crowd he was.","Mo Hua left a part of his Divine Thought on Mr. Hui.","Those two corpse spirits mistook Mr. Hui for him and started clawing at his shoulder and leaping onto his face.","Of course, Mo Hua subtly egged them on, with little remarks to create an atmosphere and divert attention.","Or, when there was no way for Mr. Hui to dodge, he’d remind him to lift his head, exposing his face for the corpse spirits.","Yet these corpse spirits weren’t simple.","All their moves were aimed at the cultivator’s head.","If bitten on the head, a strand of malignant evil thought would enter through the wound, breach the Sea of Consciousness’ gate, and infiltrate a cultivator’s mind.","The real \"corpse poison\" of these corpse spirits wasn’t in the flesh nor the Spiritual Power but in the Sea of Consciousness.","Earlier when Mr. Hui was bitten, a wisp of cyan-black poisonous thought had already infiltrated his Sea of Consciousness through his forehead.","Mr. Hui wasn’t aware, nor could the others see it, but Mo Hua saw it all clearly.","Of course, fearing Mr. Hui couldn’t handle the truth, he kept silent, covertly monitoring Mr. Hui’s state instead.","He had been curious before.","The erosion of the demon-type evil thought upon a normal cultivator, he wondered what it would be like, whether there was a gradual process, and what the symptoms would be.","Unfortunately, he never had the chance to study it.","Now an actual \"case\" lay before him, and Mo Hua naturally wanted to observe carefully.","Regrettably though, up till now, Mr. Hui hadn’t shown any abnormalities.","Mo Hua pondered; perhaps the dose of this \"corpse poison\" evil thought was too small to show toxicity.","Or due to the divine thought resilience of a Third Grade Golden Core cultivator, the Second Grade’s evil thought had little effect on those at the Golden Core Realm.","Or it’s still the \"incubation period\", with symptoms unmanifested.","\"Let’s see if there are any other corpse spirits, lure them over, and have them bite Mr. Hui a few more times.\"","\"If truly effective, then...\" Mo Hua considered for a moment, his eyes suddenly brightened:","\"I will catch some evil spirits and attempt to cultivate a virus-like ’corpse spirit’.\"","\"In the future, if someone above the Golden Core wants to kill me and I can’t battle them, I’ll find a way to unwittingly poison them with these evil thoughts, corrupt their Sea of Consciousness, disrupt their mind, and corrode their Taoist Heart...\"","Mo Hua’s eyes grew increasingly bright.","He pondered further, believing that his idea was feasible.","However, actual practice is vital; any hypothesis requires validation through real-world examples.","Mo Hua nodded.","Subsequently, he continued to lead the way while secretly monitoring Mr. Hui to verify his hypothesis of poisoning through evil thought.","Meanwhile, Mr. Hui, blissfully unaware, harbored thoughts of imprisoning Mo Hua to use for his own benefit, as he stepped deeper into the tomb."]},{"number":1960,"title":"Chapter 1960 - 950: Tomb Exploration","paragraphs":["The cemetery was dark, damp, and eerie, filled with a sense of suffocation and oppression.","The passage ahead was deep and shadowy, its length unknown, and its destination unclear.","Mo Hua held a compass in his hand, leading the group through the narrow darkness.","Mr. Hui and a few others occasionally glanced around, guarding against the strange corpses within the tomb.","Along the way, there were indeed appearances of corpse spirits, not many, mostly one or two, silently leaping out from the shadows to gnaw at heads.","However, the group was mentally prepared, and the seven Golden Core experts were on guard, watching the blind spots.","As soon as these corpse spirits appeared, they were swiftly slaughtered.","No one was bitten by the corpse spirits.","Mo Hua secretly felt a pity.","Without any bites, the sample for observation was reduced, which made his plan of poisoning with evil spirits lack many references.","Such matters, he wasn’t sure if anyone had tried before.","But if he wanted to succeed, it would be significantly difficult.","Just the sealing, storing, rearing, transformation, nurturing poison, and poisoning of evil spirits required extensive research.","Hence, he really needed someone to be bitten by the corpse spirits a few times, so when the illness manifested, he’d have more references.","However, the group was still in the stage of collaborating on their tomb exploration. The final burial chamber had not yet been found, so there was no need to rush.","Thus, Mo Hua set aside other thoughts and focused on leading the way.","The path seemed endless, and after an unknown amount of time, the passage suddenly widened.","The scene before them changed once again.","Walking at the forefront, Mo Hua immediately halted, slowly retreating to the center of the group, ensuring he was heavily surrounded by the Golden Core experts, then gazed ahead to see the passage leading to a spacious stone chamber.","The stone chamber was simple, with some murals carved around its walls.","These murals were rather crude, most of them depicting scenes of Oxhead and Horseface, dressed in Taoist Court robes, detaining, punishing, and executing criminals.","Mo Hua scrutinized the murals carefully, then sensed them with his divine sense, and finally frowned slightly.","These murals were indeed just simple murals.","They were neither contemplation maps nor did they contain formations, nor did they seem to possess any other mysteries.","Yet the depiction of Oxhead and Horseface, with their myriad punishments, gave Mo Hua a distinctly unusual feeling.","Mo Hua had a vague illusion.","These murals seemed to have been \"copied\" from somewhere, like a \"rubbing,\" but the person who copied them had no understanding of their deeper meanings, merely sketching the shapes onto the walls of the tomb.","Just the \"rubbing\" itself allowed Mo Hua to feel a chilling suffocation.","The true \"essence\" of these murals, if seen firsthand, might be even more terrifying.","Mo Hua’s brows knitted, his expression heavy.","But Mr. Hui, seeing these murals, was invigorated, turning to the group and saying:","\"These are murals from the outskirts of the underground palace; we’ve reached the underground palace.\"","\"Pass through the underground palace and enter the deeper burial chamber, and you’ll see the coffin. The treasures of the tomb will be buried with the coffin in the burial chamber.\"","\"Once inside the burial chamber, retrieve the items, and return the way we came, the mission will be successfully completed.\"","The group’s eyes were somewhat eager.","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, finally voicing the doubt in his heart: \"Whose tomb are we actually raiding, and what is buried inside?\"","Mo Hua lowered his voice, but everyone could hear.","Yet none of the cultivators present responded to him, acting as if they hadn’t heard.","Mo Hua awkwardly pursed his lips.","\"It’s getting late, let’s continue forward,\" said Mr. Hui, pausing slightly and then solemnly adding:","\"However, since we’ve reached this point, I must remind everyone, the underground palace is designed to protect the burial chamber, filled with killing formations and traps, very dangerous, so we must proceed with care.\"","The black-robed young man nodded.","Then the group, crossed over the murals of the underground palace’s perimeter, and walked nearly a hundred steps forward.","The structure of the walls changed, and before the wide underground palace appeared five branching paths.","\"These branching paths are meant to confuse outsiders and protect the tomb,\" Mr. Hui said.","The black-robed young man nodded slightly and asked: \"Which path should we take?\"","Mr. Hui and his group fell silent for a moment, all looking at Mo Hua.","Originally, tomb exploration and differentiation tasks were handled by Mr. Pi, who was well-versed in earth formations. But now that Mr. Pi was dead, the duty naturally fell to the only other formation master present, Mo Hua.","Even if his knowledge of earth formations was self-taught.","Mo Hua had a contemplative expression.","It was his first time tomb raiding... no, being \"coerced\" into entering a tomb, and there were many things he didn’t really understand.","Especially the various applications of earth formations, most of which he was encountering for the first time without much experience.","The five branching paths before him felt almost identical under his divine sense.","Even the layout of the earth formations and the breath of the formations inside were indistinguishable, making it hard for Mo Hua to discern which path truly led to the burial chamber.","\"Wait a moment, let me study it further...\" Mo Hua said.","Mr. Hui’s eyelid twitched.","The black-robed young man looked at Mo Hua with an even stranger gaze.","But Mo Hua ignored them, immersing himself in rummaging through Mr. Pi’s storage pouch.","Within Mr. Pi’s storage pouch, besides formation-related formation books and diagrams, there were some miscellaneous books and notes.","Among the miscellaneous notes, some contained his insights on tomb exploration.","The main content of the insights discussed the integration of formations with tomb burials, as well as the application of numerous formations, including the Five Elements Formation, Eight Trigrams Array, and hidden earth formations within tomb burials.","If problems were encountered, how one might resolve them through formations, and so on..."]},{"number":1961,"title":"Chapter 1961 - 950: Tomb Exploration (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Mo Hua’s Divine Sense was strong, and his thoughts rapid. As he flipped through the books and jade slips, he quickly got a grasp of the relevant contents.","This was the \"false formation\" technique used in tombs.","Five forks, exactly alike. The formations inside seemed the same as well, but four were \"false formations,\" running empty, only one was real.","This is one of the secrets of using the Earth Formation.","Mo Hua nodded, then began to follow Mr. Pi’s insights, using the deduction of the Earth Formation’s aura to distinguish between true and false formations.","One must admit, Mr. Pi’s death was quite necessary.","If he hadn’t died, I wouldn’t have obtained these formation books and jade slips and wouldn’t have figured out the intricacies.","Now that the intricacies are clear, the rest is easy.","Mo Hua used his profound Divine Thought as a foundation, aided by calculations, and after a brief deduction, identified the true and false of the Earth Formation.","Mo Hua extended his hand, pointing to the path on the far right, saying: \"This way.\"","\"Have you calculated it?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Are you sure?\" Though Mr. Hui had high hopes for Mo Hua’s talent, even planning to claim it as his own,","talent is still just talent.","Watching Mo Hua’s \"learn and apply\" approach, relying both on luck and guesses, Mr. Hui felt uncertain.","\"This is the way.\" Mo Hua acted nonchalant.","Mr. Hui frowned.","The black-robed gentleman looked at Mo Hua with a subtle expression and slowly said:","\"This young brother has made no mistakes in positioning and deciphering the formations along the way. His deduction should be correct, let’s go.\"","Mo Hua was a bit surprised by the black-robed gentleman’s comment.","The black-robed gentleman looked at Mo Hua, a faint smile forming at the corner of his mouth.","Mo Hua was taken aback, feeling slightly unsettled, sensing something odd.","Mr. Hui hesitated for a moment and nodded, having to follow Mo Hua’s deduction.","At least Mo Hua is a Formation Master; it was his calculation.","If they didn’t believe Mo Hua, they’d have no choice but to gamble on their own,","which would be even less reliable.","\"Alright.\" Mr. Hui agreed.","And so the group headed towards the path Mo Hua pointed out.","Once in the fork, the atmosphere changed suddenly. The stone walls were more solid, inscribed with various Penalty Prison Map carvings, making the atmosphere solemn and eerie.","Everyone became more cautious.","But surprisingly, the tomb passage had no traps or mechanisms, inexplicably safe along the way.","Like this, they continued until they encountered a barren stone wall with no other way out.","Mr. Hui stepped forward, knocked on the stone wall, then punched it.","The formation lit up, then shattered.","Mr. Hui’s fist went through the wall, but behind it was nothing but an endless mountain body.","\"It’s a dead-end,\" Mr. Hui turned and said.","So everyone turned their gaze back to Mo Hua.","Mo Hua stroked his chin, muttering: \"How could it be a dead-end... did I miscalculate?\"","\"What do we do now?\"","\"I’ll take another look...\"","Then Mo Hua checked the surroundings again, finding the formation wasn’t wrong, but behind it was indeed a solid mountain, a dead-end.","\"Every dog has its day,\" Mo Hua said calmly, unfazed by his mistake.","Mr. Hui and the others had no choice.","After all, the \"expert\" Mr. Pi was already dead.","Mo Hua, forced to step up, had done well to get this far.","\"Let’s head back,\" Mr. Hui said.","So they took some time to return the way they came, back to the fork.","\"Which way this time?\"","Mo Hua recalculated Mr. Pi’s tomb insights, once again deduced with the same outcome, thinking his calculation was correct.","Mr. Pi watched Mo Hua dallying, guessing Mo Hua’s formation deduction might no longer be effective and losing patience.","\"Dragging on isn’t a solution, let’s try the middle path.\"","\"If it doesn’t work, we can come back and try another. With five paths in total, trying one by one isn’t a problem.\"","Mr. Hui continued, \"Solitary Mountain City is a third-grade domain, and with our group of seven Golden Core cultivators, we can handle some dangers.\"","Mo Hua had nothing to say.","If it were a Five Elements or Eight Trigrams Formation, he would be confident.","But in this tomb, mostly Earth Formations were used, a domain he was less familiar with, requiring him to learn and apply on the spot, unsure of any mistakes.","Since he wasn’t sure about the formations, he’d let Mr. Hui, the \"experienced\" tomb robber, lead.","Thus Mr. Hui took the lead, heading towards the middle path.","Mo Hua enjoyed a bit of leisure.","Without leading, he didn’t have to walk at the front.","Mo Hua picked a safe spot in the group, ensuring there were \"shields\" all around in case of nearby danger.","The middle path looked almost identical to the far-right path Mo Hua chose.","But as they moved, the darkness was suddenly pierced by dense firelight.","Countless sharp crossbow bolts, seemingly made of flame, like a fiery rain, shot directly at Mr. Hui in the lead.","The speed of the flame bolts was extremely fast.","Mr. Hui couldn’t evade, immediately crossing his arms and forming an earth shield in front.","The dense fiery rain bombarded the shield, causing Spiritual Power to clash violently, the flames flickering brightly in the dark tomb, blindingly so."]},{"number":1962,"title":"Chapter 1962 - 950: Tomb Exploration (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Not only Mr. Hui, but others were also affected.","The scorching fire rain surged and attacked others as well.","A layer of earth and stone condensed on Shi Tou’s body, Hao Zi dodged in an eerie manner, and those several people in black employed various means to fend off the continuous firelight.","This is a Third Grade fire rain, very powerful.","Mo Hua was aware early on, knowing he couldn’t resist, so he hid behind those two tall black-robed cultivators.","The two black-robed cultivators remained immovable in the fire rain, like two small mountains.","When the fire rain stopped and the smoke dispersed, Mo Hua finally poked his head out.","In front of the corridor, Mr. Hui and the few others hit by the fire rain looked somewhat embarrassed.","The robes of the four black-robed cultivators also had some burnt spots.","Mr. Hui withdrew his earth shield and took a deep breath, clearly dealing with this fire rain wasn’t easy at all.","Yet on his face, instead of fear, there was joy, \"With tomb mechanisms, the path must be right.\"","Mr. Hui turned around and instructed, \"Everyone be careful and keep moving forward.\"","Afterwards, the group continued moving forward.","Along the way, they encountered poison gas, quicksand, stone burial, water miasma, blade formations, and other death traps repeatedly.","These tomb mechanisms were varied and appeared extremely dangerous, malicious, and insidious, hard to guard against.","But Mr. Hui and the others were experienced.","Tomb mechanisms were like everyday meals for these tomb robbers.","So being a bit cautious, they could handle it, though inevitably with some trepidation.","After walking for a while and experiencing various mechanisms, Mr. Hui frowned and said:","\"Strange, the floor beneath, doesn’t seem unusual, how are these mechanisms triggered?\"","Mr. Hui didn’t understand, but Mo Hua knew.","The mechanisms in this tomb path coordinated with the Earth Formation, controlled through the \"sense\" of the Earth Formation, triggering as long as someone passed.","This transcends the general scope of tomb mechanical techniques, involving more advanced Earth Formation usage.","Mr. Hui’s ignorance is not surprising.","And understanding the formation, it’s actually not hard to disable these mechanisms.","But Mo Hua said nothing and did nothing.","A Formation Master must know how to keep secrets.","If only he understood formations, then regardless of what he did or said, what was right or wrong, only he would know.","If he wanted to kill, deceive, or rob, it all followed his intentions.","This was taught to him not long ago by Mr. Pi.","Mr. Pi, having mingled in the Cultivation World for so many years, was immensely experienced.","Mo Hua found his words very true.","Moreover, Mo Hua was curious as well, wanting to see what mechanisms the tomb contained, so if he encountered such killing moves alone in the future, he could be mentally prepared.","Thus, the group kept triggering mechanisms while proceeding deeper into the tomb path.","But after walking for a long time, they still didn’t see the end of the tomb path.","Moreover, the deeper they went, the narrower the tomb path became, with more diverging paths, walking unknowingly, they realized they didn’t know where they were anymore.","Mr. Hui had to stop and said solemnly:","\"Incorrect... this path is also incorrect...\"","\"Then what now?\" Hao Zi asked.","\"Go back?\"","The black-robed gentleman looked around, frowned, and said, \"With so many diverging paths, how to go back?\"","The group hesitated for a moment, then unanimously looked at Mo Hua.","After all, among the group, only Mo Hua was a Formation Master.","At this moment, Mo Hua deeply understood why Mr. Pi always insisted on the principle \"one Formation Master\" each time he went down a tomb.","Cultivators take cultivation as a foundation, but cultivation is just cultivation.","For most cultivators in the world, powerful cultivation only signifies killing power and destructive force.","But many problems cannot be solved solely by cultivation.","Formation Masters are different.","Formation Visualization embodies Heavenly Dao, encompassing all aspects.","Formation Masters are proficient in formations, enlightened in myriad truths, can solve many problems that ordinary cultivators cannot.","When anything arises, others all rely on you.","Mo Hua sighed, and pretended to have trouble taking out Mr. Pi’s Compass, then began determining directions based on formation flow.","A moment later, Mo Hua pointed to the left, \"Here.\"","Everyone had no choice but to follow Mo Hua obediently.","Along the way, the forks gradually converged, encountering some triggered traps, indicating this was the way back.","Mr. Hui breathed a sigh of relief and looked at Mo Hua with even greater fervor.","After that, Mo Hua continued to discern the position via the formation, and walked for a while longer.","Just as they were about to exit the fork, Mo Hua’s expression suddenly changed, and he stopped.","\"What’s wrong?\" Mr. Hui asked.","Mo Hua’s face looked a bit unsightly, \"There’s something...\"","Mr. Hui was taken aback and then instantly understood.","\"Corpse creatures!\"","Everyone’s heart tightened upon hearing this, and their expressions immediately turned vigilant.","Mo Hua quietly retreated to the back of the group.","In just a moment, deep in the dark fork, without a sound, a head suddenly appeared.","This head was deformed and ugly, its features distorted and indistinct, with a mouth split into three cracks like the jaws of ground worms.","At this moment, the head’s three-part mouth opened, revealing wriggling flesh teeth, resembling a carnivorous flower in dark red.","Mr. Hui felt nauseous at the sight.","The scene of being gnawed on the face by this corpse creature vividly came to mind, and the disgust was something he never wanted to experience again.","Mr. Hui drew his knife, intending to cut down the corpse creature.","But halfway through the swing, he suddenly stopped, his pupils trembled, and his face turned pale.","Before him, it wasn’t just one blooming \"carnivorous flower.\"","But a whole cluster.","Flesh-red gums, sharp white fangs, blooming successively in the darkness, with a single glance, there were roughly over twenty.","Everyone’s expressions changed instantly.","\"Retreat!\" Mr. Hui shouted.","As soon as he spoke, those hideous, foul-smelling corpse creatures lunged at everyone’s heads with bloodthirsty mouths.","Mr. Hui slashed off one corpse creature’s arm with a knife.","Stone punched and sent a face-leaping corpse creature flying away.","The others also simultaneously unleashed knives, swords, and spells to slay or knock back the charging corpse creatures one by one.","But as long as the corpse creatures are not entirely dead, even a remnant of evil aura will make them continue to charge forward.","Everyone could only fight and retreat, moving back again into the fork road.","In the darkness, who knew how many corpse creatures were rushing forward like a tide, one after another?","Rotten flesh, blood, severed limbs, sword lights, blood lights, spells, mixed together.","The scene was chaotic to the extreme.","Mo Hua could only try his best to hide among the crowd, letting those with Golden Cores shield him from the \"corpse tide.\"","But the forks were confusing, the pathways narrow, and with too many corpse creatures, the group was unknowingly scattered.","When Mo Hua used his movement technique to dodge several corpse creature attacks, then used the Fireball Technique to blast away a few face-leaping corpse creatures, he turned around only to find himself alone.","\"Oh no, we’ve been separated?\"","Mo Hua was startled in his heart.","Now was not the time to scatter; if they did, his Golden Core \"shield\" would be gone.","\"I need to regroup with them.\" Mo Hua silently thought in his heart.","Fortunately, they hadn’t been separated for long, some corpse creatures had been slain, so he could barely sense the nearby people’s aura.","Mo Hua followed the aura, avoiding both corpse creatures and traps, walking for a moment before indeed spotting a person ahead.","It was the tomb robber known as \"Rat.\"","Rat was maneuvering against several corpse creatures, his magic treasure seemed to be a shovel, capable of digging earth, but also slicing people.","After a dozen rounds, Rat had slain all the corpse creatures around him.","The surroundings calmed slightly, and Rat saw Mo Hua, then asked: \"Where are the others?\"","Mo Hua shook his head, \"We need to find a way to regroup with them.\"","\"Okay.\" Rat nodded.","So the two of them set out along the fork road, trying to find traces of the others.","But as they walked, Mo Hua felt a sudden shock in his heart and immediately jumped aside, narrowly avoiding a large coarse hand.","Mo Hua exclaimed, \"What are you doing?\"","The one who had reached for him, was Rat.","Currently, Rat’s face appeared gloomy, his forehead tinged with blue, his narrow eyes fixed on Mo Hua, reaching to grab Mo Hua’s shoulder while croakily saying:","\"Hand it over to me.\""]},{"number":1963,"title":"Chapter 1963 - 951: Gold-Seeking Talisman","paragraphs":["\"What did you say?\" Mo Hua looked shocked and confused.","\"Leave it to me...\"","\"What?\"","\"Damn it, what else could it be?\" Haozi’s face was ashen, his eyes starting to show bloodshot, \"Old Pi’s Mo Jin Rune, it must be in your hands!\"","Mo Hua’s heart skipped a beat.","Indeed!","This Haozi is after that Mo Jin Rune; earlier he was rummaging through his own storage bag to find Mr. Pi’s Mo Jin Rune.","\"I don’t even know what you’re talking about...\" Mo Hua looked puzzled.","But Haozi didn’t care what he said, his rough, wide hand, like the claw of a Monster Beast, reached out towards Mo Hua again.","Mo Hua had witnessed him using this palm to kill a Golden Core of the Shen Family, and immediately felt a chill in his heart, hurriedly activating Water Passing Step to dodge.","A strand of water light wrapped around Mo Hua’s body, making him move as fast as flowing water, evading Haozi’s big hand.","Haozi switched tactics, his hand condensing a faint yellow Golden Core aura, continuing to grasp at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua’s expression slightly changed, having to push Water Passing Step to its extreme, several flashes later, he dodged another grab, then with a reverse hand and pointed fingers, a fireball swiftly flew out, blasting Haozi in the face.","But he was in Foundation Establishment, whereas Haozi was in Golden Core.","A Second Grade ordinary Fireball Technique did little harm to a cultivator in the Golden Core Realm.","The Fireball Technique exploded, smoke billowed, and after a moment, Haozi emerged covering his face.","Some of his hair was singed, and his face had some black ash; the injury was negligible, but this only angered Haozi further.","His face grew even more ferocious.","Mo Hua, without thinking, was about to turn and run, but his peripheral vision caught a glimpse of Haozi’s forehead, making his pupils contract.","The Fireball Technique had burned a small patch of Haozi’s hair, revealing a small patch of scalp.","On this patch of scalp, blood flowed, mixed with hair, and there were three swollen, rotting bite marks.","Mo Hua was shocked.","He’s been bitten by an Evil Spirit!","With a little thought, Mo Hua understood.","Just now, in the forked path, swarms of Evil Spirits had rushed in, scattering the crowd. Amid the chaos, Haozi must have been climbed upon by an Evil Spirit and bitten, but the wound was not conspicuous; he himself probably hasn’t even noticed.","Since he was bitten, he’s certainly tainted by the Evil Spirit.","Evil Thoughts were silently breeding in him, and now seeing Mo Hua alone, he couldn’t suppress the greed in his heart.","But is a Mo Jin Rune worth Haozi’s greed?","Seeing Haozi about to pounce again, Mo Hua quickly said:","\"You can’t kill me, I’m a Formation Master, without me, you won’t be able to map out positions and break formations.\"","Haozi’s hand paused.","Despite his greed, he still retained some reason, knowing Mo Hua’s special status meant he can’t be killed now, so he said:","\"I won’t kill you... As long as you hand it over, I naturally won’t make things difficult for you.\"","To reassure Mo Hua, he even forced a smile.","But his sharp, monkey-like features made the malicious smile extremely ugly.","\"I really don’t know what the Mo Jin Rune is or what it looks like, how can I give it to you...\" Mo Hua said \"fearfully.\"","Haozi suppressed his desire, his voice hoarse:","\"The Mo Jin Rune is a rune made from a pangolin’s claw, gold inlaid with silver, with a texture like ancient jade.\"","\"It’s Old Pi’s possession, he always carries it, treating it like a treasure, rarely showing it, but by chance, I saw it...\"","\"My ancestors have been tomb raiders for generations, living off digging things up... He might fool others but not me...\"","\"It’s an ancient token, only a very rare few with special bloodlines can possess it, exceedingly precious, hard to even glimpse...\"","\"And now, it’s my opportunity.\"","\"With this item, I can connect with the Earth Sect’s Dark Department, and access the Earth Sect’s true heritage...\"","These words were hidden secrets, originally buried in his heart, not meant to be spoken.","But now his desires, amplified by Evil Thoughts, were uncontrollably expressed, revealing all his greed and longing.","\"This item is useless to you, obey and give it to me...\"","Haozi tried to speak as calmly as possible.","But Mo Hua still looked frightened, shaking his head, \"I really... don’t know what you’re talking about.\"","Haozi’s expression turned cold, \"Kid, I’ve been polite to you, yet you keep stalling me, keep this up, and I’ll pry out your brain...\"","Mo Hua was about to say something when suddenly his eyes widened and he pointed behind Haozi, saying:","\"Evil Spirit!\"","Haozi sneered, \"Kid, you think it’s my first day out here, this little trick can’t fool me...\"","Before he could finish his sentence, Haozi felt his shoulder grow heavy and stickiness next to his ear; turning his head, he saw an ugly three-lobed mouth’s head gnawing at his flesh.","Haozi was shocked and terrified, breaking out in cold sweat.","Seeing the Evil Spirit gnawing on his face, Haozi urgently channeled his power to his palm, quickly pinching and twisting the Evil Spirit’s neck, flinging its body away, then with a reverse grip, crushed its head, pulling its mouth off himself.","Dark, rotting flesh and blood dripped down his cheek.","Haozi dared not take chances, immediately taking out Spiritual Liquid, washing off the foul blood, applying powder to the wound, and ingesting several pills.","After dealing with the Evil Spirit, Haozi turned back, only to find Mo Hua had long fled out of sight.","Haozi felt a surge of anger, \"Kid...\"","The passage was pitch black, intricate, and empty all around.","Haozi unleashed his Divine Sense, unable to tell where Mo Hua had run off to.","The wound beside his cheek throbbed faintly, flashing dark green, but Haozi felt nothing, only the desire in his heart burning ever fiercer."]},{"number":1964,"title":"Chapter 1964 - 951: Touch Gold Talisman (2)","paragraphs":["Stopping for a moment in thought, Rat took out a snuff bottle, placed it at the tip of his nose, and sniffed.","The pungent, musty smell filled his mind.","Rat endured the pain in his forehead, and at the same time, his nose grew a bit larger, his sense of smell becoming more acute.","Amidst it all, he caught a faint yet pure scent of ink from a person.","It was Mo Hua’s fragrance.","This ink fragrance was elegant yet rich, mesmerizing, unlike anything he had smelled on other cultivators before.","Because it was unique, it was also easy to recognize.","\"Little rascal, let’s see where you run to...\"","Rat crouched down, placing his rough hands on the ground, assuming a strange posture, channeling his Golden Core Power, spiritual power circulating around him, surrounded by yellow sand, and then with a whistle, he charged forward suddenly.","The ink scent guided the way ahead.","Following the scent, Rat chased after Mo Hua. Within a dozen breaths, he spotted Mo Hua walking alone in the tomb tunnel, cautious and somewhat sneaky.","At the same time, Mo Hua also sensed Rat’s presence.","In his divine sense, a \"large rat\" was charging towards him through the tunnel.","Mo Hua was startled.","\"How did this damn rat catch up?\"","This tomb robber named Rat shouldn’t understand formations, nor could he distinguish positions.","There wasn’t any tracking spiritual artifact left on him by Rat, so how exactly had he caught up...","However, now was not the time to worry about this.","Seeing Rat closing in, even just a few flashes away, Mo Hua unhesitatingly activated Water Passing Step and sprinted forward.","But Rat’s movement technique was cunning and peculiar, running low to the ground just like a rat.","Several times, Mo Hua was nearly caught by Rat.","Thankfully, though this \"Rat\" had a fast movement technique with clever moves, in terms of deft maneuvering, it was still inferior to Water Passing Step.","Using the sophistication of Water Passing Step, Mo Hua narrowly avoided him several times.","Meanwhile, he marveled in his heart, in this vast world, there’s indeed nothing too strange, there truly is someone who learned this kind of bizarre movement technique.","And Rat was secretly astonished.","Avoided them all...","This little rascal... Who exactly is he? So young and possessing such exquisite movement technique?","At the same time, Rat grew increasingly certain.","The stranger Mo Hua was, the more it proved that Old Pi’s \"Gold Seeking Talisman\" must be on him.","\"Gold Seeking Talisman!\"","Rat’s eyes grew redder, fully channeling his Golden Core Power, sprinting on all fours, chasing after Mo Hua.","All at once, Mo Hua’s pressure doubled.","But no matter how good Rat’s movement technique was, compared to the esteemed Elder Yi of the Eight Great Gates, it was much inferior.","Mo Hua always trained with Elder Yi, and now, although shackled, his movement was hindered, but in the bout with Rat, he was not at a disadvantage.","Back and forth they went, chased and dodged for dozens of rounds, leaving Rat more and more stunned.","\"Can’t catch him...\"","A Golden Core cultivator, and he couldn’t catch a mere Foundation Establishment kid?","Just then, whether it was because Mo Hua’s spiritual power was running low or due to being shackled and restricted, his steps faltered, his movement technique suddenly went awry, slipping to the ground, rolling a few times before stopping.","But it was clear he no longer had the strength to resist.","\"Exhausted?\"","Rat paused, then breathed a sigh of relief.","That’s more like it...","How could a Foundation Establishment escape a Golden Core’s capture? Clearly, those few moves earlier had been him at his fullest.","Seeing Mo Hua fall to the ground, his movement temporarily halted.","Rat’s eyes flashed with determination, immediately striding towards Mo Hua, extending his blood-stained hands to grab him.","Mo Hua was still of use, of course, he wouldn’t kill him now, just needed to strip him of his clothes, search him, and find that Gold Seeking Talisman.","But before his filthy hands could touch Mo Hua, a voice suddenly came from a distance along the tunnel:","\"Who’s there?\"","This voice belonged to Mr. Hui.","Rat’s eyelids twitched, secretly cursing: \"Damn it, such bad timing. Of all times, they come when I’ve almost caught the kid.\"","Seeing Mr. Hui approaching.","Rat had no choice but to desist against Mo Hua, threatening: \"Not a word of this, or I’ll kill you.\"","Mo Hua nodded \"fearfully.\"","After a while, the sound of footsteps approached, Mr. Hui and others emerged from the shadows, relieved to see Mo Hua and Rat.","Rat was an accomplice, they had gone down the tomb together several times, and there was camaraderie.","Mo Hua was a Formation Master, inexperienced but the only one they could rely on this trip.","Mr. Hui, for now, hoped nothing would happen to these two.","Especially Mo Hua.","Only...","Mr. Hui glanced at the disheveled Mo Hua, frowned, and said, \"Little brother, are you hurt?\"","Rat glanced stealthily at Mo Hua, hiding his malice.","Mo Hua mumbled, \"I... I was chased by corpses, lost my senses in panic, and fell.\"","Mr. Hui’s expression grew somewhat serious, \"Bitten?\"","Mo Hua shook his head, \"No.\"","\"That’s good,\" Mr. Hui nodded, \"Let’s find the others, regroup early, leave this crossroad to avoid being targeted by corpses again.\"","Mo Hua struggled to his feet, walking to Mr. Hui’s side.","Rat watched Mo Hua’s figure, showing a gloomy gaze, evidently still unwilling to let it go.","After that, the three of them moved together, based on footprints and spiritual power traces, began searching for the others in the tomb tunnel."]},{"number":1965,"title":"Chapter 1965 - 951: Tomb-Seeking Talisman (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Everyone, except for Mo Hua, was a Golden Core cultivator.","These zombies were all only Second Grade. They could bite Golden Core cultivators but generally couldn’t kill them.","As a result, after walking for about an hour, the group that had been scattered by the zombies regrouped.","Mr. Hui and three tomb robbers.","There were also four other black-robed cultivators.","Mo Hua observed carefully and noticed that, besides Mr. Hui, only that rat who harbored malintent towards him was bitten by the zombies.","In other words, these two were \"material.\"","The others, the one called \"Rock,\" was a pure body cultivator, with skin like earth and stone, the teeth of ordinary zombies couldn’t harm him at all.","As for those four black-robed cultivators, they were extraordinarily powerful, and their black robes seemed to be some treasure, capable of concealing their aura and serving as protection.","Just now, when everyone was scattered by the corpse tide and chased by zombies, they weren’t injured, not even tearing their black robes.","Mo Hua felt a bit regretful.","He also wanted to see what these black-robed cultivators looked like.","After regrouping, everyone discussed briefly and planned to turn back to leave the forked path.","It could currently be asserted that this forked path was a dead end.","And this forked path was narrow and intricate, making directions hard to discern.","Therefore, the way back would still be led by Mo Hua.","And because in this group of people, only he was at Foundation Establishment, the zombies posed the greatest threat to him, so everyone was afraid he might be bitten by the zombies and poisoned to death.","The body cultivator named Rock, taking the lead, stood in front of Mo Hua like a \"shield.\"","Mr. Hui and the black-robed gentleman stood on his left and right.","The rest followed behind, taking the rear.","The group maintained this formation, inching towards the exit of the forked path.","They encountered some scattered zombies along the way, but they didn’t pose much of a disturbance.","Mo Hua guided them while following the group forward.","His position was quite safe, but occasionally he felt a chilling sensation at his back, as if a pair of sinister eyes were watching him.","Mo Hua knew without thinking; it was that rat.","This one called the rat had remarkably accurate instincts.","For some reason, he was convinced that Mo Hua had taken Mr. Pi’s tomb-raiding token, so he was trying every means possible to seize it back from him.","\"Earth Sect, Secret Department, tomb-raiding token...\"","Although Mo Hua didn’t know what the Earth Sect’s Secret Department was, since Mr. Pi regarded the tomb-raiding token as a treasure, and the rat with ancestral tomb-robbing heritage was greedy for it, it signified that the token indeed hid a significant secret.","And this secret was related to the Earth Sect.","The Earth Sect enshrined one part of the \"Emperor Heaven and Earth Diagram,\" the \"Earth Diagram.\"","Mo Hua naturally couldn’t hand over the tomb-raiding token.","So far, no one dared to snatch anything from him.","Let alone that previously, the rat had turned over his storage bag, taking the spirit stones and spiritual objects within.","All these grievances were remembered by him.","\"Can’t be left alive...\"","Mo Hua silently resolved in his heart.","He certainly didn’t want a Golden Core with ill intentions eyeing him covetously on this tomb-robbing journey.","But the rat was a Golden Core, and he couldn’t kill him now.","Moreover, he couldn’t commit murder with so many people present, especially in front of his accomplices.","\"Use him to test how to trigger evil spirits, how to stir evil thoughts, and to research the manifestation of evil thoughts’ corruption on high-rank cultivators...\"","Mo Hua pondered silently.","But outwardly, he remained composed, focusing solely on guiding the way.","Under his guidance, the group broke through several traps, killed a dozen zombies, and bypassed countless corners, finally emerging from the forked path.","Once out of the forked path, the group returned to the original point.","Naturally, they faced the same problem:","Which of the five forked roads should they take?","Mr. Hui said, \"The one on the far right is a dead end, and we’ve walked through the middle one too. Among the remaining three roads, let’s choose a new one to try.\"","Mr. Hui pondered for a moment, saying, \"Let’s go with the one on the far left.\"","Mo Hua said nothing, and the others had no objections, so they all moved towards the left path.","As soon as Mo Hua entered the leftmost fork, after just a few steps, he sensed the formation layout around him, and immediately said, \"Something’s not right.\"","\"What’s not right?\" Mr. Hui was stunned.","\"It’s the same,\" Mo Hua said.","\"The same?\"","\"Yes,\" Mo Hua nodded, mentally calculating, \"The leftmost path, the middle path, and even the other two paths, they’re all the same.\"","\"These paths are connected to the same fork.\"","\"If you walk along this path, or the middle one, the result is exactly the same: we’ll still be trapped in the branch paths filled with mechanisms.\"","\"This...\" Mr. Hui frowned, \"So among these five paths, four are wrong paths, and one is a dead end?\"","\"Four wrong paths, but the remaining one is not a dead end,\" Mo Hua said, \"My previous calculation wasn’t wrong. This is a fake layout of the Earth Formation, four false and one true. The path I led us on initially is the correct one.\"","\"But...\" Mr. Hui’s gaze was heavy, \"That was indeed a dead end.\"","Mo Hua shook his head and said, \"Formations don’t lie. If it is, it is; if it isn’t, it isn’t. Even if a path seems like a dead end, if the formation deduces it to be a life path, then it is a life path.\"","As he said this, Mo Hua’s gaze was calm, his expression confident, inadvertently exuding a steady confidence.","This was the aura only a truly accomplished Formation Master possessed.","The pupil of the black-robed young master shrank slightly.","Even the black-robed elder glanced at Mo Hua in surprise.","Mr. Hui pondered for a moment, then nodded, \"Alright, let’s take another look.\"","So the group retraced their steps and, following Mo Hua’s instructions, entered the fork on the far right from the beginning.","They entered the fork and walked straight to the end, where a dead-end stone wall blocked their way.","On the stone wall was an opening that Mr. Hui had previously punched through, revealing an unseen depth of the mountain behind it.","At a glance, it indeed seemed to be a dead end.","\"If there is really a path, there should be a formation to break it, right?\" Mr. Hui said.","Mo Hua shook his head, \"If there was really a formation, I would have noticed it. It’s precisely because there isn’t a formation, it can deceive people.\"","Mr. Hui considered this for a moment and nodded, \"Makes sense.\"","Since there was no formation, the only solution was to \"dig through\" it.","So all the Golden Core cultivators took turns using various methods to excavate the mountain stone in front of them.","They dug for a long time without seeing an end.","Everyone was a little hesitant, but Mo Hua was resolute, \"Keep digging.\"","All the Golden Core cultivators could only continue to follow Mo Hua’s instructions and dig deeper.","As they dug, they gradually noticed something unusual.","The mountain stone before them seemed naturally formed, but it wasn’t.","Its interior was composed of a mix of second and third-grade stone materials, unusually solid, but upon breaking it open, they found traces of artificial construction inside.","In other words, this wasn’t a natural mountain body but an artificial \"rockery.\"","If not for the combined deep excavation efforts of six or seven Golden Core cultivators, it would have been impossible to detect.","Several of them looked back at Mo Hua, secretly amazed at his mastery of formations and sharp insight.","After digging for a while, Mo Hua suddenly called out, \"Stop.\"","\"What’s the matter?\" Mr. Hui asked.","\"There’s a formation now!\" Mo Hua’s eyes lit up.","If there’s a formation, they can’t forcibly dig through it, or it might cause the formation to go haywire and lead to a mountain explosion and collapse.","Mo Hua took out a brush and ink, beginning to calculate the formation-breaking method.","After he broke the formation, Mo Hua said, \"Continue digging.\"","The Golden Core cultivators dug for a while before Mo Hua called \"Stop\" again, then proceeded to break another formation, and after breaking it, he let them continue digging.","They kept alternating between breaking formations and digging into the mountain.","No one knew how long it took, but finally, the soil and rocks in front collapsed, revealing an opening.","All present were invigorated.","Rock walked ahead, using his sturdy body to break through the opening, and then everyone followed in succession. When they looked up, they couldn’t help but be stunned.","Before them was a massive underground palace, eerie and majestic.","But this underground palace was not enclosed, with corridors layered over one another, visible all the way to the end.","At the far end of the underground palace was a huge deep pit.","Inside the pit sat a gigantic, resplendent coffin made of golden yellow copper ore."]},{"number":1966,"title":"Chapter 1966 - 952: Opening the Coffin","paragraphs":["After many twists and turns, the group finally arrived at the underground palace and beheld the enormous, golden-bronze coffin gleaming before them.","Bright bronze coffin!","All the cultivators present gazed intently, and the breaths of Mr. Hui’s group grew rapid. Even Mo Hua’s eyes brightened.","Needless to say, merely this gigantic third-grade bright bronze coffin was worth a considerable amount of Spirit Stones.","\"Indeed, it is a grand burial!\" Mr. Hui’s eyes were filled with excitement.","Yet, at the same time, a grey-blue flicker appeared in his eyes, as if an evil thought was gradually burgeoning like a maggot.","And no one noticed.","Except for Mo Hua.","Mo Hua’s brows furrowed slightly.","Mr. Hui was bitten by a corpse monster, but there were no abnormalities during the journey until now when the sight of the bright bronze coffin triggered the growth of evil thoughts.","This implies that the trigger, growth, and expansion of evil thoughts require human \"desires\"?","Once a person harbors desire and greed arises, the evil thoughts seize the opportunity to infiltrate and proliferate?","The bright bronze coffin had ignited Mr. Hui’s desires. Correspondingly, Mr. Hui’s Taoist Heart began to falter, developing cracks, and was invaded by external evil.","Mo Hua silently noted this point.","Having found the coffin, the group no longer hesitated, proceeding along the nearby stone path towards the bright bronze coffin in the distant large pit.","Generally speaking, the deeper into a tomb one goes, the more danger there is; the ultimate reach is particularly perilous.","Therefore, along the way, everyone became increasingly cautious, barely daring to breathe.","Unexpectedly, the depths of the underground palace turned out to be unusually quiet, with no traps or corpse monster lurking.","Thus, smoothly, the group reached the edge of the pit.","The gigantic bright bronze coffin was now right before their eyes.","Gazing upon the magnificent, dazzling coffin.","Not just Mr. Hui, even Mo Hua felt a surge of heat within.","He was eager to know just what was concealed within this grand and luxurious bronze coffin, and how much treasure it held...","Among the crowd, the black-robed elder spoke:","\"Mr. Hui, please open the coffin.\"","\"No rush, let me take a look first.\" Mr. Hui replied.","Sharpening the axe does not delay the work of chopping firewood; caution is critical at the final moment.","Mr. Hui circled the pit over halfway, examining the coffin from various angles and positions. However, the more he looked, the more grave his expression became, turning ultimately exceedingly somber.","\"The bronze is ancient, outwardly bright, with dark red and yellow; the coffin seams are damp, exterior patterns distorted...this indicates excessive Yin energy, seeping outward, and even leading to blood rust...\"","\"There might be a significant entity inside this coffin...\"","\"A significant entity?\" Mo Hua was taken aback.","\"Evil objects like corpse monsters or ghostly spirits...\" Mr. Hui said.","Stone glanced around, frowning: \"No wonder, the depths of the underground palace show no traps or killing formations; the most dangerous element, it turns out, is this coffin itself.\"","\"What now?\" Stone asked.","\"What else can we do? We can’t just make a retreat.\" Rat interjected, \"It’s long been said, wealth is found amidst danger. Mr. Hui, please open the coffin.\"","\"Hmm.\" Mr. Hui nodded.","Having been in this line of work for many years, he was an experienced grave robber, having faced numerous tumultuous situations.","At this point, even if there was something astonishing inside the coffin, he wouldn’t be satisfied without at least taking a look.","Moreover, judging by the guests’ words, this coffin held significant intrigue.","\"The task of opening the coffin is in your hands, Mr. Hui.\" The black-robed elder rasped.","\"Naturally,\" Mr. Hui nodded, \"this is our specialty, but since the coffin is so large, we’re short-handed and could use some assistance from you esteemed guests.\"","The black-robed elder nodded.","Then Mr. Hui prepared to open the coffin.","Before opening the coffin, he retrieved from his storage bag a two-foot-tall, pitch-black statue of the Ksitigarbha Bodhisattva and placed it on the ground.","The face of the Ksitigarbha statue was strangely gloomy.","On its left and right sides were the words: \"Life and death are destined; wealth and honor are from heaven.\"","Mr. Hui took out three sticks of incense, placed them before the statue, held a cup of yellow wine, and kowtowed, saying:","\"Ksitigarbha Bodhisattva, bless us, open the coffin, gain wealth, and avoid all taboos.\"","After speaking, he poured the yellow wine onto the ground.","Seeing the Ksitigarbha statue, Mo Hua’s pupils trembled slightly, but before he could take a closer look, Mr. Hui had already finished the ritual and put the statue away.","Once done, he officially started opening the coffin.","But when it came to opening the coffin, Mo Hua couldn’t be of much help.","This bronze coffin was a third-grade item, with all its formations and mechanisms being third-grade, beyond the current capabilities of a Foundation Building Cultivator and a second-grade Formation Master like him.","While a second-grade Earth Formation, even if unfamiliar, could be learned and improvised.","But third-grade formations, involving more profound formation principles, were genuinely beyond his current learning capacity.","Thus, while everyone was bustling about, Mo Hua could only find a step on the corridor at the edge of the pit, sitting and watching from afar as Mr. Hui and his group opened the coffin.","Mr. Hui took out a third-grade Array Plate, placing it at the four corners of the bronze coffin.","The Array Plate appeared to be a family heirloom, its formations beyond Mo Hua’s current comprehension, though he suspected it was used for suppressing evil and binding zombies.","Additionally, there was a yellow talisman.","This yellow talisman wasn’t a paper talisman but a Jade Talisman made of yellow jade, with Mr. Hui securing it on the bronze coffin.","There was Chicken Blood Wine poured around it.","This chicken blood, from an unknown breed of Spirit Beast, full of vigorous Blood Qi, appeared to cleanse Yin and suppress evil around the bronze coffin.","Moreover, there were chalk lines, Spiritual Rice Water...","Indeed, many assorted items were involved, the procedures quite complex."]},{"number":1967,"title":"Chapter 1967 - 952: Opening the Coffin (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Mo Hua gazed at the scene, feeling a bit dazzled. At the same time, he sighed inwardly; the path of Tao Cultivation has its variations, and for Mr. Hui and his group to make a living like this, they must have some family heritage and real skills.","No wonder those four black-robed cultivators sought out Mr. Hui and his group for tomb raiding and coffin opening.","Mo Hua memorized the techniques of Mr. Hui, keeping them etched in his mind.","Although he couldn’t understand them now, it was always right to remember them for the future.","A man of many skills is never burdened.","If he could acquire some tomb heritage in the future, studying, tomb raiding, digging graves, opening coffins, and finding some treasure seemed a worthwhile pursuit.","About an hour later, Mr. Hui had everything set up.","The rest of the minor tasks were being handled by Stone and Rat.","Mr. Hui then approached Mo Hua and warned: \"Little brother, opening the coffin later will be dangerous. Whatever you do, don’t go down there.\"","\"Mm-hmm.\" Mo Hua nodded repeatedly.","There was no need for him to say it; Mo Hua already knew the danger.","Such risky tasks were certainly for others to do first.","Seeing that Mo Hua understood the situation, Mr. Hui nodded, turned to leave, but suddenly thought of something and, hesitating for a moment, asked Mo Hua:","\"Little brother, did Rat cause you any trouble earlier in the branching path?\"","Mo Hua’s Divine Thought stirred, and he suddenly realized.","The matters in the branching path were indeed seen by Mr. Hui; he knew that Rat was chasing him, but he hadn’t spoken of it earlier.","These people were indeed shrewd.","In that case...","Mo Hua’s mind turned slightly, then he wore a slightly reluctant expression, \"No...\"","Mr. Hui said kindly, \"No worries, you don’t need to be afraid. If anything happens, tell me.\"","Mo Hua still looked as if he had words he couldn’t speak.","Seeing this, Mr. Hui had some guesses, so he said: \"Rest assured, with me here, Rat won’t dare trouble you.\"","Mo Hua then felt a bit more confident, and muttered: \"He... wanted something from me.\"","\"Wanted something?\" Mr. Hui was slightly taken aback, \"What thing?\"","Mo Hua glanced into the distance, saw Rat was far away, and then whispered:","\"The artifact...\"","Mr. Hui frowned, remaining silent.","Mo Hua’s gaze flickered, from Mr. Hui’s expression, he could roughly deduce that Mr. Hui was aware that Mr. Pi had such an artifact.","But he might not know what this artifact truly entailed, otherwise, his demeanor couldn’t be so calm.","Even if he appeared calm, there would be some fluctuation in the Divine Soul.","Ordinary fluctuations in a cultivator’s Divine Soul couldn’t escape Mo Hua’s perception.","Mr. Hui pondered for a moment, glanced at Mo Hua, and asked: \"Is this artifact in your possession?\"","Mo Hua shook his head.","\"Be honest with me, I won’t blame you.\" Mr. Hui said.","Mo Hua still shook his head, \"I really don’t know anything about an artifact.\"","Mr. Hui frowned, \"If you don’t have it, why would Rat be chasing you?\"","Mo Hua looked equally ’baffled’, \"I don’t know... I don’t even know what the artifact looks like...\"","\"Mr. Hui,\" Mo Hua looked somewhat curious, then quietly asked, \"Do you know what this artifact looks like?\"","Mr. Hui was silent for a moment, then nodded, \"This artifact is made from the claw of an Exotic Beast, with a tip as transparent as jade, embellished with gold and silver, looking ancient...\"","Before Mr. Hui finished, he saw Mo Hua’s expression change dramatically, as though he was taken aback. Then he forcefully composed himself, his gaze somewhat evasive.","With that demeanor, how could he deceive Mr. Hui’s eyes?","Mr. Hui then asked: \"What’s wrong?\"","\"Nothing.\" Mo Hua shook his head.","\"Tell me.\" Mr. Hui’s tone was gentle, but his demeanor had some solemnity.","\"I...\" Mo Hua hesitated for a long time, then muttered, \"This artifact... I think I’ve seen it before...\"","Mr. Hui’s expression changed slightly, \"You’ve truly seen it?\"","\"Yes.\" Mo Hua nodded.","\"Where?\"","\"Right...,\" Mo Hua lowered his voice, \"right on him...\"","\"On him?\" Mr. Hui frowned, \"On Rat?\"","\"Yes,\" Mo Hua lowered his voice, somewhat incredulous, and said:","\"That day, when he took Mr. Pi’s storage pouch from me, I saw him seemingly tuck a tooth-like thing secretly into his palm.\"","\"I didn’t know what it was, nor did I dare to mention it.\"","\"After that, he kept insisting I stole a ’artifact’...\"","\"But...\"","Mo Hua furrowed his brows tighter, looking puzzled, \"This ’artifact’ was clearly in his possession, so why did he insist that I took it?\"","Mr. Hui’s expression grew increasingly unpleasant.","Having been in this trade for so long, how could he not understand?","Rat was crying thief to catch a thief, trying to frame Mo Hua to clear his own suspicion, intending to keep the artifact for himself.","He even planned to kill Mo Hua to silence him.","This way, no one would ever know the artifact was in his possession.","But previously, in the branching path, when he attempted to silence Mo Hua as the group scattered, he was caught by Mr. Hui, forcing Rat to momentarily back off and subsequently threaten Mo Hua to keep quiet.","Based on Mo Hua’s brief words and Mr. Hui’s years of experience navigating the Cultivation World, Mr. Hui quickly pieced together the sequence of events in his mind.","The artifact...","\"Is this artifact truly so important? Worthy of Rat going to such lengths, hiding it from me, wanting to keep it to himself...\"","Mr. Hui’s gaze grew increasingly cold.","Mo Hua quietly said: \"Mr. Hui...\"","Mr. Hui gathered his thoughts, glanced at Mo Hua, and gently assured: \"Don’t worry, as long as I’m here, he wouldn’t dare harm you.\"","Mo Hua let out a long sigh of relief, gratefully saying: \"Thank you, Mr. Hui.\"","Mr. Hui smiled kindly at Mo Hua, then turned to leave.","But after just a few steps, the smile on his face disappeared, his expression turned grim, and his eyes gradually filled with greed."]},{"number":1968,"title":"Chapter 1968 - 952: Opening the Coffin (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Mo Hua saw the bluish-gray evil thoughts slowly sprouting above Mr. Hui’s head, and a faint smile appeared at the corner of his mouth.","...","Afterward, everyone prepared to open the coffin.","Thirty minutes later, everything was ready.","In the deep pit, before the bright yellow bronze coffin.","Mr. Hui took a sip of the bright red chicken blood wine, bolstered his courage, dispelled the evil qi, and said in a deep voice, \"Open the coffin.\"","As soon as the words fell, the surrounding yin energy grew even heavier.","Mr. Hui activated the Formation, set the Mo Line, and used Spiritual Rice Water on his forehead to activate the Yellow Jade Blood Pattern Talisman on the bronze coffin.","A layer of light barrier, hazy and indistinct, rose up, enclosing everyone along with the bronze coffin.","On the light barrier, characters resembling Taoist Runes lit up one by one.","These characters, neither entirely formation nor rune, seemed like some kind of aphorism, containing mysterious power, suppressing the bronze coffin.","\"Remove the nails!\" Mr. Hui commanded again.","Stone, along with two other black-robed men and an elderly black-robed cultivator, altogether four people, immediately leaped onto the bronze coffin, occupying the four corners, pried open the lock with jade, poured royal water, and then used the Golden Core Power to forcibly remove the four coffin nails from the corners of the bronze coffin.","Without the coffin nails, the bright yellow bronze coffin was unsealed.","The yin energy and death energy from the coffin began to seep out.","Everyone present felt uneasy; even Mo Hua felt a slight chill despite being far away, causing goosebumps to rise on his skin.","Cold sweat appeared on Mr. Hui’s palms, but he still braced himself with full concentration and said in a deep voice,","\"Open!\"","Then the four of them no longer hesitated and slowly lifted the bronze coffin lid.","An intense stench of decay immediately wafted out, with yin energy spreading like frost, turning the entire deep pit into a chilling ice cellar as if it were the coldest winter.","Mr. Hui fought the palpitations and glanced inside the coffin, then his pupils shook, leaving him speechless.","The rest of the group glanced into the coffin and also fell silent.","From afar, Mo Hua felt the chilling yin energy, followed by an eerie silence, prompting his curiosity, so he leaned forward to look.","From a distance, he couldn’t see clearly.","So he climbed onto a nearby corridor roof, looked down from above into the coffin, and upon seeing it, Mo Hua’s expression changed, feeling nauseated.","Inside the respectable and elegant bronze coffin, lay a pile of corpses.","These corpses, dirty and decaying, with severed limbs stacked like discarded mud, were piled within the luxuriously decorated bright yellow bronze coffin.","It was a shocking sight to behold.","Leaving everyone momentarily speechless.","Mr. Hui’s expression turned extremely grim as he turned to those black-robed cultivators, coldly asking,","\"Is this the so-called Great Wilderness royal tomb you mentioned?\"","Everywhere in sight, the tomb contained no treasure at all but a heap of malformed, decaying corpses.","The black-robed cultivators remained calm, yet they stayed silent.","The atmosphere turned somewhat eerie.","At this moment, Mo Hua’s pupils trembled.","He felt a faint trace of... the Taoist Demon’s aura from amidst these corpses, from the dense death and yin energy.","\"Be careful!\" Mo Hua shouted.","Before the words finished, the bright yellow bronze coffin trembled.","The rotting corpses, twisted limbs, and muddy flesh began to vibrate slightly, then gradually wriggled, twisted, and converged towards the center. Flesh wove together, forming a huge \"flesh and blood statue\".","With a terrifying roar, a powerful, twisted breath burst forth in all directions.","Everyone’s complexion changed instantly."]},{"number":1969,"title":"Chapter 1969 - 953: Flesh Effigy","paragraphs":["\"What on earth... is this thing...\"","Mr. Hui trembled as he spoke.","Before opening the coffin, he had guessed that such a large copper coffin might hide a \"big thing.\"","But he hadn’t expected that thing to be so enormous, and so terrifying—a flesh colossus, woven from countless corpses and blood, standing tall and sinister.","This flesh colossus towered more than ten people high, its aura fully unleashed, reeking and chill-inducing, causing dread within all who beheld it.","Corpses are gluttons for flesh.","Such a gigantic flesh colossus was no exception.","Upon sensing the breath of the living around it, two fissures tore open on the grotesquely massive head of the flesh colossus, resembling two jet-black crimson eyes, gazing at Mr. Hui and the others.","At the same time, its body began to writhe, a swift wave of its fleshly arms conjured a bloody gust, sweeping towards the crowd.","Mr. Hui was shocked, but he did not flee.","When facing a major enemy, especially being the closest, the faster one runs, the quicker one dies.","Moreover, he was the nearest; it was already too late to escape.","\"Everyone, strike together, subdue this beast!\"","Mr. Hui shouted loudly, then gritted his teeth, immediately retrieving an entire bottle of treasured Blood Wine, pouring it over the Formation, biting his finger, putting it to his forehead, and chanting an enigmatic incantation fervently, activating the ancient Taoist Array Plate he had set up—a formation yet not a formation, talisman yet not a talisman.","Instantly, brilliance exploded from the Array Plate.","One by one, ancient and profound script patterns emerged, forming a layer of light screen.","The bloody storm stirred by the flesh colossus crashed directly against the light screen like a scarlet tide.","A colossal roar rang out, sending intense oscillations rippling outward.","The light of the Array Plate dimmed slightly, while the bloody tide of the colossus began to evaporate.","The flesh colossus’s first wave of assault was thus neutralized, but in the blink of an eye, amidst a roar filled with rotten flesh and stench, the colossus raised its arm again to strike down.","The enormous arm, entwined with ghastly zombies, descended like a shadow upon Mr. Hui.","Mr. Hui was activating the Array Plate, with no escape path; seeing the swarming arm, along with the gloomy dead air, coming to demise himself, he immediately gritted his teeth and exploded the Yellow Jade Talisman.","The Yellow Jade Blood Pattern Talisman detonated, producing rays of golden light that rose skyward, shattering the flesh colossus’s arm into pieces.","Countless pieces of flesh rained down like showers.","Mr. Hui promptly summoned his own Magic Treasure, an Earth Series shield, to protect his body from being tainted by the flesh colossus’s rain.","The flesh colossus’s arm, shattered by the Yellow Jade Talisman explosion, began to reconstitute.","In a blink, countless broken limbs and flesh once again gathered, forming a new arm.","This arm was thicker, twined with a sinister black, even dripping bloody water.","Before Mr. Hui could react, the arm, bearing fury, black qi and blood, pressed towards him.","And Mr. Hui’s maneuvers were nearly exhausted.","If he were to endure this strike stubbornly, his own shield would shatter, causing him to lose his life here.","\"Help, quick!\"","Mr. Hui turned his head, screaming in anger.","Stone quickly stood by Mr. Hui, shouting loudly, activating Golden Core power, covering himself in earth and stone armor, intending to withstand the colossus’s attack with Mr. Hui.","Mouse glanced slightly, didn’t act, but took a few steps back.","In contrast, the four black-robed cultivators intervened.","They seemed to see Mr. Hui still useful and didn’t want him dead here.","The black-robed young cultivator swung a longsword, sending out blood lights.","The black-robed old cultivator brought forth a strangely shaped short knife, its blade emanating dark light.","The two other burly men seemed to focus on Body Cultivation, they neither used Spiritual Artifacts nor Magic Treasures, but directly attacked the flesh colossus with their physical strength.","With a thunderous boom, an explosion resounded, blowing flesh away.","Even some zombie limbs flew over Mo Hua’s head.","Mo Hua had already drawn a Second Grade Nineteen Patterns Gold Stone Formation on the ground, hiding within to avoid getting involved.","Though the Second Grade Nineteen Patterns Formation was one pattern short of Twenty Patterns, it couldn’t withstand Golden Core attacks.","But to block the aftermath of the battle was no problem.","Mo Hua knew himself to be \"frail,\" thus had huddled inside the formation early on.","The aftermath of the battle reached him.","Powerful waves struck his Formation, causing its light to flicker, with signs of Formations Patterns shattering, seemingly on the verge of collapse.","Yet the Gold Stone Formation met Mo Hua’s expectations and ultimately held firm.","Once the storm began to subsist, Mo Hua looked up, seeing Mr. Hui before the colossal bright yellow copper coffin, appearing disheveled, with his own shield looking dim.","Stone’s earth and stone armor was completely cracked.","Mouse stood by, face slightly pale, yet appeared unscathed.","The two black-robed burly men, their robes torn more than half, exposed muscular bodies beneath, but still didn’t reveal their faces.","The black-robed young cultivator and old cultivator, one controlling the sword, one controlling the knife, stood a bit farther, thus were unaffected.","Against the crowd, under the combined attack of six or seven Golden Core experts, the massive flesh colossus, its arms had been rendered useless.","Mo Hua was secretly startled.","The flesh colossus was indeed strong, but these few Golden Core cultivators, particularly the black-robed ones, seemed pretty formidable as well."]},{"number":1970,"title":"Chapter 1970 - 953: Flesh Corpse Statue (2)","paragraphs":["Even Mr. Hui, his skills were not small.","They not only withstood the attack of this corpse figure but also countered, blasting off its two corpse-formed arms.","Mo Hua looked again at the blood flesh figure formed by the coagulation of corpses, emerging from the bright brass coffin, with a slight furrowed brow:","\"It indeed has the ’Taoist Demon aura’...\"","\"But the mutation isn’t deep, just a hint, seems not fully hatched, just a prototype...\"","If not for this, everyone here would have already been dead.","Mo Hua knows all too well the terror of the Taoist Demon.","Forget these six or seven Golden Core, even if there were sixty or six hundred Golden Core, it would be of no use at all.","In the end, there’s only one word: ’death.’","A true Third Grade ’Taoist Demon’ could completely overrun the Solitary Mountain state boundary, even implicating the Qianxue State Boundary, plunging the entire Qianxue region into a great catastrophe.","\"This Taoist Demon, is it naturally formed, or... is someone nurturing it?\"","Nurturing a Taoist Demon...","Mo Hua shuddered inwardly.","Could it be... his Uncle is nurturing it?!","Taoist Demon contains the karmic mutation of heaven and earth, such a terrifying thing that ordinary cultivators avoid like the plague, and the only one truly qualified to nurture, capable of nurturing, and has actually nurtured one, as far as Mo Hua knows, is only his Uncle.","\"Uncle...\"","Mo Hua frowned, thought for a moment, then shook his head.","It shouldn’t be...","Qianxue State Boundary is not like Big Black Mountain State Boundary.","Big Black Mountain State Boundary is a remote, Second Grade small boundary, with treacherous mountains and impoverished people, making cultivation difficult.","But Qianxue State Boundary is a Fifth Grade Great Province Boundary, where the Tao cultivation atmosphere is prevalent, with families and sects everywhere, guarded by the Heaven Void Ancestor.","Even boundaries like Solitary Mountain in the vicinity are all within the spheres of influence of various families.","Some small skirmishes are fine, but for someone like Uncle, who has the title of ’Taoist’ and is a great Demon Head, they would definitely be on their guard.","Generally, Uncle’s reach shouldn’t extend to Qianxue State Boundary either.","And given the ’relationship’ between Mo Hua and Uncle, if he really came, Mo Hua should have been able to encounter or at least sense it long ago.","Of course, Mo Hua hopes he never meets Uncle again.","He’s afraid Uncle is petty and bears a grudge against him.","Given the origins between them, once they meet, Uncle would definitely want his life.","Of course, these are all digressions.","The immediate biggest problem is still the blood flesh figure with the budding Taoist Demon aura.","This blood flesh figure, buried deep in Solitary Mountain, is a huge hidden danger.","If this hidden danger isn’t resolved, let alone that Mo Hua and others may not leave this tomb alive, even the whole Solitary Mountain City might face impending doom.","Once this blood flesh figure truly becomes a ’Taoist Demon,’ then the entire Qianxue State Boundary may face a brutal massacre catastrophe.","In the turbulent wind and rain, families might be able to protect themselves with their ancestral foundations.","But it’s the loose cultivators at the bottom who will suffer the most.","Mo Hua sighed slightly in his heart.","And while he was pondering, there was another disturbance in the distance. With the wind carrying a stench swirling back, the massive blood flesh figure began to reform and revive again.","The few people, including Mr. Hui, who had just breathed a sigh of relief, immediately felt their spirits sink, bearing solemn expressions.","The blood flesh figure let out a roar, its voice full of resentment, as if struggling and howling of countless dying people.","At the same time, its flesh was also writhing and transforming bit by bit.","The countless severed limbs on its body seemed to come alive, and one by one, corpse abominations reassembled from them revealed their heads from its rotting flesh.","\"Not good!\"","Mr. Hui didn’t know what changes had occurred in the blood flesh figure, but he knew that in a graveyard, the weirder the change, the less it should be allowed to develop unchecked.","Mr. Hui took out another Yellow Jade Talisman, on which more bloody inscriptions were carved.","\"Kill!\"","Mr. Hui activated the talisman, transforming it into golden light, attacking the blood flesh figure.","The others also realized things were not going well and took action together, using swords, talismans, spells, and strength to slaughter the blood flesh figure and the smaller corpse abominations it spawned.","The scene was extremely bloody and intense for a moment.","After killing with all their might for a while, they finally halted the mutation of the corpse figure.","But the blood flesh figure still seemed indestructible, able to revitalize slowly no matter how it was slain.","Mr. Hui turned pale, \"What the hell is this thing? Why won’t it end...\"","His spiritual power was almost depleted, his own Magical Treasure was dim, and continuing to fight would surely lead to being exhausted to death.","After pondering for a while, Mr. Hui gritted his teeth and said, \"No way, let’s pull back first and think of a plan.\"","The others, aware of the dire stakes, nodded in agreement.","Everyone unleashed their abilities, launching one final wave of attacks, then seized the opportunity during the blood flesh figure’s revival to retreat swiftly.","But as soon as Mr. Hui retreated, breaking the Formation, the geomantic setup suppressing the brass coffin was lost.","The Yellow Jade Talisman exploded, and the surrounding Taoist inscriptions were completely obliterated.","Without these restrictions, the blood flesh figure’s body revived even faster. In just a few fleeting moments, it wriggled back to its colossal form.","Seeing the group trying to escape, the blood flesh figure was furious. Its two gigantic deformed arms swung within the deep pit, resembling two massive pythons, stirring up a storm of dust and blood, attempting to catch and kill the fleeing Mr. Hui and his group.","But its arms, though long, had their limits.","And since it was spawned from the brass coffin, it seemed unable to leave it.","Therefore, it didn’t manage to catch Mr. Hui and the others of the Golden Core Realm.","Watching Mr. Hui and his group escape farther and farther, the ’blood flesh’ ready to be eaten flew away, and the blood flesh figure was furious. Accompanied by a roar mixed with countless fierce howls, its body began wholly splitting into one corpse abomination after another.","```"]},{"number":1971,"title":"Chapter 1971 - 953: Flesh Corpse Idol_3","paragraphs":["These corpse fiends were hatched from its flesh, mixed with its corpse poison and death aura, as if they were its \"offspring\".","The offspring of the flesh corpse image separated from its body, baring fangs and claws, and then surged like a tide, chasing after the fleeing crowd.","These \"offspring\" of the corpse fiends were densely packed, unending, making Mr. Hui’s scalp tingle.","Even Mo Hua was startled.","He hid at the edge of a deep pit, where the flesh corpse image could not harm him.","But these separated corpse fiend offspring, like a tide, were different.","If submerged by this corpse tide, he would surely die without a burial place.","Without hesitation, Mo Hua immediately took to his heels and ran.","During the chaos, Mo Hua’s fleeing figure caught the attention of another person.","This person was none other than Mouse.","Seeing Mo Hua’s figure, he acted as a cat would upon seeing a mouse, instantly driven by greed, uncontrollably chasing after Mo Hua.","In his heart, this tomb raiding was surely over.","Such a colossal corpse figure could not be killed; escaping was the best option.","Since this journey was destined to be fruitless, he might as well capture Mo Hua and interrogate the whereabouts of the Gold-Seeking Talisman.","Once he had the Gold-Seeking Talisman, he would flee far away.","Thereafter taking on a new identity, he would seek a great opportunity.","Mouse’s eyes glinted red, his brow began to take on a bluish tint, and with a dark expression, he pursued Mo Hua.","The corpse fiends chased him, and he chased Mo Hua.","The situation here was different from that in the passageway.","Previously, in the passageway, Mo Hua relied on his movement technique to maneuver skillfully, leaving some room for himself.","But now, a large horde of corpse fiends was pursuing behind.","Both of them could only run forward; if Mo Hua used the Water Passing Step to dodge left and right a few times, he would easily be caught by the corpse fiends behind.","Once submerged in the corpse tide, with densely packed zombie hands grabbing, zombie teeth gnawing, there was no space to dodge; no matter how good the movement technique, it was useless.","Therefore, Mo Hua could only run straight ahead.","But the Water Passing Step was not suited for long-distance sprinting.","He was still in Foundation Establishment; if he continued running like this, he would only be pulled closer and closer by Mouse, eventually falling into Mouse’s hands.","Mo Hua’s brow slightly furrowed.","Being chased by this damn mouse several times now, endlessly, his patience had worn thin.","Mo Hua’s face gradually turned cold.","Mouse did not notice, his mind was solely focused on how to catch Mo Hua and where to take him for interrogation once caught.","Finally, after running for 30 minutes.","The distance between Mouse and Mo Hua was almost just an arm’s reach; he could reach out and touch him.","With a flash of brilliance in his eyes, Mouse immediately extended his rough hand to grab Mo Hua’s shoulder, and unsurprisingly, he caught him.","Mouse’s expression was overjoyed, and his gaze became even more greedy.","But his joy was short-lived; in the next moment, the water mist dispersed, and Mo Hua’s figure directly vanished from his grasp.","Mouse’s expression froze, and he couldn’t help but look up.","At this glance, he saw a pair of golden eyes.","Within those eyes, there was a strict prison, with Sword Qi surging, the sharp Sword Intent directly tore through the air, cleaving into Mouse’s eyes.","A piercing pain exploded.","Mouse roared in agony, clutching his eyes, his body came to a halt, and then his Divine Soul trembled, and terror arose in his heart:","\"What is this sinister thing...?\"","Before he could think further, he felt a pair of hands clutching his shoulders, while another pair tugged at his calves.","Not just that, all over his body, his head, hands of the corpse fiend grabbed onto him.","Moreover, a corpse fiend opened its sharp teeth, starting to gnaw on his head...","Stunned by the Soul-Shocking Sword, Mouse’s movement technique stalled for a moment, after which he was chased down by the dense horde of corpse fiends.","Mouse was shocked, struggling desperately, but the more corpse fiends he shook off, the more climbed onto his body.","In just a moment, he was thus drowned alive by the corpse tide.","Mo Hua did not look back; he had no leisure for that.","In this life-and-death moment of being chased by the corpse tide, finding time to unleash a Water Shadow Phantom Body, and add a Soul-Shocking Sword Eyes was already his limit.","He even only executed the Soul-Shocking Sword for a moment.","Then he turned and ran towards the distance without looking back.","He ran, running until he reached the tunnel before the subterranean palace, only then did Mo Hua breathe a sigh of relief.","This was the path they had taken; it was also the only way out.","Mo Hua immediately dove into the tunnel, and it seemed no corpse fiends were chasing behind.","Turning back to look, he saw the corpse fiends like water, but most gathered around the flesh corpse image, fewer the further out they went.","By the edge of the tunnel, only a few remained.","The copper coffin and the corpse image were of the same root, the corpse image could not leave the copper coffin.","And this group of hatched corpse fiends, with their immense flesh corpse image, were like a \"mother-child bond\", unable to stray far from the corpse image.","Mo Hua breathed a slight sigh of relief.","\"Little brother.\"","Someone called him, and Mo Hua turned to find it was Mr. Hui.","Besides Mr. Hui, there were Stone, and a few black-robed cultivators, all gathered in the tunnel.","These people were Golden Core, stronger than Mo Hua, and could run fast when facing danger, thus also evading the corpse tide.","However, at this moment, everyone seemed weak, clearly exhausted from the fight with the flesh corpse image and the life-or-death escape.","Mr. Hui looked Mo Hua up and down, asking, \"Little brother... are you alright?\"","Relief and luck of surviving the ordeal showed on Mo Hua’s face as he nodded and said, \"I was fortunate, I made it out.\"","Mr. Hui also sighed in relief, a gleam in his eyes: \"Good that you’re okay.\"","Mo Hua then walked into the tunnel; after just a few steps, suddenly a heavy, silent voice sounded:","\"Where’s Mouse?\"","\"Mouse?\" Mr. Hui was slightly stunned, then took a moment to look around, indeed finding Mouse absent from the group.","It was Stone who asked the question.","Stone furrowed his brows, then looked at Mo Hua, saying:","\"When we were fleeing, I saw Mouse escaping with you; there’s no reason you made it out, but he didn’t. Where’s Mouse?\"","In Mr. Hui’s group, although Mr. Pi was in Foundation Establishment, he held a special status.","Mr. Hui was the leader, and Stone and Mouse had the best relationship.","Therefore, only he cared about Mouse at this point.","Mo Hua shook his head, \"I was focused on escaping, I don’t know about anything else...\"","Stone cast a doubtful look at Mo Hua, but after reflecting, found it improbable.","A Foundation Establishment, trying to harm a Golden Core, was unlikely.","Just then, a set of heavy footsteps echoed from the tunnel mouth.","Mo Hua’s heart trembled slightly, as he looked back, he saw Mouse, covered in blood, hanging with rotting flesh, full of bite marks, trudging step by step.","His face seethed with venom, eyes veined with blood-red, stared fixedly at Mo Hua, uttering:","\"Brat, you... got me killed...\""]},{"number":1972,"title":"Chapter 1972 - 954: Revealed","paragraphs":["Mo Hua’s expression changed, and without hesitation, he lightly tapped his foot and used his movement technique to run to Mr. Hui’s side.","The mangled rat stretched out a trembling hand and pointed at Mo Hua, \"You little beast, I’ll kill you...\"","Everyone looked at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua looked terrified.","Mr. Hui frowned, \"Rat, what did he do to you?\"","Rat tried to say something, but as soon as he opened his mouth, he choked, spitting out blood and unable to speak, his eyes full of bloodshot and malice, wishing to kill Mo Hua immediately.","Mo Hua whispered to Mr. Hui, \"Did he get bitten by the big zombie, and now corpse poison has invaded his brain, making him unable to speak?\"","Mr. Hui glanced at Rat’s miserable state, his expression heavy.","Stone also felt compassion and said, \"Second Master, we’re all brothers, let’s save Rat.\"","Mr. Hui hesitated.","\"Second Master!\"","Mr. Hui sighed and then took out a bottle of pills and a calming talisman.","These pills and calming talisman seemed extraordinary, and Mr. Hui didn’t have many of them, so taking them out was quite painful for him.","He wanted to heal Rat, but Rat seemed lost, the dark blue on his forehead deepening, his eyes getting redder, staring at Mo Hua with murderous intent.","\"Has the poison of the evil spirit completely erupted...\"","Mo Hua thought silently.","Seeing Rat roar and try to pounce on Mo Hua, Mr. Hui immediately said, \"Stone, restrain him.\"","\"Alright.\" Stone rushed forward and blocked Rat.","Rat’s mind was getting less clear, and he started attacking Stone, but he was severely injured and lacked the divine sense to channel spiritual power. With only a fraction of his Golden Core strength remaining, Stone quickly subdued him.","Remembering their friendship, Stone didn’t strike hard.","Mr. Hui took out spiritual liquid, cleaned Rat’s wounds, then fed him the pill and lit calming incense.","In the misty fragrance, Mr. Hui placed the soothing jade talisman on Rat’s forehead.","With a clear light spreading out, Rat indeed quieted down.","\"Curb yourself, keep your mind clear, forget everything, let nothing linger in your heart.\" Mr. Hui said in a deep voice.","Rat seemed to really listen, the dark blue on his forehead dissipating somewhat, and much of the red in his eyes fading.","Mo Hua glanced at Mr. Hui, thinking that this Mr. Hui knew quite a bit about the mysteries of the graveyard.","He might not truly understand the affairs of evil spirits, but how to exorcise and ward off evil spirits, and suppress some of the yin spirits in the graveyard, these tomb robbers probably had some traditional knowledge passed down.","Under the suppression of the jade talisman, much of Rat’s \"greed\" subsided.","Yet Mo Hua frowned.","If Rat really wakes up, it will be troublesome.","The burial talisman is indeed on himself.","Rat guessed right.","If he comes back to life and his greed stirs, he will latch onto me like a mad dog.","Moreover, during the chase by the corpse spirits earlier, I had already exposed the Soul-Shocking Sword Skill in front of him.","Whether or not he knows the details of this swordsmanship, he cannot be allowed to live.","Mo Hua glanced around.","In this group, only he wasn’t a Golden Core. Standing among the crowd, he was like a lamb among a pack of fierce wolves.","Therefore, any trump card that poses a threat to a Golden Core must be hidden well, and must not be revealed by Rat.","But now, not only is Rat not dead, he is gradually recovering.","His physical body and his divine thought.","Mo Hua frowned.","\"Golden Core is truly different...not so easily fooled to death...\"","To kill a Golden Core, it’s best for another Golden Core to strike.","But with my current cultivation, whether divine sense or spiritual power, it hasn’t surpassed Foundation Establishment. Trying to kill a Golden Core with just one Shocking God Pupil Skill was indeed wishful thinking...","Mr. Hui was still relying on the jade talisman to suppress the evil thoughts and corpse poison in Rat.","Rat’s gaze was also slightly clearer.","But the jade talisman was still superficial and couldn’t completely eradicate the evil spirit in Rat’s Sea of Consciousness.","Evil spirits are not good things to deal with, nor are they easy to remove.","Moreover, he was later bitten again by the countless corpse spirits in the copper coffin, so now the evil thoughts in his mind were deeply rooted.","Mr. Hui could only suppress them to some extent.","As Mo Hua expected, Rat’s expression soon changed, and his demeanor became hideous again.","\"Don’t overthink it, keep your mind!\" Mr. Hui shouted sharply, \"Otherwise, once your mind is lost, and the corpse poison reaches your brain, not even the Heavenly King can save you.\"","Rat also knew the dangers, so he gritted his teeth and tried not to think about anything.","But in his mind, all sorts of desires continued to unfold.","There was even a burgeoning desire, as bloodthirsty as a corpse spirit.","Mo Hua looked at Rat, then at the surroundings.","Mr. Hui and Stone were fully focused on Rat; the four black-robed cultivators were each sitting cross-legged, recovering their strength, as if they weren’t concerned with the life or death of a tomb robber.","Mo Hua’s mind stirred slightly, and he rubbed his thumb, taking out the burial talisman from the storage ring and covertly toying with it for a moment.","Rat seemed to sense something and, as if driven by unseen forces, looked at Mo Hua, immediately spotting the gold and silver engraved, glossy tooth talisman in his hand.","Rat’s pupils suddenly widened, his heart pounding uncontrollably.","He looked up at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua gave him a slight smile, a smile with a touch of innocence, a touch of wickedness, like a cat toying with a rat.","This smile provoked the evil thoughts.","Rat’s mental defenses shattered instantly."]},{"number":1973,"title":"Chapter 1973 - 954: Revealed (2)","paragraphs":["\"You, it’s you...\"","The Rat gritted his teeth hard, nearly shattering them.","He knew he had been fooled by this kid, played with.","But at the same time, a stronger desire consumed his reason, and the Rat’s eyes turned bright red.","A surge of evil aura enveloped his face.","\"Not good!\"","Mr. Hui saw his calming talisman was full of cracks and immediately shouted: \"Stone, get the chains.\"","Stone took out the chains, trying to lock up the Rat who had blood-red eyes and was in a frenzied state.","But the next moment, the Rat roared furiously, and a stream of dark blood surged through his body. His arms swelled, breaking free of Stone’s chains, and then lunged at Mo Hua.","However, before he could reach Mo Hua, Mr. Hui drew his knife and slashed at the Rat’s leg.","The Rat stumbled and fell to the ground, quickly trying to get up again.","Mr. Hui immediately stepped forward and pressed the Rat down with his life shield.","Stone seized the opportunity to step forward and firmly locked the Rat with chains.","The Rat struggled and howled, unable to break free, like a zombie.","Mr. Hui sighed: \"The ’Corpse Transformation’ has begun, there’s no way out.\"","\"Then isn’t it...\" Stone frowned.","Mr. Hui was somewhat reluctant but had no choice but to say:","\"According to custom, once a tomb robber is infected with corpse poison and begins ’Corpse Transformation,’ we have to kill him to prevent disaster.\"","Stone understood this rule.","But considering their brotherhood, he was still reluctant for the Rat to die.","\"Mr. Hui, why not...\" Stone pondered, \"tie up the Rat and lock him aside, and see after some time?\"","\"If he improves, we can take him out and then hire a Pill Master to detoxify and repel evil, maybe he can regain his senses. Even if his cultivation is wasted, it’s better to keep him alive.\"","Mr. Hui fell into contemplation upon hearing this.","He had no fondness for the Rat.","Moreover, just before the bright yellow bronze coffin, when the flesh corpse likeness wanted to kill him, everyone intervened to help, except the Rat who had selfish thoughts and stood by idly.","But he also didn’t want to truly act and kill the Rat.","After all, they had worked together for so many years; he had to consider their camaraderie somewhat.","Mr. Hui was about to nod when suddenly Mo Hua’s muttering echoed in his ear, \"The item is clearly with him, why kill me to silence me?\"","This sentence was very low, carrying a hint of unnoticeable eeriness.","The item... is with him.","Mr. Hui was momentarily dazed, and without realizing it, a buried evil thought slowly began to emerge from the depths of his heart.","Mr. Hui struggled internally for a moment, shaking his head: \"In the tomb robbery business, rules are rules. Keeping him alive, once completely corpse transformed, will bring big trouble.\"","\"Life and death are fated, wealth lies in the heavens.\"","\"This is ancestral teaching; since we’ve taken up this bowl, we should be mentally prepared.\"","Meanwhile, the Rat’s corpse transformation worsened, his flesh began to rot and supurate, and his pupils contracted with more and more whites, gradually looking more menacing.","Stone was left speechless.","Mr. Hui sighed, \"Rat, sorry about this.\"","Then he took out a long knife, dipped in chicken blood, rubbed it with a yellow talisman, raised it high, and chopped off the Rat’s head in one blow.","The Rat’s head had eyes wide open, as if he couldn’t rest in peace.","Yet his body still struggled like a zombie.","Mr. Hui took out some Fire Talismans, ignited them, and burned the Rat’s body.","But discreetly stuffed the Rat’s storage pouch into his own pocket.","Third-grade fierce fire burned the Rat’s corpse into charcoal.","That’s how the Rat met his end.","Mr. Hui looked at the Rat’s remains, poured a glass of wine, and said softly: \"Don’t blame your brother.\"","Stone also looked at the Rat’s \"charcoal\" like corpse, then turned to Mr. Hui, with a very unfamiliar gaze.","Mo Hua also looked at the Rat, then silently at Mr. Hui, pondering in his heart.","Firstly, he had no immediate ideas about planting evil spirit.","But he had some experience with how to hatch, stimulate, and arouse people’s evil thoughts.","Human evil thoughts probably stem from their own desires.","When one stands tall on a thousand-foot wall, if there is no desire, there is strength.","Conversely, when people harbor greedy desires, they become weak, foolish, and prone to self-destruction.","In this world, there truly are no smart people.","Before desire, everyone is a fool.","\"Learn to perceive people’s desires and use them to make them self-destruct...\"","By perceiving others’ desires, one can \"manipulate\" others.","In a certain sense, it’s somewhat like Uncle’s \"Planting Devil in Taoist Heart.\"","But Mo Hua wasn’t very clear on more specific spell points.","Moreover, his current experience in \"manipulating people’s hearts\" was still very rudimentary and not very effective.","Next time, it should be more hidden and planned...","Mo Hua quietly calculated in his heart.","For a moment, everyone had their own thoughts.","...","The Rat died, and this matter came to a close, but the grave-robbing wasn’t over.","Men die for wealth, birds die for food.","On this trip, they naturally couldn’t return empty-handed.","Mr. Hui thought for a while, then said to the four black-robed cultivators:","\"Everyone, according to our prior agreement, if there are treasures in this tomb, we split them fifty-fifty. If there are no treasures, the commission doubles.\"","Now Mr. Pi is dead, and the Rat is dead.","Double the commission.","That left Mr. Hui and one other, just their share of the commission was no small amount.","Provided these black-robed cultivators were trustworthy and wouldn’t default.","Seemingly understanding Mr. Hui’s thoughts, the black-robed elder nodded: \"Mr. Hui, rest assured, what was agreed upon, naturally counts.\"","The elder’s tone was steady, and Mr. Hui slightly relaxed, then said:"]},{"number":1974,"title":"Chapter 1974 - 954: Emergence (Part 3)","paragraphs":["\"In that case, we currently have three choices:\"","\"First, we can withdraw now. Although doing so means you all need to pay double the commission, we have lost two companions who have risked their lives with us.\"","\"Both sides have suffered losses, but ours are greater. After all, Spirit Stones can be earned again, but once a companion is dead, it’s permanent.\"","\"Secondly, we can go treasure hunting elsewhere. This blood meat corpse is too vicious, and we should avoid its sharp edge. Perhaps we can find some treasures elsewhere and not become food for the undead.\"","\"The third option is that we try to find a way to kill the blood meat corpse.\"","\"The blood meat corpse was hatched from the bronze coffin, and by killing it, we can reach the bottom of the coffin.\"","\"Good things buried with the dead are often pressed at the bottom of the coffin. The greater the risk, the greater the rewards.\"","\"But as you’ve seen, this corpse is too powerful, and we may not be its match. It’s not worth taking such a big risk...\"","Mr. Hui considered the pros and cons and then looked at a few black-robed cultivators, \"What do you all plan to do?\"","The four black-robed cultivators were silent for a moment.","Mo Hua’s throat moved slightly, but he didn’t speak.","He quite wanted to slay this \"blood meat corpse.\"","If it remains, it might truly develop into a \"Taoist Demon\" over time.","By then, everyone in Solitary Mountain City would likely be doomed.","Moreover, Mo Hua had been recalling for a long time and sensed a familiar aura from this Solitary Mountain blood meat corpse.","This trace of aura was very similar to the chaotic, evil, deformed, and ferocious energy he had perceived at the node of the Divine Authority Tree.","There must be a connection between the two.","The nodes of the Divine Authority Tree are crucial to the Evil God sacrificial system.","Thus, the core of this blood meat corpse is very likely an \"Evil Embryo.\"","Killing this corpse might even expose the \"Evil Embryo.\"","But such matters were not up to him.","Furthermore, if this blood meat corpse were indeed an undeveloped Third Grade Taoist Demon prototype, it would to some extent possess the power of immortality and regeneration.","It would probably be impossible for just a few Golden Cores present to kill it...","Just as Mo Hua thought of this, he heard the black-robed elder say:","\"Kill this blood meat corpse and dig up its coffin.\"","Mr. Hui frowned, \"Gentleman, this might...\"","\"It can be killed.\" The black-robed elder’s eyes flickered, \"Within this corpse, a trace of ’nyue energy’ has emerged. As long as the nyue energy persists, it will not perish and will continue to revive.\"","\"Therefore, as long as there is a way to first suppress this trace of ’nyue energy’, we can negate its regenerative power and extinguish this blood meat corpse!\"","\"Nyue energy...\" Mr. Hui frowned, puzzled.","It was the first time he heard this term.","Mo Hua, however, was shocked internally:","This elderly cultivator is definitely not an ordinary person...","\"How can we suppress...this so-called ’nyue energy’?\" Mr. Hui asked.","\"I have my methods,\" the black-robed elder replied, \"I request Mr. Hui to lend your aid, using the inherent Maoshan Formation and Runes, to join us in subduing and eliminating this blood meat corpse.\"","Mr. Hui pondered for a moment, then nodded: \"Alright.\"","After further discussion, they began to act formally, setting out to destroy this enormous and hideous blood meat corpse within the Solitary Mountain burial ground, encased in a bright yellow bronze coffin.","But this matter had little to do with Mo Hua.","This was a Third Grade battlefield, not a puzzle to solve by position-finding or formation-breaking. With Mo Hua’s current cultivation and strength, he couldn’t participate.","Moreover, they weren’t trying to kill an ordinary undead.","It was a terrible zombie, possessing a \"Taoist Demon\" prototype.","No one expected anything of him anyway.","Not even the black-robed elder and Mr. Hui included him in their discussion.","Mo Hua could only watch from afar.","Several Golden Core cultivators present were swift in their actions and, after discussing the tactic, began to strike.","Stone, being a body cultivator, could only serve as muscle, dealing with frontal attacks and defenses.","Mr. Hui’s livelihood hid deeply within the Maoshan Tao legacy he bore.","This included the Daoist Script Formation and the Yellow Jade Blood Pattern Talisman, among others.","These things seemed naturally effective against undead evil objects.","Soon, with a roar filled with countless wailing spirits causing heart-wrenching pain, the battle with the blood meat corpse began anew.","Pale golden light shone, Daoist letters emerged, and under the suppression of the Yellow Jade Blood Talisman, everyone exerted their full effort against the blood meat corpse.","The scene was as it started.","The corpse, towering like a small mountain, raised its limb fused with mutilated remains, unleashing a scarlet rain laced with corrosive, sinister energy, intending to put the cultivators before it to death and devour them as feed.","Mr. Hui and a few others employed their tactics to contend against the blood meat corpse.","After the glow of various Taoist Skills faded, the blood meat corpse, once defeated, reformed. Its subsequent fury escalated, its murderous aura grew colder, and overall its energy became more formidable each time.","The more it revived, the stronger the blood meat corpse grew.","Mr. Hui gritted his teeth and persisted.","Meanwhile, after the blood meat corpse shattered and reformed thrice, the black-robed elder finally made a move.","From afar, Mo Hua couldn’t see clearly.","He could only vaguely see the elder fish out a piece of bone, perform some kind of worship, and as he pinched a seal, a thread of aura like chains in the void latched onto the blood meat corpse’s heart.","\"Bone?\"","Mo Hua was taken aback. Before he could comprehend, another resonant roar echoed, shaking one’s heart.","This roar resembled a dragon’s cry.","Mo Hua’s pupils shook; he quickly turned to look, and then he saw a black-robed giant standing in front of the gigantic blood meat corpse in the distance.","This giant, tall and strong, showed no lack of momentum facing the monstrous corpse.","With a roar, the giant struck with his fist.","The momentum of the punch was immense, and right before Mo Hua’s eyes, the formidable fist created a dragon’s silhouette.","Dragon?!","Mo Hua’s heart trembled.","And the giant, with dragon chants from his mouth, unleashed a punch bearing a dragon shadow, its power extremely potent.","The residual force shattered his black robe inch by inch, revealing his bronze-cast, iron-forged flesh as well as the dense, solemn, and fearsome dragon patterns of blue, black, and red interwoven on his back.","It’s him!","Mo Hua’s pupils constricted.","This silent giant along the way was none other than the Demon Sect leader, who had nurtured the Blood Pool, committed heinous massacres, escaped the siege of Taixu Gate and the Qianxue Court Tribunal, and was later wanted by the tribunal with his whereabouts unknown.","And the pattern on his back was precisely what he was looking for...","The Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation Map!","Mo Hua’s face still bore shock, but his hands were instinctively drawing patterns, calculating in his heart, as he seized this once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to deduce the Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation Map stroke by stroke..."]},{"number":1975,"title":"Chapter 1975 - 955: Dragon Diagram","paragraphs":["In the depths of the tomb pit, the battle atop the bright yellow bronze coffin raged on.","Amidst the blood wind and rain, severed limbs filled the sky.","A gigantic fleshy corpse effigy swung its arms, commanding hundreds upon thousands of corpse demons, roaring in anger like a monster.","And opposite him, the black-robed man carried an Evil Dragon on his back, surrounded by towering Blood Qi. The Four Symbols Green Dragon Evil Formation was operating at full force, its fierce power rivaling the massive corpse effigy.","Each of this man’s punches could unleash a dragon’s shadow.","Each dragon shadow, accompanied by a dragon’s roar, charged forward with astonishing might, crushing onto the enormous fleshy corpse effigy.","The power of the Evil Dragon was terrifying in the extreme, and even the powerful fleshy corpse effigy couldn’t withstand it.","Large masses of fleshy remnants were blasted apart, dissolved, turning into ashes by the Dragon Fist.","Such mighty power not only provoked the flesh corpse effigy into furious anger, but also caused the other people present to feel emotionally turbulent.","Especially Mr. Hui, whose face was full of shock.","\"Is this... a dragon?!\"","He never expected that the silent man along the way would actually possess such terrifying Evil Dragon power.","Stone was equally shocked.","Even the other three black-robed cultivators were momentarily overwhelmed with various expressions.","The black-robed elder exhibited an arrogant expression tinged with fanaticism.","The black-robed noble sighed enviously, murmuring: \"So this is... the dragon of the Great Wilderness...\"","Another black-robed man, amidst the fierce battle, also tore off his black robe, revealing a physique as robust as Bear Pi, along with the fierce Monster Pattern on his back.","This black-robed man crushed a corpse demon with his bare hands and then raised his head to look at the figure covered in Dragon Pattern, his eyes full of longing.","And within that longing were traces of jealousy and greed.","The cultivators present, some were shocked while others had different thoughts.","Only Mo Hua was secretly working hard, calculating Formation Patterns, \"stealing\" the formation.","Using the overwhelming Corpse Qi, along with the surge of Spiritual Power and Blood Qi as a cover, Mo Hua hid at a distance, employing both Heavenly secret Tricky Calculation and Heavenly secret Calculation to amplify each other, spying on this secretive Great Wilderness Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation Diagram.","In his eyes, black, white, and gold, the three colors intertwined.","Powerful Telekinesis poured forth like a flood.","Various ancient and mysterious Formation Patterns, carrying ancient significance, presented themselves in his mind through calculation.","Meanwhile, Mo Hua used his hands to draw on the ground, sketching Mo Patterns, quickly recording these Formation Patterns one by one on the ground.","On the gray-black ground, streaks of ink marks gradually emerged, like Azure Dragon’s scales and claws, piecing together.","First the dragon claws, then dragon scales, dragon tail, dragon body, dragon fins...","A dragon-shaped figure outlined by Formation Patterns gradually appeared... until it reached the dragon head.","But at the dragon head, the entire dragon was stuck.","The calculation suddenly slowed down.","Mo Hua’s Sea of Consciousness began to ache like being pricked by needles, his Divine Sense gradually exhausted.","The calculation empowered by Tricky Calculation surpassing what he could endure began to limit, causing his eyes to swell, as if blood was about to flow...","It seemed like a bottleneck was stuck on the path of calculation.","No matter how hard he tried, how persistent he was, he couldn’t overcome this bottleneck and couldn’t calculate the entire dragon.","Blood almost flowed from the corner of his eyes, the stabbing pain in the Sea of Consciousness became sharper, Mo Hua knew he had truly hit his limit, and had no choice but to cease the calculation.","\"The Divine Sense is still not enough, the peak of Nineteen-Pattern also isn’t enough...\"","\"The Tricky Calculation and the Calculation are still lacking flare.\"","Mo Hua sighed and then gently rubbed the corner of his eye, lowering his head to look at the Formation Map on the ground.","The Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation, a complete Formation Diagram, presented a dragon shape, but now this dragon lacked a head.","The body part consisted of eighteen patterns.","Mo Hua tried his best but could only deduce to this extent.","The remaining Formation Patterns for the Azure Dragon’s head were beyond the current limits of Mo Hua’s Divine Sense and Calculation powers; he couldn’t deduce them.","Based on the deduced partial diagram, the complete Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation Diagram might be nineteen patterns, but is more likely over twenty patterns, or even twenty-one patterns as an Ultimate Formation.","This means, this Demon Sect Leader’s Green Dragon Formation, is not just a Four Symbols Formation of the Great Wilderness, but also a Divine Beast Formation within the Four Symbols Formation, furthermore, a transmission exceeding a Second Grade Twenty Pattern Absolute Formation.","\"What a pity...\" Mo Hua sighed inwardly.","If his Divine Sense and Tricky Calculation method were stronger, perhaps he could have completely deduced this Formation Diagram.","Not ending up like now, with claws and tail but no head.","\"Though even if calculated, it seems useless...\"","Mo Hua examined again the partially deduced Azure Dragon Formation Diagram, gradually frowning.","Though a dragon, but the bones were jagged, patterns reversed, claws and fangs sharp, exuding an aura of evil from its majesty.","\"This is an Evil Formation...\"","If it was an Evil Formation, then it couldn’t be learned.","Mo Hua would not arrogantly disregard his mentor, Elder Master Xun, and all the elders and seniors’ warnings along the way.","He would not be foolish enough to learn the Formation of the Evil Path acting smart.","Not listening to elders’ words will lead to suffering visibly.","The distinction between good and evil, he could still discern clearly.","\"Then what about my Lifebound Formation Map...?\"","\"How should this incomplete Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation Diagram be handled?\"","To transform evil into good?","Where to obtain a complete Formation Diagram?","Surely not, having to kill this powerful Demon Sect Leader, peel the skin off his back, and copy it down?","Mo Hua furrowed his brows tightly.","But with time pressing, he had no space for much thought.","Recording the deduced Formation Diagram onto the Jade Slip, storing it in the Storage Ring, afterward erasing all the traces of calculation on the ground, Mo Hua finally felt at ease, then looked up at the distant battlefield."]},{"number":1976,"title":"Chapter 1976 - 955: Dragon Diagram (Part 2)","paragraphs":["The battle with the flesh corpse statue continues, but it is gradually approaching its end.","A Demon Sect leader in the late Golden Core Realm, carrying the Four Symbols Green Dragon Evil Formation, has a terrifyingly strong power of killing.","The resurrected evil aura of the flesh corpse statue was suppressed by the section of white bone summoned by the black-robed elder.","Its heart was tightly bound by that wisp of white energy.","\"That section of white bone, could it be... dragon bone?\"","\"Dragon bone, capable of suppressing the evil aura of Taoist Demons?\"","Mo Hua’s eyes sparkled; this was the first time he had heard of such a thing.","And with the suppression of the dragon bone, the \"evil aura\" on the flesh corpse statue indeed gradually dimmed.","Without the power of laws from the evil aura, the seemingly powerful flesh corpse statue was merely a large \"walking corpse,\" not a match for everyone.","After dozens more rounds, with a loud bang, the flesh corpse statue was struck on the head by the Demon Sect leader, and a black-red dragon shadow pierced through its skull.","The corpse statue’s flesh crumbled and collapsed with a crash.","The aura of death and gloom, having lost their foundation, gradually dissipated.","This giant flesh corpse statue was thus annihilated.","Without the foundation of flesh and the nourishment of gloom, the wisp of \"evil aura\" suppressed by the dragon bone also dimmed as a result.","\"We won...\"","Mr. Hui was a little incredulous, then looked at the Demon Sect leader, who carried the Evil Dragon and stood proudly, with deep terror and apprehension in his eyes.","In that instant, he made up his mind and cupped his hands towards the black-robed elder and others:","\"Everyone, with this monstrosity slain, my mission is also complete. If you’ll excuse me... I’ll take my leave first.\"","\"Hold on.\" The black-robed elder said.","Mr. Hui’s steps came to a halt.","The black-robed elder said, \"This statue is slain, and the bronze coffin is right before us. Does Mr. Hui not want a share?\"","Mr. Hui forced a smile and said, \"I didn’t put in much effort to slay the statue; I dare not claim any reward for no merit.\"","The black-robed elder shook his head, \"We had an agreement beforehand. Now that the task is complete, how could I go back on my word?\"","Mr. Hui felt nervous internally.","He had realized he was already in the tiger’s den.","This group of black-robed cultivators were genuine Demon Cultivators, astonishingly strong, even able to cultivate an Evil Dragon.","Anything related to a dragon is extraordinary.","Mr. Hui didn’t want to get involved in these murky waters anymore.","If he could leave now, with the storage pouch filled with gains, and capture a young \"genius Formation Master\" to raise for his own benefit, it would not be a loss by any means.","But clearly, this black-robed elder had no intention of letting him go.","This group, with their ruthless cultivation techniques, had slain a flesh corpse statue; dealing with him would be even easier.","Left with no choice, Mr. Hui stiffened his resolve and said, \"In that case... it’s better to follow orders graciously.\"","The black-robed elder then beckoned to Mo Hua from afar.","Mo Hua was taken aback, but still ran over.","The black-robed elder said, \"Young man, you can also pick something from the coffin later.\"","\"Really?\" Mo Hua was somewhat astonished.","\"Naturally.\" The black-robed elder nodded, \"In this tomb-robbing venture, you also provided effort, so you deserve a share of the treasure.\"","\"Thank you, elder.\" Mo Hua outwardly appeared flattered but was inwardly puzzled:","Why is this old man giving something to me?","What is his true intention?","Of course, Mo Hua was also somewhat curious, wondering what treasures might be buried inside such a large bright-yellow bronze coffin.","Afterward, everyone joined forces to clean the bright-yellow bronze coffin, burned the zombie’s flesh, and began searching the coffin.","Yet, after clearing the remnants and burning the decayed flesh, the vast coffin was empty at the bottom, with nothing at all.","No tomb owner, no burial goods.","Nor was there any trace of the \"Evil Embryo\" that Mo Hua was looking for.","It was as if this entire bronze coffin was just burying these dead corpses.","Mr. Hui saw this and seemed to think of something, his face changing.","The black-robed elder and his companions remained silent.","The black-robed young master frowned in thought for a moment, then looked up at the elder with a slightly cold voice, \"Second Elder, this is not what you mentioned before.\"","\"Young Master Xuan, please remain calm.\"","The black-robed elder’s voice was hoarse, but his expression also showed some confusion.","Apparently, they hadn’t found what they were looking for.","And the current situation was also unexpected for them.","Mo Hua kept his head down, showing no expression but his mind was racing.","He roughly figured it out.","Among the four black-robed cultivators, the demon cultivator with Dragon Patterns was the leader of the Demon Sect.","The one with the build of a Bear Pi was the \"Elder Xiong\" from the Demon Sect.","He was also the \"fish that escaped the net\" when the Taoist Court and Taixu Gate joined forces to besiege the Demon Sect last time.","At the same time, according to Elder Xun Ziyou, this \"Elder Xiong\" was precisely one of the three Golden Core Realm monster cultivator elders in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons back on Demon Hunting Mountain.","Back then, Mo Hua sneaked into the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons when these three monster cultivator elders were away, so he never directly encountered them.","Elder Xun Ziyou had also mentioned that one of these monster cultivator elders died on Refining Demon Mountain, but details of the death were unknown.","There were broad claw marks on the chest, as if disemboweled, the storage pouch was gone, the skin with Monster Patterns was stripped away, making it impossible to determine what kind of monster cultivator it was.","Another one was the Snake Demon Elder.","During the Yanluo Mountain siege of the Demon Sect, it was slain by Elder Xun Ziyou.","The last one was this Bear Pi man before them.","He was the only surviving Golden Core Demon Cultivator in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","As for the black-robed elder called \"Second Elder\"...","Mo Hua thought about it and believed he should be the \"Second Elder\" in the Demon Sect, the most senior, second only in status to the Demon Sect leader."]},{"number":1977,"title":"Chapter 1977 - 955: Dragon Diagram_3","paragraphs":["But isn’t the Second Elder dead?","Was it a fake death? Or did he shed his skin like a cicada?","Mo Hua frowned, feeling a bit puzzled.","When he had divined earlier, he was largely correct; these three people, in some sense, all had some connections to him.","The only exception was this young master.","The Second Elder called him \"Young Master Xuan.\"","From Mo Hua’s mastery over the Demon Sect’s Thunder Magnetism Formation, there was no person like \"Young Master Xuan\" in the Demon Sect.","Mo Hua was also sure he had never met him before.","So who exactly was he? What connection could he have with him?","The strangest thing was, why did these Golden Core members of the Demon Sect run to Solitary Mountain to dig up this grave?","What was their true purpose?","Why was this grave built in the Shen Family’s mining mountain?","Why were there so many bodies in the bright yellow copper coffin? Where did these bodies come from?","Mining mountain... Shen Family... Taoist Demon...","Mo Hua was full of doubts, his gaze gradually turning cold.","\"Did we come to the wrong place?\" The black-robed youth called \"Young Master Xuan\" frowned and said, \"The Shen Family’s mining mountain is so big, the grave we’re looking for might not be built here.\"","\"Otherwise, it’s impossible for there to be nothing in this bright yellow copper coffin...\"","\"Did the Shen Family build other graves? Is this grave just a decoy?\"","Mr. Hui’s eyes flickered, but he remained silent.","At this moment, Mo Hua suddenly remembered something and asked:","\"Where is Shen Qingsheng?\"","\"Shen Qingsheng?\"","\"The young master from the Shen Family who was captured with us,\" Mo Hua replied, \"Where is he?\"","\"Well...\" Mr. Hui and the others looked at each other.","\"It seems... we lost him?\"","\"When was he lost?\"","\"It seems...\" Stone recalled, \"earlier, at the forked path.\"","Shen Qingsheng was being escorted by Mouse.","When everyone was first attacked by a swarm of corpse demons and got separated, Mouse only cared about capturing Mo Hua, naturally losing track of Shen Qingsheng.","After all, Shen Qingsheng was dispensable; whether he lived or died, nobody cared, and he was soon forgotten.","Now they had robbed a grave, only to find it empty.","Remembering the Shen Family, Mo Hua also remembered Shen Qingsheng.","\"The young master of the Shen Family...\" The black-robed elder frowned and slowly said, \"Find him and ask a few things.\"","Mr. Hui nodded.","Thus, the group retraced their steps.","However, everyone knew that with the disaster of corpse demons in the forked path and the numerous changes in the underground palace, finding Shen Qingsheng was uncertain.","Even if they found him, whether he was alive or dead was still an unknown.","But they had to try searching.","Returning to the forked path, with Earth Formations densely packed and tunnels complexly interwoven, the task of guiding naturally fell to Mo Hua.","Mo Hua held a compass in one hand, secretly feeling a copper coin with the other, divining Shen Qingsheng’s energy, and found that Shen Qingsheng’s karmic connections were clear, seemingly not dead, which was somewhat unexpected.","\"Good people don’t live long, but evil survives for a thousand years,\" was not casually said after all.","Mo Hua followed the energy, leading the way.","Not knowing how many forked paths they bypassed, finally, in a corner of the wall, they found Shen Qingsheng curled up on the ground.","Shen Qingsheng lay on the ground in terror, surrounded by a faint golden light, evidently a protective treasure.","At that moment, four or five corpse demons crawled on him.","These decayed corpse demons bared their teeth and chewed at Shen Qingsheng, but because of the protective treasure, they couldn’t reach his flesh.","Shen Qingsheng, therefore, survived and wasn’t eaten by the corpse demons.","Seeing Shen Qingsheng still surrounded and bitten by corpse demons, Mr. Hui stepped forward, drawing a knife to slash the corpse demons one by one, rescuing Shen Qingsheng.","Previously curling up undaring to breathe heavily, Shen Qingsheng now, seeing the corpse demons slain, wore a hideous expression, kicking them with all his might in anger, despite the stench, saying:","\"A bunch of filthy, ugly, lowly mining cultivators...\"","Mo Hua’s gaze chilled, speaking in a deep voice:","\"How do you know... these corpse demons are mining cultivators?\"","Shen Qingsheng’s face turned pale, \"Isn’t it... obvious... this is a mining mountain... it’s...\"","\"Enough,\" Mr. Hui interrupted, \"Who cares about your mining cultivators, let me ask you, this mining mountain, it belongs to the Shen Family, right?\"","\"Yes...\"","\"Then the grave beneath your Shen Family’s mining mountain, was it also built by the Shen Family?\"","\"I... don’t know.\"","Mr. Hui reached out a large hand, gripping Shen Qingsheng’s neck, \"Kid, don’t play dumb. Tell me honestly, what was your Shen Family building this grave for...\"","Mr. Hui’s voice was sharp, with a hint of fear.","Shen Qingsheng’s face was solemn, \"I... I really don’t know... I’m too young to be involved in family matters, I don’t know...\"","\"Damn, a useless piece of trash.\" Mr. Hui casually threw Shen Qingsheng to the ground.","Shen Qingsheng staggered to the ground, his gaze filled with resentment, but he dared not speak.","Mo Hua’s gaze was profound, glancing at Shen Qingsheng, then at Mr. Hui, seeing the unease in his eyes, also seeing the fear in his divine soul.","\"Shen Qingsheng might not know anything, but Mr. Hui... clearly senses something...\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, just about to say something to tease out the truth from Mr. Hui, when the black-robed elder spoke with an aged voice:","\"Mr. Hui, at this point, why bother hiding anything?\"","Mo Hua was startled, a chill running through his heart.","This Second Elder of the Demon Sect, who could suppress demonic energy with dragon bones, indeed had extraordinary means.","He could tell Mr. Hui was hiding something, just as Mo Hua noticed.","Mr. Hui’s eyelid twitched, \"Senior, what do you mean by that?\"","The black-robed elder said, \"I entrusted an old friend to flip through Maoshan’s genealogy, and from the direct line found the exiled Mr. Hui. With Mr. Hui’s Maoshan cultivation, I believe it won’t disappoint me.\"","Flipping the genealogy, investigating origins, tracing back to Maoshan.","Mr. Hui’s heart trembled.","He thought this business deal was a stroke of luck, brought to him by others, but unexpectedly, he was long targeted by someone."]},{"number":1978,"title":"Chapter 1978 - 956: Ten Thousand Corpses Sealing the Coffin","paragraphs":["The old man in a black robe, with eyes cloudy yet sharp like a hawk’s, stared at Mr. Hui.","The leader of the Demon Sect remained silent, but the aura of the Evil Dragon emanating from him was enough to make anyone shiver in fear.","Elder Xiong’s aura was slightly weaker, but he was still a Monster cultivator at the Late Golden Core Stage, with a body as robust as a bloodthirsty Bear Demon.","The atmosphere was intensely oppressive for a moment.","Mr. Hui felt a tingling on his scalp, knowing the situation was beyond his control. He sighed, understanding his life was no longer his.","\"This is an extremely sinister burial method, known as the Ten Thousand Corpses Sealed Coffin Tomb.\"","\"Ten Thousand Corpses Sealed Coffin?\" the old man in a black robe said solemnly.","Mr. Hui nodded, feeling chilled to the core, \"As the name suggests, it involves killing ten thousand people and sealing their corpses in a gigantic coffin, gathering the death aura, grievances, and underground yin energy inside to raise corpses.\"","\"Ten thousand living people, that’s no small number... once they die and are piled together, the grievances would be terrifyingly strong.\"","\"Thus, this horrifying burial method has long been banned in the Cultivation World.\"","\"I only heard a few seniors mention it when I was seeking the Dao at Maoshan, but I’ve never seen it... \"","\"Now that the Taoist Court rules, purging the world of demons, even major Demon Sects find it extremely difficult to kill ten thousand people for burial purposes...\"","\"Let alone erect such a tomb in the land of Qianxue, with the Taoist Court’s supervision right under their noses...\"","\"Truly... astonishing...\" Mr. Hui said, trembling.","The old man in a black robe frowned.","Although he originated from the Demon Cultivators, he was not well-versed in matters of tombs and yin houses.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t have spent a fortune to specially hire Mr. Hui, who carried the Maoshan Tradition, to take a tour of this Solitary Mountain burial tomb.","\"The Ten Thousand Corpses Sealed Coffin Tomb nurtures that... flesh and blood corpse effigy bred from ’malevolent energy’?\" the old man in a black robe asked.","Mr. Hui’s face turned pale, shaking his head, \"The key to the Ten Thousand Corpses Sealed Coffin is the word ’seal.’\"","The old man in a black robe understood immediately, his gaze intensifying, \"You mean... the Ten Thousand Corpses Copper Coffin is actually a ’seal’? The gigantic blood and flesh corpse effigy is merely a ’guardian’ protecting the seal?\"","Mr. Hui nodded, his face as still as water, \"It’s a deadly formation, the bright copper coffin is a fake, used to nurture the ten thousand corpses.\"","\"Even if Golden Core Cultivators come in numbers, they’d nearly be certain to die.\"","\"And where there’s a fake coffin, there must be a real coffin.\"","\"The fake coffin is the seal of the real coffin, meant to cover up everything, to keep others from knowing.\"","\"This fake coffin, built so grand and immense, with countless killings, must mean the real coffin is even more terrifying.\"","\"Moreover, this is at the Qian Learning State Boundary, a genuine ’deceiving heaven’ formation, this sort of true grand scheme, grand orchestration, is not something an ordinary cultivator could arrange.\"","\"And once the tomb formation is arranged, what’s sealed must be a monumental secret, what lies in the real coffin must certainly be something even more terrifying...\"","The more Mr. Hui thought about it, the more fearful he became.","The simple presentable bright copper coffin already fostered such a terrifying ten thousand corpse demon effigy.","What greater horror could truly lie buried in that tomb?","This was a setup far beyond a typical Golden Core cultivator like him.","But just as Mr. Hui finished speaking, the eyes of the old man in the black robe gleamed, \"You mean, there’s a real tomb still? Quickly, take us there.\"","\"Senior...\" Mr. Hui frowned.","\"Undo the seal of the fake coffin, lead us to the real tomb,\" the old man in a black robe ordered, not allowing refusal.","Then his gaze turned sharp, \"You are the direct line of Maoshan, trained in the dark arts, don’t tell this old man you can’t unravel the seal.\"","Mr. Hui remained silent.","The old man in the black robe’s eyes grew increasingly dangerous.","Mr. Hui understood he had no choice, and could only sigh, \"Alright.\"","The expression of the old man in the black robe slightly relaxed, \"Rest assured, Mr. Hui, we are true to our words. Once the task is complete, the treasures and inheritances within the tomb will be divided equally between us.\"","Mr. Hui smiled wryly, \"Under these circumstances, why deceive me, old senior? I only wish to keep my life, nothing else.\"","With that, Mr. Hui began to lead the way, \"Ladies and gentlemen, please follow me.\"","Thus, the party returned to the depths of the underground palace.","In front was still a deep pit, and within the deep pit lay a colossal, luxurious bright yellow copper coffin.","Broken remains littered the surroundings, blood and flesh blurred.","Shen Qingsheng, having never seen such a gory scene, immediately covered his mouth and nose, unable to stop retching.","But no one cared about him.","The old man in a black robe surveyed the surroundings, pondered for a moment, then asked Mr. Hui, \"The real coffin’s entrance is beneath this copper coffin?\"","\"Yes.\" Mr. Hui nodded, \"This copper coffin is actually a seal, sealing the real tomb.\"","\"How to break this seal?\"","\"It requires some Secret Techniques of my Maoshan Tao.\"","\"Then we must trouble Mr. Hui,\" the old man in a black robe said flatly.","Mr. Hui, looking solemn, approached the gigantic bright yellow copper coffin.","He took out a copper coin sword, three candelabras, some Blood Ink, and a mysterious Taoist Talisman Formation, Yellow Jade Ancient Talisman, among other Maoshan Tao art apparatuses.","It seemed Mr. Hui indeed brought out all his hidden legacies.","In front of the old man in the black robe, he dared not be perfunctory.","Mo Hua was secretly watching.","He was also very interested in \"Maoshan Tao art.\"","Based on his observations of Mr. Hui, the Maoshan Tradition appeared to be a comprehensive Tao Cultivation tradition aimed at Corpse Ghosts, involving a specific series of cultivation techniques, Taoist Skills, runes, formations, apparatus, and special secret techniques...","Mo Hua took all these in, imprinting them on his mind.","Even if he didn’t understand them now, he could at least broaden his horizons and gain some knowledge."]},{"number":1979,"title":"Chapter 1979 - 956: Ten Thousand Corpses Sealing the Coffin (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Tao cultivation is not just about fighting and killing.","Vision and experience are also a part of a cultivator’s strength.","This is how Mo Hua was: watching Mr. Hui open the altar and set up his methods, seeing him activate the Taoist Seal Formation, the Yellow Jade Ancient Talisman, and perform a series of seemingly impressive secret techniques with his Eight Diagrams Step.","These secret techniques might actually be useful.","But Mo Hua guessed that part of these \"rituals\" were actually redundant, meant to camouflage and prevent the real inheritance from being learned by others.","Especially by someone like Mo Hua.","Moreover, Maoshan’s process was quite well-defended.","At least for Mo Hua, except for the formation part, the other Maoshan Taoist Skill seemed quite baffling.","Nonetheless, Mr. Hui’s Maoshan Taoist Skill truly had an effect.","As his rituals unfolded, indeed some kind of vibes around the copper coffin were drawn by Mr. Hui.","The surrounding deathly and gloomy aura was gradually cleansed away.","Some karmic bonds started to spin, detach, and completely disintegrate...","Mo Hua could almost see with the naked eye a thin layer of mist slowly dissipating, the karmic aura, flowing with pitch-black blood, suffusing the surroundings.","It was like opening a gate to hell on earth.","The ground began to tremble slowly, jagged rocks crumbled.","The massive bright yellow copper coffin started to melt, golden copper liquid flowed on the ground, outlining a large inscription.","Then the inscription shattered, and the ground collapsed.","Underneath the melting copper coffin, appeared a huge, pitch-black pit.","This huge copper coffin was like a \"lock.\"","Now that the lock had dissolved, the gates to the deeper tomb had opened...","Seeing this spectacular and profound Maoshan Taoist Skill and the pitch-black, eerie pit emitting a chilling gloom like the Nine Nether lands, Mo Hua took a sharp breath.","\"The ground gate to the tomb has opened,\" Mr. Hui wiped the cold sweat off his forehead, exhaled deeply, and bowed to the elder in black robes.","\"Much obliged.\" The elder in black robes activated his eyes, gazing towards that eerie pit.","And the moment the elder in black robes turned his head, Mr. Hui swiftly picked up a Jade Talisman and stuck it on his forehead.","The Jade Talisman shattered, flashing light, and Mr. Hui’s entire figure disappeared.","The elder in black robes was taken aback, then quickly flicked his sleeve, shooting a blood-colored bone needle into an empty spot several yards away.","The bone needle pierced through an indistinct silhouette.","This silhouette flickered, falling to the ground.","The elder in black robes frowned, \"Maoshan Substitute Escape Talisman?\"","As soon as he spoke, the silhouette pierced by the bone needle and fallen on the ground revealed its original form, a puppet made of wood.","\"A fake, a puppet?\"","Mo Hua froze for a moment, then suddenly felt a chill, and looked up to see a large hand before him.","This large hand, wrapped in an earthy aura, reached out towards him.","\"Mr. Hui? He wants to capture me?\"","Mo Hua stood still in place, effectively pretending that there was no chance to evade.","Suddenly, a blood-colored sword light slashed down.","The \"Young Master Xuan,\" standing within two yards of Mo Hua, seemed to have been paying close attention to Mo Hua’s movements, promptly drawing his sword, pulling a streak of blood light, striking towards Mr. Hui’s palm.","Mr. Hui had no choice but to withdraw his hand.","He wanted to continue his attack to capture Mo Hua, but Young Master Xuan had already stepped forward, blocking in front of Mo Hua.","Mr. Hui inwardly cursed.","Originally, he intended to seize the chance to abduct Mo Hua along with him.","Unexpectedly, using the Maoshan Substitute Escape Technique, he had fooled the elder in black robes, but this black-robed youth named Young Master Xuan had suddenly intervened.","The chance to escape lay in those few moments; unable to capture Mo Hua, he could only escape alone.","He would definitely not venture into that gloomy underground.","With his experience, going there was likely a death sentence.","So, after using the Maoshan Taoist Skill to melt the copper coffin and open the gate, Mr. Hui immediately wanted to flee.","After all, the door was already open, and he was of no further use.","As long as he escaped the underground palace, those powerful Demon Cultivators would probably not pursue relentlessly.","If they still wanted to go further into the tomb, they couldn’t afford to waste too much time on him.","Before leaving, Mr. Hui hoped to abduct Mo Hua.","Nowadays, talent was what mattered.","Tomb treasures are temporary, but nurturing a Formation Master could provide ongoing opportunities to plunder treasures.","It’s a pity that the black-robed youth disrupted the plan.","Mr. Hui, decisive by nature, seeing his plan fail, didn’t dwell on Mo Hua any longer, instead forming a hand seal and stamping the ground, his entire body sinking into the earth, vanishing without a trace.","This should also be the Earth Escape Skill from the Maoshan Taoists.","The elder in black robes sneered, his gaze tightened, and he fully extended his Divine Sense.","The elder’s Divine Sense was extremely strong, even Mo Hua felt as if immersed in a sea of blood, his chest gripped with suffocation.","Within a moment, it seemed the elder had sensed Mr. Hui’s location.","He grasped the air, blood threads emerged, weaving into a spear, stabbing into a distant patch of ground.","When the blood spear pulled out, it dragged out a figure.","It was Mr. Hui, about to flee.","The blood spear had deeply pierced Mr. Hui’s shoulder, and he gritted his teeth, trying to draw a blade to sever his arm and escape.","But before he could sever his arm, a monster cultivator as tall as a Bear Pi appeared behind him, clutching Mr. Hui’s shoulder with a bear-like hand.","The sound of bones cracking was heard.","The dagger in his hand dropped to the ground, Mr. Hui’s face turned pale instantly, unable to move, he pleaded, \"Senior, spare me!\""]},{"number":1980,"title":"Chapter 1980 - 956: Coffin Sealed by Ten Thousand Corpses (Part 3)","paragraphs":["The black-robed elder withdrew his hand and warned, \"This is the last time.\"","\"Yes...\" Mr. Hui’s voice trembled.","The black-robed elder cast a glance, and only then did the Bear Demon Cultivator stop.","Cold sweat poured from Mr. Hui like rain.","\"Let’s go,\" the black-robed elder said.","Mr. Hui, clutching his arm, could only resign himself to fate and head toward the dark tomb pit sealed by the bright yellow copper coffin.","When he reached the pit, Mr. Hui still hesitated.","\"Wealth must be sought amidst danger,\" the black-robed elder said with a somewhat meaningful tone, \"It was you who said that.\"","Mr. Hui sighed, gritted his teeth, and jumped into the tomb pit.","Afterward, the others followed one after another.","When it was Shen Qingsheng’s turn, he suddenly screamed like a madman, \"I’m not going down, it’s so eerie inside, you want me to die...\"","But no one cared about him.","The burly Bear Pi struck Shen Qingsheng with a hand-chop, knocking him out, and then tossed him down.","It was Mo Hua’s turn next. Mo Hua actually wanted to go in, but he was afraid his intentions were too obvious, drawing suspicion and making him appear \"unsociable\" compared to Mr. Hui and Shen Qingsheng, so he also put on a troubled face and stammered:","\"I don’t want to go down...\"","The black-robed elder looked at Mo Hua warmly.","Mo Hua had no choice but to sigh, close his eyes, and jump into the abyss-like tomb pit.","Afterwards came the Bear Demon Cultivator and Young Master Xuan.","Finally, only the black-robed elder and the Demon Sect leader were left.","The black-robed elder’s cloudy eyes glanced at the silent Demon Sect leader, speaking with a sense of age and decay:","\"Third Prince, the lifeline of our Great Wilderness tribe, depends on this moment...\"","The Demon Sect leader’s majestic gaze trembled, and then he stepped into the pitch-black tomb pit.","...","Meanwhile, within the passageway.","The Shen family, along with Xun Ziyou, Fan Jin, and Master Gu, were walking forward step by step.","Xun Ziyou held a jade lock in his hand.","Occasionally, corpse monsters appeared around them, the ground frequently quaked, and strong fluctuations of Spiritual Power and Evil Power could be felt.","On the jade lock, Mo Hua’s vitality fluctuated between pale white and red.","Even though there was no definite sign of death, Xun Ziyou’s mood was still unsettled, causing him great apprehension.","After walking a bit further, Xun Ziyou glanced at the passageway, noticed something strange, and asked Shen Shouxing, \"Elder Shen, is this the Shen family’s tomb?\"","\"Sort of,\" Shen Shouxing replied.","\"Who is buried here?\" Xun Ziyou asked.","\"No one is buried,\" Shen Shouxing said calmly.","\"No one is buried?\" Xun Ziyou frowned, \"Such a large tomb, and yet no one is buried?\"","\"The Shen family is large, with many clansmen. It’s built as a reserve,\" Shen Shouxing glanced at Xun Ziyou, speaking indifferently, \"Does the Shen family’s construction of a tomb require reporting to the Taixu Gate?\"","Xun Ziyou made no comment but narrowed his eyes slightly, \"Since no one is buried...\"","He flicked his fingers, shooting a strand of sword light, shattering an approaching corpse demon, then said, \"Where do these corpse monsters come from?\"","Shen Shouxing’s eyelid twitched as he coldly replied, \"Underground sinister beings, taking over this place.\"","Xun Ziyou sneered.","Afterwards, no one spoke; they kept moving forward, passing through the passage and winding through several forks, eventually entering the far-right path leading to the underground palace.","Mo Hua and the others had left too many traces up ahead.","Following these traces, it didn’t take long for Xun Ziyou to find the depths of the underground palace, in front of the massive bright yellow copper coffin.","The scene in front of the bright yellow copper coffin was extraordinarily brutal.","The ground was pitted, and there were shattered mountain stones everywhere.","The ground was littered with the remains of corpse demons, mangled flesh, and the stench of blood was overwhelming.","Just a glance, and everyone could imagine the intensity of the battle, the ferocity of the slaughter here.","It seemed that several late-stage Golden Core cultivators had unleashed their full power, battling the corpse tide with all their might, to cause such devastation.","And from some lingering traces of eerie Blood Qi, these late-stage Golden Core cultivators seemed to be powerful demon cultivators...","Xun Ziyou’s heart pounded with fright as he couldn’t help but lower his head, looking at the jade lock again, feeling somewhat incredulous.","So many powerful demon cultivators.","Such a bloody scene, such intense slaughter.","It had created such destruction, even making a late Golden Core stage Sword Cultivation Elder like him uneasy...","And young Mo Hua, entangled in this situation, could he really survive?","Xun Ziyou frowned deeply, the more he thought about it, the more absurd it seemed.","Then he turned his head, silently looked at Shen Shouxing, and said indifferently, \"Elder Shen, this surely... can’t be just simple ’sinister beings’...\"","At this point, Xun Ziyou and the others could all see.","There was certainly a big problem with the Shen family’s tomb.","And those tomb raiders were likely anything but ordinary.","Shen Shouxing’s face looked extremely grim, especially when seeing the vanquished corpse monsters, the melted copper coffin, and the exposed massive tomb pit.","A chilling dread surged in his heart.","Xun Ziyou also followed Shen Shouxing’s gaze, looking at the dark tomb pit on the ground, pondering:","\"This group of tomb raiders killed a corpse monster here, broke some seal, melted the copper coffin, and then... entered this tomb pit?\"","This meant that Mo Hua followed inside too?","Surely so...","Xun Ziyou didn’t even need to think.","Such a dangerous, ferocious, and still bustling event surely involved Mo Hua.","Xun Ziyou’s heart gradually rose with anxiety.","Meanwhile, Shen Shouxing also silently thought to himself:","\"Along the way, there was no sign of Qing’er’s body, nor any indication of his protective treasure being shattered, indicating that Qing’er was also taken into this...\"","Shen Shouxing’s expression was terrifyingly solemn.","\"Elder Shen,\" Xun Ziyou said, \"what is this tomb pit?\""]},{"number":1981,"title":"Chapter 1981 - 956: Ten Thousand Corpses Seal the Coffin (Part 4)","paragraphs":["Shen Shouxing shook his head, \"I don’t know either...\"","Xun Ziyou’s gaze narrowed slightly, \"Then why don’t we go in and take a look?\"","Shen Shouxing frowned, \"This is the Shen Family’s tomb. The depths may hide the family’s secrets, and since all of you are outsiders, it might not be convenient for you to enter.\"","\"The direct descendant of my Taixu Gate might be inside. I’ve been ordered by the ancestor to ensure his safe return to the sect.\"","Xun Ziyou’s tone was firm, even invoking the ancestor.","Shen Shouxing’s face was as calm as water, contemplating something unknown, then he sighed, \"Since that’s the case, I will go down together with Elder Xun.\"","Xun Ziyou was somewhat surprised, but still nodded and said, \"Alright.\"","\"Elder Xun, please go first.\" Shen Shouxing cupped his hands.","Xun Ziyou hesitated a little.","This Shen Shouxing was too deep to read.","This tomb pit was too gloomy and likely hid great dangers.","Normally, he would stay far away, but now Mo Hua was inside. No matter how dangerous it was, he had to make this trip.","Xun Ziyou nodded, then with an intent filled gaze, stepped into the pitch-black tomb pit.","Master Gu followed behind him.","Fan Jin didn’t want to follow them in, but after glancing at Shen Shouxing with apprehension, he had no choice but to grit his teeth and follow Xun Ziyou.","Xun Ziyou was a Sword Cultivation Elder of the Taixu Gate.","If anything were to happen, holding onto Taixu Gate was better than mingling with the Shen Family.","Moreover, the Shen Family...","Fan Jin felt a shiver run down his spine.","As the three of them entered the dark tomb pit, Shen Shouxing’s gaze remained indifferent, letting out a cold laugh as he muttered,","\"The gate of hell is closed, yet you insist on trespassing...\"","He turned and commanded, \"Two of you come with me, the others stay here and guard this tomb pit.\"","\"Send someone to deliver a message, mobilize more people, and seal this tomb pit completely.\"","\"Yes, Elder.\" The Shen Family Golden Core Cultivators cupped their hands.","\"Qing’er... don’t die on me...\" Shen Shouxing silently prayed, then with a sharp gaze, stepped into the tomb pit.","Two skilled Shen Family Golden Core Cultivators followed him into the tomb pit.","The remaining Golden Core Cultivators then spread out to guard the tomb pit’s surroundings.","One Shen Family cultivator, following Shen Shouxing’s orders, turned to leave, preparing to gather more people.","But after taking just a few steps, he suddenly heard a \"creak creak\" sound. Realizing something was wrong, he turned to look and was immediately terrified.","Among the Shen Family’s Golden Core, one suddenly peeled off their skin, like taking off clothes, revealing a ghastly white body, neither human nor ghost, like a demon monster.","At this moment, his eyes were blood-red, using white bone as a knife, beheading one Shen Family Golden Core after another.","All the Shen Family Golden Core Cultivators stood motionless as if enchanted, allowing themselves to be slaughtered.","\"You...\"","The reporting cultivator was filled with terror, wanting to escape immediately, but suddenly a bloody vision appeared before him, as if gazing upon a scholarly yet sinister human face.","Under its gaze, his Divine Sense seemed to be drawn away.","The next moment, sharp pain shot through his throat as a piece of white bone impaled it.","His consciousness gradually faded, his body slowly collapsing to the ground, dead.","The pale demon, after killing him, continued slicing the remaining \"puppet-like\" Shen Family Golden Core, then dipped in their blood, drawing a crimson evil formation on the ground.","The evil formation encompassed the tomb pit beneath the bright yellow bronze coffin.","After finishing all this, the pale demon walked to the edge of the tomb pit, its features deformed, voice peculiar, \"Now that everyone’s here, let’s... all perish inside...\"","It grinned sinisterly, then leaped into the pitch-black tomb pit."]},{"number":1982,"title":"Chapter 1982 - 957: Lighting the Soul Lamp","paragraphs":["Mo Hua fell into the tomb pit.","It was as if he had plunged into a dark and suffocating ocean, surrounded by deeper darkness and the cold stench of corpses.","It was unclear how long he fell, but finally, his feet touched the ground.","A flash of watery light appeared underfoot, and using the Water Passing Step, Mo Hua reduced the force of his fall, then slowly stood up.","One by one, others jumped down, and after a while, everyone was there.","Mr. Hui and several black-robed Demon Cultivators gathered together again, led by the black-robed elder, and continued to move forward.","All around was pitch black; you couldn’t even see your fingers in front of you, the visibility was worse than above.","Mo Hua could only circulate Spiritual Power, covering his eyes to activate the \"Night Vision Skill.\"","This was a basic cultivation spell that most cultivators knew, used for seeing in the dark.","But because circulating Spiritual Power caused fluctuations that could attract attention from others or Monster Beasts, experienced cultivators would not use the Night Vision Skill in dangerous situations unless absolutely necessary.","The problem was, in this tomb pit, there really was no visibility at all.","In a place like this, even the perception of Divine Sense couldn’t be fully trusted.","Therefore, not only Mo Hua, but everyone activated night vision.","A layer of faint Spiritual Power enveloped their eye sockets, allowing them to discern their surroundings, and thus they were able to follow the path and move forward slowly.","But the further they walked, the stranger Mo Hua felt.","The surroundings were even more desolate and deserted than the cemetery above.","Moreover, the ground was covered in rubble, the walls were rocky and damp, and there were no corridors; it was more like a barren mountain pit than a completed tomb.","After walking for a while, the black-robed elder suddenly said:","\"Be careful.\"","Mo Hua sensed something as well and stopped, stealthily moving closer to the group.","In the darkness, there was the sound of wet footsteps.","This sound wasn’t coming from below but from above.","As if something was approaching them.","Everyone took out their Spiritual Artifacts and Magic Treasures, circulating Spiritual Power and Blood Qi, remaining alert in secret.","In just a moment, a fishy wind rose in the darkness, and a flash of cold light appeared.","This cold light descended from above, but before it could tear into anyone, the Bear Demon Cultivator grabbed it, twisted its limbs, tore its body apart, and threw it to the ground.","Blood of an unknown color slowly flowed out, seeping into the ground.","Mo Hua focused and realized that the ambusher was not a corpse revenant but a Monster Beast.","This Monster Beast was covered in scale armor, with sharp fangs and claws, resembling a Mountain-penetrating Demon. But its pointed head had facial features that looked human, which was somewhat creepy.","\"What is this thing...\"","\"A monster body with a human face, what did it eat to develop like this?\"","Everyone frowned.","Thankfully, although this Mountain-penetrating Demon was strange, it was only of Third Grade Primary Rank.","A Third Grade Primary Rank tomb Monster Beast would surely be a big problem for Mo Hua and very troublesome for Mr. Hui and the others.","But for the Late Golden Core Stage Demon Sect leader, the Bear Demon Cultivator, and the black-robed elder, it posed no threat.","Mo Hua secretly felt relieved.","This Solitary Mountain Tomb was fraught with danger; without a few of these major Demon Cultivators, he wouldn’t have made it this far.","\"Let’s keep moving.\"","The black-robed elder said in a deep voice, then stepped forward.","Mr. Hui felt puzzled, and after walking for a while, he frowned and said in a low voice, \"This doesn’t look like a tomb at all...\"","Mr. Hui frowned, feeling something inexplicable.","After walking a while longer, they suddenly came to a vast, boundless pit.","Everyone felt a weight in their hearts as they slowly approached the edge of the mine, their eyes cast downwards.","In the pitch-dark night, the broad mine slowly revealed some vague images, becoming clearer through the Night Vision Skill.","Mr. Hui was momentarily stunned, and even the black-robed elder and other Demon Cultivators sharply inhaled, their pupils contracting.","The mine before them was abandoned; it had collapsed.","Not only was it boundless as far as the eye could see, but looking down, it was unfathomable and completely filled with corpses!","It was as though the bodies were piled into a sea.","Some had decayed, some had dried, some were buried in ore, and some seemed to have been gnawed by beasts at the mountain’s bottom, broken and ruined, scattered like rubbish.","Some seemed to have maintained their struggle for life before death.","These people, in tattered clothes, were almost exclusively Mining Cultivators. At a glance, their number was uncertain.","They were calling for help, filled with anger, in despair.","As tomb robbers, they undoubtedly had blood on their hands.","As Demon Cultivators, they had killed innumerable times.","Yet even so, seeing the scene before them, seeing so many corpses together, even the most ruthless Demon Cultivators present couldn’t help but be stunned.","This death was ordinary yet cruel.","\"Is this... a mining disaster?\" Mr. Hui said hoarsely, his voice trembling.","\"Just how big of a disaster...\" Stone was also incredulous.","Mo Hua’s pupils trembled, his face stern as water.","The Shen family’s records, including the Taoist Court’s documents, had no record of such a massive disaster.","Not a single bit.","Even within the Shen family’s internal Jade Slip, secretly given by Shen Xiuyan, there was no trace.","A disaster of this magnitude, the Shen family couldn’t possibly be ignorant.","They deliberately concealed it.","Mo Hua finally understood why so many orphans suddenly appeared in Solitary Mountain City centuries ago.","Because their parents and ancestors all died in this mine.","Their orphaned children were left unattended and naturally became orphans."]},{"number":1983,"title":"Chapter 1983 - 957: Lighting of Human Lamps","paragraphs":["And for orphans, life is tough, with nowhere to cultivate. Even when they grow up, they are likely to die in the harsh world of cultivation. Their children become orphans again...","Generation after generation, Solitary Mountain City truly became the City of Solitude.","But this matter is probably not that simple...","Mo Hua silently turned his head to look at Shen Qingsheng beside him.","Shen Qingsheng had been knocked unconscious by a Bear Demon Cultivator and dragged along the way. Now, stimulated by the yin energy, he saw endless corpses before him. His pupils dilated, and his face turned deathly pale.","Young Master Xuan also glanced at him, exclaiming:","\"Is this the work of your Shen Family? Such a large mass grave; it seems at least a hundred thousand are dead here...\"","Shen Qingsheng was immediately terrified, \"How could this be possible? How could my Shen Family have done something like this?\"","Young Master Xuan gave a sinister smile, \"Isn’t this your Shen Family’s mine?\"","\"No...\"","\"It’s not your Shen Family’s mine?\"","\"Yes...\"","In his panic, Shen Qingsheng blurted, \"No! It must be someone framing us, creating such slaughter under my Shen Family’s mine! It must be!\"","\"My Shen Family is upright, a prestigious fifth-grade family in the Qianxue state boundary, with hereditary ties to the Qian Taoist Sect, conducting ourselves justly and properly...\"","\"This... this is a mining disaster, a natural calamity, unrelated to my Shen Family!\"","Shen Qingsheng gritted his teeth and said.","Young Master Xuan sneered, \"Whether or not your Shen Family did it, once this matter is exposed, says that beneath your Shen Family’s mine lies a mass grave. If the Taoist Court investigates, you’ll be in serious trouble.\"","Shen Qingsheng’s face suddenly turned ashen, \"No, these lowly laborers, if they die, they die. What does it have to do with my Shen Family...\"","Mo Hua’s gaze grew slightly cold.","But Young Master Xuan shook his head, not really caring what Shen Qingsheng said.","The old man in a black robe felt the same.","They had more important matters to attend to.","\"The thing, it’s in this mass grave...\" The old man in the black robe seemed to have confirmed something, turned around, and looked at Mo Hua, \"Young brother, could you lead the way?\"","Mo Hua was taken aback and asked, \"What thing?\"","\"The real tomb,\" said the old man in the black robe.","Mo Hua thought for a moment and shook his head, \"Elder, in this mass grave, there are corpses everywhere, and only a few traces of formations. I’m afraid I can’t find the way...\"","He was telling the truth.","Moreover, the formation of the tomb was his weak point.","He had no idea what kind of grave these Demon Cultivators were searching for.","Not to mention, in this mass grave, where corpses lay like grass, endless and bottomless, it was impossible to find any direction.","The old man in the black robe glanced at Mr. Hui.","Mr. Hui had a troubled look and also shook his head, saying:","\"This mass grave at most is a ’chaotic burial ground’, not a formal tomb. There is no pattern to follow, I have no solution.\"","The old man in the black robe gave Mr. Hui a deep look, confirmed he was not lying, slightly frowned, then turned his head to the Demon Sect leader:","\"Can you sense it?\"","Sense?","Mo Hua’s heart stirred, and he secretly looked toward the Demon Cultivator leader with the Evil Dragon aura.","The Demon Sect leader took out a knife, sliced his wrist, and collected the blood in his palm.","The deep red blood seemed to tremble in his palm, as if drawn by some unseen force.","\"Let’s go.\"","The Demon Sect leader’s voice was low and authoritative.","Then his burly body leaped straight into the mass grave.","The others hesitated for a moment, then could only follow behind him.","As they jumped into the mass grave, all around them were the corpses of Mining Cultivators, who had died on the brink of despair. There was a chilling, invasive chill.","Fortunately, this mass grave was initially a massive mine collapse, which left some mountain paths between the corpses.","The group followed the mountain paths, moving toward the distance, as if walking within a dense sea of corpses.","Mo Hua was constantly worried these dead bodies would suddenly move and swallow them whole.","But fortunately, these corpses, unlike the corpse spirits outside, did not move, and were truly just corpses.","Yet as Mo Hua watched, he felt a sense of unease.","Logically, so many cultivators dying tragically should generate immense death and resentment energy.","These energies tied together over the years, these corpses could not possibly avoid \"corpse transformation.\"","But these corpses now just piled together, showing no signs of \"mutation\"...","Mo Hua frowned, looked closer, and suddenly felt an epiphany.","\"These corpses... seem to have been drained?\"","\"Something is extracting the death energy and resentment from these corpses?\"","Mo Hua’s eyes trembled slightly. He quietly looked away and continued to follow the group.","As they walked for a while, Mo Hua suddenly looked up, his pupils slightly contracting.","In his Divine Sense vision, the sky ahead appeared different, with countless, broken... evil spirits floating in the air?","No...","These evil spirits, in a fragmented \"human shape\", seemed more like wandering ghosts.","These ghosts blocked the path ahead of the group.","At that moment, the old man in the black robe raised his hand and said, \"Stop.\"","After the group stopped, the old man in the black robe furrowed his brows, then looked to Mr. Hui, \"Mr. Hui, the yin energy ahead is quite heavy.\"","Mr. Hui didn’t dare to be negligent either, he took out a Jade Pendant, bit his finger, and smeared his blood on it. Then, the Jade Pendant shone with an eerie green light.","Mr. Hui, with a solemn expression, lowered his voice:","\"There are some unclean things.\"","Mo Hua felt a sudden realization.","\"So that’s how it is...\"","These people, Mr. Hui who specializes in Maoshan Skill, including this seasoned Second Elder of the Demon Sect, could not \"see\" these spirits as he could.","They could only vaguely sense the yin energy and then use some magical tools to predict."]},{"number":1984,"title":"Chapter 1984 - 957: Lighting the Human Lantern","paragraphs":["These ghosts, Mo Hua actually isn’t afraid of them.","But he is somewhat curious in his heart, whether Mr. Hui and these people have any way to deal with the ghosts before them...","\"I don’t practice the ’Ghost’ Path...\"","The black-robed elder pondered for a moment, looking at Mr. Hui, \"In Maoshan Taoism, there should be a spell point for expelling Yin ghosts?\"","Mr. Hui frowned: \"Ghosts are different from zombies, they are formless entities, involving Divine Thought Dao Skill. Even within the Maoshan inheritance, unless a disciple has innate extraordinary Divine Sense and talent in this path, they cannot study it.\"","\"Junior is dull-witted and cannot learn this kind of inheritance, it’s just...\" Mr. Hui sighed, \"I do tomb-robbing every day, so I have learned some simple methods for entering tombs that can ward off, but whether they are effective is hard to say.\"","\"No worries,\" the black-robed elder said, \"Mr. Hui, just give it a try.\"","Mr. Hui said, \"This method is called ’Lighting the Human Lamp’.\"","\"Human Lamp?\"","Mr. Hui nodded, \"Usually, when we enter a tomb and feel something strange, with Yin ghosts lurking, we catch one or two living people as backup, using their Divine Sense to light the lamp and clear the path for us.\"","The black-robed elder looked at Mo Hua, then at Shen Qingsheng, and asked, \"What kind of living person works best?\"","Mr. Hui said, \"Young, with clean Blood Qi, pure-minded, talented, abundantly filled Sea of Consciousness, preferably with some formation knowledge...\"","\"The Divine Sense of such people is what evil spirits love the most.\"","Mo Hua was momentarily speechless, a bit at a loss.","In his mind, why not just name me directly instead of describing so much...","It turns out they brought me initially to use as a \"human lamp.\"","Sure enough, the black-robed elder looked at Mo Hua, nodded slightly, then reached out to seize Shen Qingsheng at the side:","\"Use him to light the lamp.\"","Mr. Hui was not surprised at all, simply said: \"Okay.\"","Shen Qingsheng looked terrified.","No...the person you described is not me...","Mr. Hui took out a golden hoop resembling a lampstand.","Shen Qingsheng screamed, \"Stop! Do you know who my father is? You can’t do this to me! You...\"","Mr. Hui already had his hand around Shen Qingsheng’s throat, whispered, \"Dare to scream again, and I’ll kill you.\"","Shen Qingsheng’s face was furious but ultimately deflated, not daring to resist.","Mr. Hui placed the golden hoop on Shen Qingsheng’s forehead.","The golden hoop clasped tightly at Baihui and Shenting several, connecting the Sea of Consciousness acupuncture points.","There was also a lampstand on the golden hoop.","Mr. Hui took out a white candle, inserted it into the lampstand, then lit it with a dim white fire.","With the light on, the hazy light illuminated the path ahead.","Shen Qingsheng looked bewildered, feeling neither pain nor discomfort.","But Mo Hua could see that his Divine Sense was drawn out by the golden hoop, burning along with the candle, and then scattering like smoke around.","Mr. Hui ordered Shen Qingsheng, \"You, walk in front.\"","Shen Qingsheng cursed inwardly but dared not disobey, forced to walk with the golden hoop lampstand on his head, acting as the \"human lamp,\" leading at the front.","The surrounding ghosts indeed gathered, feeding off the smoke of the Divine Sense burning from Shen Qingsheng’s Sea of Consciousness through the human lamp.","After inhaling the smoke, the ghosts became unusually quiet, not violent, and did not attack the other cultivators.","Everyone followed behind Shen Qingsheng, walking along the path filled with ghosts, with not a trace of evil spirits touching them, unusually safe.","Mo Hua marveled silently, unexpected that such a bizarre spell existed in the world.","Shen Qingsheng, leading in front, was fine at first. His abundant Divine Sense meant that lighting the human lamp with his head felt painless.","But as it continued, he started to feel as if something was being \"sucked\" away inside his head.","Divine Sense gradually burned out.","The burning pain slowly intensified.","It was then that Shen Qingsheng realized the pain, realized the fear, \"What the hell is this...\"","He reached out intending to remove the lampstand, only to have his arm firmly grasped by Mr. Hui.","\"Kid, behave, or I’ll kill you,\" Mr. Hui said coldly.","There was no politeness towards Shen Qingsheng.","In his heart, Shen Qingsheng wished to kill all of Mr. Hui’s ancestors but was helpless and could do nothing but let his head be used as the \"human lamp.\"","The group continued onward.","Shen Qingsheng’s face grew paler and paler, his Divine Sense drying up, the Sea of Consciousness increasingly pained.","Though not a Formation Master, he experienced a kind of exhausting pain, with his brain juices wrung dry and his Divine Thought depleted.","Fortunately, after a little while, the group finally emerged from the \"Ghost Path.\"","The Yin energy faded, Mo Hua could also see that the ghosts were all dispersing.","Only then did Mr. Hui remove the lampstand from Shen Qingsheng.","He didn’t really want to kill Shen Qingsheng after all.","Not knowing what lay ahead, it was better to keep a living person as a reserve, even for lighting the lamp.","If Shen Qingsheng died, then Mo Hua would have to be used to light the lamp.","To use Mo Hua as the lamp, honestly, he was somewhat reluctant.","Beyond the Ghost Path, amidst the depths of the Mass Graves, the blood in the hand of the Demon Sect leader trembled more vigorously.","It seemed to resonate with something of the bloodline.","For the first time, on the face of this grim and imposing Demon Sect leader, Mo Hua felt a distinct emotion.","The Demon Sect leader, moving his hefty body, continued walking forward.","After a while, everyone came to a spacious area of the mountain.","On the surface, this area looked ordinary, but oddly, despite being within the Mass Graves, there wasn’t a single corpse around this mountain area.","It seemed as if this place was a sanctuary.","Or perhaps, it was a certain inviolable \"Holy Land.\"","The blood in the hands of the Demon Sect leader pulsed restlessly. His voice was deep and hoarse, suppressing a hint of excitement:","\"This is the place...\"","Mo Hua’s heart tightened involuntarily.","He could feel that he was close to something...","Something with significant karma with him.","Even making him inexplicitly excited deep down.","But as to what exactly, Mo Hua couldn’t say for the moment...","The Demon Sect leader, relying on the bloodline sense in his hand, took a circle around, then stopped at a blank mountain wall.","The mountain wall was broad, with nothing upon it.","The Dragon Pattern lit up, Evil Power possessed, and with a roar like a dragon, the Demon Sect leader smashed the mountain wall with a single punch.","Stone shards fell, dust billowed.","When the dust settled, behind the mountain wall revealed a huge and grand entrance.","This door was also forged from bright yellow copper ore, inlaid with various gemstones, engraved with exquisite reliefs, noble and magnificent.","Behind the door, a golden palace with flying pavilions and floating eaves, brilliant and dazzling to the extreme.","This was a Divine Temple.","Seeing such ostentatious majesty, golden brilliance in the somber Mass Graves, everyone felt a sense of awe and oddity.","But Mo Hua slightly frowned.","He felt that this Divine Temple gave off an air of familiarity everywhere.","\"Familiar...\"","Mo Hua examined the surroundings of the Divine Temple, then, unable to help himself, his gaze fell on the jeweled, luxurious entrance.","On the door were reliefs.","The reliefs depicted a deity dazzling in golden light.","This deity held a Mountain Spear, adorned in chain-link Golden Armor, with a long, stern face, eyes severe, and an expression exuding a compelling aura of dominance over all beings.","Mo Hua stared at it for a long time, slowly opening his mouth in surprise.","This face...","This is... Lord Yellow Mountain?!","In the depths of Solitary Mountain City, beneath the corpse-statue coffin at the Mass Graves, this luxurious golden palace is... Lord Yellow Mountain’s Divine Temple?!"]},{"number":1985,"title":"Chapter 1985 - 958: Divine Temple","paragraphs":["Mo Hua was shaken, finding it somewhat unbelievable for a moment.","Suddenly, he recalled something:","\"Master Gu once said, Solitary Mountain is rich in bright yellow copper mines, and was once known as ’Guhuang Mountain’... So the mountain god of Guhuang Mountain, is the Mountain God Guhuang... Lord Yellow Mountain?\"","Mo Hua had never thought there would be such a connection before.","When Master Gu mentioned \"Guhuang Mountain\" to him, he simply didn’t remember any matter about Lord Yellow Mountain.","However, something felt off...","Mo Hua immediately frowned.","The Downcast Mountain God, Lord Yellow Mountain, was an old friend of his.","If there were indeed ties with Solitary Mountain, with his own insight into the Way of Cause and Effect, he would have certainly sensed some signs.","Yet he hadn’t perceived anything at all.","Either he was careless, or it meant that the matters relating to Lord Yellow Mountain were wrapped in a great cause and effect, concealed by some heavenly secret technique, preventing others from seeing or sensing it.","Mo Hua glanced again at the grand gate of the Divine Temple, at the image of the Mountain God Guhuang, holding a Mountain Spear, donned in intricately chained Golden Armor, with a stern and elongated face, exuding majesty while gazing down upon all beings.","In his mind, another image emerged of a ruined temple, a clay statue donned in a plain robe, with a pale and hungry face, drinking rainwater daily and eating rotten vegetables, obsequiously smiling at him—Lord Yellow Mountain.","For a moment, he simply couldn’t connect these two entities—no, these two deities—as one.","It seems not only humans can fall into destitution; even a mountain god falling into destitution has a hard time.","But at the same time, Mo Hua became even more perplexed:","\"What exactly happened to the once so grand Lord Yellow Mountain, to reduce him to such a state?\"","\"Wasn’t he severed from his evil foundations by the predecessors of Taixu Gate? What history lies within this?\"","\"Why was his Divine Temple sealed within this mass grave beneath Solitary Mountain...\"","...","Mo Hua raised his head, looking beyond the grandiose doors towards the magnificent, luxurious Divine Temple.","\"Perhaps the truth lies within the temple itself...\"","As Mo Hua was tangled with thoughts and doubts, Mr. Hui, upon seeing the temple, also showed an expression of shock.","\"Within this tomb, there’s such a treasured hall...\"","Despite his astonishment, he was puzzled, \"What hall is this exactly? Doesn’t seem like a tomb from inside.\"","Mr. Hui frowned and looked toward the black-robed elder, only to see the elder wearing a face of piety and aged solemnity, murmuring:","\"At last, found it...\"","He extended his hand to touch the golden door, but upon contact, recoiled as if electrocuted.","It felt as if a divine power was condensed upon the door, forbidding others from touching it.","The black-robed elder’s expression became grave, infusing blood-colored evil power in his palm to push the door again.","His withered palm pressed upon the door.","The blood-colored evil power intertwined with the golden door.","The golden light gradually brightened, becoming scorching, evaporating the blood color bit by bit.","The black-robed elder’s hand seemed pressed upon a \"branding iron,\" as white smoke curled up, not only was the evil power depleted, but also the flesh of his palm was burnt, charred, falling off, leaving a bare white bone.","The elder’s expression remained unchanged, facing death with equanimity, striving to push the door.","Yet the golden door of the temple didn’t budge a bit.","Seeing not only his palm turned to bone, but also his arm gradually burnt, the black-robed elder sighed deeply and finally withdrew his hand.","After withdrawing, the white bone on his arm began to be enveloped by fresh blood, muscles connecting, reforming back into a human hand.","Seeing the black-robed elder fail to push open the door, the Demon Sect Leader rasped:","\"Let me try.\"","The black-robed elder sighed, speaking with an apologetic tone: \"This old servant’s bloodline is not worthy...\"","The Demon Sect Leader nodded slightly and proceeded toward the golden door, with the Azure Dragon Formation Patterns upon his back lighting up one by one, blood qi surging, channelling the immense power of the Evil Dragon into his palms.","His palm slowly pressed against the temple’s door.","A deep, subdued dragon roar resounded.","As if something resonated with his bloodline.","The Demon Sect Leader’s blood began to boil, surging into the golden temple door in torrents.","The opulent, secretive door gradually trembled.","Mo Hua’s heart involuntarily grew tense with anticipation.","Time passed bit by bit.","With a solemn expression, the Demon Sect Leader stood, surrounded by the shadow of an Azure-Black Evil Dragon, vast and roaring, with almost half of his blood being drawn.","The temple door, satiated by Evil Dragon blood, looked as if it would open.","Suddenly, a tangible sword light, like a white ribbon, carrying astonishing spiritual power, sliced through the air directly toward the Demon Sect Leader who was pushing the door.","The Demon Sect Leader’s expression changed, but he did not withdraw.","The Bear Demon Cultivator roared in anger, shielding in front of him, transforming into a demonic claw laced with monster qi to block the sword strike.","However, this sword light glowed like white jade, even more potent, piercing through the Bear Demon Cultivator’s claw after a moment of stalemate, heading straight for the Demon Sect Leader.","The black-robed elder flashed, summoning a horned skull, forming a skeletal shadow to intercept the rest of the sword light, finally neutralizing the sword moves.","The black-robed elder looked up and saw six cultivators approaching from afar. Their cultivation ranged from the initial to peak Golden Core.","The person leading them, a peak Golden Core cultivator, had an ordinary appearance but exuded a steady temperament, with eyes sharp like a hawk, wearing a Shen Family Taoist robe, none other than Shen Shouxing, a powerful elder of the Shen family.","At this time, he held a White Jade Sword, from which the earlier astonishingly powerful sword light originated.","Besides him, there were two other Golden Core cultivators from the Shen family, along with Xun Ziyou, making it a total of three."]},{"number":1986,"title":"Chapter 1986 - 958: Divine Temple (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Shen Shouxing saw the leader of the Demon Sect covered in Evil Dragon Patterns trying to push open the gate of the Divine Temple. His pupils trembled, and he angrily shouted:","\"Demon Path creature, seeking death!\"","He swung another sword, the blade as white as jade, the sword light as clear as white silk.","The black-robed elder continued to wield the ferocious horn bone, transforming it into a skeletal Blood Shadow to battle Shen Shouxing.","Xun Ziyou also struck with his sword but was blocked by the Bear Demon Cultivator.","Their eyes flashed with enmity upon meeting.","\"Bear Pi beast, it’s you!\"","\"Taixu Sect Sword Cultivation Elder, you deserve to die!\"","Xun Ziyou’s tone was chilling, \"After searching high and low, today I shall make you, beast, die under my sword.\"","\"Arrogant words,\" the Bear Demon Cultivator’s eyes turned blood red, \"Today I shall devour your flesh and drink your blood, leaving you nowhere to rest in peace.\"","The two formed a grudge back in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","Later, during the eradication of the Demon Sect, another fierce life-and-death struggle ensued.","At this moment, both bore intense hatred, thus engaging in a death battle upon contact.","Aside from this, Master Gu and Master Fan fought against the two tomb robbers, Mr. Hui and Stone.","Young Master Xuan, on the other hand, faced two other Shen family Golden Core members alone.","The great battle was about to erupt, with blades and swords flying, Taoist and evil spells intertwining, causing chaos on the battlefield.","Mo Hua immediately hid far away.","This was indeed a fierce battle of Golden Core cultivators, with even some at the Golden Core Peak and late Golden Core stage risking everything, the aftermath was too strong for Mo Hua to endure.","For someone like him at the \"fragile\" Foundation Establishment stage, the chaos of a Golden Core battle was no joking matter.","It’s already good enough if he can protect himself, even watching the battle requires staying far away.","Fortunately, the Golden Core cultivators present only aimed to kill their enemies, not to harm the innocent.","So even as the Golden Core powers clashed intensively on the battlefield, Mo Hua remained unharmed for the moment.","Starting the battle, things were a bit stuck.","But as the battle went on, the situation became clear, with Shen Shouxing and Elder Xun apparently gaining the upper hand.","One was a Shen family elder at the Golden Core Peak, seemingly only a step away from Feather Transformation.","The other was a late Golden Core stage sword cultivation elder of Taixu Sect, whose Sword Intent was honed to perfection.","The Bear Demon Cultivator gradually couldn’t withstand Elder Xun’s Sword Intent.","As for the black-robed elder, though he wielded the evil horn skeleton, full of sinister and peculiar evil techniques, he was ultimately aged, his meridians in decline, unable to endure prolonged battles, gradually falling into a disadvantage against Shen Shouxing.","\"Elder Xun can win?\"","Mo Hua felt a slight joy in his heart.","Although the Shen family elder might not be a good person, they were certainly better than these demon heads.","Moreover, if the Shen family and Elder Xun won, capturing the Demon Sect leader, he might get to see the complete Green Dragon Formation Map on him.","His Lifebound Formation Map seemed to have a clue.","But just as Mo Hua was thinking this, Shen Qingsheng, who was tied up and thrown on the ground, seeing his father about to win, immediately showed great joy and shouted:","\"Father, kill that old thing!\"","Mo Hua’s heart jumped, this saboteur ruined everything...","Sure enough, as soon as he shouted \"Father,\" the black-robed elder’s pupils shook, abandoning Shen Shouxing and with several flickers of his figure, retreated in front of Shen Qingsheng.","The withered, aged hand grabbed Shen Qingsheng’s neck.","\"He is your father?\"","Shen Qingsheng turned pale, not daring to speak.","The black-robed elder sneered, turning to Shen Shouxing and said, \"Stop, or I’ll squeeze him to death.\"","Shen Shouxing frowned, cursing inwardly.","\"Useless brat, incapable of achieving anything great but ruining it all!\"","If he hadn’t shouted, these demon cultivators wouldn’t know their relationship and might not think of using his life to threaten.","Shen Qingsheng hadn’t figured out the crux, panic-stricken, he said, \"Father, save me!\"","Shen Shouxing could only stop.","When he stopped, naturally Xun Ziyou had to stop too.","He wanted to save Mo Hua.","But since Mo Hua didn’t make a sound, Xun Ziyou, being smart, pretended not to recognize Mo Hua.","In this situation, Fan Jin and Master Gu had no authority to speak and naturally wouldn’t expose anything.","The chaotic situation thus calmed down.","Though the tension remained high, both sides hesitated to act recklessly for the moment.","Shen Shouxing looked at the black-robed elder with icy eyes and said:","\"Hand over the person.\"","The black-robed elder said, \"You can have him...\" He pointed at Xun Ziyou beside them, \"First, kill this Taixu Sect elder.\"","Shen Shouxing’s gaze flickered, \"Why must I kill him?\"","The black-robed elder’s voice was cold:","\"Taixu Sect has a blood feud with our sect, so many of our Demon Sect disciples died at the hands of Taixu Sect, thus anyone from Taixu Sect must suffer a thousand cuts to death!\"","Behind him, as the junior brother of Taixu Sect, Mo Hua felt a chill in his heart, somewhat grateful.","Luckily he was clever enough not to reveal his identity.","He didn’t expect these demon cultivators to harbor such deep hatred towards Taixu Sect.","\"Kill the Taixu Sect elder, and your son will be returned to you,\" the black-robed elder repeated.","Shen Shouxing sneered, \"This isn’t my first time dealing with you demon path beasts, how could I trust your words?\"","The black-robed elder began to squeeze Shen Qingsheng’s neck.","Shen Qingsheng’s face turned the color of pig liver, \"Father...\"","Shen Shouxing’s expression turned grim, \"This condition won’t work, make another one.\"","The black-robed elder insisted, \"Kill the Taixu Sect elder.\"","Shen Shouxing coldly laughed, \"If I act against him, it will only be mutually destructive, then you can reap the benefits as a bystander, do you think I don’t understand this?\"","Xun Ziyou calmly said, \"Indeed, Elder Shen, if we join hands, we can first take down these beasts.\""]},{"number":1987,"title":"Chapter 1987 - 958: Divine Temple (3)","paragraphs":["\"Join forces?\" The black-robed old man chuckled lightly, \"Your Taixu Gate wants to collude with the Shen Family?\"","Xun Ziyou said, \"Killing you heretical demons is the cultivators’ duty. How can it be called collusion?\"","\"Elder Xun, why pretend to be ignorant?\" The black-robed old man sneered, \"Here, are we really the only ones who are ’heretical demons’?\"","Xun Ziyou’s gaze darkened slightly, \"What do you mean?\"","The black-robed old man said, \"I may not know how you were able to follow us here, but along the way, in the Shen family’s mine, didn’t you see what was going on?\"","\"Those corpses, densely packed, were like a tide.\"","\"Do you think the Shen family’s actions are any different from those of evil demons?\"","Before Xun Ziyou could speak, Shen Shouxing said indifferently:","\"Stop talking nonsense, the corpses here have nothing to do with my Shen Family. My Shen Family is a Righteous Dao Fifth Grade family granted by the Taoist Court, our disciples are all devoted to Tao cultivation, full of righteous aura, how could we possibly do anything that violates the Taoist Court’s laws?\"","The black-robed old man was startled for a moment, then praised:","\"As expected of an elder of the Shen Family, as expected of a top-grade family. No wonder my Demon Path kills people and everyone shouts to eradicate us, but your family feeds on people and yet prospers, being respected by all.\"","Shen Shouxing’s expression was as cold as water, \"Slandering the Shen Family’s reputation in this way, you deserve a thousand deaths.\"","The black-robed old man chuckled hoarsely, then looked at Xun Ziyou:","\"Honest words, does Taixu Gate also want to share in the Shen Family’s dealings?\"","Xun Ziyou’s gaze flickered slightly, and he said slowly:","\"Whether the mining disaster involves the Shen Family still needs to be investigated, but you demon beasts are indeed notorious for your evil deeds, with innumerable sins. Let’s kill you first and talk later.\"","\"Kill me, and you think you can leave this Solitary Mountain City?\" The black-robed old man said with a half-smile, \"Aren’t you afraid that this Elder Shen might stab you in the back?\"","\"Stop trying to sow discord.\" Shen Shouxing drew his sword, the white jade blade pointing directly at the old man.","The black-robed old man gripped Shen Qingsheng’s neck, \"Aren’t you afraid I’ll kill your son?\"","Shen Shouxing’s gaze was icy, \"If my son dies, all of you will accompany him in death!\"","Then, without hesitation, his sword light surged as he charged at the black-robed old man.","The black-robed old man’s heart sank.","This Shen Shouxing, to make a name for himself in the Shen Family, is indeed decisive and astute.","And his assumptions were not wrong.","He really won’t kill his son right now.","This son, at least, is a bargaining chip in his hand. If killed, he would be of no use at all.","Not only that, it would also provoke Shen Shouxing to madness, causing unpredictable variables.","The black-robed old man could only temporarily spare Shen Qingsheng’s life to hold Shen Shouxing back.","Shen Shouxing, considering his only son, couldn’t strike with full force either.","Xun Ziyou also began to act, but everyone had their concerns, so the battle was at a stalemate.","Just then, the leader of the Demon Sect, who had been maintaining the Divine Temple with his bloodline, suddenly roared, his aura surging.","As the phantom of the Evil Dragon emerged, a powerful aura was unleashed.","With a loud boom, the tightly shut doors of the Divine Temple were opened.","Inside the temple, a resplendent golden image slowly appeared before everyone’s eyes.","The black-robed old man’s eyes gleamed with decision: \"Go!\"","Their purpose here was the Divine Temple; they didn’t want to be delayed by the Shen Family.","Young Master Xuan’s eyes sharpened, his longsword drawing a trail of blood light, dispatching two Shen Family Golden Core cultivators before stepping into the Divine Temple first.","Elder Bear roared, his body covered in Monster Patterns, seizing a moment of respite from Elder Xun before recklessly charging into the Divine Temple.","Following him were Mr. Hui and Stone.","Mo Hua thought for a moment, seeing the opportunity and swiftly slipped through the gate crack.","Then it was the black-robed old man, dragging Shen Qingsheng as he stepped through the Divine Temple’s doors.","\"Qing’er!\" Shen Shouxing’s face was filled with anger.","Xun Ziyou’s heart also sank, \"Mo Hua!\"","The two of them flashed, transforming into sword light, rushing towards the temple doors.","Yet halfway through, a roar from the Evil Dragon erupted like thunder from a clear sky, followed by a pair of Dragon Fists carrying enormous pressure, forcibly intercepting them.","Violent tremors spread.","Xun Ziyou stepped back three steps from the force of the punch.","Even Shen Shouxing, at the peak of the Golden Core, retreated a step, his face pale.","The massive leader of the Demon Sect stood before them.","Even having lost some blood, with the support of the Azure Dragon Evil Formation, the leader’s strength was still terrifyingly powerful.","After repelling the two, the leader of the Demon Sect, with cold and arrogant eyes, slowly retreated towards the temple doors.","Shen Shouxing and Xun Ziyou wanted to strike again, but they couldn’t break through the Evil Dragon Formation surrounding the leader, nor could they enter the Divine Temple under the intimidating presence of his massive divine body.","Thus, they could only watch helplessly as the leader bearing the Evil Dragon, eyes crimson, stepped into the depths of the Divine Temple.","At the same time, the golden doors of the Divine Temple slowly closed before them.","Shen Shouxing and Xun Ziyou’s expressions were extremely serious.","...","Inside the temple.","Mo Hua felt a transformation before his eyes, and upon reopening them, he found himself in a brilliantly golden forehall.","The entire grand hall was seemingly made of bright yellow brass. It looked like it was coated with gold, dazzling and eye-catching.","Yet, Mo Hua walked around and found no one else.","\"Strange, we clearly entered together...\"","Mo Hua continued to search around the forehall and finally encountered a figure.","This person was in a black robe, with a fair and handsome face, none other than the Golden Core Realm \"Young Master Xuan.\"","When Mo Hua saw him, Young Master Xuan also saw Mo Hua.","His eyes lit up slightly, and he curled a faint smile.","\"I found you.\"","\"Looking for me?\" Mo Hua was taken aback.","\"Yes.\" Young Master Xuan said, \"This temple is quite mysterious. Upon entry, it confuses one’s sense of direction. I specifically came to find you.\"","\"Find me for what...\"","Mo Hua showed a puzzled expression, though his heart trembled slightly, feeling that something was amiss.","\"I’m giving you an opportunity.\" Young Master Xuan smiled slightly.","\"Opportunity?\" Mo Hua was taken aback, then saw Young Master Xuan take out an amber-colored token.","This token seemed made from some kind of skull, with three fused cracks on it.","Young Master Xuan waved the Bone Token in front of Mo Hua.","Mo Hua was stunned, then his divine sense felt heavy, as if some thoughts were burrowing into his mind.","At the same time, he heard Young Master Xuan whispering:","\"From this day forth, I am your master, and you are my servant.\"","\"You will obey my every command.\"","\"You must follow all my utterances, and not defy any of my orders.\"","\"If I let you live, you live; if I let you die, you die...\"","\"These words become Dao, transforming into a Demon Seed, planted in your heart, neither lost nor extinguished, growing endlessly...\"","...","Mo Hua was stunned for a long time before slowly coming to his senses.","This Young Master Xuan, isn’t he trying to plant a devil in my Taoist heart?"]},{"number":1988,"title":"Chapter 1988 - 959: Demon Seeding","paragraphs":["\"He? Planting Devil in my Taoist Heart?\"","This sort of thing was truly perplexing, and for a moment, Mo Hua didn’t know what expression to make, so his face appeared even more blank and dazed.","Young Master Xuan nodded, his voice low with a hint of bewitchment:","\"Remember it?\"","Mo Hua nods dazedly.","\"Repeat it.\" Young Master Xuan commanded.","Mo Hua said, \"From this day on, I am your master, and you are my servant.\"","\"You shall obey my every command.\"","\"If I let you live, you shall live; if I let you die, you shall die...\"","When these words entered his ears, Young Master Xuan froze for a moment, a trace of inexplicable anger rising in his heart.","I asked you to repeat, not to repeat it like this.","In the way you say it, who exactly is whose master?","Young Master Xuan frowned.","\"Why is it like this? Did something go wrong with the Planting Devil in the Taoist Heart? Clearly, the other two are fine, no accidents...\"","\"Or is it that... his Divine Sense is strong, his thoughts keen, so he has resistance to Planting Devil in the Taoist Heart?\"","Young Master Xuan glanced at Mo Hua, thinking that his supposition is not without reason. He then took out the Three Realms Token, waved it in front of Mo Hua, and recited the incantation for \"Planting Devil in the Taoist Heart\" again.","After reciting, Mo Hua’s eyes dimmed.","He seemed to be pondering, digesting, learning something.","Moments later, Mo Hua looked at Young Master Xuan, his gaze deep and revealing a strange gray, word by word he said:","\"This word is the Dao, transforms into a Devil Seed, planted in your heart, neither lost nor perishing...\"","Young Master Xuan was slightly startled, his mind in fluctuation, feeling something amiss.","The next moment, Mo Hua again spoke to him in a low voice: \"I shall obey your every command...\"","\"I shall obey your every command.\"","Young Master Xuan’s senses gradually returned, he nodded, and only then did he feel relieved, much more at ease in his heart:","\"It’s planted.\"","\"As expected, such a clever little ghost, one planting is not enough, two is necessary.\"","Since he has planted the Devil in his Taoist Heart, he will certainly obey, live if he commands him to live, die if he commands him to die.","This thought remained in Young Master Xuan’s heart as well.","\"Follow me...\"","Young Master Xuan said to Mo Hua, then turned and arrogantly walked forward.","Mo Hua followed him with a blank stare, meanwhile his mind was filled with heavy thoughts.","This Young Master Xuan actually knows Planting Devil in the Taoist Heart?","Why?","Is he connected with the Uncle?","Probably unlikely...","His level, not at all resembling someone who’s inherited the Uncle’s legacy.","Even with a thousandth of the Uncle’s level, these Golden Core cultivators would have self-destructively killed each other long ago.","If not the Uncle’s legacy, then it’s the orthodox Demon Sect’s \"Planting Devil in the Taoist Heart\"?","Mo Hua had previously researched a bit and knew this method originally wasn’t the Uncle’s \"trademark\", but a heritage from the ancient Demon Gate, the Illusory Demon Sect’s Sect Protecting Faction.","However, although the Illusory Demon Sect’s \"Planting Devil in the Taoist Heart\" is cunning and insidious, vicious and bizarre, corrupting minds, making cultivators shudder at its mention, it isn’t truly a top-tier heritage.","But the Uncle’s \"Planting Devil in the Taoist Heart\" is vastly different.","Walking the path of the Gui Tao, conferred as \"Taoist\", a Planting Devil in the Taoist Heart deepened by Heavenly secret Tricky Calculation, unique and unparalleled.","And, apparently much stronger than the Illusory Demon Sect’s.","But just how much stronger, no one really knows.","Because those hit by the Gui Tao’s \"Planting Devil in the Taoist Heart\", none seem to survive.","Back then outside Li State City at the Ten Thousand Demons Hall, Mo Hua remembered clearly, so many Golden Cores, including three Feather Transformation Realm Demon Path True Men, also did not speak a word once hit.","Especially in a crowd, hit one, and a whole piece dies.","Mo Hua contemplated a little.","Young Master Xuan’s method of Planting Devil in the Taoist Heart seems to need some kind of Evil Artifact during execution — namely, in his hand, that three-skull-pieced amber-colored token, to confuse minds.","Additionally, needing some kind of \"word curse\" as a medium.","This word curse is somewhat lengthy, sometimes saying it once isn’t enough, must be said twice, by which time the yellow flowers have cooled.","But the Uncle is different.","When he wants to Plant Devil in the Taoist Heart, usually a single glance suffices, sometimes even a simple sentence, a thought, or even a name could become a \"seed\" for Planting Devil in the Taoist Heart.","The Uncle is really so powerful.","That’s why back then, I stole his techniques.","This Young Master Xuan, is far behind.","Come to think of it, Uncle’s Divine Thought Skill, still called \"Planting Devil in the Taoist Heart\", is also probably evolved from the Illusory Demon Sect’s method.","But now, it’s impossible for me to learn the Uncle’s \"Planting Devil in the Taoist Heart\".","Then, as the next best, study this Young Master Xuan’s basic \"Planting Devil in the Taoist Heart\" usage?","\"Seems feasible, besides...\"","Mo Hua glanced through the corner of his eye at the surrounding Divine Temple, thoughtfully.","This temple appears magnificent, but being sealed by countless corpses in coffins, hidden deep inside, must contain great peril.","What’s to come is still unknown.","And I, a Foundation Building Cultivator, mixing with this group of Golden Core Great Demon Cultivators, really too risky.","Not to mention the late Golden Core stage Demon Sect leaders, late Golden Core stage Bear Demon Cultivator, late Golden Core stage black-robed elder, even facing this \"Young Master Xuan\" directly, I am no match.","If careless, showing a flaw, will be suspect, and even bring lethal disaster.","In that case, better to give some ’handle’ out, serve as their ’puppet’, let them be at ease.","Mo Hua looked again at Young Master Xuan walking ahead, a hint of strangeness in his eyes:"]},{"number":1989,"title":"Chapter 1989 - 959: Planting Demonic Seeds","paragraphs":["\"Of all things to use, you dare use ’Planting Devil in Taoist Heart’ on me...\"","As Young Master Xuan walked in front, a slight tremor coursed through his heart. He suddenly turned back, only to see Mo Hua with a dim gaze and a vacant expression, following behind like a fool, showing nothing out of the ordinary.","Young Master Xuan frowned, a bit puzzled.","But just as his confusion rose, the words Mo Hua had spoken and the incantations he had chanted echoed once more in his mind.","Young Master Xuan pondered briefly, his frown gradually easing.","\"The Planting Devil in Taoist Heart technique, used on a Foundation Building Cultivator, how could it be wrong? This kid is already my ’plaything’...\"","Young Master Xuan nodded, turning around to continue leading Mo Hua forward.","The Divine Temple was resplendent with gold and emerald, the towers majestic, bronze pillars stood in a forest, corridors crisscrossed, and the directions difficult to discern.","Yet it seemed Young Master Xuan knew the way, directly passing through layers of golden terraces and towers, arriving at a front hall.","In the front hall, shadows flickered, all the Golden Core Demon Cultivators were present.","Even Mr. Hui and Stone were there.","But both of them, with eyes vacant and listless, were clearly also victims of ’Planting Devil in Taoist Heart.’","And judging by their state, it seemed Young Master Xuan was responsible.","\"All present.\" Young Master Xuan said.","The old man in the black robe nodded slightly, then glanced at Mo Hua, \"This young brother, you’ve also planted?\"","\"Of course,\" Young Master Xuan said, then looked at Mo Hua, \"It’s for his own good...\"","\"Planted with Demon Thought, turned into puppets, they’re oblivious to our words. This way, there’s a chance he might survive afterward. Otherwise, any secret of this Divine Temple he overhears would be a death sentence.\"","\"Moreover, this kid seems naïve, but he’s actually quite clever. I wouldn’t feel at ease not planting a demon in him.\"","\"That makes sense,\" the old man in the black robe nodded, then glanced at Young Master Xuan, \"You seem to value this kid quite a bit?\"","Young Master Xuan smirked, \"I need a servant to serve tea and water, one with a pleasing visage, this kid fits the bill perfectly.\"","The elder in the black robe said nothing more.","Young Master Xuan instead glanced at the Shen Qingsheng in the elder’s hand, asking, \"And what about this kid from the Shen Family, will you take him with you?\"","The elderly man nodded, \"The Shen Family won’t let things rest, he’s useful as leverage.\"","\"True enough.\" Young Master Xuan nodded.","\"It’s getting late, let’s go.\"","\"Yes,\" Young Master Xuan nodded, his expression turning slightly solemn, smiling faintly, \"After overcoming countless hardships, we’ve reached this point. I hope the Second Elder and Third Prince won’t disappoint me.\"","The black-robed elder gave no reply, stepping forward to lead the way.","The leader of the Demon Sect followed him, heading deep into the temple.","Young Master Xuan, leading Mo Hua, Mr. Hui, and Stone, the three \"puppets\" implanted with devil seeds, walked at the back.","The stairs of the Divine Temple were wide and long, like a golden-scaled flood dragon, winding upwards to the highest point, leading to the most majestic and magnificent hall atop overlapping silver terraces and golden pavilions.","All along the way, with carved beams and painted rafters, golden palaces, jade halls, splendid and breathtaking views, that were overwhelming.","Mo Hua walked on the steps, like a humble \"pilgrim\", going to meet a mighty deity, secretly grumbling in his heart:","\"What a decadent Lord Yellow Mountain you have become...\"","But he dared not look around too much, instead keeping his hands and feet stiff, like a wooden figure, stepping up one step at a time.","It was not clear how long they walked before a vast square appeared ahead.","The square was enormous, constructed of bright yellow copper ore, shining golden.","And within the square, densely packed, knelt innumerable bronze statues.","These statues included men and women, young and old, mostly in ragged clothing and sorrowful expressions, all piously kneeling on the ground, praying toward the temple atop the mountain.","Though it was a solemn and sacred scene, the black-robed elder inexplicably felt a sense of creepiness.","Because above this grand golden hall, there was an intense concentration of sinister energy.","As if it were an entire sea of darkness, enough to make one’s skin crawl.","The black-robed elder halted, glanced at Mr. Hui, and asked Young Master Xuan, \"To what level have you cultivated your Planting Devil in Taoist Heart?\"","Young Master Xuan understood the elder’s implication and said:","\"My skills are still shallow, those implanted with the demon cannot use cultivation techniques or Taoist skills, only some instinctive martial arts. However, they can answer questions and perform basic tasks.\"","The black-robed elder said: \"Have him take out the Maoshan Jade to measure the sinister energy.\"","\"Yes,\" Young Master Xuan nodded, then commanded Mr. Hui, \"Take out the Maoshan Jade.\"","Mr. Hui complied as instructed, retrieving the jade pendant from his storage bag.","The jade pendant gleamed with an eerie green light.","This light was deeper than before, almost turning black.","Young Master Xuan asked, \"What does this mean?\"","Mr. Hui blankly said: \"This is... an omen of great darkness, overwhelming resentment.\"","With those words, the atmosphere grew heavy, and everyone’s faces fell.","Mo Hua also subtly nodded.","Indeed, it was a sign of great darkness.","He could now see with his own eyes, that on the golden plaza where thousands of kneeling bronze statues stood, countless vengeful spirits and fierce ghosts were roaring and howling, a dark mass like an army besieging the city, an overwhelming black cloud, deeply unsettling.","Regrettably, this scene was invisible to Young Master Xuan and his companions.","The black-robed elder frowned in contemplation, slowly saying:","\"This is the Divine Temple, also the imperial tomb of our Great Wilderness, deities require worship, our royal descendants of the Great Wilderness also demand obeisance.\"","\"These bronze statues before us are made from living humans, worshipping both deities and royals. From life to death, they continuously bow.\"","\"In life, they were slaves to the imperial power. In death, they transform into sinister fierce ghosts, guarding this imperial tomb and the Divine Temple.\""]},{"number":1990,"title":"Chapter 1990 - 959: Demon Seed","paragraphs":["\"Therefore, this Taoist Field is the Holy Land of the dead, a forbidden area for the living.\"","Young Master Xuan’s gaze was stern as he asked, \"How do we break the formation?\"","The elder in the black robe shook his head slightly.","Young Master Xuan asked curiously, \"Isn’t this your Great Wilderness’s inheritance? It should be the handiwork of the Great Wilderness clan, does even the Second Elder not know?\"","The elder’s murky eyes trembled slightly, suddenly revealing a cold intent to kill, \"The one who created this arrangement is a traitor of the Great Wilderness. He... stole the inheritance of the Great Wilderness, deserving of a thousand deaths...\"","Mo Hua, standing aside, was startled upon hearing this.","A traitor of the Great Wilderness?","Who is he talking about?","Young Master Xuan didn’t care much about the traitor of the Great Wilderness; he only cared about whether he could reach the Divine Temple.","\"Is there no other way?\"","The elder pondered for a moment and said, \"I have an item, a relic of the Great Wilderness lineage called the ’Divine Mist Lamp,’ which can hide the traces of Divine Sense and evade the sinister ghosts.\"","\"But...\"","The elder looked into the distance, \"But this Taoist Field is too vast, filled with evil objects like clouds, and the path is too long. Relying solely on this ’Divine Mist Lamp’ might not be enough to make it through.\"","Young Master Xuan said, \"Then perhaps, you should also light a person as a lamp?\"","The elder contemplated for a moment and nodded, \"It seems we have no other choice.\"","Young Master Xuan instructed Mr. Hui to take out his gold hoop.","The elder shook a few times, injecting a chilling evil power into Shen Qingsheng’s meridians, waking him up, and then put the gold hoop on Shen Qingsheng’s head.","The familiar sensation returned, and Shen Qingsheng’s face instantly turned pale with terror as he said, \"No, I will die...\"","The elder sealed Shen Qingsheng’s mouth and nose with blood-colored spiritual power, preventing him from shouting.","Afterward, he began to recite mystical and ancient words from the Barbaric Wilderness, and the Divine Mist Lamp was lit.","A lamp of fire ignited, mist filled the air, enveloping everyone and concealing their presence.","Mo Hua sensed the surrounding mist, pondered for a moment, and understood.","Within the Divine Mist Lamp was the Formation of Divine Mist, and once activated, it could transform into mist to confuse the perception of Divine Thought.","The sinister fierce ghosts, being things of \"divine thought,\" would also naturally be confused by the Divine Mist Lamp.","Mo Hua was somewhat amazed in his heart.","This Divine Mist Lamp can actually merge with the Divine Mist Formation, crafted ingeniously, likely using the ancient artifact refining methods of the Great Wilderness lineage.","The inheritance of the Great Wilderness is indeed extraordinary.","Shrouded by the Divine Mist Lamp, they walked through the Taoist Field.","Surrounded by infused bronze figures, with ominous shadows overhead like clouds, there seemed to be no incident for a while.","But as they walked further, some significantly stronger ghostly entities detected something amiss and began probing into the mist of the Divine Mist Lamp.","The elder gave Young Master Xuan a glance.","In understanding, Young Master Xuan emulated Mr. Hui and ignited the \"human lamp\" on Shen Qingsheng’s head.","Shen Qingsheng’s Sea of Consciousness began to burn bit by bit again.","His divine thought transformed into smoke, diffusing into the sky, attracting these ghostly entities to one side.","Young Master Xuan and his group breathed a slight sigh of relief.","Thus, under the cover of the Divine Mist Lamp and the protection of the human lamp, they continued to walk forward.","Shen Qingsheng was used as a \"candle,\" burning all the way.","But Shen Qingsheng’s divine sense was not strong; having been lit once before, this time it was already drying up.","Shen Qingsheng’s head felt as though a thousand needles pierced it.","Soon, his eyes rolled back, and he fainted.","Young Master Xuan checked his breath and rolled his eyelids, shaking his head, saying, \"He’s nearly spent. If we keep lighting him, he’ll be gone.\"","Shen Qingsheng was still useful, so the elder didn’t want him to die just yet.","As the human lamp extinguished, the sinister aura grew heavier.","Without bait, more powerful ghostly entities began to probe into their mist again.","The elder said, \"Let’s switch people.\"","Young Master Xuan nodded.","Thus, the gold hoop lamp was placed on Mr. Hui’s head.","All his life, Mr. Hui had been using others to \"light the lamp.\" Little did he expect that one day, his own head would be used for lighting.","The human lamp ignited again, and wisps of divine sense smoke rose.","Mr. Hui was a Golden Core, his divine sense stronger than Shen Qingsheng’s.","But surprisingly, his divine sense smoke was even more mixed than Shen Qingsheng’s, perhaps due to his age, his distracted thoughts, and excessive greed.","Added to this was the fact he had been bitten by corpse spirits, his divine thought already tainted with impurities.","Therefore, the smoke burnt from his divine thought wasn’t to every ghost’s liking, naturally making its effect somewhat weaker.","Though weaker, he was still a Golden Core, thus more \"resistant\" to burning.","They continued walking a good distance until he showed signs of divine sense exhaustion.","\"Switch again,\" said the elder.","So the one being lit as the human lamp was swapped out for Shi Tou.","Shi Tou’s divine thought was much better than Mr. Hui’s; his thoughts seemed much less complex, and his greed not as intense.","But being a Body Cultivator, he was somewhat dull-witted, not fond of thinking.","Thus, the smoke from his divine thought had a somewhat bland scent.","But with the cover of the Divine Mist Lamp, the quality of the human lamp wasn’t that significant; as long as it could be lit, it sufficed.","Thus, they continued traversing the golden Taoist Field.","Unknown how long they walked, the towering Divine Temple was already in sight, and the emperor’s tomb of the Great Wilderness seemed also to be just ahead.","Yet at this moment, Shi Tou’s divine sense was nearing exhaustion, the human lamp about to extinguish.","There was still a small stretch of path to leave the Taoist Field.","Shen Qingsheng, Mr. Hui, Shi Tou had all been used as lamps, the only one left was Mo Hua.","These demon cultivators naturally wouldn’t use their own divine thought as a lamp.","But Mo Hua...","Young Master Xuan was somewhat hesitant; he had a great use for Mo Hua, reluctant to truly use him to light the lamp.","If it burns out his mind, he’d lose an excellent servant.","The elder was also hesitant.","But seeing the human lamp nearly depleted, there seemed no other choice.","\"Light it,\" said the elder.","\"Alright.\"","Young Master Xuan thought for a moment, nodded, and took the gold hoop from Shi Tou’s head, turning it to fit onto Mo Hua’s head.","Mo Hua wanted to resist but didn’t dare move.","After all, at present, he was a \"puppet\" of Planting Devil in Taoist Heart, not allowed to have independent consciousness.","Moreover, surrounding him were Golden Core Demon Cultivators, each stronger than the next.","\"If it’s lighting the human lamp, then so be it...\"","At most, it’s just draining some divine sense, probably nothing too significant.","Besides, divine sense exhaustion, damage, even divine sense depletion, he’d long grown accustomed to, so draining some divine sense wasn’t much of an issue.","Mo Hua stood motionless, letting Young Master Xuan put the human lamp’s hoop on his forehead.","Afterward, Young Master Xuan began lighting the lamp.","The human lamp shone for a while but with no reaction.","\"What’s going on?\" Young Master Xuan was startled.","The elder frowned.","Mo Hua hesitated for a moment and was unclear, so he introspected with his divine sense, sensing what was happening, and gradually understood.","His divine thought was like a complete union with the Dao, fused and inseparable, like a copper cast, unmovable by the human lamp.","Unable to draw on divine thought, naturally the lamp couldn’t be lit.","With the elder and Young Master Xuan watching him, he had no choice but to \"loosen up.\"","He voluntarily released a portion of his divine sense, feeding it to the human lamp for burning.","The human lamp slowly ignited.","\"It’s working...\"","Young Master Xuan nodded slightly, breathing a sigh of relief.","But the next instant, he was stunned.","The human lamp’s light grew brighter and more brilliant.","A strand of pure golden smoke drifted into the sky.","Then everyone felt as if the entire sky \"boomed\" with an explosive sound, the winds and clouds shifted, the previously fierce sinister aura surged like a monumental tsunami."]},{"number":1991,"title":"Chapter 1991 - 960: Uprising","paragraphs":["\"What’s going on?\"","\"A riot of spirits?!\"","Everyone’s faces changed color, even the usually calm Demon Sect leader showed a heavy expression.","The surrounding Yin Qi suddenly gathered like a storm, becoming extremely intense, the air turned so gloomy it seemed like water could drip from it, with a coldness that seeped into the bones.","The elderly man in a black robe looked up at the sky.","The sky was gray, permeated with Yin Qi, and devoid of anything.","But he could foresee that there were incredible changes happening.","The elderly man in a black robe turned his head to Mo Hua, his pupils involuntarily trembling.","Although he didn’t understand what was happening, it was clear that the spirit disturbance in the Taoist Field was attracted by this kid’s Divine Sense.","\"What in the world is happening...\"","The Yin wind surged with an immense sense of oppression, gathering above their heads, then stagnating, continuously swirling above.","The elderly man in a black robe was unaware of what was happening, but Mo Hua could see it.","In his vision, countless spirits and ghostly entities, attracted by his golden Divine Sense smoke, were gathering like a tide.","This golden Divine Thought made them yearn, yet it also made them fearful.","This yearning made them howl and tremble all over.","But this fear also made them apprehensive, pacing in hesitation.","It was like a \"gift\" from a deity, endowed with supreme honor, they wanted to consume it, yet no one dared to take a bite.","The evil spirits and ghostly entities gathered more and more, circling around the golden Divine Thought, covering the sky, forming a terrifying dark whirlwind.","This dense mass of evil spirits was squeezing and trampling against each other, even causing the space to warp slightly.","Cold sweat gradually appeared on the elderly man in a black robe’s forehead.","The others didn’t dare to make a sound either.","Meanwhile, the lamp above Mo Hua’s head remained lit, the golden Divine Thought continued to rise, becoming more concentrated by the moment.","Finally, one evil spirit couldn’t resist.","Its greed overpowered its fear, and it took the first bite of Divine Thought from Mo Hua, this \"Demigod.\"","An indescribable sweetness and richness instantly filled its entire being.","Its body even began to mutate, developing faint golden patterns.","It howled furiously, a look of extreme ecstasy appearing on its hideous and ugly face.","It wanted to take a second bite, but in the next moment, it was torn apart by other wandering spirits.","Like a plump lamb falling into a hungry wolf pack, its evil thoughts-filled body was shredded by countless vengeful spirits and fierce ghosts surrounding it, devoured until nothing remained.","Greed had torn open a rift, letting the fragrance of Divine Thought escape.","More ghostly entities tasted this sweetness that penetrated the divine soul and marrow.","They became completely mad.","More and more wandering spirits dared to feast on Mo Hua’s golden Divine Sense.","But as soon as they took a bite, in the next moment, they would be shredded and consumed by more fierce ghosts and wandering spirits.","Mo Hua’s Divine Thought was both \"nourishment\" and a \"plague.\"","Ghostly entities could gain great benefits from consuming it, but after consumption, they faced inevitable ruin, buried by other ghostly entities.","An endless expanse of ghostly entities fought fiercely around this golden Divine Sense, howling and crying out as gusts of Yin wind surged.","Meanwhile, some even more terrifying auras were approaching from afar.","It seemed that certain mighty fierce ghosts were also being drawn by this Divine Sense.","The elderly man in a black robe’s pupils trembled violently, rasping, \"Run quickly!\"","There were too many ghostly entities.","If they didn’t run, everyone would die!","Even if they were Golden Core cultivators, top late Golden Core stage great cultivators, they would certainly meet their end at the hands of these invisible, unknowable spirits and fierce ghosts.","Invaded, polluted, consumed, and dying mutated!","No one dared to delay, they urged their movement techniques and began to swiftly run forward.","In doing so, a flaw appeared in the Mist Lamp, exposing some living aura.","Many ghostly entities were startled and then, with an evil, savage look, transformed into gusts of Yin wind, attacking the crowd.","The elderly man in a black robe suddenly felt a chill to his core, and without hesitation, he took out a Monster Beast’s skull and threw it into the sky.","The skull exploded, turning into a mist of blood.","These ghostly entities, attracted by the blood mist, were momentarily blocked.","\"Maoshan Talisman!\"","The elderly man in a black robe immediately commanded.","Young Master Xuan understood, turned to Mr. Hui, and ordered in a strange accent:","\"Use the talisman!\"","Mr. Hui nodded dazedly, took out a bunch of Maoshan Jade Talismans from his storage bag without discerning their authenticity or effectiveness, and detonated them one by one.","Because his Taoist Heart was planted with a devil, he was half-conscious, using all sorts of Jade Talismans indiscriminately.","Most of the talismans had no effect.","But a small portion, upon exploding, generated golden tiger shadows and mysterious seal scripts, indeed hindering the ghostly entities momentarily.","Taking advantage of this interval, the elderly man in a black robe spat a mouthful of essence blood onto the Mist Lamp, using his own Blood Qi to fully activate the treasure’s function, creating an even thicker mist, enveloping everyone within.","The ghostly entities were momentarily disoriented.","But after a brief confusion, in the next moment, they still surged towards the crowd, and this time even more frenzied, with the aura of powerful fierce ghosts approaching from afar.","It seemed that fierce ghosts had also set their sights on them.","The elderly man in a black robe shuddered inside, realizing the situation instantly.","\"Extinguish the human lamp!\"","Usually, cultivators who lighted the human lamp would offer a portion of Divine Sense for ghostly entities to enjoy, serving as \"passage fee.\"","However, Mo Hua’s Divine Sense was incredibly valuable.","This was akin to flaunting gold and jewels while traveling.","Possessing a treasure invites crime; this wasn’t a \"passage fee,\" but rather a \"death fee.\""]},{"number":1992,"title":"Chapter 1992 - 960: Uprising (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Young Master Xuan immediately removed Mo Hua’s golden band, not daring to let Mo Hua ignite the \"human lamp\" again.","The wisp of golden Divine Thought vanished.","The countless vengeful spirits and fierce ghosts paused, indeed becoming silent, but only for a moment. What followed was a strong sense of anger and roaring.","The \"fat meat\" dripping with the aura of a deity was snatched away.","Numerous vengeful spirits and ghostly creatures were furious.","They began to go mad, twisting and mutating, attacking each other, flying wildly, biting everything indiscriminately.","\"Have all these ghosts... gone insane?\"","The black-robed elder gasped, then dared not delay, fully activating the Mist Lamp to cover the group’s frantic advance forward.","But after all, they were a bit late.","Some vengeful spirits and fierce ghosts had already breached the mist, starting to bite at the group.","Mr. Hui and Stone were most eroded by the ghostly creatures.","The rest of the group also, more or less, was tainted with the aura of malevolent spirits.","The only exception was Mo Hua.","Whether vengeful spirits or fierce ghosts, they would rush to Mo Hua and then stop cold as if encountering something terrifying, not daring to make a move at all.","As a result, among the chaotic ghost swarm, Mo Hua was actually the safest.","However, all these changes on the ominous spirit level were clear to Mo Hua, but not to the others.","The black-robed elder and the others just felt an eerie coldness, a bone-chilling cold, with tremendous pressure bearing down on them.","But they didn’t know that the fierce ghosts had already bitten them and torn some \"flesh\" off their bodies.","If this continued, no matter if they were Demon Sect leaders with Golden Core Cultivation, they would all die in this Taoist Field.","But luckily, they were not far from the edge of the Taoist Field.","This was their chance for survival.","After half an hour, the group walked out of the golden Taoist Field, escaping from the thousands of bronze figures and countless vengeful ghosts and shadowy spirits behind them.","The black-robed elder felt a rare sense of having narrowly escaped death.","It was a feeling he had not experienced in many years.","Behind him, a dense aura of evil spirits loomed like storm clouds bearing down on a city.","Clearly, the unrest had not ceased. The disturbed shadowy spirits swept through the entire Taoist Field like a raging storm, chilling hearts to the core.","The black-robed elder slowly turned his head, looking at Mo Hua beside him, a feeling of extreme absurdity rising in his heart.","\"This kid... who on earth is he?\"","\"Why does his Divine Sense cause such a massive evil disturbance...?\"","\"Could his Divine Thought be ’immortal flesh’? Why is it so immensely attractive?\"","The black-robed elder’s eyes widened in shock, momentarily in disbelief.","But Mo Hua stood there like a wooden figure, unresponsive, his eyes gradually dimming, as if his Divine Sense essence had been depleted from being lit as a lamp.","\"What a pity...\"","The black-robed elder sighed slightly upon seeing this, contemplating silently, \"Such exceptional Divine Sense talent, if it weren’t for having the Devil planted in his Taoist Heart, he would surely have been a promising candidate for a Great Witch...\"","\"It’s a pity, all wasted now...\"","The black-robed elder shook his head, then gathered his thoughts and said to the group, \"This is no place to stay, better leave early.\"","Young Master Xuan nodded.","The feeling of being entangled by shadowy spirits, like needles in the back, was indeed uncomfortable.","The group then set out again, stepping one by one along the resplendent golden steps like dragon scales, climbing towards the most magnificent Divine Temple at the top.","And having crossed Solitary Mountain City and the vast shadowy spirits.","This deepest, grandest, most resplendent Divine Temple, perched atop the group of platforms, slowly unfolded before their eyes...","...","Meanwhile, outside the Divine Temple.","Shen Shouxing, Xun Ziyou, along with the Shen Family elders, Master Gu, and Fan Jin, were jointly attacking the main gate of the Divine Temple.","They wanted to break through the gate, rescuing Mo Hua and Shen Qingsheng.","As time passed, the longer Mo Hua and Shen Qingsheng stayed inside the Divine Temple, the more dangerous their situation became, and the slimmer their chances of survival.","Mo Hua might still be fine.","Xun Ziyou, holding the Jade Pendant, at least knew that Mo Hua’s life was temporarily safe.","But not Shen Qingsheng.","Even Shen Shouxing knew that his son was ultimately a pampered waste; without the family’s protection, he couldn’t accomplish anything. Yet, he was arrogant and conceited, disregarding everyone.","Now he had fallen into the hands of several Golden Core Great Demon Cultivators, ruthless and cunning. If not rescued, it was basically a death sentence.","Hence, Shen Shouxing was more anxious than anyone.","At the same time, a voice unbidden echoed in his mind:","\"This is your only son. If he dies, you will have no descendants...\"","The words \"no descendants\" inexplicably terrified Shen Shouxing.","So he spared no effort, employing all manner of Sword Qi and Magic Treasures, hoping to blast open the gate of this Divine Temple.","Yet, no matter how hard he tried, the Divine Temple gate remained unmoved.","Xun Ziyou also furrowed his brows.","He himself didn’t matter, but this Shen Shouxing was an influential elder of the Shen Family, at the Golden Core Peak, just a step away from the Feather Transformation Realm. Even with his cultivation techniques, he couldn’t blow open this door...","This Divine Temple was undoubtedly extraordinary...","\"Mo Hua...\"","Xun Ziyou slightly furrowed his brow.","It’s hard to believe, but his \"bodyguard\" might be more concerned about Mo Hua’s safety than Mo Hua himself.","Xun Ziyou again touched the Void Sword Order in his sleeve, his gaze grave.","This Sword Command he kept in his sleeve without a bit of neglect, ready to crush it at the slightest indication of Mo Hua’s Jade Pendant turning black, to notify Elder Master Xun.","But looking at the current situation, even notifying Elder Master Xun might not immediately open this Divine Temple gate."]},{"number":1993,"title":"Chapter 1993 - 960: Riot_3","paragraphs":["And the crisis of life and death often occurs in an instant. If slightly delayed, it might be too late to save it.","\"What should we do...\"","Xun Ziyou’s heart gradually grew anxious.","Not only Xun Ziyou, but Fan Jin and Master Gu also looked worried.","Mo Hua is a benefactor of the Gushan Refining Workshop, and Master Gu didn’t want anything to happen to Mo Hua.","Mo Hua is Fan Jin’s hard-earned \"big support,\" and naturally, Fan Jin didn’t want to lose this support just like that.","Moreover, as the Records Officer of Solitary Mountain City, if something happened to Mo Hua in Solitary Mountain’s territory, he would be somewhat implicated.","But their anxiety was of no use; no matter what methods they tried, the golden doors of the Divine Temple remained impregnable.","It was as if this was a forbidden land of the deities, not allowing any mortal to approach.","As time passed little by little, everyone’s hearts grew colder bit by bit.","It was unknown how much time elapsed when, just as a thread of despair began to surface in everyone’s heart, a flash of blood-red light appeared.","The doors of the Divine Temple suddenly trembled and then slowly opened in front of everyone’s eyes.","Everyone was momentarily incredulous.","\"It opened...\"","\"Has it finally been broken?\"","\"But...how did it open?\" Master Gu wondered, as they saw no traces of breaking the Formation or any mechanism.","Xun Ziyou frowned, also unable to figure it out.","\"Mo Hua is inside; no matter what, we have to go in and take a look,\" Xun Ziyou said.","Master Gu nodded.","On the other side, Shen Shouxing glanced at Xun Ziyou and the others, a flicker in his eyes showing a hint of ruthless determination, before stepping into the doors of the Divine Temple.","The Shen Family’s Golden Core followed closely behind.","Xun Ziyou and the others also stopped hesitating and stepped into the temple.","Once inside the temple, there was a moment of dead silence around them.","Suddenly, the sound of rustling began, and a pale humanoid demon, devoid of human skin, with deathly white skin and distorted features, slowly emerged.","It glanced at the doors of the temple, then cracked a bloody grin before also slowly entering the temple.","The pale, deformed figure disappeared into the door.","After it entered, a flash of blood light appeared, and the doors of the temple slowly closed, sealing everyone inside.","...","Deep within the Divine Temple.","After walking a little longer, the group with the black-robed elder finally arrived at the final hall.","The hall was vast, the steps were high, and the entire space was suffused with a brilliant gold.","On both sides of the hall stood rows of giant statues.","These statues were humanoid, but unlike the copper men kneeling at the Taoist Field, these copper sculptures were all towering and majestic, with dignified expressions, either riding a dragon horse, sitting on a dragon chair, or holding a dragon sword, overlooking and dominating the area.","The copper sculptures loomed high above, as if receiving the kneeling tributes of countless mining cultivators, who were like slaves in the Taoist Field.","\"Dragons? Are these people the royals of the Great Wilderness?\"","Mo Hua speculated in his mind, but remained expressionless without revealing any emotion.","The Demon Sect leader shivered at the sight of the majestic, grand statues etched with \"Dragon Patterns,\" experiencing a visible emotional turmoil.","\"We have finally...arrived here...\"","The black-robed elder also sighed with an elderly voice, \"The fortunes of my Great Wilderness have finally encountered a turning point, Third Prince...\"","The black-robed elder looked towards the Demon Sect leader.","The Demon Sect leader nodded and then strode towards the main entrance of the hall.","The main doors of the hall were tightly closed, with a gigantic dragon head affixed to the door, sealing off the deepest part of the Divine Temple as well.","Heavy chains extended from the dragon head, spreading out, and finally anchoring onto each statute of the Great Wilderness’s royals.","These royal statues also stood with astonishing might, guarding this final door of the Divine Temple.","The Demon Sect leader slashed open his palm and then extended his arm into the mouth of the dragon head at the door.","Blood dripped down, feeding the dragon.","As if it tasted the bloodline of the royals, the dragon head trembled, and its eyes slowly lit up, gazing at the Demon Sect leader with terrifying majesty.","At the same time, the surrounding statues of royals seemed to come to life, exuding a killing aura.","The Demon Sect leader’s gaze was firm as he slowly knelt, his voice deep and resonant, like that of a dragon’s growl, speaking word by word:","\"Descendant, Shen Tuao, third son of the Great Wilderness royals, pays respects to the ancestors.\"","\"In these times, the royal bloodline has fallen into decline, left isolated and wandering.\"","\"The Taoist Court is without justice, and our family’s bloodline is cut off.\"","\"I, Shen Tuao, humbly request our ancestors to restrain the Dragon Qi, open the imperial tomb, grant me the Dragon Vein of the Great Wilderness, defy the heavens, alter the Life Chart, revive royal enterprise, and reign supreme over the three thousand mountains, unifying the myriad tribes of the Great Wilderness!\"","...","Mo Hua shivered upon hearing this.","\"This Demon Sect leader is actually called ’Shen Tuao,’ is Shen Tuao the royal surname of the Great Wilderness?\"","\"To reign over three thousand mountains, unify the myriad tribes of the Great Wilderness, and revive the royal enterprise...what is Shen Tuao planning?\"","\"Could it be... he intends to rebel?\"","\"And what exactly is the Great Wilderness Dragon Vein?\"","\"Is it with this object that he could stage a rebellion?\"","The more Mo Hua listened, the more shocked he became. If it weren’t for his proficiency in the Divine Thought, his deep thoughts, his exceptional determination, and his habit of \"acting\" to deceive others, he would have certainly revealed his shock, showing flaws on his face.","Rebellion, really?","Reigning over the Great Wilderness, reviving the royal throne, resisting the Taoist Court?","This Shen Tuao truly possesses audacious courage and ambition.","Mo Hua never expected that this trip to Solitary Mountain’s tomb would unearth such a groundbreaking secret.","This was something beyond his anticipation, something he wouldn’t have guessed even if he racked his brains...","And just at the moment when the Demon Sect leader, the third prince of the Great Wilderness, Shen Tuao, finished these words.","The entire grand hall of the Divine Temple had a slight tremor.","As if his bloodline, his ambition, and his aspirations had awakened those ancestors and past emperors of the Great Wilderness, who had been slumbering and forgotten in the depths of the underground palace for countless years.","A series of deep dragon roars began to echo, intertwining with each other.","The ancestors of the Great Wilderness seemed to be responding to Shen Tuao’s ambitions.","They transmitted their lingering Dragon Qi, bit by bit, to the door through the straps binding dragons, subduing the violent dragon head.","As an obstinate dragon roar echoed.","The doors of the Great Wilderness imperial tomb slowly opened, and a fierce aura of the Karma Dragon emanated from the depths..."]},{"number":1994,"title":"Chapter 1994 - 961: Dragon Coffin","paragraphs":["The aura of the Karma Dragon was deep and intense, carrying an unparalleled majesty that made everyone present tremble inside, a faint feeling of \"submission\" emerging within them.","The old man in the black robe looked devout, half-kneeling on the ground.","Young Master Xuan’s face slightly paled, bending over to pay his respects.","The Bear Demon Cultivator was internally terrified, prostrating in salute.","Mo Hua, however, remained motionless.","His Divine Sense was extremely strong, and with Divine Thought Taoism, close to deity level, he had an innate resistance to this kind of \"majesty\" on the level of Divine Sense.","In life, a person kneels to heaven, earth, and their parents.","The royal family of the Great Wilderness, no matter how powerful and majestic, did not deserve his submission.","Moreover, he was now a pitiful \"puppet\" implanted with the Planting Devil in Taoist Heart.","A \"puppet\" had no feelings, how could it willingly kneel and bow?","As the dragon’s aura diminished, the people slowly stood up.","The huge dragon head opened, the grand door swung open, revealing behind it a world of resplendent gold and divine majesty.","\"The royal tomb of the Great Wilderness has opened...\"","Shen Tuao, covered in dragon patterns, said softly, then stepped forward, his body as towering as a small mountain, slowly walking into the final Divine Temple.","A few people, including the old man in black robes, also followed in step.","Young Master Xuan glanced at Shen Tuao and the others, his gaze obscure, pondering something unknown. Moments later, he ordered Mo Hua and the other two:","\"Go.\"","Mo Hua obediently, with a stupefied gait, followed as they walked into Gushan Temple, which held the secrets of the Great Wilderness.","Inside the temple, the sight was ablaze with dazzling gold, extremely luxurious.","All around the long staircase were various kinds of statues.","These statues, with various poses and utmost intricacy—standing, sitting, lying, wearing golden armor, or clad in magnificent robes, in scholarly attire, or draped in grand cloaks—each had a stern, elongated face, all invariably depicted as Lord Yellow Mountain.","Mo Hua couldn’t help but click his tongue in wonder:","How many people, how much time, how much yellow ore, and how many Spirit Stones must have been used to forge so many divine statues.","This Lord Yellow Mountain...","To be so corrupt, it’s no wonder it has fallen on hard times.","Indeed, some things are divinely destined.","\"But, why is Lord Yellow Mountain going to such lengths to make so many statues...?\"","Mo Hua was a bit puzzled, muttering to himself, and then continued to walk forward with the others.","The route thereafter encountered no mechanisms or Killing Formations.","This grand hall seemed to be for offering tribute to the royal tomb of the Great Wilderness and the Mountain God of Solitary Mountain City. Outside, there might be perilous crises and treacherous conditions, but inside the grand hall, to avoid disturbing entities such as the royal family or deities, it was instead serene and solemn.","Thus, the group bypassed a multitude of statues of varying shapes and forms and walked all the way to the deepest part of the grand hall.","In the deepest part, it was more grand and magnificent, with a shimmering glow.","A much larger statue of the Mountain Lord was built deep within.","This Mountain Lord wore royal armor, embodying an aura of power without anger, looking at first glance like the deity of Solitary Mountain City, but on closer inspection, resembling the royal family of the Great Wilderness.","Deity and royalty, the two styles fused into one, creating this enormous statue of the Mountain Lord, situated at the deepest part of the Divine Temple.","Beneath this statue lay a sarcophagus.","The shape of this sarcophagus was nearly identical to the huge bright yellow bronze coffin outside in the underground palace, nurturing countless flesh and corpse statues.","Yet this sarcophagus was far more exquisite and delicate, only large enough to bury one person, and its materials were evidently far more precious.","What’s more special is that on top of this sarcophagus, a mighty and unruly dragon was carved.","This was a dragon coffin!","Mo Hua’s heart trembled slightly, his thoughts turning:","\"Who is buried in this dragon coffin? Is it the royal family of the Great Wilderness?\"","\"Is the dragon vein of the Great Wilderness, mentioned by Shen Tuao, also hidden in this dragon coffin?\"","\"Speaking of which, what on earth is the ’dragon vein’ of the Great Wilderness? Is it some kind of inheritance, a set of dragon bones, or some other part of the dragon?\"","\"Could it possibly contain... the complete Four Symbols Green Dragon Evil Formation Diagram?\"","Mo Hua’s eyes slightly trembled, quietly heaving a sigh of relief.","\"Finally... my Lifebound Formation is getting closer and closer...\"","It was a journey full of challenges.","Mo Hua had not expected that Solitary Mountain City hid so many dangers and that so many deadly schemes had been laid down.","Grave passages, eerie corpse spirits.","Flesh sacrificial statues, thousands of corpses sealed within coffins.","Ten-thousand-man pit, sinister ghost paths.","And within this Divine Temple, the golden Taoist Field teeming with fiends.","Guarded by the ancestors of the Great Wilderness, the dragon head gate of the Divine Temple could only be opened by a descendant of the Great Wilderness royal bloodline.","Mo Hua pondered a while and realized that other than dealing with ghostly evil spirits, which didn’t cost him much effort, it seemed that the other challenges could not be solved by his abilities.","Especially the dragon head gate, to which he had no solution whatsoever—after all, his body didn’t carry the royal blood of the Great Wilderness.","Luckily, those big Demon Heads from the Demon Sect were a massive help to him.","And now, after all this struggle, the dragon coffin of the Great Wilderness was finally within reach.","Mo Hua suppressed the excitement in his heart, standing aside like an \"innocent puppet\" without evil intent.","And indeed, no one present regarded him as significant.","In their eyes, there was only that dragon coffin, a symbol of royal power, honor, and extraordinary aura of the Great Wilderness.","\"Is it inside the coffin?\" Young Master Xuan asked.","The old man in black robes nodded, \"Exactly.\"","In Young Master Xuan’s eyes, a trace of fanaticism appeared, \"Then what are we waiting for? Why not open the coffin?\"","The old man in black robe shook his head, \"Not yet.\"","Young Master Xuan frowned, \"Why?\"","\"Inside the dragon coffin is sealed an Evil Embryo.\"","\"Evil Embryo?!\"","Young Master Xuan’s pupils contracted.","Mo Hua’s heart also trembled as well."]},{"number":1995,"title":"Chapter 1995 - 961: Dragon Coffin (Part 2)","paragraphs":["As expected!","Inside the Solitary Mountain, there’s an evil fetus hidden, and this evil fetus is surprisingly sealed within the dragon coffin of the Great Wilderness royal family.","But...","How does this black-robed elder know all this?","Mo Hua was puzzled in his heart.","At this moment, Young Master Xuan also asked, \"Is this true?\"","The black-robed elder slowly nodded.","Young Master Xuan frowned, his eyes flashing, \"Second Elder, don’t just try to scare me with an illusory ’evil fetus’ title. If you want our cooperation to go smoothly, I ask Second Elder to explain this matter clearly.\"","\"What is this evil fetus, and where did it come from?\"","The black-robed elder remained silent for a moment, sighed, and a cold glint appeared in his eyes, \"This matter needs to start from a once highly respected ’Shaman’ in my tribe...\"","\"Shaman?\" Young Master Xuan was slightly taken aback.","The black-robed elder said, \"A Shaman is one who serves Ghost Gods, draws Four Symbols, controls totems, commands beasts, foresees fortune and misfortune... the wizard of my Great Wilderness tribe.\"","\"The Taoist Court killed our Great Wilderness royals, severed our Great Wilderness bloodline, and destroyed our Great Wilderness foundation. After so many years of turmoil and wandering, the Shamans of the Great Wilderness, barely one in ten remain.\"","\"Even so, the surviving Shamans still bide their time, concealing their light to revive our Great Wilderness royal family.\"","\"But heaven did not bless us, there was a bloody ’betrayal’ among the Shamans!\"","The black-robed elder was both angry and somewhat fearful.","Young Master Xuan’s expression turned slightly gravely.","The black-robed elder trembled and said, \"One Shaman, during a ritual to serve Ghost Gods, violated a taboo and awakened the ancient Evil God of the Great Wilderness.\"","\"Under the bewitchment of the Evil God, he betrayed us.\"","\"On the surface, he was still a highly respected Shaman, but secretly, he strayed from his original intention, betrayed the Great Wilderness, and devoted his body and mind to the Evil God, causing a catastrophe, stealing the Great Wilderness’s inheritance, seizing the Great Wilderness’s bloodline, and nurtured an evil fetus in this Divine Temple!\"","\"This is the first evil fetus he raised.\"","\"He wanted to use the evil fetus to bring the Evil God descending.\"","\"But for some reason, he failed. The Evil God did not descend, and the evil fetus went out of control.\"","\"The traitor could only seal this evil fetus in the Divine Temple at the bottom of Solitary Mountain.\"","\"And right now...\" the black-robed elder looked at the golden dragon coffin before him, with fear in his eyes, \"that evil fetus is lying dormant in this coffin.\"","Young Master Xuan’s face changed upon hearing this, but after a moment, he frowned, still somewhat skeptical.","However, Mo Hua, who heard this, couldn’t help but feel a surge of emotion.","Young Master Xuan was unaware, but he was different; he was deeply involved in the matters of the Evil God, and naturally understood better than anyone else.","The Second Elder’s words revealed too many secrets.","And answered many of Mo Hua’s questions.","Mo Hua’s mind was quickly turning, pondering over the Second Elder’s words:","\"The traitor, who the Second Elder spoke of, the one who betrayed his tribe and devoted himself to the Evil God... is ’Mr. Tu’?\"","\"Mr. Tu was actually a ’Shaman’ of the Great Wilderness tribe?\"","\"Serving Ghost Gods, drawing Four Symbols, controlling totems, commanding beasts, foreseeing fortune and misfortune... no wonder he could master the Four Symbols Formation, the Divine Formation, raise monster cultivators in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, conceal the Heavenly secret for the Rouge Boat, and could foresee blessing and curse...\"","\"He nourished an evil fetus in Solitary Mountain, which was also the first evil fetus.\"","\"He had even attempted for hundreds of years to use this evil fetus to bring the Evil God descending...\"","Mo Hua thought of the ten thousand pits, those densely packed mining cultivator corpses of over a hundred thousand, and his heart felt as heavy as water.","On the other side, Young Master Xuan pondered for a moment, then said with a faint smile, \"Senior, do evil gods truly exist in this world?\"","\"You better pray you never encounter one in your lifetime...\"","The black-robed elder glanced at him, \"Such beings as Evil Gods, if you don’t encounter them, they don’t exist. If you do encounter them, whether they exist or not no longer matters, because by that time, you won’t be you anymore.\"","\"You’ve studied the Planting Devil in Taoist Heart, you should understand.\" The black-robed elder said.","Young Master Xuan felt a slight shiver in his heart, and after a moment, he added, \"If it’s really as the senior said, that a dragon coffin holds an evil fetus, aren’t we supposed to awaken it?\"","\"It must not be awakened.\" The black-robed elder said.","Young Master Xuan frowned, \"Why?\"","\"You don’t know how terrifying the evil fetus is,\" the black-robed elder said, \"Once it’s awakened, all of us will die.\"","Young Master Xuan was slightly unbelieving.","The black-robed elder saw his thoughts and said solemnly:","\"Don’t think just because you’ve mastered the Planting Devil in Taoist Heart, you’re proficient in the Divine Thought. You’ve never truly experienced the bizarreness within the Divine Thought, nor do you understand the immense horror within it.\"","Young Master Xuan maintained a somewhat cold expression, \"This evil fetus is, at most, only of the Third Grade, right?\"","\"Only Third Grade...\" the black-robed elder sneered, \"Do you know what a Third Grade Divine Fetus implies?\"","\"This is the fetus of a Third Grade Evil God that failed to descend into the current world!\"","\"Once it awakens, not to mention you, even if your family elder arrives, he might not escape this Solitary Mountain alive. Even if the body leaves, his soul will be trapped here.\"","\"What’s more, if I’m not mistaken...\" the black-robed elder’s eyes filled with deep fear, \"This evil fetus is likely at the peak of Third Grade, nearing the Fourth-grade realm...\"","Upon hearing this, while Young Master Xuan was indifferent, Mo Hua felt his scalp tingle.","A Third Grade peak, nearing Fourth-grade evil fetus?","This is impossible!","Completely unbeatable, absolutely unbeatable.","Mo Hua’s heart was racing.","Slaying a Second Grade evil fetus already took a great deal from him, let alone facing a Third Grade peak evil fetus.","They are on entirely different levels of existence, incomparable.","Moreover, this seems to be a failed descent, and a \"lost control\" evil fetus, raising the danger level even higher."]},{"number":1996,"title":"Chapter 1996 - 961: Dragon Coffin (Part 3)","paragraphs":["\"This is the real ’big guy,’ far more terrifying than that enormous flesh corpse...\"","A chill surged up his heart, and Mo Hua felt a bit cold inside.","He had previously entertained the idea of ’eating’ this Evil Embryo of Solitary Mountain City, hoping to break through to Divine Sense 20 Patterns.","Now it seems he had offended...","He truly wasn’t worthy of consuming an Evil Embryo at the peak of the Third Grade realm.","In a face-off, who would eat whom was really uncertain.","\"Reckless, too hasty...\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, then immediately shifted his strategy in his heart:","The matter of the Evil Embryo, let’s forget about it; if you can’t provoke it, don’t provoke it...","Finding a way to obtain the Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation Map would suffice.","Of course, it would be best to also get hold of the Dragon Vein of the Great Wilderness.","These people are toying with the Dragon Vein with rebellion in mind; getting it into his hands would also be doing the Taoist Court a huge favor.","Even if he couldn’t use the Dragon Vein himself, handing it over to the Taoist Court in exchange for some of the Court’s secret Ultimate Techniques shouldn’t be a problem...","Mo Hua quickly made up his mind.","On the other side, Young Master Xuan heard about the \"Evil Embryo at the peak of the Third Grade\" and nodded slightly, showing some apprehension.","Then he frowned, \"If this Evil Embryo is really that formidable, doesn’t that mean we can’t open the coffin?\"","The old man in the black robe was silent for a moment, saying nothing more, but rather asked:","\"Young Master Xuan, can you uphold the agreement we talked about before?\"","Young Master Xuan nodded, \"Of course, the demon gate of my lineage will assist your Great Wilderness royalty in revitalizing and dominating the Southern Wilderness against the Taoist Court. All we need is a place for our Demon Gate to preach.\"","\"Good.\" The Second Elder nodded.","Then he walked up to Shen Tuao, and performed a salute, his expression complex, with a voice old and full of emotion:","\"Third Prince, this old servant can only... accompany you up to this point.\"","\"Perhaps in the future, I will have no chance to witness you ascending to the Dragon Seat, ruling the Great Wilderness...\"","Shen Tuao, who had always been silent as a mountain and coldly arrogant, suddenly had a trace of sadness in his gaze.","He deeply bowed to the Second Elder.","This was the first time Mo Hua saw him bow.","Afterward, Shen Tuao said nothing further.","That one bow was enough.","The Second Elder nodded, speaking in a calm voice: \"I will seal the Evil Embryo, isolating its perception so it won’t awaken. Then you can open the coffin and take out the Dragon Vein. But remember, you only have two hours.\"","After saying this, the Second Elder began to raise his head, using the Great Wilderness’ secret techniques to observe the position of the Dragon Coffin, calculating something in his mind.","A moment later, he determined the location and walked straight to an open area three Zhang in front of the Dragon Coffin.","The Second Elder sat cross-legged and took out some strange and ancient, barbarian-flavored bone instruments, including claws, small arms, shins, and skulls...etc.","These bones were arranged on the ground by the Second Elder to form a dragon shape.","The Second Elder then took out Blood Ink and drew some specific Formation Diagrams on the ground.","Mo Hua glanced slightly and noticed that these Formation Diagrams looked like Four Symbols Patterns and also like beast totems. Drawn in blood, the style was peculiar and very unfamiliar to him.","\"Is this also a secret formation of the Great Wilderness?\"","The Second Elder meticulously completed the Blood Patterns.","These Blood Patterns seemed like a bloodline, linking all the White Bones together as if connecting them into a bloody Bone Dragon.","Having done all this, the Second Elder took out the last section of bone.","This piece of bone, as clear as jade, was extraordinary, and it was the Dragon Bone he used earlier to suppress the oppressive energy of the flesh corpse.","The Second Elder bit down on this piece of Dragon Bone.","Then he drew out a sacrificial dagger and, without hesitation, stabbed it into his own heart. At the same time, his whole body trembled violently, as if enduring incredible pain.","Amidst this pain, the fresh blood from the Second Elder’s mouth soaked the Dragon Bone.","The Dragon Bone wailed, gradually turning crimson.","On the ground, the blood-patterned Bone Dragon resonated, and the blood threads slowly entwined and merged with the White Bone to finally form a \"Dragon Bone Chain\" forged from blood and bone.","This Dragon Bone Chain floated slowly into the air and then, according to a particular position, sealed off the dead angles of the Dragon Coffin, isolating some kind of terrible energy inside the coffin.","Yet the Second Elder gradually lowered his head, and his breath slowly faded away.","Mo Hua saw this, his heart shaken:","Dead...?!","Is this the secret magic of the Great Wilderness Shaman?","This Second Elder, a Late Golden Core Stage Cultivator, sacrificed his life, activated Dragon Qi, and together with his blood and the Dragon Bone, forged a Dragon Lock to seal off the Evil Embryo?","Mo Hua glanced at the Dragon Coffin in front of him using his peripheral vision.","Indeed, some mysterious changes were occurring on the Dragon Coffin.","This Dragon Coffin was different from before; it seemed to have been stripped of something, or maybe something was \"sealed,\" making its \"current realm\" and \"Void Realm\" existence completely separated for a short time.","Changes in reality would no longer affect the existence on the level of the Divine Thought, namely, the Evil Embryo of the peak Third Grade.","This tactic was truly extraordinary.","The Second Elder’s actions not only surprised Mo Hua; even the Bear Demon Cultivator and Young Master Xuan were shocked.","They hadn’t expected that to open the Dragon Coffin, the Second Elder would actually sacrifice his own life.","Moreover, he did it so decisively, without the slightest hesitation.","The expressions on the two men’s faces were momentarily grave.","The sadness in Shen Tuao’s eyes deepened, but after a moment, he buried this grief, along with all the pain of losing his clansmen before, deep in his heart.","Once again, his face became cold and arrogant.","The sacrifice of the Second Elder could not be in vain. The blood of the Great Wilderness clan could not flow in vain.","All of this was for the revival of the royal family.","With determination in his heart, Shen Tuao slowly moved forward, extending his large hand to cover the golden and luxurious Dragon Coffin, then gradually began to push the lid open.","The sound of a dragon’s roar echoed.","A powerful force of resistance emerged from the Dragon Coffin as traces of ancient Dragon Qi bore into Shen Tuao’s arm.","But these Dragon Qi were once again dissolved by Shen Tuao, who was infused with the power of the Evil Dragon.","Finally, the Dragon Coffin was slowly pushed open.","The atmosphere froze.","Everyone saw the scene within the coffin, and for a moment, they were a little dazed.","Inside the coffin, engraved with golden Dragon Patterns, lay a child of about ten.","This seemed like a young Prince, wearing the dragon robe of the Great Wilderness, with ancient Azure Dragon Patterns embroidered on it.","He lay in the Dragon Coffin, his flesh intact, his face pale yet serene, eyes closed, with a peaceful expression.","Looking at this face, Mo Hua’s pupils abruptly constricted, his heart trembled:","\"This person... why do they look a bit... like Yu Er?\""]},{"number":1997,"title":"Chapter 1997 - 962: Origins","paragraphs":["Mo Hua focused and looked more closely.","The prince in the dragon coffin had a face different from Yu Er’s. Though equally youthful, it carried an innate dignity, unlike Yu Er’s gentle cuteness.","Yet their brows and eyes looked very similar.","Why?","Why does he resemble Yu Er a bit?","Mo Hua frowned slightly.","\"Is Yu Er a prince of the Great Wilderness?\"","\"Or does he have the bloodline of the Great Wilderness royal family?\"","\"But that’s not right...\" Mo Hua was puzzled, \"Yu Er is clearly a child of the Shangguan and Wenren families, how could he be related to the Great Wilderness?\"","On the other side, upon seeing the prince in the dragon coffin, Shen Tuao’s emotions suddenly trembled.","\"Ye’er...\"","Shen Tuao murmured softly.","Ancient memories, like old bitter wine, trickled back through his mind.","The calamity that befell the Great Wilderness royal family, the separation of flesh and blood.","Over the years, his kin had dwindled, wandering everywhere, even at the cost of royal dignity, becoming a Demon Cultivator, playing along with the traitors, living a life neither human nor ghost. The hardships, despair, and helplessness shook his mind, stirring his emotions.","Now, at last, he saw his closest kin, saw his brother.","Even though his only brother was already dead.","Reduced to a cold corpse lying in this out-of-the-world dragon coffin.","Shen Tuao’s hands trembled, wanting to touch the prince in the dragon coffin, whom he called \"Ye’er.\"","But suddenly, a bloody sword light slashed through the air, striking his arm.","The sword light was formidable, but Shen Tuao had the Dragon Pattern protecting him, so it didn’t harm him, not even breaking the skin.","Still, the sudden change made Shen Tuao’s expression pause.","He turned his head, looking at Young Master Xuan holding the sword, and said coldly: \"What do you mean?\"","Young Master Xuan met Shen Tuao’s dragon-like gaze, feeling a brief chill in his heart, but his eyes flashed, dispelling that fear, and he chuckled:","\"I want to ask the Third Prince for something.\"","\"What?\" Shen Tuao’s voice was deep, intimidating without anger.","Young Master Xuan’s eyes gleamed, \"I want... Prince Ye’s body.\"","Upon hearing this, Mo Hua was taken aback.","Shen Tuao’s eyes turned red, fury bursting forth, exuding a chilling killing intent.","Young Master Xuan, overwhelmed by his aura, couldn’t help but step back. Then, upon realizing, he felt a bit annoyed, mobilized his Demonic Qi, gathering in his eyes, and confronted Shen Tuao.","Although he was at a disadvantage in cultivation, by leveraging the subtleties of \"Planting Devil in Taoist Heart,\" Young Master Xuan resisted Shen Tuao’s authority, indifferently saying:","\"Prince Ao, don’t you want to revive the Great Wilderness? Don’t you want to restore the royal family?\"","That sentence seemed to awaken Shen Tuao.","Too much had been sacrificed for the Great Wilderness royal family’s grand cause, so some humiliation had to be endured.","Otherwise, just for coveting Ye’er, he would’ve acted against Young Master Xuan by now.","Shen Tuao slowly gathered his killing intent, \"The royal heritage of the Great Wilderness Dragon Vein, I can pass a portion to you.\"","\"That’s what the Demon Gate wants, but not what I want,\" Young Master Xuan said.","\"What do you want?\"","\"I’ve told you, I want Prince Ye’s body.\"","Shen Tuao’s gaze was cold.","Young Master Xuan smirked slightly, then said: \"The Demon Gate is the Demon Gate, and I am me. I took a risk for the Demon Gate, so naturally, I have my own little requests.\"","\"I’ll give you one more chance, think it over carefully,\" Shen Tuao said calmly.","Young Master Xuan shook his head, \"Prince Ye’s body, I am determined to get it.\"","Shen Tuao’s Dragon Pattern appeared around him, Blood Qi surging, looking at Young Master Xuan indifferently, with a hint of mockery in his cold gaze:","\"What makes you think you have the right to speak to me like this? What qualifies you to make such a rude request to me? With your paltry ’Planting Devil in Taoist Heart’?\"","\"You do realize, with a flick of my hand, I could crush you?\" Shen Tuao’s Dragon Pattern flickered, killing intent fierce.","Mo Hua was also deeply puzzled.","This Young Master Xuan didn’t seem like a fool, so why dare to make such a bold demand of Shen Tuao, this Late Golden Core Stage, bearer of the Evil Dragon’s power, Demon Sect leader, and Great Wilderness Prince?","What does he rely on?","Can he use Planting Devil in Taoist Heart on Shen Tuao?","Impossible... even I don’t have that ability.","Is it by relying on Mr. Hui, Shitou, and me, a small Foundation Establishment?","To fight Shen Tuao?","That’s impossible too...","Even ten Mr. Huis combined with me wouldn’t be a match for Shen Tuao.","Mo Hua was a Formation Master, he had seen with his own eyes, and understood better than anyone, the power of Shen Tuao’s Four Symbols Evil Dragon Formation.","What exactly does this Young Master Xuan rely on?","While Mo Hua was puzzled, Young Master Xuan smiled lightly, looking at Elder Bear Pi, who remained silent, and with a hint of temptation in his voice, asked:","\"Do you want to be a ’bear,’ or a ’dragon’?\"","Elder Bear Pi was taken aback, and Shen Tuao’s gaze sharpened.","Young Master Xuan looked at Shen Tuao, speaking to Elder Bear Pi: \"As long as you kill him, all those Dragon Patterns will be yours.\"","Elder Bear Pi remained silent.","Young Master Xuan smiled at him: \"You are not from the Great Wilderness clan, you are not even from the Great Wilderness itself.\"","\"Don’t think I don’t know, you monster cultivators, the cultivation techniques you practice, the Monster Patterns you nurture, are just wedding dresses for others, to breed a formation that can truly ’transform into a dragon.’\"","\"You, as an elder, are nothing but a consumable.\"","\"Are you willingly going to spend your whole life as a bear, unquestioningly obeying others? Don’t you want to be a true dragon for once?\""]},{"number":1998,"title":"Chapter 1998 - 962: Origins (Part 2)","paragraphs":["\"This is your one and only chance in this life. The Second Elder is dead, Shen Tuao’s blood qi is depleted, alone. If you don’t fight now, you will never have a chance to obtain the Great Wilderness Dragon Pattern in this lifetime.\"","Elder Bear Pi’s gaze trembled, his heart in turmoil, and after a moment, he gritted his teeth and stood in front of Young Master Xuan.","Shen Tuao was not angry, but sneered: \"Transform into a dragon? What kind of trash deserves to transform into a dragon? Fine, since you want to die, I’ll fulfill your wish.\"","Shen Tuao’s figure flashed, trailing a dragon shadow, arriving in front of Young Master Xuan in just the blink of an eye.","Amidst the roar of the Evil Dragon, a pair of massive hands, carrying the force of ten thousand pounds, slammed down fiercely.","Young Master Xuan’s expression changed, and his figure immediately twisted into a non-human, bizarre posture, like a rubber band, shedding the pressure from the Evil Dragon, and escaping from Shen Tuao’s palm.","Shen Tuao’s palm missed, and with a reverse hand, he struck again.","But this strike was intercepted mid-air by a demon hand as robust as a Bear Pi’s.","Golden Core Strength shocked, the aura rampaged, sending a wave of intense fluctuation outward.","Strength shredded, a foul wind howling, those present were Golden Core cultivators, but Mo Hua in the Foundation Establishment Realm couldn’t withstand it.","He took this opportunity to pretend to lose his footing, being blown away by the strong wind, rolling a few times on the ground, and ended up hiding in the corner of the hall.","In such a Golden Core Realm battle, no one cared about him, a Foundation Establishment Realm \"little puppet.\"","Thus, Young Master Xuan through Planting Devil in Taoist Heart, commanded Mr. Hui and Stone, along with Elder Bear Pi in the late Golden Core Stage, to fight against Shen Tuao.","Shen Tuao had frequently used the power of his bloodline along the way, activating the Great Wilderness heritage, depleting much blood qi, reducing his strength significantly.","Young Master Xuan and the others were outnumbered.","Yet despite this, they still weren’t Shen Tuao’s match.","Shen Tuao, barehanded, wielded the power of the Evil Dragon between his punches and palms, azure-red Formation Patterns flickering, with the support of the Four Symbols Green Dragon Evil Formation, forcing Elder Bear Pi, who was also in the late Golden Core Stage, with strong cultivation and a body like steel, to retreat step by step.","Let alone Young Master Xuan.","He could only maneuver from afar, relying on scarlet sword light for restraint, or use Planting Devil in Taoist Heart for slight interference, not daring to approach.","Mo Hua lay like a wooden man, watching the scene from afar, inwardly envious.","\"This is the Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation...\"","The formation integrates into the body, a punch with a dragon shadow, both attack and defense, both majestic and powerful, not only does the body have dragon scales’ protection, but dragon power also reigns supreme in the attack.","If I learned it, I wonder if I could be this powerful.","Of course, his physical foundation is too shallow, he definitely couldn’t learn it well.","But even if he was half as strong as Shen Tuao, no, even a tenth as strong, that would be quite enough.","Then when using the Water Passing Step, he wouldn’t just focus on dodging, occasionally he could throw a punch.","A punch with a dragon shadow, regardless of its true power, would definitely be intimidating.","\"Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation...\"","The more Mo Hua watched, the more envious he became.","Meanwhile, Shen Tuao held the absolute advantage, Mr. Hui and Stone had already been crippled, thrown aside.","The Bear Demon cultivator and Young Master Xuan were even overwhelmed, gasping for breath.","\"Indeed, underestimated him, the heritage of the Great Wilderness Royal Clan truly lives up to its name...\" Young Master Xuan muttered, gritting his teeth, then looked at the Bear Demon cultivator, saying:","\"Elder Bear, there’s no need to hide your prowess anymore.\"","Elder Bear Pi’s gaze deepened.","Shen Tuao paused, then realized, and immediately punched towards Elder Bear Pi.","This punch was unexpected, with a power stronger than ever.","Seeing he couldn’t block it, Elder Bear Pi gritted his teeth, and his originally robust and muscular body suddenly slithered, like a sturdy python, coiling around Shen Tuao, biting down on the back of his neck fiercely, blood gushing.","Shen Tuao, injured, with unchanged gaze, punched again.","This punch struck Elder Bear Pi properly, the sound of bones shattering resounded, flesh tearing.","Elder Bear Pi spat a mouthful of blood, immediately transforming back into Bear Pi, retreating to the side.","But his arm hung limply.","Especially the skin on top, shredded by the strength of the Evil Dragon, flesh mangled.","But the next moment, demonic power flowed, bones regenerating, his skin slowly recovering, the damaged skin shedding, revealing new monster patterns underneath.","This was an eerie snake pattern.","Mo Hua had mingled in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, meddling with these Four Symbols Monster Patterns, now watching with a silent shock.","This Bear Demon cultivator had, quite uniquely, two monster patterns. One was the Bear Demon Pattern, the other was the Snake Demon Pattern.","Mo Hua’s eyes flickered.","Just one glance, and he understood the origin of this snake pattern.","This snake pattern belonged to the Snake Demon Elder, one of the three Golden Core Demon Cultivators in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","During the siege of the Demon Sect, the Snake Demon Elder died, and his monster pattern seemed to be stripped.","Now, this snake pattern was merged onto the Bear Demon cultivator.","Either he secretly peeled it off when the Snake Elder died.","Or beforehand, he had schemed against the Snake Elder, skinned him, causing the Snake Elder to get fatally injured during the Taoist Court’s siege.","Mo Hua silently clicked his tongue.","Indeed, the cultivation world is perilous, these Demon Cultivators have more plots than one.","Even though he knew some of these Demon Cultivators’ backgrounds, he never expected that this seemingly honest Elder Bear would be so deeply scheming."]},{"number":1999,"title":"Chapter 1999 - 962: Entanglements (Part 3)","paragraphs":["He had clearly harbored covetous intentions for a long time, wanting to strip the Green Dragon Pattern from the Demon Sect leader.","He had even prepared thoroughly for this.","\"Another one... trying to take things from me...\"","Mo Hua’s thoughts moved slightly.","On the other side, Shen Tuao stopped, looking at the snake pattern on Elder Bear, and slightly furrowed his brows.","\"The serpent wants to transform into a dragon...\"","Since he was exposed, Elder Bear no longer hid.","He fully exposed his aura, and with the support of two sets of Four Symbols Demon Formation, the demonic power of Bear Pi and the python mixed together, though a bit incongruous, it was unexpectedly violent and strong at the moment.","This was the first time Shen Tuao’s expression became somewhat serious.","Seeing this, Young Master Xuan let out a slow breath and said:","\"Third Prince, as long as you hand over Prince Ye’s physical body to me, I won’t break my promise; my branch of the Demon Gate will still assist you in unifying the Great Wilderness.\"","\"The difficulty of being enemies with the Taoist Court and reviving the Great Wilderness royal family—I’m sure you understand this better than I.\"","\"Surely, you’re not a person who blindly adheres to old ways without knowing how to be adaptable.\"","Shen Tuao was silent for a moment and then asked coldly: \"Why... must it be Ye’er’s remains?\"","Young Master Xuan looked at the prince’s body in the dragon coffin, a hint of greed in his eyes. After contemplating for a moment, he slowly said: \"Honesty is the best policy, I won’t hide it from you...\"","\"I need Prince Ye’s body to cultivate... the Mystery Demon Foetus!\"","Mystery Demon Foetus?","In the corner, Mo Hua was taken aback upon hearing this.","He always felt that these three words were very familiar, as if he had heard them somewhere a long time ago.","Past memories, like a tide, slowly rolled back...","Mo Hua’s pupils suddenly contracted.","Mystery Demon Foetus... Xuan Sanren?!","\"Xuan Sanren...\"","Mo Hua’s gaze trembled slightly; he still remembered the time when the righteous and demonic factions besieged his master in the Five Elements Sect of Li Mountain City.","A group of Demon Cultivators took the opportunity to hold the Ten Thousand Demons Gathering.","During the gathering, his uncle used Gui Tao’s Heaven Sealing Formation to seal the Ten Thousand Demons Hall and then planted the devil in the Taoist Heart, slaughtering all the Demon Cultivators cleanly.","Among these Demon Cultivators, there were even three at the Feather Transformation Realm.","At that time, his uncle, having the demon seed of Golden Core, was not supposed to be capable of eroding the Taoist Heart of someone in the Feather Transformation Realm—","This was something said by the Feather Transformation Demon Head known as \"Poison Venerable.\"","But the problem lay with \"Xuan Sanren.\"","Mo Hua remembered clearly that Poison Venerable had cursed angrily back then:","\"...Xuan Sanren, you cowardly beast, you dared to use Mystery Demon Foetus in place of your true self?!\"","Mystery Demon Foetus changes, Supreme Demon Skill.","One body with two foetuses, indistinguishable between real and fake.","The causal links binding his master were seized to steal the secret of the Back Ruins Heaven Burial, a matter of immense significance, and Xuan Sanren likely anticipated its dangers, thus sending a Mystery Demon Foetus in place of his real self.","Yet despite its dual nature, a Mystery Demon Foetus’s Taoist Heart was divided.","It could only achieve the cultivation level of the Feather Transformation Realm without a complete Taoist Heart of the same realm.","This gave his uncle an opportunity.","In the sealed Demon Palace, a Mystery Demon Foetus at the Feather Transformation Realm was infected by his uncle with the devil in the Taoist Heart, making survival for the other two Feather Transformation Demon Heads practically impossible.","\"By planting the devil in the Taoist Heart, slaughter the ten thousand demons, execute Feather Transformation...\"","Mo Hua was an eyewitness to this event.","And those Demon Cultivators who besieged his master mostly perished at his uncle’s hands.","Only Xuan Sanren, he merely lost a Mystery Demon Foetus.","Mo Hua turned his head towards Young Master Xuan.","No wonder, during divination, he felt Young Master Xuan was familiar, even sensing a deep connection between them.","So that’s it, this causal chain traces back to \"Xuan Sanren,\" who harmed his master...","Young Master Xuan, Xuan Sanren, Mystic Demon Sect...","\"This truly... is quite a profound connection.\"","Mo Hua’s gaze was icy.","Facing Shen Tuao, Young Master Xuan’s expression shifted slightly, and in his heart, he felt an inexplicable fear as though he had been targeted by some terrifying beast.","...","Meanwhile, across mountains and rivers,","in the dark and cold, demon-filled, dragon pit-like Mystic Demon Sect.","An elderly man, resembling a child with crane-like hair, suddenly opened his eyes during meditation, unable to suppress a tremor in his heart.","Had some karmic bond... been touched?"]},{"number":2000,"title":"Chapter 2000 - 963: Dragon Vein","paragraphs":["This white-haired, childlike, fair-skinned cultivator is none other than Xuan Sanren, known as the \"Mystery Demon Ancestor\" of the Mystic Demon Sect.","Since the Ten Thousand Demons Gathering years ago, when a Mystery Demon Foetus was killed, Xuan Sanren suffered a severe loss of vitality and has since remained in seclusion.","But now, with the flow of cause and effect, omens are upon him, and Xuan Sanren feels it acutely, furrowing his brows.","\"Where does this cause and effect come from...?\"","Throughout his life, Xuan Sanren has cultivated the Mystic Demon Path, killing countless people, making numerous enemies, and at this moment, he couldn’t fathom which enmity could make him uneasy.","\"I have never left any survivors; all cause and effect have been resolved... Or is there still a fish that slipped through the net?\"","Xuan Sanren feels uneasy.","Killing must uproot, even the infant in the womb must not be spared to ensure everything is foolproof.","This is Xuan Sanren’s code of conduct.","Thus, even though his cultivation is not the strongest among the demon heads, his fierce reputation is widespread, which is why he is called the \"Mystery Demon Ancestor,\" making others frightened.","\"Exactly what time and place is this cause and effect...?\"","Xuan Sanren traces the origin and reasons, but his mind is a blank with no clues.","Xuan Sanren originally wanted to give up, but couldn’t let it go; after contemplating for a moment, he decided to harden his resolve and took out a compass from a heavily sealed red box.","This compass is cast from white bone.","Inside it is sealed with a lock, dark blood soaking into the lock, engraved with primitive formation patterns, and embedded in the center is a demon eye, fierce and constantly blinking.","This is the Demonic Path Treasure: Nether Heavenly Mechanism Seal.","This mechanism seal, he hasn’t used for a long time.","Xuan Sanren bites his finger, wipes it across his forehead, leaving a blood mark, the blood mark writhing on its own, and Xuan Sanren’s divine sense becomes even sharper.","He forms a seal with his hand to activate the Nether Heavenly Mechanism Seal, attempting to deduce some past cause and effect with this seal.","But the next moment, the mechanism seal trembles, and the demon eye in the lock suddenly widens, bloodshot, trembling in fear.","Xuan Sanren is stunned on the spot, his pupils gradually constricting.","\"The mechanism seal... dares not calculate?\"","\"It’s... afraid?\"","\"A demonic path treasure, what is it afraid of? And who is it afraid of?\"","In just a moment, Xuan Sanren remembers the time outside Li Mountain City when besieging that person, the mechanism seal seemed to tremble like this.","The unease in his heart gradually amplifies.","In a trance, Xuan Sanren recalls, outside Li Mountain City, while deducing cause and effect, he vaguely sensed a trace of ominous sign.","The feeling of that ominous sign slowly surfaces in his mind again.","Just like inadvertently releasing a bunch of fry into the river.","But within those fry, it seems there was a young and vicious \"crocodile.\"","Upon closer examination, the river is vast and indistinct, waves shimmer, utterly unclear, nothing visible.","Xuan Sanren’s brows furrow tighter.","\"That person is dead, Back Ruins Heaven Burial, those related are either dead or scattered, the storm gradually subsides, and there’s no one worthy of attention...\"","\"This fish that slipped through the net, who could it be?\"","\"Will it threaten my Mystic Demon Sect?\"","Xuan Sanren hopes he is overthinking, yet something still weighs on his heart, as if somewhere in the void, a little monster is gradually rising, growing bit by bit...","\"Ten years have passed, the changes brought by Back Ruins Heaven Burial is starting to reveal, finally.\"","\"Crisis and peril, are beginning to spread.\"","\"The heavenly secret weaving, cause and effect interplaying, within the game of asking into Dao to become immortal, who in the end laid down this chess piece...\"","Xuan Sanren sits motionless for a long while, feeling uneasy.","After a moment, his gaze becomes obscure, as he solemnly takes out an ancient book from the Bone Ring.","Xuan Sanren’s bone-colored white hand gently caresses the ancient book, murmuring softly:","\"Hereafter, perhaps the life and death fate of the Mystic Demon Sect rests upon this...\"","This is a scroll fragment, with wax-yellowed pages, showing signs of water damage and fire exposure. On the incomplete title page, six ancient, vigorous characters are inscribed:","\"Planting Devil in Taoist Heart Great Technique.\"","...","Solitary Mountain City, within the Divine Temple.","Young Master Xuan also senses an inkling of trepidation, but his proficiency in divine thought does not match Xuan Sanren’s, so he merely feels a slight confusion and dismisses it.","Moreover, he still has to face the formidable Shen Tuao.","He needs to seize the Great Wilderness Heritage from Shen Tuao, and his other foundational element for cultivating the Mystery Demon Foetus—","That is, the flesh of the Fourth Prince of Great Wilderness.","Though the Great Wilderness Dragon Vein is good, it has a drawback, that being a royal inheritance, wherein the cultivation techniques, Taoist skills, formations, artifact refining methods, bone talisman methods, and even sacrificial skills, and various other secret techniques, cannot be mastered or driven without royal bloodline.","Hence, without royal bloodline, even obtaining the Great Wilderness Heritage is somewhat a \"useless appendage.\"","This matter wasn’t mentioned by Shen Tuao and the Second Elder, but Young Master Xuan is aware.","To acquire the Great Wilderness Heritage, one must possess the Great Wilderness Bloodline.","Without the bloodline, everything is empty talk.","The royal family of the Great Wilderness is nearly extinct, with barely any flesh bodies left to find.","The one alive is Shen Tuao right in front of him, but he is too strong, with a very firm mind and immense ambitions, not easily controllable.","Even collaborating with him offers scant benefit.","Given this, he could only find the deceased, yet intact \"Fourth Prince,\" refining him into his own \"Mystery Demon Foetus.\"","Change the Mystery Demon Foetus, Supreme Demon Skill.","One body, two foetuses, indistinguishable from genuine to fake.","Once the Mystery Demon Foetus is refined, he becomes the prince of the Great Wilderness, able to act in the name of the \"prince.\"","In the future, once the grand plan succeeds, the entire Great Wilderness will be in his grasp."]}]);
